window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3901,"title":"Chapter 3901: The End of Princess Rao (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3901: The End of Princess Rao (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Right now, the Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom are fighting fiercely in the Peace Grassland. They’re about the same level, and it’s still too early to tell who’s going to win.”","The more Raoxi said, the more excited she became. “This is the best time for the Northern Yan Kingdom to get involved! We’ll get a big share, no matter if we side with the Dongsang Kingdom or the Junwu Empire!","“Father, I’m in favor of...","However, before she could finish, the king silenced her with a wave of his hand.","Princess Raoxi looked at him in bewilderment.","The king stared at her. “Is that why you wanted to kill Feng Wu?”","Princess Raoxi said, “Yes! It’s said that she’s Jun Linyuan’s favorite. Capturing her will keep Jun Linyuan from taking action. Father, what’s wrong with that?”","The king thought to himself, “Normally, I wouldn’t think much of it, but things are different now. Feng Wu is...”","“Father, Feng Wu has to die!” Raoxi screamed at the top of her lungs. Her head kept banging on the ground, and soon, blood covered her forehead. It was a ghastly sight.","Normally, the king wouldn’t have let his daughter do such a thing, but now, he was staring at Princess Raoxi with a cold look in his eyes. The queen looked from the king to Princess Raoxi...","Somehow, she felt uneasy.","The king sighed and said to Princess Rao Xi, “So, apart from trying to kill Feng","Wu, you also wanted to kill me, didn’t you?”","He had almost been tricked by Raoxi and forgotten about her most fundamental mistake.","Princess Raoxi shook her head repeatedly. Her pale face looked so harmless, but...","The king didn’t give her a chance to explain herself. Instead, he summoned Zhao.","Soon...","Little Dian, who worked in the royal study, Lady Mei, and all her servants entered the hall.","Seeing this group of people, Princess Raoxi didn’t seem pleased.","As expected...","Her father knew!","Princess Raoxi remained calm, but the queen was panic-stricken.","Princess Raoxi threw a dirty look at her, telling her to calm down.","The queen wanted to calm down as well, but she couldn’t. That was the crime of trying to murder a king...","The king stared at Princess Rao Xi. “I’m giving you one last chance. You’d better tell me yourself. You know what will happen if I reveal the truth!” Raoxi looked up at the king and asked a completely unrelated question.","“Father, you won’t do anything to Feng Wu, will you?”","Although the king didn’t answer, Princess Raoxi wasn’t stupid. She knew that her father wouldn’t touch Feng Wu.","She smiled bitterly. “Father, why? Why? Is she that likable?”","The king thought, “That’s right. Feng Wu is the Patriarch’s favorite.”","It didn’t matter if he liked Feng Wu or not. The Patriarch liked her.","He was the ruler of the kingdom, but the Patriarch was the real leader behind everything. He could make anyone the king. That was just how things worked.","Princess Raoxi smiled bitterly. “Father, it’s Feng Wu... I’ve found out everything. Feng Wu had the study set on fire on purpose, and she was the one who sold the medicine to Lady Mei... She has poisoned you so badly.. Father, please believe me!”"]},{"number":3902,"title":"Chapter 3902: The End of Princess Rao (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3902: The End of Princess Rao (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The king shook his head sadly.","He had given Raoxi a chance, but she wouldn’t take it.","Seeing the look on the king’s face, Princess Raoxi knew that something was wrong.","At that moment, she mentioned the Patriarch again.","“Father, you can listen to Feng Wu’s slander and believe that I poisoned you.","You can even believe her and kill your daughter, but Father, I’m not only","Princess Raoxi. I’m also the closest person to the Patriarch!”","She gritted her teeth and stared at the king. “Father, can you bring yourself to upset the Patriarch?”","Since she had lied, there was no reason not to keep lying.","She gritted her teeth. “Father, it’s my birthday today, and I’ve received the","Primary Heaven Pill from the Patriarch!”","Staring at the emperor, she used all her strength. “Father, don’t you want to know how much I’ll grow after taking the pill?","“This is the pill!” Princess Raoxi took out a red pill the size of a pigeon’s egg and showed it to the king. “I have it now. I’m the most important person to the","Patriarch. Father, please don’t upset him!”","The king gave her a “you idiot” look and didn’t know what to say.","He used to believe what Raoxi said, but after this episode, what more could he believe?","The queen forced herself to calm down.","That was right! The Primary Heaven Pill. As long as she mentioned the Patriarch..","Before, whenever they ran into trouble, the king wouldn’t hold them accountable as long as the Patriarch was mentioned, so this time...","But she was disappointed this time because the king gave her a strange look and only asked, “Is this the Primary Heaven Pill?”","Raoxi raised the pill over her head and nodded solemnly. “Yes, this is the pill the master gave me!” However...","The king snorted.","Princess Raoxi’s heart sank when she saw this. Something didn’t feel right.","The king smirked. “Raoxi, since you were little, how many times have you used the Patriarch to intimidate me? Are you still going to lie to me?”","Princess Raoxi asked, “Father?”","The king said imnatipntlv_ “Tt’q a fake nnpl”","Princess Raoxi stared at him in astonishment.","The king smirked and said, “The Primary Heaven Pill is fake!”","Seeing how confident the king was, Princess Raoxi was uneasy. Had some slut heard her talking to her mother and told her father?","However, what the king said next almost killed Princess Raoxi.","He said coldly, “Because the Patriarch has given the pill to someone else.”","Princess Raoxi was astonished.","Her head went blank, and she almost couldn’t think straight.","No. Her father had to be bluffing. That had to be it.","At that thought, she forced herself to calm down and forced a smile. “Father, you’re so funny.”","Lady Mei and the others all dropped to their knees and lowered their heads as if they didn’t exist.","But they didn’t miss a word.","They were shocked as if they had heard some incredible secret.."]},{"number":3903,"title":"Chapter 3903: The End of Princess Rao (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3903: The End of Princess Rao (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","As expected, the king said coldly, “I’m not joking. I saw with my own eyes that the Patriarch gave the pill to someone else, and you...”","Seeing that Princess Raoxi’s expression was cracking, the king didn’t feel anything for her. He said, “You were scrubbing the floor in the tower. Wasn’t that true?”","Princess Raoxi felt as if she had been struck by lightning.","Her father saw it...","He saw it...","For a moment, Princess Raoxi blanched, but she soon blushed.","The king kept his gaze on her. “Your Primary Heaven Pill is fake, and so is the Patriarch’s favor for you. Raoxi, you’re such a poser. You’ve fooled me and everyone else in the Northern Yan Kingdom!”","The king had planned to show Princess Raoxi some respect, but what she did crossed the line, so he didn’t show her any mercy.","Princess Raoxi shuddered when she heard those words.","The king thought she would stop, but she didn’t.","She was absent-minded for a brief moment but soon returned to normal. She only smiled and said, “Father, you’re mistaken. I did some cleaning in the tower, but that was because the Patriarch was teaching me a powerful technique, so I needed to work on it first. According to the Patriarch, a great task is bound to befall a person first...","What a sharp-minded, tenacious, and resolute girl... Not many people could do that.","The king was almost impressed.","Still, she had crossed the line.","“It’s not a big deal that you tried to kill Feng Wu. After all, she’s not dead. “It’s not a big deal for you to pretend that the Patriarch dotes on you.”","The look in Emperor Yan’s eyes grew colder. “But you should never have tried to kill the king!”","Of course, the princess wouldn’t admit it. She kept kowtowing. “Father, I didn’t..","She was already bleeding a lot, and she looked like she was going to collapse at any moment.","However, with all the evidence, no matter how hard Princess Raoxi tried, it wouldn’t work.","When Lady Mei and her maids all pointed at Princess Raoxi, there was no way that she could get away.","“Out, all of you.” With a wave of the king’s hand, the others left.","Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi sat on the ground in a trance-like state.","Her father had exposed her disguise in front of so many people... He was so relentless! He had destroyed all her pride!","The king walked up to Princess Raoxi and looked down at her.","Princess Raoxi smiled bitterly. “Father, are you going to kill me?”","The king crouched down in front of Princess Raoxi and brushed away a lock of hair on her forehead. He said sympathetically, “You’re my favorite daughter.”","After a pause, he sighed. “You’re supposed to be my favorite heir to the throne...","Why are you in such a rush? If I’m dead, you can have the throne.”","An idea struck her. It seemed that she was still useful to her father, and he wouldn’t kill her just yet.","As expected, the king said, “You have two choices.","“First, you’ll marry Night Owl, the crown prince of the Dongsang Kingdom. “Or, you can marry Feng Xun, the son of Feng Xiangnan of the Junwu Empire..”"]},{"number":3904,"title":"Chapter 3904: The Patriarch’s Gift (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3904: The Patriarch’s Gift (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The king stared at Princess Raoxi. “That’s the only thing you can do for the","Northern Yan Kingdom. Think about it and tell me.”","But Princess Raoxi suddenly asked, “What if I want to take the third option?”","The king frowned at her.","Princess Raoxi said, “What if I want to marry Jun Linyuan?","The king had the biggest frown on his face.","He shook his head. “No.”","Princess Raoxi said seriously, “But I want to marry Jun Linyuan, and that’s the only way I can be of use to the Northern Yan Kingdom...’","However, the king cut her off before she could finish.","“You’ll destroy the Northern Yan Kingdom!” The king waved his hand. “Not Jun","Linyuan! Never!”","Princess Raoxi asked, “Why? Even if I can’t be his wife, I’ll still want to be his concubine. Father, can’t I even do that?”","The king thought that when Jun Linyuan became the emperor one day, he would have a lot of concubines. Therefore, it wouldn’t be a bad idea for Raoxi to become one.","If that was the case, his relationship with Feng Wu would be even closer.","That would be a good thing, wouldn’t it?","Seeing that her father didn’t turn her down right away, Princess Raoxi had an idea.","When she tried to compete for the throne, she had been trying to win the","Dongsang Kingdom to her side so that she could resist the Junwu Empire. However, if she had to choose a husband, it would only take her a split second to make the right choice.","“Jun Linyuan and Gui Qulai will fight in the imperial capital tomorrow.” She narrowed her eyes. “Father, don’t worry. I’ll make Jun Linyuan take responsibility for me. 1–1e has to marry me!”","A concubine?","Of course, Princess Raoxi wouldn’t want to be a concubine. As for Feng Wu...","Hadn’t her father taken a fancy to her? Jun Linyuan would never want Feng Wu again after everything was done.","At that thought, she smirked inwardly.","But the king didn’t think about that. He only wanted to make good use of the last bit of value of Raoxi.","The father and daughter had different thoughts, and neither could guess the other’s.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu asked the Patriarch to give her friends some gifts.","There was only one Primary Heaven Pill, and the Patriarch couldn’t do anything about it. However, after all these years, the old man had a lot of good stuff on him.","Especially wnen came co lorgmg weapons.","Hence, Feng Wu fetched a pair of shoes for Feng Xun, known as the Flying Wind Boots. Once he put it on, he could travel as fast as the wind, and he could disappear in a split second.","“That’s a semi-divine weapon!” Feng Wu was astonished as well.","That was so valuable!","“That’s very generous of you!” Feng Wu looked at the Patriarch in amazement.","Patriarch Huyan said grumpily, “He’s your brother, isn’t he? He’s taken care of you for so many years, so why can’t I give him something nice? If my master wants to give him a gift, it has to be a divine weapon!”","The mention of his master brought tears to his eyes again.","Just then, Feng Xun ran back in excitement. To be more precise, he had slided into the room.","Those boots felt like they had wheels.","Feng Xun was so excited that his cheeks flushed and his eyes twinkled.","“These shoes are amazing!” Feng Xun grabbed Feng Wu’s hands, his eyes twinkling in excitement.. “My speed has doubled!”"]},{"number":3905,"title":"Chapter 3905: All Senior Brothers (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3905: All Senior Brothers (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Grabbing Feng Wu, Feng Xun’s eyes lit up in excitement. “My speed has increased exponentially!”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","Feng Xun grabbed Huyan Yichen’s hand in excitement. “Did you see that? My speed has doubled!”","Huyan Yichen stared at him jealousy and pouted.","Feng Xun then went to the prince in excitement. “My shoes! Did you see that?","OMC}!”","The prince looked away in frustration.","Feng Xun turned around in excitement and dashed off, shouting at the eagle, “Catch me if you can!”","The eagle didn’t want to talk to the dumb teenager at all.","However, Feng Xun rushed to its side and patted it on the head when he ran past it. “Silly bird!”","The eagle lost its temper right away, and it was so angry that it flapped its wings.","It didn’t mind nicknames, but this dumb teenager had just called it a silly bird! That was unacceptable!","“Stop right there!”","Hence, the teenager and the eagle began to chase each other around the tower, which gave Feng Wu a headache.","She had no idea where Feng Xun got his charm from, but ever since he entered the tower, he got along well with the silly eagle in no time. Even Patriarch Huyan didn’t find him repulsive. Instead, he had left a good impression on Feng Xun and gave him a pair of incredible shoes.","Feng Wu gave the Patriarch a wry smile. “That’s what Feng Xun’s like. Please don’t mind him.”","Seeing Feng Xun’s nimble figure, the Patriarch looked nostalgic. He even smiled a little. He was thinking about someone from the past.","“He used to be like this...” said Patriarch Huyan.","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Who?”","Patriarch Huyan said, “You fourth...”","He suddenly changed the subject, waved his hand, and stopped talking.","Seeing that Huyan Yichen and the prince were envious, Feng Wu decided to give them something nice as well.","Huyan Yichen received a pair of gloves.","It was a pair of insulation gloves, which would help him greatly in forging weapons. Huyan Yichen was so happy that he almost got as excited as Feng","Xun.","As for the prince, he had obtained a concealed weapon tube.","It wasn’t as good as Feng Wu’s arm of discipline, but it was a simplified version that could be hidden in his sleeve and used as a secret weapon.","The prince cared about his safety the most, so this tube would be of great help to him.","“Thank you, Sixth Senior Brother,” Feng Wu said quietly to Patriarch Huyan.","Patriarch Huyan waved his hand and said indifferently, “I’ve been forging these little gadgets for the past few years just to pass the time, and I’ve always thought that no one would be lucky enough to have them. I didn’t know that...”","He gave Feng Wu a strange look. “But ever since you came, you’ve brought these three with you. They’re all very talented good kids, and that’s very hard to come by.”","After that, he gave Feng Wu an even stranger look, which gave Feng Wu the creeps.","Feng Wu stumbled back. “What are you looking at?”","Patriarch Huyan rubbed Feng Wu’s head affectionately. “Kiddo, you’re so lucky. You had six Senior Brothers in your previous life, and now, you have so many nice brothers. That’s so rare.”","Feng Wu loved it when other people said that she was lucky, but she was more curious now. “Six Senior Brothers? Are you saying that I have six Senior Brothers?”","Patriarch Huyan said, “Of course.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Are there only senior brothers? Do I have any senior sisters?”"]},{"number":3906,"title":"Chapter 3906: All Senior Brothers (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3906: All Senior Brothers (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Patriarch Huyan jabbed a finger into Feng Wu’s head. “Of course not. Are you not happy with your six senior brothers?”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Six senior brothers are perfect, but I don’t know the other five yet...”","But the Patriarch wasn’t going to tell her.","But Feng Wu was so curious...","“Sixth Senior Brother, are you the only one who wants to know me?” Feng Wu feigned a pitiful tone and looked at Patriarch Huyan.","Patriarch Huyan immediately said, “How dare they?! Our Master will cut their legs off!”","Feng Wu tugged at his sleeve. “But... but why won’t they come to find me? I don’t even know who or where they are... Please just tell me.”","Patriarch Huyan scratched his head. He wanted to tell her, but heaven’s secrets couldn’t be divulged.","The phoenix had been following the girl around and hadn’t revealed anything. Therefore, Patriarch Huyan wasn’t going to reveal anything either.","However, he gave a hint. “I’m the youngest of your senior brothers, but I’m still the Patriarch of the Northern Yan Kingdom. If your other senior brothers are still alive, they’ll be even more capable.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. That was right!","Patriarch Huyan glanced at Feng Wu and said, “Just think about that.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up, and she cried out in surprise. “So... so, can I guess it that way? The other five senior brothers are all at your level?” Patriarch Huyan said, “As long as they’re not dead, they have to be.”","Feng Wu asked, “Could they be dead?”","Patriarch Huyan snorted. “Good people don’t live long, and disasters last for a thousand years. What do you think?”","It then occurred to Feng Wu that her senior brothers didn’t get along well with each other. That was why her sixth senior brother didn’t say anything nice about the others.","But that was enough for Feng Wu to guess.","“So, my third senior brother is the counselor of the Dongsang Kingdom, isn’t he?” Feng Wu smiled at Master Huyan.","Patriarch Huyan looked at Feng Wu, obviously surprised by her question.","“How did you know that?” He cried out.","Hence, Feng Wu told Patriarch Huyan about how she knew the white fairy.","Only then did Patriarch Huyan realize what had happened. “That’s right. That princess used to be his fiancee, but something happened, so... I didn’t know that she was so infatuated.”","“He’s indeed in the Dongsang Kingdom,” Patriarch Huyan told Feng Wu. “Moreover, he has a great treasure, which was left behind by my master. He’s been keeping it for you.","Feng Wu’s eyes twinkled, and she sounded excited when she asked, “Sixth Senior Brother, are you saying that my third senior brother also has something valuable that can make my cultivation level rise?”","Feng Wu was so excited that she was almost in tears.","The Primary Heaven Pill had helped her a lot this time. It had helped her rise to the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage and enabled her to refine her marrow. That was incredible!","It would take her years to cultivate on her own...","“Is that it? Am I right?” Feng Wu followed the Patriarch around and asked.."]},{"number":3907,"title":"Chapter 3907: The Battle (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3907: The Battle (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Patriarch Huyan said, “My master didn’t tell us what it was when he gave us the treasure.”","He sounded jealous when he said that. “Of the six boys, my master likes my third senior brother the best, so of course, he’ll keep something at least as valuable as the Primary Heaven Pill...”","Feng Wu didn’t know how to comfort the Patriarch when she saw how disappointed he was.","She had thought that he was just an old crybaby, but as it turned out, he was also a jealous old man. Feng Wu was cracking up inwardly and had to fight back her laughter.","In the end, she asked a question. “By the way, Sixth Senior Brother, have you heard of the broken star pieces?”","“Broken star pieces?” Patriarch Huyan tilted his head and frowned. “That sounds so familiar.”","Feng Wu was thrilled.","Sound familiar? He must have heard about it before, then! She had almost finished collecting the second broken star piece and was only waiting for the third one...","Patriarch Huyan suddenly stared at Feng Wu.","Puzzled, Feng Wu asked hesitantly, “Wh- what’s wrong?”","Patriarch Huyan scratched his head. “I heard one of the senior brothers mention it once. I think your third senior brother is holding a broken star piece.”","“What?!” Feng Wu grabbed him and almost jumped to her feet. “What? What did you say?!”","Patriarch Huyan didn’t expect the girl to be so excited, and he almost jumped.","“Is it really a broken star piece? Tell me!” Feng Wu almost tore his sleeve off.","Patriarch Huyan didn’t know why the girl was so excited, but it meant that it was very important to her.","He gave it more thought and said in frustration, “It’s been so long that I can’t remember. But... I think so.”","Feng Wu let out a breath of relief.","She had been worried about where to find the third broken star piece after she found the second. According to the Patriarch, her third senior brother had it now.","That would make things a lot easier!","After she was done with the Northern Yan Kingdom, she had to go to the Dongsang Kingdom, talk to her third senior brother, and get the broken star piece.","Feng Wu wasn’t worried that her third senior brother wouldn’t give her the broken star piece, but she was worried that she wouldn’t be able to find him. According to the white fairy, he would cultivate in seclusion for 30 to 50 years on end.","Feng Wu grew anxious at that thought.","She decided that she would set out for the Peace Grassland and enter the Dongsang Kingdom as soon as Jun Linyuan and Gui Qulai finished their competition.","At that moment.","The giant eagle flew back.","“Master, Master, Gui Qulai is kneeling outside. He wants to see you.” The giant eagle looked curiously at Patriarch Huyan, wondering if he would see Gui Qulai this time.","Gui Qulai?","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","Wasn’t he the one who was going to compete with Jun Linyuan tomorrow? What was he doing here?","Feng Wu was about to ask that question.","The giant eagle suddenly said, “He’s very sincere. He’s been coming here every year for the past ten years.”","“What’s he doing here?” Feng Wu asked curiously.","The giant eagle said, “He’s here to ask for a sword every year for the past ten years. The Patriarch said that he would consider it if Gui Qulai did that and reached a certain cultivation level..”"]},{"number":3908,"title":"Chapter 3908: The Battle (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3908: The Battle (2)","Translator: Henvee Translations Editor: Henvee Translations","Feng Wu looked curiously at the giant eagle. It didn’t say nice things about people for no reason, unless...","The eagle grinned at Feng Wu.","Look at that grin. The eagle must be doing this because that man had given it some sort of reward.","Feng Wu tugged at the Patriarch’s sleeve and looked eagerly at him.","By now, he was very familiar with Feng Wu’s petty tricks, and he found the girl as lovely as ever...","Hence, he looked affectionately at Feng Wu and rubbed her little head.","“Sixth Senior Brother, is he really here for a sword?” Feng Wu asked in a low voice.","Patriarch Huyan nodded. “He’s been asking for it for ten years. That’s very sincere of him, and he’s quite talented in swordplay. Well...’","The eagle then led a swordsman in with a bamboo hat on his head.","Feng Wu had seen Gui Qulai fighting Jun Linyuan on the mountain peak and saw that Jun Linyuan had gained the upper hand, so she was a little relieved.","Gui Qulai?","The prince and Huyan Yichen didn’t dare to move when they saw who it was. They both stood ramrod straight.","Feng Xun wasn’t as lively as before. Right now, he narrowed his eyes and looked at Gui Qulai cautiously.","Although Gui Qulai kept his gaze on Patriarch Huyan, he was surprised to see the others out of the corner of his eye.","It had been years since any outsiders visited the Patriarch. Why was it so crowded now?","However, he didn’t think much of these people. He went straight to Patriarch Huyan and greeted him.","Patriarch Huyan’s eyes lit up when he saw Gui Qulai. “Your cultivation level has risen again!”","Gui Qulai might look like an unapproachable swordsman, but when he was around Patriarch Huyan, he seemed to admire the latter.","He was thrilled every time Patriarch Huyan praised him.","His cultivation level had risen again? Feng Wu wasn’t so sure anymore...","What would happen if Jun Linyuan fought him tomorrow?","Next to her, Patriarch Huyan smiled at Feng Wu. “He’s a pretty good swordsman. How about I let him teach you?”","Gui Qulai couldn’t help but give Feng Wu a curious look. He had never met anyone who could make the old man treat her so nicely.","Feng Wu pursed her lips and shook her head. “No!”","The Patriarch smiled. “We’ll talk about it later, then. You can start any time you want.”","Gui Qulai couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu again.","Someone in the Northern Yan Kingdom had said no to the Patriarch? Who was She?","The Patriarch said, “You’ve been asking for a sword for ten years. That’s very rare. Eagle, bring me the invincible sword.”","The Invincible Sword? That sounded awesome!","The eagle soon went into the armory, where the weapons were stored after the Patriarch forged them. The bad ones would be reforged, and the good ones would be left behind. So far, there were only three of them.","How did Feng Wu know that? Because the eagle told her that after she followed it into the warehouse.","Seeing the three swords hanging on the wall, Feng Wu said, “The Patriarch didn’t tell you which one to take.”","The eagle gave Feng Wu a suspicious look. “The best sword, of course.","After that, it reached for the sword.","“Hey, wait! Wait!” Feng Wu stopped the eagle.","The eagle turned around and looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “What’s wrong?","Feng Wu was hesitating if she should stop the bird.","Jun Linyuan and Gui Qulai were going to have a battle. Gui Qulai had made some progress in his cultivation. With the help of the sword, he would have a higher chance of winning.","Should she stop him?"]},{"number":3909,"title":"Chapter 3909: Should She Stop Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 3909: Should She Stop Him","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Should she stop the eagle?","Meanwhile, the giant eagle was still praising the sword.","“Gui Qulai has made some progress in his cultivation to begin with, and now, he has this Heaven Demon Sword. Tsk, tsk, no one on this continent will be his match in the future.”","Feng Wu stared at the eagle.","Only then did the giant eagle notice the change in Feng Wu’s expression, and it said innocently, “Hey, what’s wrong? You’ve been pulling a long face since we walked in.”","Feng Wu snorted and looked away.","The giant eagle finally realized that something was wrong. It ran up to Feng Wu, but Feng Wu turned away again.","It ran up to Feng Wu, who turned around again.","No matter how dumb the giant eagle was, it could tell that something was wrong.","“What happened? Who upset you? I’ll beat them up for you!”","Crossing her arms, Feng Wu glanced at him. “It’s you.”","The giant eagle panicked a little. “Me? What did I do? How dare I?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, it’s you.”","The giant eagle panicked even more. “What did I do? What did I do? No one dares to pick on you! My master will roast me if I do that!”","Feng Wu almost burst out laughing, but she managed to keep her face straight. “You took my favorite Heaven Demon Sword, and you’re giving it away. Why do you think I’m upset?”","“Is it your favorite sword?” The giant eagle thought, “You’re making it up. It’s not your favorite sword. Do you know what it’s called before I tell you?”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right. As soon as I saw it, I thought it would suit me the best. I just want it!”","The giant eagle looked at Feng Wu in resignation. “Do you really like it?”","Feng Wu said, “I do.”","The giant eagle glanced at her. “You should have told me. I’ll give it to you.” Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure about that?”","The giant eagle said grumpily, “Of course. You’re my master’s favorite, and he’ll give you anything you want. If he won’t give it to you, you can say something nice, and he’ll give in.”","Feng Wu cleared her throat uneasily.","The giant eagle said, “Why are you coughing? It’s like I said something wrong.”","Feng Wu ?cleared her throat uneasily.","The giant eagle said, “That’s why I’m giving you this Heaven Demon Sword. Gui Qulai can have another one. The Star Peak Sword is a nice one, too. Although it’s not a Semi-divine one, it’s still much better than his One Strike.” The eagle then turned to leave.","“But...” The giant eagle gave it some thought and said, “That Heaven Demon Sword is the most suitable for Gui Qulai’s martial art. The first thing my master said when he made it was that it would suit Gui Qulai.”","The eagle was ready to leave after that.","Holding the Heaven Demon Sword, Feng Wu suddenly felt very guilty.","Gui Qulai was a real swordsman, and the Heaven Demon Sword suited his martial arts. If she tried to sabotage his plan, she would be exploiting her Sixth Senior Brother’s favor.","Feng Wu had a strange feeling about it.","Was it wise for her to help Jun Linyuan like this?","Was it what Jun Linyuan would want?","If she had been the one fighting and her opponent’s weapon had been swapped for something less suitable... No, her pride wouldn’t allow her to do such a thing.","What about Jun Linyuan?","Feng Wu was reminded of that proud, elegant teenager. He was so proud. If even she couldn’t bring herself to do it, how could he... “Fine!” Feng Wu tossed the sword to the eagle.."]},{"number":3910,"title":"Chapter 3910: My Pride Won ‘t Allow It","paragraphs":["Chapter 3910: My Pride Won ‘t Allow It","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The giant eagle was confused. “What?” Feng Wu said grumpily, “If it’s his most suitable sword, give it to him!”","The giant eagle was confused. “Are you sure?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes! Just take it away! It’ll only get in my way!”","The giant eagle scratched its head in resignation. It couldn’t understand what the woman was doing.","If she didn’t want to give the sword to Gui Qulai, she could have taken it away. Why did she give it back?","The bird couldn’t understand it.","The giant eagle asked Feng Wu over and over again, but Feng Wu said she didn’t want it. Only then did the eagle bring the sword to Gui Qulai.","Seeing that Gui Qulai had taken the sword away, Feng Xun came to Feng Wu in frustration. “Are we really going to let him take it? This is bad.”","Feng Wu immediately asked what was going on.","Feng Xun said, ‘When Boss Jun went to take care of the old master of the Zuo family, he did defeat that old man, but he was injured as well, and his Sky","Destroyer was damaged.”","Feng Wu glared at Feng Xun. “Why didn’t you say so earlier?!”","Feng Xun said, “I... I didn’t want to ruin Boss Jun’s reputation, so I didn’t tell you that he was injured.”","Feng Wu snapped, “You idiot! I’m so mad! Where is Jun Linyuan now? Take me to him!”","Feng Xun mumbled.","Feng Wu didn’t hear him, so she raised her voice and asked, “What did you","Day ;","Feng Xun mumbled, “After he was injured, he wrote me a letter and told me to take it to Northern Yan’s king so that he could protect you for the time being. After that, he went to a secret place to cultivate. If I knew where he was, I would have taken you with me. This is a great chance for you to work on your relationship.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She rolled her eyes at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun mumbled, “Isn’t it? He was injured trying to save you, and his sword is broken. Don’t you feel sorry for him? Don’t you want to look after him?” Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Xun said, “You’ve been doing a great job hiding all this time. Even someone as capable as Boss Jun couldn’t find you. He said that you were as good at hiding underground as a mole.”","Feng Wu retorted in a low voice, “I’m not like a mole!”","Feng Xun said, “Those people were busy chasing you, and Boss Jun was busy chasing them. By the way, there was the fifth daughter of the Hua family...”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right! I’ve seen her! She and Raoxi tried to kill me!”","Feng Xun nodded. “Boss Jun only found out that Raoxi was after you after he caught that girl. But don’t worry. You’ll never see her again.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is she dead?” That girl had only made one appearance so far.","Feng Xun nodded. “That’s right. She wanted to kill you, so of course, Boss Jun wouldn’t let her live. The Hua family is in Flower Valley, isn’t it? Boss Jun has taken care of that place as well.","“Why do you think Boss Jun was so badly injured? After handling the Zuo family, he dragged his injured body back to Flower Valley and wiped out the entire Hua family. He has cut off the right arm of all their capable cultivators!” Feng Wu was astonished.","While she was running away with the Gao family, Jun Linyuan had done so many things for her...","He had challenged all those families in turn...","“How could he do that? He’s still injured! Does he want to die?!” Feng Wu stomped her foot in frustration.. “Can’t he take care of his own injury first?!”"]},{"number":3911,"title":"Chapter 3911: What Jun Linyuan Did for You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3911: What Jun Linyuan Did for You","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun glanced at Feng Wu and said casually, “You were still being chased, and he blamed himself so much that he couldn’t care less about his own injury.”","Feng Wu was indeed concerned. Frowning, she spun around in circles. Seeing this, Feng Xun smiled a little, but soon suppressed it as if nothing had happened.","Jun Linyuan was indeed injured, but he was a miracle worker and was recovering rapidly. Feng Xun had made it sound more serious so that his silly sister would feel guilty.","How long had it been since they last saw each other? They still hadn’t expressed their feelings for each other yet. If Feng Xun had been the man, their son would have been running around by now.","So, he was going to be the perfect assistant!","Frustrated, Feng Wu mumbled, “Why is he like this? Why won’t he listen to me?!”","Crossing his arms, Feng Xun darted a look at Feng Wu. “Because he’s in love","with someone.”","Feng Wu glared at him. “That’s enough.”","Feng Xun went on talking to himself. “Poor Boss Jun. His internal injury is so severe that his face is ghastly pale. His thin lips are almost white, but he’s still chasing those people. Gosh...”","Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun. “I want to see him! I want to see him now!”","Feng Xun’s stomach lurched. His plan worked!","Unfortunately...","He sighed. “Forget about it. I don’t think anyone can find him now... I wonder if he’ll pass out in the middle of nowhere...”","Feng Wu pictured Jun Linyuan walking alone in the woods with a hand on his chest before passing out...","She was so anxious!","Just then, Feng Xun glanced at her. “You’re worried, aren’t you? You miss him, don’t you? You’re worried about him.”","Feng Wu threw a dirty look at Feng Xun, but she didn’t try to deny it this time.","Feng Xun chuckled inwardly. See? He had made some progress.","The imperial capital wasn’t built in a day. As long as the two of them made some progress, everything would be fine.","“He’ll be here tomorrow, right?” Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun said seriously, “Boss Jun values his promises above all else. Look, he said he would protect you, and he meant it. He said he was going to have a competition tomorrow, and I’m sure he’ll come, even if he’s sick.”","Feng Wu snapped at Feng Xun. “Stop nagging. I know that.”","Feng Xun rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “You know? Give him a reply, then. He’s been working so hard to follow you around. He’s Jun Linyuan, the one who can shake the world with a stomp of his foot!”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything, but she didn’t retort Feng Xun, which meant that she agreed with him.","That night..","Feng Wu tossed and turned but couldn’t fall asleep.","She couldn’t fall asleep.","All she could think of was Jun Linyuan passing out from his internal injury...","How could Feng Xun put that picture in her head?","Feng Wu sat up in bed and took out the arm of discipline.","Didn’t Feng Xun say that Jun Linyuan’s Sky Destroyer was damaged? Since she couldn’t repair it for him now, she might as well modify the arm and make it more suitable for Jun Linyuan.","At that thought, Feng Wu went to the refinery room that very night.","No one but Feng Wu could enter the Patriarch’s refinery room.","No one knew what modifications Feng Wu had made.","Feng Wu was the only one who knew how much Divine Phoenix Blood she had used to nourish the arm.."]},{"number":3912,"title":"Chapter 3912: The Battle (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3912: The Battle (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Where’s Xiao Wu?”","Feng Xun went to look for Feng Wu early in the morning but realized that he couldn’t find her anywhere. He grew anxious.","In the end, the giant eagle took him to the refinery room and told him that","Feng Wu was inside.","Thump, thump, thump!","Feng Xun pounded on the door.","Feng Xun’s heart went out to Feng Wu when he saw her face.","Her beautiful face was drained of all color, and her bright eyes were bloodshot red.","“What’s wrong? What happened?”","It had only been one night. Why did his sister look like she had lost a lot of blood?","Feng Wu sneezed.","Feng Xun threw a robe over her shoulders. “Why did you catch a cold? Where did you go last night?”","Feng Wu waved her hand. She didn’t want to talk about it. Instead, she asked,","“Didn’t you say that the battle was today...”","“That’s right!” Feng Xun said in a hurry. “That’s why I’m here! The battle is about to start. No, it probably has already started! But you’re...”","Feng Wu waved him off. “I’m fine. I have to go.”","Otherwise, why did she work so hard last night?","Seeing how persistent Feng Wu was, Feng Xun nodded. “Alright. But if you don’t feel well, just let me know.”","Feng Wu nodded.","They walked out of the tower to find Huyan Yichen waiting for them.","Huyan Yichen ran up to them. “I knew you were going, so I’ve prepared a carriage. Let’s go!”","He patted the carriage next to him as he spoke. Iron Tower was driving the carriage.","Feng Wu nodded at him, said thank you, and got into the carriage first.","Feng Xun followed her in and sat down.","As a matter of fact, the Junwu Empire had an official residence in Northern Yan, and Feng Xun had already contacted them. Now that Huyan Yichen was around, Feng Xun didn’t need an official residence anymore.","The battle between Jun Linyuan and Gui Qulai wasn’t taking place in the arena.","Their battle was going to take place at the top of Northern Yan.","The tallest building in Northern Yan wasn’t the royal palace, but the royal temple.","“So, they’re going to the royal temple?” Feng Wu cried out. “Doesn’t your king mind it?”","Huyan Yichen smiled bitterly. “His Majesty would love to do something, but one of them is the most capable cultivator of Northern Yan, and the other one is the most powerful cultivator of the Junwu Empire. I don’t think he’ll be able to stop them.”","“The only one that can do anything about it is our Patriarch. Not only didn’t he do anything, but he even chuckled...”","Feng Wu asked, “What did he say?”","Huyan Yichen said, “The Patriarch was glad to hear that. Since he said so, what more can His Majesty say?”","Soon, their carriage was 300m away from the temple.","The temple was surrounded by soldiers, and the roads were heavily guarded. It wasn’t easy for ordinary people to get in, and even Huyan Yichen was almost stopped.","People could still see the battle beyond that range. They just couldn’t see it up close.","Meanwhile, a lot of commoners had been stopped outside as well, and they were there because they had all heard the news. There were at least tens of thousands of them.","“Huyan Yichen, what are you doing here?”","Feng Wu recognized the voice right away.."]},{"number":3913,"title":"Chapter 3913: The Battle (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3913: The Battle (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Raoxi?","Enemies were bound to meet.","Huyan Yichen’s face darkened.","He had always considered Princess Raoxi his enemy, but she didn’t think much of him! At that thought, Huyan Yichen clenched his fists in frustration.","“Wait...’","Seeing Feng Xun next to Huyan Yichen, Princess Raoxi was a little surprised.","They both came from noble families and had met before at social events, so Princess Raoxi recognized Feng Xun when she walked past him.","“Are you... Feng Nun?!” She stared at Feng Xun with twinkling eyes.","She had searched high and low for Jun Linyuan, only to find his best friend here. The two of them were very close. As long as she had Feng Xun, she would know where Jun Linyuan was!","Therefore, as soon as she saw Feng Xun, she fought back her urge to give Huyan Yichen a condescending smile and behaved appropriately.","Feng Xun recognized her as well.","“So, it’s Princess Raoxi...” Feng Xun drew out the last syllable.","He thought to himself, “So, Princess Raoxi is the one who’s been trying to kill","Xiao Wu. What a day!”","Feng Xun was very good at holding grudges. He had memorized Princess Raoxi’s face and decided that he would soon take his revenge.","Princess Raoxi told the officer who stopped their carriage who Feng Xun was.","He was a member of the royal family of the Junwu Empire, but the general still wouldn’t let Feng Xun in.","Princess Raoxi’s face darkened, and she said in a threatening tone, “Are you going to defy me now?”","The general said he wouldn’t dare.","Just then, someone announced the arrival of the eldest prince.","The prince’s carriage slowly arrived. Seeing what was going on, the prince’s servant, Quan Xi asked the question on his master’s behalf.","The prince smiled. “They’re all honored guests I’ve invited. Please let them pass. ”","Then, Princess Raoxi saw that the general really followed the prince’s order.","No...","Princess Raoxi felt as if she had been slapped.","Before, other people would only respect her more than the prince, but why wouldn’t they listen to him now but not her?","“Princess...”","Seeing that Raoxi was gripping her whip, Caixia was worried that she would hit the general, so she reminded Raoxi in a low voice, “Princess? Princess?” Princess Raoxi took a deep breath to fight back her resentment.","She knew what was going on!","What happened in the palace the day before...","Many people had seen it when Feng Wu slapped her in the face. Although the queen had warned them not to tell anvone else. the Drince’s men were there as well, and they would spread the news as fast as they could.","So, they all knew how humiliated she had been.","At that thought, Princess Raoxi was even angrier.","What she didn’t know was that the king was a decisive man. Since he had deprived Princess Raoxi of her right to inherit the throne, he wouldn’t let her mislead other people anymore.","It wouldn’t be a big deal if other people misunderstood, but it would be a disaster if the Patriarch was misled.","Therefore, the king summoned all seven officials last night to discuss the matter.","Naturally, the officials wanted the prince to be the next king, not the princess.."]},{"number":3914,"title":"Chapter 3914: It Began (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3914: It Began (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hence, the officials didn’t argue with one another. For once, they agreed on the suggestion, and it was settled.","The general was the second son of the minister of the Ministry of Official Personnel.","Therefore, he knew that Princess Raoxi was no longer the candidate for the throne, so he didn’t try to save her dignity.","It was just that Raoxi herself didn’t think that other people would know about it so soon.","The prince invited Feng Wu and the others to his private room.","That was right. A lot of private rooms had been built here in a matter of days. The prince’s was on the east wing, and Princess Raoxi’s was on the west. That one detail could tell the difference between the two.","The Northern Yan Kingdom valued the East above all else.","“Who made the seat arrangement?” Seeing that she was in the West, Princess Raoxi was infuriated.","No one dared to reply.","“Get out!” Princess Raoxi had no choice but to vent her anger on her servants. Caixia, her senior maid, was whipped.","The prince asked Feng Wu to sit next to him, but she declined.","The prince grew anxious. “We have the best view and can see everything from here.”","Was that so?","Feng Wu was still hesitating when Feng Xun rushed over and sat down next to the prince.","The prince stared at Feng Xun.","However, Feng Xun patted the empty seat next to him and told Feng Wu, “Xiao","Wu, come here! Sit with me!”","Just then, a figure flew toward them.","The person stopped at the top of the temple and was hundreds of meters above the ground.","Feng Wu had thought that it was Jun Linyuan and was so excited that she thought her heart was going to jump out of her mouth. As it turned out, it was Gui Qulai. She was disappointed.","Feng Xun comforted her. “Gui Qulai is here. I’m sure Boss Jun will be right behind him. Xiao Wu, sit down.”","Feng Wu nodded and sat down next to Feng Xun.","sne ana reng nun were Sitting m tne same row so tnat Jun Linyuan would De able to spot her easily...","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Huyan Yichen sat down on Feng Wu’s right.","The four of them sat in a row.","Feng Wu kept her gaze on the sky, waiting for Jun Linyuan to arrive...","Time ticked by...","15 minutes passed...","30 minutes passed...","45 minutes...","Many grew impatient and began to discuss among themselves.","“Isn’t Jun Linyuan supposed to be fighting Gui Qulai? Why isn’t he here yet?”","“Is Jun Linyuan too scared to come?”","“Normally, he shouldn’t be late for a duel between two top cultivators. I think he’s really scared...’","“I thought he was someone that could shock the world with a stomp of his foot, but as it turned out, he’s nothing much...”","The audience was displeased.","The voices were like mosquitoes buzzing in Feng Wu’s ears.","Feng Wu’s face darkened.","Although she had been complaining about Jun Linyuan as well, finding him too stubborn and overbearing, she was the only one who could say such things about Jun Linyuan. Who were these people to say anything about him?!","Just then, someone next to Princess Raoxi spoke.","He was Princess Raoxi’s younger brother, the third prince of the kingdom.","As he nibbled on the fruit, he crossed his legs and said unhurriedly, “I think that Jun Linyuan was only bluffing.. As a matter of fact...”"]},{"number":3915,"title":"Chapter 3915: It Began (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3915: It Began (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“As a matter of fact, he’s just fishing for fame!” The third prince smirked.","“Sister, I’m telling you. If he stands in front of me, even I can defeat him.","Believe it or not.”","Feng Wu flared up!","Jun Linyuan was the most superior man in the empire, and she wouldn’t stand such filthy words from the third prince!","Before Princess Raoxi could scold him, the third prince went on. “Sister, look at Jun Linyuan. He’s not young anymore, but he hasn’t gotten married yet. I think he’s just...”","Before Princess Raoxi could react, Feng Wu dashed off like a gust of wind.","She slapped the third prince away.","Poor prince...","He was in his seat when he said those words and had put his leg on the table, but Feng Wu had slapped him away.","He flew into the air before falling to the ground.","He was dumbfounded as he stared at Feng Wu. Princess Raoxi was the first to react.","“Feng Wu, you!”","She glared at Feng Wu. “Have you lost your mind? How dare you hit him? Do you know who he is?!”","Feng Wu smirked. “I’ve hit him already, and you’re asking me how dare I do that?”","Princess Raoxi was astonished.","By then, the third prince finally realized what had happened. He burst into tears and ran toward Princess Raoxi.","Naturally, their guards wouldn’t let that happen. However, most of them had been there the day before and had seen with their own eyes how well the king treated Feng Wu.","Princess Raoxi offended Feng Wu the day before and was forced to kneel and apologize. Therefore, they didn’t dare to do anything to Feng Wu now that she was scolding the third prince.","Those who hadn’t experienced what happened the day before came out.","Such as this Captain Xia.","“What’s going on? What happened?!”","Captain Xia was on Princess Raoxi’s side. He was one of the seven generals, and his job was to maintain order in the arena.","That was to say, he was the most influential official here.","He led a team of soldiers in soft armor, and each of them had a saber hanging on their waists. They were ready to draw out their sabers at any moment.","Instantly, things became intense.","The third prince rushed over and pointed at Feng Wu. “Captain Xia, take her down! Kill her!”","Captain Xia looked at the third prince and saw that one side of his face was swollen... It was a ghastly sight.","Captain Xia stared at Feng Wu and narrowed his eyes.","‘Guards!” With a wave of his hand, Captain Xia was going to have Feng Wu arrested and killed.","Meanwhile, Feng Xun and the eldest prince arrived at Feng Wu’s side.","Feng Xun shielded Feng Wu, for he still didn’t know how important Feng Wu was to the king.","Huyan Yichen smirked. The third prince was such a troublemaker. He had messed with someone he shouldn’t have.","Just then, the third prince said, “How dare you hit me? But you’re quite pretty.”","He told Captain Xia, “Don’t kill her yet! Cripple her cultivation and tie her up...”"]},{"number":3916,"title":"Chapter 3916: It Began (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3916: It Began (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The third prince told Captain Xia, “Don’t kill her yet! Cripple her cultivation ability and tie her up... I’ll teach her a lesson!”","As a man, Captain Xia took the hint right away.","However, she deserved what she got for hitting the third prince.","Hence, with a wave of his hand, Captain Xia said, “Take her...”","However, before he could finish, the eldest prince’s cold voice rang out. “Captain Xia doesn’t know what he’s doing. Raoxi is, shouldn’t you know better?”","Princess Raoxi was filled with hatred.","Captain Xia, on the other hand, paused and looked at the eldest prince in bewilderment.","The eldest prince frowned and stared at Princess Raoxi. “How well did our father treat Xiao Wu yesterday? When you offended her, you had to kneel and apologize. You...”","Princess Raoxi threw a dirty look at the crown prince before turning to Captain Xia. “Stop.”","Meanwhile, Captain Xia was utterly shaken.","What did he just hear?","The princess had knelt and apologized?","Captain Xia looked at Princess Raoxi in bewilderment. Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi felt a burning sensation on her face.","She had thought... She was furious.","But the third prince wouldn’t have it.","He glared at the eldest prince, then at Princess Raoxi. “Sister! Why did you stop? Why?! She’s mine! I want her!”","That was getting out of hand!","Princess Raoxi recalled what the seventh princess said about how the king fancied Feng Wu.","“Shut up! Go back to the palace if you don’t want to watch the battle!” Princess Raoxi glared at the third prince.","Meanwhile, the noise attracted a lot of attention.","After all, more and more people were getting wind of the battle, and the royal family was creating a commotion. Everyone liked a bit of gossip, and the people of the Northern Yan Kingdom were no exception.","Hence, a lot of people stuck their heads out and discussed among themselves.","Hearing all the noises, Princess Raoxi was furious. She glared at the third prince.","Meanwhile, the third prince was still glaring at her.","“Why? Why?! I’m the one getting hit! Why am I the one getting yelled at now?” He couldn’t understand it.","As the third son of the king, he had always been doted on. Because he wouldn’t inherit the throne, he had always been able to do whatever he wanted, be it robbing or bullying. Growing up, he had done all sorts of evil things. When he got into trouble, his sister would clean up after him. Hence, he had never felt wronged.","Taking a deep breath, Princess Raoxi told the guards behind her, “Take His","Royal Highness back.”","The third prince stomped his foot. “I’m not leaving! I won’t!”","Seeing that he had gone out of control, Princess Raoxi felt sorry for him as well. She said in resignation, “If you promise that you won’t make any trouble, you can stay.”","“Alright. I won’t make any trouble. I promise!” The third prince promised as he threw a dirty look at Feng Wu.","He had indeed been defeated once, but when he figured out what was going on... Just wait and see!","Princess Raoxi said to Captain Xia, “There’s nothing else here. Captain Xia, please go back to your patrol.”","Captain Xia took his leave and led the team away, but he had a lot of questions on his mind.","He saw with his own eyes that the girl addressed as “Xiao Wu” by the eldest prince had slapped the third prince away. The prince fell to the ground with a thump and almost broke his neck.","“And Princess Raoxi... If the eldest prince hadn’t intervened, would she just watch as I offended Miss Xiao Wu?”"]},{"number":3917,"title":"Chapter 3917: It Began (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Even the princess revered the girl called Xiao Wu, but she had let the captain offend the girl instead... At that thought, Captain Xia, who had been loyal to Princess Raoxi, felt even more disappointed.","On the other hand, the crown prince was a nice guy... He thought to himself.","Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi turned from Captain Xia to Feng Wu. “Are you satisfied now?”","Feng Wu didn’t even look at Princess Raoxi. She only stared at the third prince.","The third prince glared at Feng Wu as well.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","However, he was soon defeated by Feng Wu’s cold gaze and was a little scared...","He took a step back and almost hid behind Princess Raoxi. Feng Wu stared at him. “Apologize!”","“Apologize for what?” Princess Raoxi glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smirked. “If he doesn’t apologize, fine. I’ll keep slapping him.”","What a statement!","Princess Raoxi was the one who had been so arrogant before.","She gritted her teeth and glared at Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu wouldn’t give in. She stared at the third prince and said, “Apologize!”","The third prince gritted his teeth. “What if I don’t?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll hit you, then!”","Their conversation might sound childish, like a quarrel between two kids, but no one dared to take it lightly because one was Feng Wu, the emperor’s favorite, and the other was the third prince of the kingdom.","Even Gui Qulai couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu.","He recognized Feng Wu. Wasn’t she the beautiful girl who stood next to the Patriarch? Had someone picked on her now?","Gui Qulai narrowed his eyes and wondered if he should help her.","Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi could sense all the eyes on her. She gritted her teeth and stared at Feng Wu. “That’s enough!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “It won’t end until he apologizes.”","Princess Raoxi warned Feng Wu in a low voice. “Feng Wu!”","Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to talk to Princess Raoxi anymore. She only stared at the third prince and said, “If you don’t want to apologize, I’ll beat you until you do!”","After that, Feng Wu grabbed the third prince by his collar and picked him up.","Everyone was watching!","Princess Raoxi was angry and anxious.","She was angry at Feng Wu for being so aggressive, and she was worried that she would lose all her authority.","Shocked by Feng Wu’s intimidating tone, the third prince panicked a little as well.","Involuntarily, he turned to Princess Raoxi. “Sister, help!”","Gritting her teeth, Princess Raoxi took a deep breath and said to the third prince, “Apologize!”","The third prince was about to turn her down when Princess Raoxi slapped him.","“Apologize! Can’t you hear me?!” The third prince was dumbfounded.","His sister had hit him...","Feng Wu stared at him.","The third prince could only mumble a few words in Feng Wu’s direction.","Feng Wu smirked. “I can’t hear you!”","The third prince gritted his teeth. “You’re pushing it! ” Feng Wu asked, ‘What did you say?","The third prince took a deep breath. “I’m sorry.”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Who are you apologizing to?”","The third prince said, “I’m sorry...”","Feng Wu pointed east in the direction of the Junwu Empire.","She snorted. “You’ve slandered Jun Linyuan. Kneel in that direction and apologize to him!”","Jun Linyuan stood behind Feng Wu and watched her in silence.."]},{"number":3918,"title":"Chapter 3918: It Began (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The third prince was furious.","As the third prince, he had never been humiliated like this before. All he did was talk about Jun Linyuan.","He had scolded, beaten, and killed a lot of people. But now, he was being forced to... No!","Although the third prince was screaming in his head, when he saw that his sister wouldn’t help him and that Feng Wu was going to hit him at any moment, he had no choice but to sway a little. He then looked back at his sister with much difficulty.","Princess Raoxi nodded at him.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","The third prince was really in tears. Under pressure, he had to kneel to the east and apologize according to Feng Wu’s instructions.","“I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have said bad things about Jun Linyuan...’ The third prince burst into tears.","Princess Raoxi threw a dirty look at Feng Wu. “Are you satisfied now?”","Feng Wu glanced at the third prince. “Say it again, and I’ll beat you up every time I see you!”","After that, Feng Wu raised her hand.","Frightened, the third prince hid behind Princess Raoxi.","“Come. Sit down.” Feng Wu was about to lead Feng Xun back to their seats, but she froze when she turned around.","She saw someone!","Someone who would show up in her dreams all the time and pick on her all the time!","Feng Wu stared at the familiar face in bewilderment.","He was tall, handsome, and extraordinary. He was the most talented teenager in the empire!","He stared at her with his brooding black eyes...","Feng Wu could feel her heart thumping.","After a long parting, she wanted to ask softly, “I hope you’re alright. How’s your injury?","However, those words were stuck in her throat, and she couldn’t utter a word.","Jun Linyuan kept his unblinking gaze on Feng Wu, and there was a greedy look in his eyes.","His girl was alright.","Just then, Princess Raoxi realized something.","“His Royal Highness!” She cried out.","That immediately interrupted the intimate atmosphere.","The frozen world seemed to start moving again.","In her excitement, Princess Raoxi failed to notice the interaction between Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan. Lifting her skirt, she quickly walked up to Jun Linyuan and greeted him with a bow. “Your Royal Highness.”","The crown prince frowned and glanced at Princess Raoxi.","Princess Raoxi froze and didn’t dare to move.","How scary those eyes were...","Compared to a few years ago, he was much more handsome and unapproachable.","However...","Princess Raoxi thought to herself, “He’s always like this. It doesn’t matter.”","Just then, Feng Wu came back to herself and ran up to Jun Linyuan, tugging at his sleeve.","Seeing Feng Wu’s hand, Princess Raoxi was furious.","How dare she?!","Jun Linyuan was going to cut her hand off!","However, the next second, Jun Linyuan turned his gentle gaze on Feng Wu, and the look in his eyes was so tender that it reminded one of a clear pool.","“Yes?” the crown prince asked in a gentle voice.."]},{"number":3919,"title":"Chapter 3919: It Began (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3919: It Began (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan’s voice exploded in Princess Raoxi’s head.","No, it couldn’t be!","She couldn’t believe her eyes.","Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu... Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu...","As a matter of fact, Princess Raoxi had heard about Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu before, but her source told her that Jun Linyuan didn’t like Feng Wu. Not only didn’t he like her, he even found her repulsive...","How did this happen?","Were they acting in front of everyone?","Under Jun Linyuan’s intense gaze, Feng Wu felt her cheeks burning. She patted Jun Linyuan on the chest. “Are you alright now?”","Jun Linyuan only stared at her with brooding eyes.","Feng Wu smacked him again and asked grumpily, “I’m asking you a question. Have you recovered?”","Only then did the crown prince realize what she was asking. He straightened his back and said, “I’m fine.”","However, Feng Wu could feel the bandages on him through his clothes, and she frowned. “Are you still not recovered?”","Just then, someone looked in their direction from the top of the temple.","It was Gui Qulai.","Feng Wu regretted her decision.","She shouldn’t have let Gui Qulai take the sword, but Jun Linyuan’s injury... Frustrated, Feng Wu took out the arm of discipline from behind her and handed it to Jun Linyuan. “Put it on.” The crown prince was confused. “What?” Feng Wu said, “Give me your hand.”","The crown prince did as he was told.","The others were all amazed.","Huyan Yichen watched as the pretty couple talked and saw that Jun Linyuan would do whatever Feng Wu told him to. He couldn’t believe it.","Back then, the arrogant and aloof genius Jun Linyuan had always stuck out his chin and wouldn’t listen to anyone. He was always on his own.","But now, he would answer all Feng Wu’s questions and reach out his hand as if he were her little brother. How was that even possible? Was he still the Jun Linyuan everybody knew?","And Huyan Yichen wasn’t the only one who thought that way.","The eldest prince was astonished as well.","Although he knew that Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan seemed to be engaged, he didn’t expect them to interact like this. It was so...","Princess Raoxi’s nails dug into her palms.","However, the handsome couple had no idea how they had shocked the others.","Holding the arm of discipline, Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan and tried to negotiate. “How about we postpone the battle?”","Jun Linyuan smiled at her and shook his head.","“I knew it!” Feng Wu thought to herself. Jun Linyuan might seem obedient now, but he was actually a stubborn kid. He wouldn’t change his principles.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Put on the arm, then. You’re not doing well because you’ve been injured. I heard that the Sky Destroyer has been damaged as well.”","Jun Linyuan said proudly, “I can win!”","Feng Wu snorted and stomped her foot in frustration. “Not only did Gui Qulai become a little more capable than last time, but he also got the Heaven Demon Sword. I regret it so much! I should never have given it to him!” This was the first time that Jun Linyuan had heard about it.","“The Heaven Demon Sword?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Patriarch Huyan made the best sword for Gui Qulai. It suits him very well. ”","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu knew it. Jun Linyuan had never been intimidated. All he ever did was face the challenge head -on.","No matter how hard it was, no matter how tired he was, he still had to face the challenge.."]},{"number":3920,"title":"Chapter 3920: The Duel (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3920: The Duel (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu watched as Jun Linyuan rose to the sky.","Jun Linyuan wore a black robe with the lower hems flapping in the wind. He looked as handsome as a god.","Just then, a pair of venomous eyes stared at Feng Wu. The gaze was so cold that Feng Wu thought she was going to have goosebumps.","Feng Wu turned around and wasn’t surprised to see the furious look in Princess Raoxi’s eyes.","“You!” Princess Raoxi pointed at Feng Wu and gritted her teeth. “What’s that supposed to mean?!”","Feng Wu was perplexed.","Princess Raoxi stepped forward and stared at Feng Wu. “What’s your relationship with His Royal Highness?!” So, that was why...","“It’s a long story, then,” said Feng Wu.","Princess Raoxi thought that Feng Wu was going to continue, but after that, Feng Wu only stared at the sky and ignored her.","How dare she ignore her like this!","Princess Raoxi knew that Feng Wu was doing it on purpose.","She told herself to control her temper.","Princess Raoxi forced herself to control her emotions. She only calmed down after five minutes.","“Feng Wu.” Princess Raoxi sounded much calmer this time. “Tell me the truth. Aren’t you and His Royal Highness annulled the engagement? Shouldn’t you be archenemies?”","Feng Wu glanced at Princess Raoxi in bewilderment.","Princess Raoxi asked, “Am I wrong?","Feng Wu asked, “Where did you get that information?”","Princess Raoxi said, “The H... I can’t tell you.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “The Hua family?”","Princess Raoxi didn’t say another word.","Feng Wu looked at Princess Raoxi and shook her head. “I used to think that you were quite capable, but it seems that there’s only one word for you.”","“What’s that?” the third prince asked curiously.","“Stupid.” Feng Wu waved Princess Raoxi off. She didn’t have time to talk to this woman. She was watching the battle in mid-air.","The battle between the two swordsmen would change at any moment, and Feng Wu didn’t want to be distracted.","However, her casual tone almost gave Princess Raoxi a heart attack.","“Feng Wu! I’m only talking to you out of kindness, but you’re insulting me! Just because my father dotes on you doesn’t mean you can do whatever you want!” Princess Raoxi was furious as well.","In that split second, Princess Raoxi suddenly realized something very important.","wait!","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan... If the two of them were in love, then what about her father...","Wasn’t her father so obedient because Feng Wu was so pretty that he wanted to make her his concubine? If he knew that Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan had done such an intimate thing in front of everyone...","At that thought, Princess Raoxi was so excited that her face turned scarlet red.","She now knew how to get rid of Feng Wu!","Feng Wu gave Princess Raoxi a strange look.","There was something strange about the princess... The look in her eyes was so crazy that she looked like she was going to blow Feng Wu up.","What did she want?!","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and stared coldly at Princess Raoxi.","By then, Feng Xun also realized that something wasn’t right with Princess Raoxi. Taking Feng Wu’s hand, he said, “Come, let’s go back to our seats and watch the battle. Don’t waste your time on irrelevant people.” Feng Xun recalled what Jun Linyuan was like earlier..."]},{"number":3921,"title":"Chapter 3921: The Duel (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan used to be covered in blood. Feng Xun had no idea what would happen now that Gui Qulai had become even more capable and had enhanced his equipment.","As a matter of fact, Feng Xun was worried sick.","Feng Wu nodded at Feng Xun and went back to her seat, although she wondered what Princess Raoxi was up to.","However, Feng Wu soon forgot about it and focused on the battle above.","Princess Raoxi stared at Feng Wu for a few seconds before looking away. She then whispered something in the third prince’s ear.","Box","The third prince was reluctant at first. “I’m watching the battle.”","However, Princess Raoxi whispered something in the third prince’s ear again. In the end, she told him, “If you can do this, Feng Wu’s reputation will be ruined, and the humiliation you’ve suffered...”","The third prince’s eyes lit up.","“Alright! I’m on it!”","The third prince ran as fast as he could, heading for the palace.","Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi threw a dirty look at Feng Wu. Just wait and see!","Up in the sky.","The battle between Jun Linyuan and Gui Qulai was fierce.","The blade glinted.","The sword intent swept across the air, and the shockwave seemed to create tidal waves.","Their swords were like swimming dragons!","It was a world of swords!","“Oh god!","Just then, Feng Wu cried out.","Feng Wu wasn’t the only one. Many people cried out in surprise as well, for one of the two men had been stabbed.","Jun Linyuan wore a black robe, while Gui Qulai wore a straw hat and linen clothes.","Gui Qulai was aiming at Jun Linyuan. Jun Linyuan dodged to the side, but the blade slid across his stomach.","A drop of blood fell to the ground.","Feng Wu rose to her feet, looking even more anxious.","Feng Xun was equally anxious. “I told you already. He’s injured...’","Judging by the current situation, Jun Linyuan was at a disadvantage, while Gui Qulai was winning.","“Gui Qulai’s strike was aimed at Boss Jun’s wound!” Feng Xun turned to Feng wu.","Feng Wu frowned. “Isn’t it on his chest?”","Didn’t she hit the bandage on Jun Linyuan’s chest when she punched him?","However, Feng Xun said with a long face, “His chest is indeed injured, but the bigger one is on his abdomen. It’s been cut all the way from his left armpit to his lower right abdomen. It’s such a long gash!”","Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun nodded.","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","Seeing how unperturbed Gui Qulai was, Feng Wu wanted to snap his sword in half.","What Feng Wu didn’t know was...","Thew weren’t the nnlv ones watching","The Dongsang Kingdom.","Night Owl sat on a chair with a pale face and coughed violently.","There was a giant curtain of water in front of him, through which Night Owl could see everything that was going on in the battle.","Mr. Sakiya sat on Night Owl’s right. On the left was the capable guard that the king of Dongsan had just given Night Owl.","The man was known as Xiao, and he was probably second only to Jun Linyuan in his capability.","Night Owl had been staring at Jun Linyuan ever since the battle started, wishing that he could cut Jun Linyuan into pieces and skin him alive!","Because he had lost the battle against Jun Linyuan.","He hadn’t lost to Jun Linyuan but to that teenage girl who came out of nowhere!"]},{"number":3922,"title":"Chapter 3922: The Duel (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Night Owl had predicted everything except for Feng Wu.","At the thought of the Immortal Spiritual Fruit Feng Wu stole, Night Owl took a deep breath and didn’t say another word.","Strangely enough, he didn’t hate Feng Wu. Instead, he was intrigued by her, but he hated Jun Linyuan.","He kept his unblinking gaze on the water screen because...","Sakiya glanced at Night Owl and sighed inwardly.","Box","He knew that it was because the crown prince wanted something.","Night Owl wanted nothing more than for Jun Linyuan to lose to Gui Qulai.","Sakiya shook his head inwardly. His Royal Highness’s request wasn’t righteous. A truly capable cultivator should think of a way to defeat their competitors on their own, not asking for help.","Jun Linyuan had always defeated his enemies on his own, not by relying on other people.","That alone put Night Owl at a disadvantage.","Mr. Sakiya was about to say something when Night Owl coughed violently.","Cough... cough..","Seeing that Night Owl was about to cough his lungs out, Mr. Sakiya felt sorry for him.","After everything Sakiya had done to keep Night Owl alive, he decided that he wouldn’t make life harder for Night Owl.","Just then, Night Owl laughed.","Zuoqiu looked up and saw Gui Qulai cut Jun Linyuan in the stomach. He frowned a little. When he turned to look at Night Owl again, Night Owl said coldly, “Sir, what’s that look on your face? Am I not allowed to laugh?” Mr. Sakiya remained unperturbed.","Night Owl pointed at the water curtain and said to Sakiya, “I want Jun Linyuan to lose. It’ll be great if he can die there!”","Mr. Sakiya couldn’t stand it anymore and looked very disappointed. Night Owl was acute enough to see the disappointment in Mr. Sakiya’s eyes. He even knew why.","He stared at Zuoqiu Sakiya and said coldly, “Sir, do you think I’m wrong?”","Sakiya shook his head. “No, I’m not disappointed.”","Instead, he was filled with despair.","Night Owl didn’t see the look of despair in Sakiya’s eyes. He only stared at the water curtain, waiting for Jun Linyuan’s defeat or even death.","“Are the three capable men all in Northern Yan?” Night Owl suddenly asked.","Mr. Sakiya didn’t say anything. Instead, Xiao, the capable man behind Night Owl, crossed his arms and nodded.","Night Owl suddenly asked Xiao, “What’s your level now?”","Xiao said indifferently, “Even if I’m not as good as Jun Linyuan, I’m two levels below him at most.”","That was to say, the two of them were about the same cultivation level.","“Good!” Night Owl waved his hand and gave Xiao an order. ‘You’re leaving for the Northern Yan Kingdom now!”","Mr. Sakiya frowned. “Your Royal Highness...”","However, Night Owl didn’t even look at Mr. Sakiya. He only stared at Xiao. “Go to Northern Yan now. Jun Linyuan is fighting Gui Qulai. If he survives the battle, he won’t be very capable either.. Kill him!”"]},{"number":3923,"title":"Chapter 3923: The Duel (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3923: The Duel (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Xiao cupped his fists. “Yes.”","Night Owl grinned. “Remember, let him die in the Northern Yan Kingdom!”","Xiao left after cupping fists.","Meanwhile, Mr. Sakiya frowned at Night Owl.","Night Owl gave Mr. Sakiya a sidelong glance. “What? Do you think I’m despicable?”","Mr. Sakiya shook his head. He was only confused. “Three top cultivators of the same level are already waiting to take their revenge on Jun Linyuan. Your Royal Highness, why...” Why was he so unconfident?","“Just in case!” Night Owl said without hesitation. “Not only is Jun Linyuan capable, but you also know how lucky he is. What if he narrowly escaped death again?","“I’m sure you know that if Jun Linyuan dies, the Dongsang Kingdom will rule the world. We must kill him at all costs!”","Mr. Sakiya suddenly asked, “Has it never occurred to Your Royal Highness that you should defeat him on your own?”","Night Owl chuckled. “Sir, I’m the crown prince, and I’m too precious to lose.”","Sakiya thought, “Jun Linyuan is the crown prince as well, and he’s all about self-improvement. He’s used his own sword to fight the world, but you, Night","Owl, are nothing compared to him.”","His crown prince was nothing compared to Jun Linyuan.","Sakiya sat there in disappointment.","Night Owl was right. Right now, three powerful cultivators were waiting in Northern Yan in a teahouse a short distance away from the temple.","They each wore a bamboo hat, and the others didn’t know who they were.","But if Jun Linyuan were here, he would recognize them right away.","To be more precise, he had defeated all three of them before.","The old master of the Zuo family in Jingyang City, the matriarch of the Flower Valley, and the master of the Firmament Palace.","Jun Linyuan vented his anger on both the Zuo family and the matriarch of","Flower Valley for hunting Feng Wu. He beat the crap out of them before he left.","Why didn’t he kill them?","Killing a Spiritual Saint would result in a lightning tribulation. The more one killed, the more lightning tribulation they would accumulate, and the breakthrough would become very problematic.","Especially someone as capable as Jun Linyuan, who had to withstand a lot of lightning to begin with. Doubling it would be too much even for him.","Jun Linyuan had to live and protect the person he cared about. He couldn’t die.","Therefore, Jun Linyuan gave them a chance to turn over a new leaf.","But...","Showing mercy this time had left him with some hidden danger.","The old Matriarch of the Firmament Palace opened her eyes.","Before, she could stop Jun Linyuan from killing Zuo Qingluan with a single punch, but now, the old woman had opened her eyes.","But she still couldn’t move, so she only told the old master of the Firmament Palace to leave the mountain and treat the Zuo family’s old master and the matriarch of the Flower Valley.","The old master of the Firmament Palace gladly went to save the two of them and brought them back to the Northern Yan Kingdom.","While Jun Linyuan and Gui Qulai were fighting, the three of them were enjoying themselves in a teahouse.","Feng Wu had no idea of any of this.","Even the king of Northern Yan didn’t know.","A storm seemed to be brewing in the capital city.","Right now, it was only the calmness before the storm.","But it wasn’t exactly peaceful.","The battle was still going on.","Whoosh!","There was another flash of light.","Feng Wu saw another cut on Jun Linyuan’s chest.."]},{"number":3924,"title":"Chapter 3924: The Duel (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3924: The Duel (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Screw you!” Feng WII’s face darkened when she saw Jun Linyuan’s injury.","Jun Linyuan had been losing ground since the battle started, and he had been injured twice.","Feng Wu felt so sorry for him.","However, the discussion only made her angrier.","Behind her were the people of Northern Yan.","They were discussing among themselves.","‘Wait, is that Jun Linyuan? The crown prince?”","“The most powerful man? I think he’s just the most powerful man in the Junwu","Empire. He’s not like that in the Northern Yan Kingdom.”","“That’s right. The most powerful man in Northern Yan is Gui Qulai, the swordsman.”","“And there’s the Patriarch. I heard that he gave Gui Qulai a new sword, Heaven","Demon. From now on, he’ll be known as Gui Qulai, the Heaven Demon Swordsman.”","“So many people have been praising Jun Linyuan, and here I was, wondering how capable Jun Linyuan would be. As it turned out, he’s still going to lose.”","“That’s right! Northern Yan is the most powerful force on this continent, and the Junwu Empire is nothing! We’re superior to them!”","Feng Wu was angry and worried.","She was angry because Jun Linyuan had to fight when he was still injured while Gui Qulai had upgraded his equipment. To make it worse, she had given the sword to Gui Qulai.","She was worried that Jun Linyuan’s injury would get worse.","All of a sudden, nine streaks of sword energy shot out at Jun Linyuan!","“Eight of them are fake, and only one of them is real.” Feng Wu heard a voice.","Feng Wu was confused. It wasn’t Feng Xun.","Turning her head, she saw that someone else had joined her.","No, it wasn’t a human being, but an eagle.","The giant eagle.","The Patriarch’s giant eagle!","Feng Wu was elated! That was right! She still had her Sixth Senior Brother. If things got worse, she could always ask him to stop the unfair battle.","“Did you just say that eight of them are fake and one is real?” Feng Wu looked at the eagle in bewilderment.","The giant eagle sat there like a human being, and it had deliberately adjusted its size. Therefore, many people who had been watching the battle didn’t notice the eagle next to Feng Wu.","Staring at the battle in the sky, the giant eagle narrowed its eyes as if it was thinking about something.","“It’s a unique swordplay. If that kid can find out which is the real one, he’ll be able to turn things around,” the giant eagle had never been so serious.","Feng Wu looked up in a hurry.","The nine streaks of dragon-like sword energy each had a different color, and they looked like nine dragons. Which one was real?","“You won’t recognize it,” the giant eagle said unhurriedly.","Feng Wu was so frustrated that she couldn’t recognize it, for she wasn’t capable enough yet. If that was the case, why would the silly bird tell her?","Just then, Feng Wu heard a voice in her head.","The green one.","wait!","Feng Wu recognized the voice as Little Phoenix’s. She was the only one who could hear it.","“Green?” Feng Wu repeated in bewilderment.","As a matter of fact, she was asking Little Phoenix, but the giant eagle didn’t know that.","“You can tell?!” The giant eagle stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She reacted quickly and stared at the giant eagle. “How do you know that?”","The eagle glanced at Feng Wu and said proudly, “Of course I do. I know everything. But how did you guess it? Why did you guess green?”","Feng Wu didn’t have time to talk about it. Instead, she focused on the sky. The eagle wouldn’t let go of Feng Wu. “How did you know that? How?”","Feng Wu looked up at the sky and asked the eagle, “Then how did you know?”","The eagle said, “Of course I know. Gui Qulai didn’t understand the sword intent himself and had been walking back and forth outside our tower for months. He almost pulled his hair off, but my master explained it to him. I was there. How do you think I knew?”","Seeing that Feng Wu was going to shout, the giant eagle stopped her. “Stop it. It’s not fair.”","Feng Wu said angrily, “Giving Gui Qulai the Heaven Demon Sword was the most unfair thing! Why can’t I tell Jun Linyuan?”","“No, you can’t.” The eagle wrapped its wings around Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “...I’m going to tell Sixth Senior Brother that you’ve been bullying me!”","The eagle panicked. “Hey, don’t do that! I’ll let go of you, alright? But you can’t tell on me.”","The eagle thought, “I guess I can’t help Gui Qulai anymore.” After all, Feng Wu had the Patriarch behind her.","Feng Wu grunted. When she crawled out from under the wings and looked up at the sky, she saw...","“Wait a minute!”","Feng Wu was surprised, and so was the giant eagle.","Because by then, the eight sword images were gone, and all that was left was the green sword energy!","The green sword flew toward Jun Linyuan like a giant dragon, and Jun Linyuan grabbed it.","Right now, he looked like a sovereign lord, so powerful that it was an unmatched visual impact.","“He, he...” The eagle turned to look at Feng Wu and stammered in surprise. “He guessed it, didn’t he?”","Feng Wu gloated. “No, he didn’t! Jun Linyuan is the smartest person! Just live with it!”","The eagle said, “I don’t believe you. He must have guessed it.”","Feng Wu gloated. “Even if that’s the case, it’s only because he’s unbelievably lucky. Luck is a part of one’s capability. What are you going to do about it?!”","The eagle said, ‘You’re on his side!”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right! I’m on his side! What are you going to do?!”","The eagle was furious. What was there to be proud of? He was just a teenager who had almost been defeated by Gui Qulai. What was there to be proud of...","Well...","The eagle scratched its head. Gui Qulai seemed to be quite a capable cultivator. It couldn’t defeat him when he was twenty.","The bird stopped thinking about it.","While the eagle was watching the battle in the sky and saw the tens of thousands of sword energies shooting out like erupting volcanoes, it shuddered all of a sudden, and countless sword intents appeared in its head...","It seemed that it was going to break its bottleneck.","“Shit!” Little Phoenix cried out in Feng Wu’s ear.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s wrong? What’s wrong?”","Little Phoenix pointed at the eagle with a long face. “It, it... It’s going to make a breakthrough in advance, and it’ll be stronger than me again. It’ll be able to pick on me again. Gosh, that’s so frustrating!”","Feng Wu looked at the giant eagle in surprise. The bird indeed looked like it was having an epiphany.","Little Phoenix’s wailing voice rang out in Feng Wu’s ears again. “We magical beasts aren’t like you humans. You need an epiphany to make a breakthrough. It’s already very difficult for magical beasts to gain intelligence, but an epiphany is as difficult as ascending to heaven. Therefore, we usually don’t need an epiphany during breakthroughs.","“But if you have an epiphany, your cultivation level will rise by a lot more than one or two levels!","Little Phoenix cried. “It’s having an epiphany now! It’s having an epiphany!” Feng Wu gave Little Phoenix a sympathetic look, then looked at the eagle...","Feng Wu noticed that the apron she made for the eagle in her spare time was hanging on its back, and the pocket was stuffed with nuts, sweets, and snacks.","This bird..","“It’s just here to enjoy the show.” Feng Wu said in resignation.","“How many breakthroughs can it make?” That was what Little Phoenix cared about the most.","If the eagle only made one or two breakthroughs, Little Phoenix might be able to catch up with it. However, if it made too many breakthroughs... Little Phoenix still remembered how the eagle had stopped it when it tried to enter the tower. It was so frustrating.","Feng Wu looked at Little Phoenix and shook her head, indicating that she didn’t know either.","Meanwhile, things had turned around in mid-air.","When Jun Linyuan exerted his full power, Gui Qulai began to lose ground.","Feng Wu almost jumped to her feet.","“Jun Linyuan held back because he wanted to see how capable Gui Qulai was!” Feng Wu turned to the eldest prince. “He’s exerting his full power now!”","The eldest prince’s face was a little pale.","He had never thought that Jun Linyuan would win.","How could he possibly win?","Who was Gui Qulai?","Gui Qulai was born a genius. When he was little, the Patriarch taught him how to use a sword. He started challenging masters of various sects when he was ten and became a Spiritual Saint when he was twenty. From then on, he was invincible!","He had even been to that legendary kingdom on the other side of the East Sea and had come back safe and sound!","Jun Linyuan was indeed an incredible cultivator, but Gui Qulai, who had fought so many battles and stood at the top of the world, wasn’t someone Jun Linyuan could defeat.","Therefore, when Jun Linyuan was at a disadvantage at first, the eldest prince couldn’t understand why everyone was saying that Jun Linyuan wasn’t good enough. Wasn’t it obvious? There was no way he could win.","But now...","The eldest prince stood there in astonishment.","Jun Linyuan didn’t even use the arm of discipline. He was using the half-damaged Sky Destroyer that Feng Wu had mentioned.","The Sky Destroyer was scarlet red in color, and wherever the sword went, blood splashed everywhere.","One strike, two strikes, three strikes...","By then, Gui Qulai had been stabbed over a dozen times.","The eldest prince couldn’t sit still anymore. Rising to his feet, he clenched his fists and stared at Jun Linyuan.","Meanwhile, Huyan Yichen was equally dumbfounded.","It was five or six years ago when Jun Linyuan came to the Northern Yan Kingdom last time.","Huyan Yichen believed that Jun Linyuan was a genius back then, but he wasn’t as capable as he was now. He had cornered Gui Qulai, who couldn’t fight back.","Huyan Yichen looked back at Feng Wu. Right now, all Feng Wu cared about was Jun Linyuan.","He then recalled how he had overestimated himself and fallen in love with Feng Wu... Not only that, but he had also thrown a tantrum for hours. Huyan Yichen was so ashamed that he almost dropped to the ground.","Meanwhile, someone else was equally astonished.."]},{"number":3925,"title":"Chapter 3925: The Perilous Moment","paragraphs":["Chapter 3925: The Perilous Moment","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Night Owl was also astonished.","He couldn’t sit still after Jun Linyuan turned things around.","Although he Imew deep down that Jun Linyuan was never going to lose, Night Owl was still so angry that he almost jumped off his chair.","Just when Sakiya thought he was going to explode, Night Owl took a deep breath and let out a breath of relief. Only then did he calm down.","Seeing Night Owl like this, Sakiya nodded. As long as the crown prince could stay calm, there was still hope.","“Sir, I was so wise that I sent Xiao ahead of time.” Night Owl played with the fruit in his hand and smiled at Sakiya.","Sakiya didn’t say anything.","“Master, are you disappointed in me?” Night Owl stared at him.","Sakiya narrowed his eyes and looked at the crown prince, whom he had brought up.","Night Owl snickered. “Master, have you fantasized about having Jun Linyuan as your pupil so many times that you couldn’t sleep at night?”","Night Owl stared at Sakiya as he spoke.","Sakiya narrowed his eyes even more.","Night Owl laughed so hard that he was convulsed. He even clapped his hands. “Master, I was only joking!”","Sakiya stared at Night Owl and heaved a long sigh. He cupped his hands at Night Owl and left.","He was leaving just like that?!","Night Owl’s face darkened when he saw Sakiya leave. He smashed the table next to him after Sakiya was gone.","“He just doesn’t like me!","“He just thinks that Jun Linyuan is better than me!","“Is Jun Linyuan stronger than me? He’s going to die! How can he be better than me?!”","Night Owl vented his frustration.","He chased everyone out of the room.","His heart-wrenching scream resonated in the spacious room.","He whimpered like an injured beast.","To him, who was only one step away from Jun Linyuan, Jun Linyuan’s talent was unacceptable.","He had been dreaming about surpassing Jun Linyuan! Just then, a dark shadow appeared and asked a question.","“Do you want to surpass Jun Linyuan?”","Who could it be?!","Night Owl turned around involuntarily, but there was no one behind him.","A chill ran down his spine. “Do you really want to surpass Jun Linyuan?” The voice rang out again.","‘Who’s there? Who are you? Come out!”","Night Owl was on the alert. He kept spinning around, trying to find the person, but no matter how hard he tried, he couldn’t find the person.","“Tell me yes or no.” The voice seemed to be giving Night Owl a chance to make a choice.","Night Owl froze on the spot.","As the voice rang out, a terrifying power seemed to restrain him. Night Owl realized that he couldn’t even move a finger. Why was this happening? To make it worse, Night Owl felt the power of death around him.","What a terrifying power...","As a prince of the Dongsang Kingdom, Night Owl had met many capable cultivators, but he had never met anyone so terrifying.","This person reminded him of Minister Chu!","People wanted to prostrate on the ground and worship this person.","“Who on earth are you?”","The person didn’t reply.","Seeing that Night Owl still hadn’t answered the question, the person seemed displeased. The suffocating coldness seemed to dissipate as well.","Night Owl’s stomach lurched.","He suddenly had a feeling that he would lose this opportunity forever.","Seeing that the master was going to give up on him, Night Owl suddenly raised his voice. “Wait!","“I’ll tell you! I’ll answer your question now!","“That’s right! I’m jealous of Jun Linyuan! He’s the one I want to defeat the most!","“He’s my nightmare as long as he’s alive and my archenemy after he’s dead!","Night Owl was about to say something else when the shadow waved at him.","Night Owl immediately stopped talking.","“You talk too much.” The shadow seemed displeased.","Night Owl held his breath.","Could it really be Master Chu Tianxiao...","Night Owl was thrilled.","The next second, the shadow tossed Night Owl a stone.","To be more precise, it was a purple pebble.","Night Owl looked at the purple pebble in bewilderment.","The shadow said, “To master the technique, you have to first... Once that happens, Jun Linyuan won’t be your match anymore.”","The Rhadnw was ready in leave after that","Night Owl didn’t see the person’s face and had no idea where the person came from. Seeing that the shadow was leaving, Night Owl ran after them. “What if I don’t want to practice it?”","The shadow snorted. “It’ll set itself on fire in two hours.”","After that, the shadow disappeared, leaving Night Owl behind.","What was the prerequisite for mastering the technique?","Night Owl injected his spiritual essence into the purple pebble, and soon, words flew out of it and lined up in the air.","The first line of the words in mid-air said, “To master the technique, one has to castrate themselves first..","Night Owl was astonished.","It took him a while to recover from the shock.","Castration? Night Owl didn’t know what to say.","Naturally, he wouldn’t do that.","That was preposterous!","Night Owl looked at the water screen and saw that the battle was coming to an end.","Night Owl thought to himself, “Jun Linyuan is going to win.”","But so what if Jun Linyuan was going to win? Night Owl had long seen that Jun Linyuan was injured, and there was blood on his clothes. It had to cost him a lot.","Xiao couldn’t get there yet. Even with the special portal, it would still take him some time.","But the three old masters were there. Night Owl sat back down and waited for Jun Linyuan’s death.","Meanwhile, in the temple of the Northern Yan Kingdom.","Seeing that Jun Linyuan had gained the upper hand and Gui Qulai was steadily losing ground, Feng Wu was so excited that she almost waved her fists. However, she restrained herself when she considered the fact that the giant eagle was having an epiphany.","A short distance away, Princess Raoxi clenched her fists involuntarily, her cheeks flushed and her eyes bright.","Only the people of the Northern Yan Kingdom knew what a capable cultivator Guilai was. Right now, Jun Linyuan was going to defeat him.","“Whoosh!”","Sky Destroyer moved again, and this time, it stabbed at Gui Qulai’s throat.","It was too late to dodge.","The Sky Destroyer was aimed at Gui Qulai’s throat.","Time seemed to freeze at that moment.","Everyone held their breaths, and the people of the Northern Yan Kingdom watched this in astonishment.","As much as they hated to admit it,","Jun Linyuan had indeed pointed his sword at Gui Qulai’s vital point. With a flip of his wrist, Gui Qulai’s throat would be pierced instantly, and his life would be in danger.","“You win.”","Gui Qulai stared at Jun Linyuan with a defeated look in his eyes.","He had risen by a level since the last time he met Jun Linyuan and had switched to the Heaven Demon Sword. He had come here with great ambition, but he had been defeated by Jun Linyuan. It took him by surprise.","Therefore, when Jun Linyuan was ready to draw back his sword, Gui Qulai ambushed him! “You bastard!”","Feng Wu was furious.","“How dare you sneak up on my Junjun! You must be tired of living!”","Feng Wu had made up her mind. She would tell her Sixth Senior Brother about it when she got back.","Little Phoenix said, “He’s forcing Jun Linyuan to kill him!”","What?","Feng Wu looked up and saw that the tip of Jun Linyuan’s sword was already in Gui Qulai’s next. Blood was oozing out, but Gui Qulai was still smiling.","Jun Linyuan had obviously stopped, but Gui Qulai grabbed Sky Destroyer with his bare hands.","His palms were covered with blood, but he still stuck Sky Destroyer into his throat.","He had to have lost his mind!","Just then, the people of the Northern Yan Kingdom saw it as well.","Their eyesight wasn’t as good as Feng Wu’s, so they only saw a little.","“Jun Linyuan has crossed the line! Gui Qulai admitted our defeat, but he still wants to kill him!”","“That’s right! How can he be so cruel?!”","“How can he be so cruel? Haven’t you heard of that fiend? He’s synonymous with cold-blooded murderers!”","“But no matter how many people he kills, he should do it in the Junwu Empire.","He can’t show off in the Northern Yan Kingdom!”","“That’s right! Gui Qulai is our symbol. We can accept his defeat, but how can Jun Linyuan humiliate him like this?!”","“By humiliating Gui Qulai, he’s humiliating all the people of the Northern Yan Kingdom.”","Feng Wu was furious.","Blind!","Were these people blind?","Couldn’t they see what was going on?","No, they weren’t blind. Some of them could see what was going on, but as natives of Northern Yan, they always took Gui Qulai’s side.","That was their home-ground advantage!","Feng Wu was about to say something when someone stepped out.","“It’s not what you think. There has to be a misunderstanding...” Princess Raoxi rose to her feet and turned to face the crowd. “Please trust me. I’ll give you an explanation!”","Feng Wu stared at her coldly.","What was that supposed to mean? Wasn’t it obvious? Gui Qulai had been trying to kill himself and wanted to die by Jun Linyuan’s sword...","Feng Wu looked up anxiously.","Jun Linyuan was badly injured, so when Gui Qulai exerted all his strength, Jun Linyuan couldn’t push him away.","Below, Princess Raoxi seemed to be speaking up for Jun Linyuan, but her words were ambiguous.","Feng Wu heard someone ask Princess Raoxi, “What’s your relationship with the crown prince of the Junwu Empire? Why are you helping the people of the Junwu Empire instead of our own swordsman?","Princess Raoxi looked as if she had been put in a difficult spot, but her cheeks had turned pink...","Feng Xun glared at Princess Raoxi. Why did he feel that the princess was looking for trouble? Why did she seem to want to create a rumor between her and Boss Jun?","That was indeed the case.","Tears welled up in Princess Raoxi’s eyes as she shook her head. “You’re mistaken. How can I have anything to do with His Royal Highness? I only met him a few years ago, and we sat in the same carriage... Other than that, how can there be anything between us?”","“It’s improper for a man and a woman to stay in a room alone, and you were in","the same carriage! Who knows what you did in the carriage?”","“Your Royal Highness, if you really have nothing to do with Jun Linyuan, from now on, you don’t have to say another word for him!”","“But... but His Royal Highness is a guest...”","“Look, don’t you see? Princess Raoxi is still on His Royal Highness’s side. Would she do this if they weren’t involved? Have they...”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She looked at Princess Raoxi in astonishment.","Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi was also looking at Feng Wu, and their eyes met.","Feng Wu saw the look of satisfaction in Raoxi’s eyes.","“She did it on purpose!” Feng Xun was furious!","Boss Jun was supposed to be an impeccable man, but he had just been blackmailed by this woman, right under their noses.","Feng Wu was amazed by how shameless Princess Raoxi was.","Princess Raoxi only snorted and went on talking to her people.","Feng Wu held her breath. Suddenly, she concentrated her energy in her dantian and shouted at the top of her lungs.","“Gui Qulai!”","Hearing Feng Wu’s thunderous voice, everyone gave her strange looks.","Feng Wu went on yelling. “Get the hell down from there!”","A hush fell over the crowd.","Everyone was speechless.","Even the third prince looked at Feng Wu in astonishment and admiration.","That was incredible!","After all, Gui Qulai was the best swordsman of Northern Yan!","What a formidable cultivator!","How dare Feng Wu yell at him like that? It was as if she was yelling at her servant.","Princess Raoxi smirked and waited for Feng Wu to embarrass herself.","But...","To everyone’s astonishment, Gui Qulai stopped moving when he heard Feng Wu’s voice.","Jun Linyuan looked from Gui Qulai to Feng Wu and was even more confused. Even someone as smart as the crown prince couldn’t figure out what was going","on.","Gui Qulai let go of Jun Linyuan’s Sky Destroyer and only landed after giving him a long look.","He had really landed.","No one said a word. They all held their breaths and stared at Gui Qulai, wondering what had happened to him.","The swordsman had always been a lone wolf. What was he going to do now?","Was he going to kill the girl?","That was the only way to save his dignity as a swordsman, wasn’t it? Many people thought so.","What Princess Raoxi was thinking was that even if Gui Qulai didn’t kill Feng Wu, he would still teach her a lesson because the best swordsman couldn’t be humiliated!","Right now, Jun Linyuan was standing behind Feng Wu like a rock, protecting the petite girl in front of him.","Princess Rao xi stepped forward and bowed at Gui Quai. She was about to say something when...","He nodded at her without saying a word. He had always been a man of few words.","Princess Raoxi didn’t feel offended either because Gui Qulai was powerful","enough to do that.","Gui Qulai stood in front of Feng Wu and kept his unblinking gaze on her.","Feng Wu cleared her throat uneasily.","She had bellowed in excitement just then, but when Gui Qulai walked up to her, she felt a little embarrassed. After all, he was the best swordsman of the Northern Yan Kingdom. Was she a little... However, Gui Quai spoke the next moment.","“Miss, how can I help you?”","Wait...","Everyone was scared out of their wits.","Miss?","What did he mean?","Did he mean what he thought he meant?","What was with that title?","However, Gui Qulai frowned and spoke again. “Miss?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Noticing that all eyes were on her and even Jun Linyuan crossed his arms and raised his eyebrows, Feng Wu was embarrassed.","Feng Wu waved him off. “You’re not my servant. That’s not necessary.”","Gui Qulai nodded and didn’t say anything else, but he seemed to be protecting Feng Wu from where he stood.","Well...","Three people were sipping tea in a teahouse a short distance away.","The battle between the swordsmen on the top of the temple had ended.","The show was only getting started.","“It’s our turn.”","It was none other than the old master of the Firmament Palace.","With a wave of her hand, she covered her face with a black scarf.","The head of the Firmament Palace was hiding her face, which meant that she didn’t want to expose herself.","The Zuo family’s elder and the Hua family’s old lady looked at each other, and they covered their faces as well.","Hence, when the crowd was about to leave, formidable, cold energy spread out toward the temple.","Jun Linyuan narrowed his eyes and pulled Feng Wu behind him. The next second!","Gui Qulai stood in front of Feng Wu as well.","The old master of the Zuo family, the old lady of the Hua family, and the master of the Firmament Palace joined the battle. They formed a triangle around Jun Linyuan and the others.","Everyone was astonished.","They stared at the three masked men in black, who had surrounded Jun Linyuan and the others. Who were they? Why were they so powerful?","They hadn’t started fighting yet, but the impact made their blood boil.","They were too close.","Hence, the commoners backed away.","But they were curious as well, so the bold ones stopped at a teahouse a kilometer away. Together, they stared at the imminent battle.","They had a feeling that the battle would be fiercer than the one between Jun Linyuan and Gui Qulai.","Patriarch Zuo, Matriarch Hua, and the master of the Firmament Palace took up positions in mid-air and surrounded the crowd.","Seeing the princes and princesses of Northern Yan, Patriarch Zuo said coldly,","“You random people should get out of my way!”","Who was their target?","“Our target is Jun Linyuan. The rest of you, leave.” The old Lady Hua only wanted to finish the battle as soon as possible. She didn’t want to get involved with the most capable cultivators of the Northern Yan Kingdom.","Gui Qulai was one of them.","And they didn’t want to mess with Patriarch Huyan either.","Princess Raoxi and the eldest prince looked at each other.","The three of them...","Gui Qulai said, “It’s a battle of the Spiritual Saints. Leave!”","He was a swordsman of the Northern Yan Kingdom, so he reminded the princes and princesses.","Neither Princess Raoxi nor the eldest prince moved.","Apart from them, Feng Wu, Little Phoenix, Feng Xun, Huyan Yichen, and the eagle were also there.","“Your Royal Highness, it’s been a while. How have you been?” Patriarch Zuo asked in a taunting voice.","Half a month ago, Jun Linyuan attacked the Zuo family’s old manor in Shangyang Province and defeated the old man. Today, things had turned around, and Patriarch Zuo was sure that he was going to win.","Of course, Princess Raoxi recognized them right away, for she had worked with them before.","They weren’t the only ones. There were more!","They were after Feng Wu, but why did they go after Jun Linyuan now? Princess Raoxi was suspicious, but her eyes soon lit up because she had an excellent idea!","The best way to get Jun Linyuan.","“Get out.” Jun Linyuan tried to push Feng Wu out of the circle.","But Feng Wu shook her head affirmatively. “No.”","Jun Linyuan frowned a little. “Do as I say.”","Feng Wu looked into his eyes. “No! I want to fight alongside you!”","However, at that moment, a gust of wind charged at them.","Apart from Jun Linyuan and Gui Qulai, everyone else was blown hundreds of meters away before they fell to the ground with a thump.","Of course, Patriarch Zuo wouldn’t be polite with these kids. Even Princess Raoxi and the eldest prince fell to the ground, let alone Feng Wu.","“Ouch!” The giant eagle was woken up by the noise. Covering its butt, it opened its eyes and looked around in confusion. Was the battle over?","“Stop whining! What level are you now?” Little Phoenix sat on the eagle’s shoulder and smacked it on the head.","The giant eagle was still dumbfounded. “I used to be at Level... but now... I’ve risen by one, two, and three levels... Gosh, I’m a Level-2 Spiritual Saint now!”","The giant eagle stomped its foot in frustration. “I could have made another breakthrough, but I was woken up. Who did it? Who kicked me?!”","Staring at the eagle in astonishment, Little Phoenix cringed.","The eagle was already a Level-2 Spiritual Saint! Little Phoenix didn’t know what to say.","The giant eagle looked at Little Phoenix. “Did you just hit my head?”","Little Phoenix swallowed.","Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi grabbed Feng Wu’s arm, for Feng Wu was running toward the arena.","“Listen to me! I can save Jun Linyuan!” Princess Raoxi had never been so serious. “Give me what I want, and I’ll help you save Jun Linyuan!” Feng Wu threw off her hand.","However, Princess Raoxi shouted after her, “Jun Linyuan is alone, but he’s fighting three Spiritual Saints. Do you think he can defeat them all?!","“Do you think the three of them are the only ones? You’re making a big mistake if you think that way.”","Feng Wu stopped, turned around, and stared at Princess Raoxi.","She Imew better than Princess Raoxi that Jun Linyuan was injured.","He had been injured before the battle, and his wounds had only gotten worse. Feng Wu could smell blood on him just then, and his clothes were soaked with blood. However, because he was wearing a black robe, people couldn’t see it with their naked eyes.","“And the Dongsang Kingdom?” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. Princess Raoxi smirked. “You’re so good at guessing.”","Feng Wu said coldly, “Didn’t you work with them to kill me?”","Princess Raoxi almost choked on her own spit.","However, she could do it, but she couldn’t say it aloud. Therefore, she denied it right away. “That’s bullshit!”","Feng Wu smirked and didn’t reply.","The others were dumbfounded.","Especially the eldest prince and Huyan Yichen. They exchanged looks.","Did Feng Wu just say that Princess Raoxi had teamed up with these Spiritual Saints to kill Feng Wu?","That was to say, Feng Wu had escaped the pursuit of these powerful cultivators.","That couldn’t have been!","But judging by the look on Feng Wu’s face, she was telling the truth.","The eldest prince was astonished!","Meanwhile, Huyan Yichen was dumbfounded.","It then occurred to him that he had fancied Feng Wu before and had felt conflicted because of the rumor about Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan... Gosh, he was thinking too highly of himself!","Staring at Feng Wu, Princess Raoxi said, “I’m the only one who can save Jun","Linyuan now!”","Feng Wu glanced at her and said, “Speak!”","But Princess Raoxi couldn’t tell the others that because it was very private.","She whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear.","Feng Wu only had one word for her suggestion. “Shameless!”","However, Princess Raoi wasn’t provoked. Instead, she grinned at Feng Wu. “I’m taking advantage of the situation. Yes, I find it shameless, but you’re in love with him. Since you like him, you should give up on him.” What kind of logic was that?!","Feng Wu ignored her and ran into the circle as fast as she could.","Feng Wu saw how shameless the three Spiritual Saints were. They were attacking Jun Linyuan all at once!","Feng Wu didn’t think much of it under normal circumstances, but her Junjun was so badly injured that she almost couldn’t breathe.","She saw Gui Qulai watching the battle as if he was comprehending something.","“Gui Qulai.” Feng Wu looked at him.","Gui Qulai revered Feng Wu because he had seen with his own eyes how the Patriarch treated the girl.","The old master treated her like a treasure, so Gui Qulai saw her as a young master.","Feng Wu said, “Will you listen to me?”","Gui Qulai looked at Feng Wu and nodded.","Feng Wu said, “I know you’re a top swordsman and won’t follow orders. Let’s make a deal.","“If you help me this time, I’ll owe you one.","“When you’re in trouble next time, no matter what the situation is, I’ll help you with my life!”","It wasn’t that Feng Wu hadn’t thought about asking for her Sixth Senior Brother’s help. In fact, she had talked to the giant eagle earlier, and the eagle had let slip that the Patriarch wasn’t in the tower.","He wasn’t in the tower... Feng Wu was filled with despair.","Hence, she could only ask Gui Qulai for help now.","A moment ago, Gui Qulai was going to fight Jun Linyuan to the death, but now, she was asking him to help her... Feng Wu didn’t know what to say, but she didn’t mind giving up her dignity for Jun Linyuan. She had to force Gui Qulai for this once.","Gui Quai gave Feng Wu a serious look. After some thought, he nodded and said, “Alright.”","Feng Wu nodded at Gui Qulai with a smile. The next second, she turned to look at the battle and set foot in the arena.","She headed straight for Matriarch Hua as soon as she walked in.","Her plan was very clear. Jun Linyuan still had a chance, and as long as they stalled the other two, Jun Linyuan would be able to take care of one of them as soon as he could!","“Gui Qulai, stall the master of the Firmament Palace! Yes, the tallest old woman!”","The head of the Firmament Palace almost exploded when he heard what Feng Wu said.","The tallest old woman? Was she that old?"]},{"number":3926,"title":"Chapter 3926: The Mighty Crown Prince","paragraphs":["Chapter 3926: The Mighty Crown Prince","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The tallest old woman? Was she old? She was beautiful! The master of the Firmament Palace was furious!","But she didn’t have time to do that because Gui Qulai was already attacking her.","The master of the Firmament Palace didn’t want to fight Gui Qulai, for her target was Jun Linyuan. It wasn’t in her interest to fight Gui Qulai. She couldn’t help but say, “Gui Qulai, this is none of your business. Go away!” Gui Qulai remained unperturbed and didn’t say a word.","Recalling what Feng Wu had promised Gui Qulai, the head of the Firmament Palace gritted her teeth and said, “I’ll do whatever Feng Wu offers you! If she owes you a favor, so will the Firmament Palace! Please leave!”","The three of them had been confident that they could defeat the injured Jun","Linyuan when they attacked him together, but Feng Wu had lured Lady Hua away. If Gui Qulai were to lure her away now, Patriarch Zuo wouldn’t be able to face Jun Linyuan all by himself.","However, Gui Qulai was simply too difficult to handle!","He didn’t say a word.","No matter what the head of the Firmament Palace said, he only struck out with his sword without showing any emotion, which infuriated the old lady.","The head of the Firmament Palace had to dodge the attack while helping Patriarch Zuo to attack Jun Linyuan.","Just then, someone was stabbed.","The head of the Firmament Palace took a look, and her eyes lit up. As it turned out, Feng Wu, who was fighting Matriarch Hua, had been hit.","“An ant can’t shake a tree!” Matriarch Hua smirked.","That was indeed the case.","Feng Wu was only a peak Spiritual Overlord and hadn’t reached the Spiritual Saint stage yet. How was she supposed to fight these top cultivators? She wouldn’t have been so reckless on any other day, but Jun Linyuan’s life was at stake now, so she had to do her best.","Whoosh!","Another strike cut Feng Wu’s arm.","Feng Wu dodged in time and wasn’t hit in the vital part, but her clothes were soon soaked with blood.","Blood oozed out like a blossoming flower.","Jun Linyuan was so anxious that his eyes were bloodshot red, but he was surrounded by the old master of the Firmament Palace and Patriarch Zuo.","The temperature dropped, and everyone felt as if they had fallen into an icehouse.","Seeing Jun Linyuan’s rage, the head of the Firmament Palace smirked. “Jun Linyuan, I didn’t know you could look like that!”","Jun Linyuan stared at the master of the Firmament Palace with his cold eyes. The next second, he pointed Sky Destroyer at her, and the sword energy shot up like a rainbow!","“Argh!” The head of the Firmament Palace screamed. The blade had pierced her shoulder!","“Go to hell!”","The moment Jun Linyuan stabbed the master of the Firmament Palace, Patriarch Zuo took the chance and stabbed Jun Linyuan in the back.","“Jun Linyuan, watch out!”","Seeing that Jun Linyuan was going to injure the master of the Firmament Palace at the cost of his own life, Feng Wu knew that Jun Linyuan wanted to kill the master of the Firmament Palace. That way, he would only have two people to deal with.","“Don’t worry. I can do it. I have Little Phoenix and the giant eagle. We’ll buy you some time!”","That was indeed the case.","By then, Little Phoenix had arrived with the giant eagle. They charged into the battlefield and headed for Matriarch Hua.","The giant eagle was the most capable one in Feng Wu’s group, and it was already a Level-2 Spiritual Saint. Both Feng Wu and Little Phoenix were stuck at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage.","Even so, the crowd was shocked when they saw what Feng Wu fought. Especially Princess Raoxi, whose nails almost dug into her palms when she saw what Feng Wu did.","She had ordered people to hunt Feng Wu down, so of course she knew how capable Feng Wu was. She was a cripple without any cultivation ability back then, and before she was crippled...","Wasn’t she supposed to be an intermediate Spiritual Overlord?","How long had it been?","It had only been a few months, but she had improved again!","Why was she making progress so fast?","The eldest prince was equally astonished.","He had seen Feng Wu’s capability when they fought against Princess Raoxi’s assassins at Huyan Yichen’s place. She had no cultivation ability!","And Huyan Yichen... He was the one with the most say.","Feng Wu couldn’t do anything when she dealt with Princess Raoxi’s assassin and lent him the arm of discipline. If she was capable enough, she wouldn’t have relied on him.","But now, she was only one step away from the legendary Spiritual Saint stage. Huyan Yichen almost burst into tears.","Wait, he couldn’t just stand there and watch. What if Feng Wu lost...","He had to get help! But where? His grandfather!","That was right!","Huyan Yichen ran as fast as he could without telling the others.","Since Huyan Yichen had gone to get help, of course, Princess Raoxi wouldn’t stay idle.","The Spiritual Overlords had almost no right to take part in this battle. Even peak Spiritual Overlords would only be cannon fodder if they went in. One could only imagine how dangerous Feng Wu’s situation was.","The difference in the cultivation levels between the two sides wasn’t that big. As long as one more Spiritual Saint joined the battle, things would change.","Apart from the Patriarch and Guil Quai, were there any other Spiritual Saints in the Northern Yan Kingdom?","As a matter of fact, there was.","Princess Raoxi’s eyes darted around. She knew that with one more Spiritual Overlord, the tide would turn.","This was the best chance to negotiate!","Without hesitation, she dashed off.","She wanted to go to court!","Meanwhile in the Dongsang Kingdom.","Night Owl stared at the water screen with a cold, cruel look in his eyes.","Her?","Why her again?","Night Owl couldn’t understand it. What was wrong with this world? Why did all the girls revolve around Jun Linyuan?","On the screen, he had learned that Princess Raoxi, his ally, had switched sides. Now, Feng Wu was willing to sacrifice her own life for Jun Linyuan!","Night Owl wanted to kick Feng Wu’s ass and show her who the best man in the world was.","Why wasn’t Xiao here yet?","There was a special path!","The battles in Feng Wu’s group were especially fierce.","Their group was the weakest, and Matriarch Hua was furious when she saw Feng Wu.","Back in the imperial capital, most of the Spiritual Overlords of the Hua family had been killed by the explosion because of Feng Wu’s trap. Those that weren’t killed were taken to the Peace Grassland.","The old lady stared at Feng Wu. “I’m going to kill you today!”","The old lady kept her promise and pointed her saber at Feng Wu.","Whoosh!","The blade cut Feng Wu on the back again, and blood gushed out.","To the old lady, who was an intermediate Spiritual Saint, Feng Wu was nothing.","Little Phoenix was so angry that its eyes turned red.","With a whoosh, it charged at the old lady’s head and stuck out its beak!","The old lady struck down at Little Phoenix.","However, at that moment, the giant eagle charged at the old lady and yelled, “How dare you touch her? How dare you? I’ll die if my master finds out that I didn’t protect her properly! Do you know that? How dare you touch her?!”","The old lady had no idea who the bird was talking about. All she did was chase after Feng Wu. Caught off guard, she stumbled back from the impact. Old Mrs. Hua finally steadied herself and aimed her fist at the eagle.","Poor eagle... It flew backward at the impact.","“Do hit the eagle! I won’t let you!”","While she was dealing with the eagle, Little Phoenix struck out at her again, aiming at her throat.","Hiding behind the old lady’s collar, Little Phoenix bit down, and blood oozed out!","“Ah!”","Matriarch Hua screamed and charged at Little Phoenix again.","However, Little Phoenix was too smart. Moreover, it could conceal itself, so the old lady couldn’t catch it.","It wouldn’t be a problem for the old lady to catch the bird if the latter was on its own, but now that she was under attack from all three sides, catching the bird became very difficult.","Just when she was about to throttle Little Phoenix, Feng Wu charged at the old lady again.","Matriarch Hua turned her attention back to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned. This couldn’t go on. The old lady would kill them before they could kill her.","All of a sudden, Feng Wu’s eyes lit up, and she waved at Little Phoenix.","Feng Wu spoke to Little Phoenix in her head. “Don’t you know how to hide yourself? Come over here and let’s take care of that old hag together!” Little Phoenix’s eyes lit up.","That was right. Only by hiding itself could it catch the old hag off guard.","The next second, Little Phoenix went back to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu told the eagle, “We’ll work together now. You’ll be the main tank.” The giant eagle was dumbfounded. What did she mean by that? What was a tank?","There was no time for Feng Wu to explain, for the next second, she was out of sight.","The old lady was astonished. She didn’t know Feng Wu had that ability.","An idea struck her all of a sudden, but it disappeared so fast that she didn’t grab it. At that moment, the eagle followed Feng Wu’s instruction and charged at the old lady again.","The old lady was furious.","She was confused. The eagle was only a Level-2 Spiritual Saint, but why was its defense so strong?","Because...","The Primary Heaven Pill was about to expire, so of course, it would drop some crumbs.","Because the pill had always been put in the shrine, there was no way that Patriarch Huyan would lick the table. However, the giant eagle could do it, and it would lick the white powder off the table.","By the time Patriarch Huyan noticed it, the giant eagle had already become quite resistant to physical attacks. Hence, the old man began to train it in that direction.","After all these years, the giant eagle had become an MT that could withstand blows. Of course, it had never been attacked by a Spiritual Saint before, but now, it realized how tough it was.","What was there to be afraid of? The bird knew it could handle the attack!","Thump!","The old lady struck out at the eagle again.","With a smack, the giant eagle was sent flying again.","While the old lady was still attacking the eagle, Feng Wu made her move as well.","She could see the old lady when she was invisible, but the old lady couldn’t see her.","Therefore!","When the old lady struck down at the eagle, Feng Wu struck down at her with her arm of discipline.","The arm used to be in Jun Linyuan’s hand, but when Feng Wu joined the fight, Jun Linyuan removed it and gave it to her.","The arm of discipline was a semi-divine weapon. All the weapons here put together weren’t as lethal as this one.","Matriarch Hua screamed.","As it turned out, after Feng Wu put on the arm of discipline, she stabbed the old lady in the throat with a sharp blade.","Poor Matriarch Hua. Caught off guard, another hole appeared in her throat.","However, a Level-4 Spiritual Saint was too powerful for Feng Wu. Even if she could break her defense, she couldn’t go too deep.","Little Phoenix could do that because its beak was a Semi-divine weapon.","Seeing the blood oozing out, Feng Wu sighed inwardly and felt sorry for herself.","She was so close...","One inch deeper the old lady’s aorta would have been cut off. What a pity...","It wasn’t every day that she had such an opportunity.","That was indeed the case.","After the ambush, the old lady had her eyes on Feng Wu.","She was on guard and would look at Feng Wu as soon as Feng Wu took a step forward.","Feng Wu knew that with how alarmed the old lady was, it would be too difficult for her to sneak up on her again.","But that suited her.","Because Feng Wu wanted to stall the old lady so that Jun Linyuan could deal with the Zuo family’s old master.","Just then, they heard someone screaming.","It was...","Turning around involuntarily, Feng Wu saw something exciting.","Jun Linyuan’s broken Sky Destroyer pierced the old master’s chest!","Jun Linyuan had three drops of blood on his fair, handsome face, while Patriarch Zuo stood there, too scared to move.","Jun Linyuan’s sword pierced the old man’s chest.","Behind the old man, Feng Wu could see that he was convulsing.","Was he going to die?","Feng Wu was still thinking that way when she saw the old man move something in his sleeve.","Meanwhile, Jun Linyuan wasn’t paying attention to the old man’s hand. Everything happened in a split second.. At that critical moment..."]},{"number":3927,"title":"Chapter 3927: Jun Linyuan Went Berserk","paragraphs":["Chapter 3927: Jun Linyuan Went Berserk","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At that critical moment, Feng Wu made her move.","Involuntarily, she raised her arm, and a barrel suddenly stuck out, aiming at","Patriarch Zuo’s arm.","Instantly, there was an explosion!","Feng Wu fired at the old man as she told the others to back off.","Everyone here was smart. They were acutely aware of the danger, so they all backed away involuntarily. Jun Linyuan did the same, and Feng Wu ran the fastest.","There was a loud explosion!","Patriarch Zuo was already holding something that looked like it was going to explode, but Feng Wu’s explosion had increased the power by several times.","Boom!","Flames filled the air.","The fire was blazing!","Involuntarily, Feng Wu and the others lay flat on their stomachs to dodge the impact.","Jun Linyuan threw himself at Feng Wu, shielding her with his own body.","Poof!","Boom!","Even with the invisible formation, the temple still cracked as if it could collapse at any moment.","The onlookers were a thousand meters away and thought that they had run far enough, but when the shock wave hit them, they realized how terrifying it was.","“Argh! My eyes!”","“My hair! I’m on fire!”","“My clothes are in pieces!”","“My face is covered with blood!”","Even from so far away, these people were already in such a miserable state, let alone someone so close to the Patriarch Zuo.","Everything quieted down after the explosion.","Wiping away the ash on her face, Feng Wu looked up and saw that Patriarch","Zuo had turned into a charred corpse.","Standing there, he looked rather intimidating.","The battle had stopped, but Little Phoenix reacted quickly and hid in her ring space. The giant eagle was able to withstand the attack, so it was fine. What about Jun Linyuan?","Feng Wu heard a faint noise.","Only then did Feng Wu’s ears stop buzzing, and she gradually regained her senses. She then realized that someone was lying on her back. It was none other than...","“Jun Linyuan?”","Feng Wu rose to her feet in a hurry, but she moved so fast that Jun Linyuan drew in his breath in pain.","Feng Wu didn’t dare to move, but she was worried sick. “How do you feel? Does it hurt? Is it serious? Don’t worry about it. Take the medicine first.”","Before Jun Linyuan could react, Feng Wu stuffed a handful of pills into his mouth.","The Semi-divine Blood-Clotting Pill, the Internal Blood Pill, the Injury Pill, the","Painless Pill... Feng Wu stuffed everything she had into his mouth.","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","A smile flickered in his cold eyes.","Smile?","A short distance away, Princess Raoxi was dumbfounded.","“What’s going on? Your Royal Highness, how can you still be smiling?!”","Moreover... Why was he smiling so gently at Feng Wu? Not only was he smiling, but he was also rubbing Feng Wu’s head. That was so frustrating!","Meanwhile, Matriarch Hua and the master of the Firmament Palace exchanged looks, and both saw fear in each other’s eyes.","Patriarch Zuo was dead...","He was dead, just like that...","“Jun Linyuan, how dare you kill a Spiritual Saint?!” Matriarch Hua pointed at Jun Linyuan with a smirk on her face.","Jun Linyuan snorted. Although he didn’t say anything, everyone could tell what he meant. So what if he did?","However, the old lady frowned. “Don’t you know that you have to pay a price for killing a Spiritual Saint?”","Jun Linyuan remained unperturbed.","However, Feng Wu frowned a little. Her instinct told her that something wasn’t right.","Therefore, Feng Wu said, “So what if he killed a Spiritual Saint?”","The old lady suddenly laughed. “So what? What do you think? A Spiritual Saint can’t be humiliated or killed. If you kill him, the lightning tribulation will double when you climb the heavenly stairs.”","Feng Wu frowned.","If that was the case, Jun Linyuan would be in a lot of trouble. Although she didn’t know what heavenly stairs were if Jun Linyuan made another breakthrough in the future...","Just then, the head of the Firmament Palace spoke in a cold voice.","“If I’m not mistaken, just then...","“You killed Zuo, didn’t you, Feng Wu?”","The head of the Firmament Palace glanced at Feng Wu with a taunting look in her eyes.","Feng Wu stiffened.","Jun Linyuan stiffened as well.","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan looked at each other, and both recalled what happened before the old man died.","Patriarch Zuo wasn’t dead when Jun Linyuan’s Sky Destroyer pierced his heart, and he was still strong enough to fight back. Feng Wu then aimed her arm at the old man.","What...","Feng Wu almost buried her head in her hands. It was true. She really had killed the old man.","“I killed a Spiritual Saint? I killed a Spiritual Saint?!”","No one would believe it, but it was the truth!","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan and wanted to cry, but no tears would come. Jun Linyuan was obviously in a bad mood as well... What if Feng Wu made a breakthrough one day...","Seeing Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan’s reaction, the old master of the Firmament Palace and Matriarch Hua were elated and laughed in satisfaction.","However, the next moment, Jun Linyuan put Feng Wu aside and turned to face the two women.","The temperature seemed to drop.","A chill ran down their spines.","“Protect yourself,” Jun Linyuan told Feng Wu behind him.","Feng Wu looked concerned.","Looking around, Feng Wu was anxious. Why wasn’t her Sixth Senior Brother here yet?","Meanwhile, the two women exchanged looks and nodded at each other.","“Let’s go!”","Both women shouted at the same time.","Gui Qulai was about to move closer when a black shadow charged at Feng Wu and grabbed her.","Feng Wu tried to throw him off, but she couldn’t even move her arm of discipline.","“It’s you!”","Feng Wu recognized the person.","The man in the black robe!","It was none other than the black-robed man who had taken Feng Wu away from the ship but had been thrown off by Feng Wu. He had been chasing Feng Wu ever since!","Feng Wu was filled with hatred as soon as she saw the person.","Hiding behind the black mask, the man stared at Feng Wu with a smirk on his face. He then tried to drag Feng Wu away.","While Jun Linyuan was fighting the two Spiritual Saints, he tried to take Feng Wu away.","But he had forgotten about something.","Gui Qulai would never die for Jun Linyuan, but he wouldn’t let anything happen to the girl that the Patriarch was protecting. Hence, he drew out his Heaven Demon Sword.","“Put her down! ”","He charged out and swiped the sword across the man’s back.","Whoosh!","The back of the man’s robe was cut open, revealing a bloody gash.","The man was going to take Feng Wu away, but he slowed down a little so that Feng Wu could use her arm of discipline.","The scorching hot barrel of the arm was aimed at the black-robed man’s chest.","There was a flash of lightning!","At such a close distance, even when the black-robed man reacted in time and dodged the attack, he was still hit on the right side of his chest.","“Ahhh!”","The man bellowed and stared at Feng Wu.","Since when did the girl have such a formidable weapon?","Feng Wu’s attack successfully helped Gui Qulai block the man’s way. He pointed his sword at the man. “Put her down!”","The man glared at Gui Qulai. “Are you representing Northern Yan to make Dongsang your enemy?”","Gui Qulai’s pupils contracted!","Among the Junwu Empire, the Dongsang Kingdom, and the Northern Yan Kingdom, the Dongsang Kingdom was the strongest, the Junwu Empire the second, and the Northern Yan Kingdom the third..","If the Dongsang Kingdom was offended, the Northern Yan Kingdom would be in a lot of trouble.","Although Gui Qulai was an unparalleled swordsman, he still had tens of thousands of fellow countrymen. He couldn’t abandon them, nor could he abandon the fate of Northern Yan.","But he still couldn’t back off.","Gui Qulai blocked the man with his own body and stared at him. “Put her","down.”","The man glared at her. “Are you really going to offend Dongsang?”","Gui Qulai said, “You can leave, but put her down.”","The man smirked.","Put it down? He could do that.","After tossing Feng Wu at Gui Qulai, the man went to look for Jun Linyuan himself.","Immediately, the three of them surrounded Jun Linyuan again.","Exasperated, Feng Wu was about to go in when Gui Qulai grabbed her. “No!”","Feng Wu glared at him. “Let go of me! If you won’t help him, I will!”","However, Gui Qulai still wouldn’t let go of Feng Wu. He heaved a long sigh. “I’ll go fight Matriarch Hua. Stay here.”","The man was a high-ranking official of the Dongsang Kingdom, and the relationship between the Dongsang Kingdom and the Northern Yan Kingdom was concerned, so Gui Qulai couldn’t attack him.","The Matriarch of the Firmament Palace was still waking up, so he couldn’t attach the head of the Firmament Palace either.","Therefore, Matriarch Hua was the only one he could pick on.","However, just as Gui Qulai was about to move forward, he heard a thump.","A sword stabbed into the old lady’s body, instantly breaking her defense. It was Jun Linyuan!","He was still able to kill the old lady when the three of them were attacking him together.","However, a Spiritual Saint like Matriarch Hua couldn’t be killed with one strike. She still had a lot of energy left.","But...","Feng Wu reacted quickly.","She had already activated her arm when Jun Linyuan stabbed the old lady.","Feng Wu had spent a lot of effort to build this arm, and she had hidden a lot of hidden weapons in it. She had used a lot of them, but at least there were still some things left.","She Imew that it was now or never!","Once the defense was broken, she could injure Matriarch Hua the way she had injured Patriarch Zuo.","“Watch out!” Feng Wu shouted as she ran toward the old lady and aimed her arm at the old lady’s back.","Instantly, flames filled the air.","The giant eagle reacted quickly as well. When Feng Wu charged forward, it shifted and shielded Feng Wu with its cumbersome body, blocking the last strike from the old lady.","As expected!","The old lady wasn’t to be trifled with either!","Jun Linyuan had stabbed her in the chest and Feng Wu had fired at her in the back. She felt as if her soul was going to leave her body.","“How dare you!","“Go to hell!”","The old lady knew that she was doomed and was going to die here in the Northern Yan Kingdom, but she had to drag someone down with her.","She had realized all along that Feng Wu was Jun Linyuan’s treasure and his life. If Feng Wu died, Jun Linyuan might lose his mind, and if he lost his mind, the Junwu Empire would be doomed!","That was to say, her mission would be accomplished.","“Master, I’ve lived up to your order!”","After that, Matriarch Hua spared no effort and pounced at Feng Wu. She wanted to wrap her arms around Feng Wu and explode!","Jun Linyuan was surrounded by the black-robed man and the old master of the Firmament Palace and couldn’t get close enough.","Thud! Thud!","Jun Linyuan was hit twice in a row!","He stumbled and looked like he was going to collapse.","Just as the old lady pounced at Feng Wu, Gui Qulai leaped into the air. Spiritual essence filled the air, and the next second, he threw Feng Wu away, but he was too late.","Thump!","Matriarch Hua grabbed Gui Qulai and blew herself up.","“Gui Qulai!”","Feng Wu cried out in mid-air.","She had been careless...","She had been too careless...","This was the battlefield of Spiritual Saints, and she was only a Spiritual Overlord. Although she was a peak Spiritual Overlord, she was a Spiritual Overlord nonetheless. This wasn’t her battlefield.","Staring at the flames, Feng Wu was filled with murderous intentions.","Was Gui Qulai dead?","The ground shook violently, and the air seemed to ripple.","The black smoke dissipated.","Feng Wu saw the old lady’s shattered body.","Half of her body was still on Gui Qulai.","Meanwhile...","“Cough, cough..","Gui Qu wasn’t dead, but he was charred black from head to toe.","Feng Wu rushed over and stuffed a handful of pills into his mouth.","Blood-Clotting Pills, Internal Injury Pills, Anesthesia Pills... She stuffed them all in.","Gui Qulai tasted something sweet in his throat, and blood gushed out. He was about to spit it out when Feng Wu said hastily.","“They’re all Semi-divine pills!”","Gui Qulai had never seen so many Semi-divine pills before, and he couldn’t bring himself to spit them out. He swallowed them all in one go with the blood.","Seeing that he could still swallow the pill, Feng Wu let out a breath of relief. “You’ll be fine. I think you’ll be fine...”","Gui Qulai opened his bright eyes and nodded at Feng Wu. He then sat down in a corner and started cultivating.","Feng Wu was filled with guilt when she saw Gui Qulai repairing his injuries, coughing violently before swallowing the blood.","Only a moment ago, she was blaming Gui Qulai for not doing anything...","In fact, if she were to be serious, she would consider Gui Qulai to be Jun Linyuan’s match. Only a petty person should be considered an enemy. It was already very rare that he had helped her before. Feng Wu took a deep breath. She owed Gui Qulai one.","And...","Feng Wu then saw the Heaven Demon Sword.","Gui Qulai had to rely on the Heaven Demon Sword to survive the explosion.","Feng Wu was glad that she hadn’t been too stingy and had given the sword to Gui QUIai in the end. Otherwise...","Everything was predestined.","However, Feng Wu had also been hit by some of the aftershocks, which made her blood boil.","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan only had two opponents left. One was the black-robed man, and the other was the old master of the Firmament Palace.","As for Jun Linyuan...","No matter how many wounds he had sustained, the stubborn teenager still stood ramrod straight like a god!","It was the intimidating power of a supreme master!","It was as if the two Spiritual Saints were as insignificant as ants. Feng Wu wasn’t the only one who thought that way. Many other people thought the same.","Was Jun Linyuan really the god of war?","The old master of the Firmament Palace felt her heart skip a beat.","She saw the charred body of Patriarch Zuo and the disintegrated body of Matriarch Hua... She had been so confident before, but now, she was suspicious.","Was Jun Linyuan impossible to kill?","Wasn’t he injured before coming here to fight Gui Qulai? Hadn’t he been cut a few times by Patriarch Zuo? Shouldn’t he be dead by now? Why was he still fighting after losing so much blood?","The head of the Firmament Palace couldn’t understand it.","Another person was confused as well. It was none other than the black-robed","man.","He hid in a corner and only came out when the battle was almost over. However, was it too early?","Staring at the two Spiritual Saints with his cold eyes, Jun Linyuan was surrounded by a cold-blooded energy.","His Sky Destroyer was already cracked, and it should be cracking at any moment.","But he...","Blood dripped down the tip of his sword.","With each step Jun Linyuan took, the two Spiritual Saints in front of him stumbled back.","Feng Wu wondered who had said that confidence was more precious than a diamond. It seemed that it was true...","Although two of them were Spiritual Saints, they still felt their confidence had been shattered by the severely injured Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan’s murderous intention was like a tidal wave that no one dared to fight back!","The old master of the Firmament Palace and the black-robed man looked at each other and nodded solemnly. They then charged at Jun Linyuan and fought him to the death.","The Dongsang Kingdom.","Night Owl was dumbfounded.","He couldn’t believe it...","How did this happen?","Weren’t the three of them attacking Jun Linyuan together? How could he take the chance to kill one of them? Were they idiots?!","Night Owl was so angry that he almost blew up his own room.","There were two Spiritual Saints left, and Xiao would be here before Jun Linyuan’s help arrived. Therefore, things were still manageable. Night Owl thought to himself.","Meanwhile...","Many people felt differently from Night Owl.","Because of how intimidating Jun Linyuan was, with each step he took, everyone felt that death was closing in on them.","Jun Linyuan was about to crush everyone when a figure descended from above!","That speed meant that it was another very capable cultivator.","However, when the cold wind dissipated, the man in black said in pleasant surprise, “Master Xiao, you’re here!”","Master Xiao?","Feng Wu’s heart sank when she saw the excited look on his face.","The newcomer was from the enemy’s side and was more powerful than the black-robed man.","They just wouldn’t stop! Feng Wu was almost in tears.","“Where’s Feng? Why isn’t he here? Hasn’t he been protecting Jun Linyuan?” Feng Wu grabbed Feng Xun.","Feng Xun said with a long face, “Feng has gone to another kingdom. It’s that mysterious kingdom on the other side of the sea. He won’t be back for a while.” Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","The three of them were working together against Jun Linyuan. No matter how capable her Junjun was, he wouldn’t be able to withstand such a tiresome battle!","The next moment, Jun Linyuan’s eyes flickered, and a sword howled. Blood gushed out of Sky Destroyer, then turned into a river of blood behind Jun Linyuan!","Blood filled the air, and the fierce sword energy howled like a gust of wind, bringing with it a destructive power!","Feng Wu felt that Jun Linyuan’s cultivation level had suddenly risen, but the increase made her stomach lurch, and she felt that things were getting out of hand.","As expected, in the next moment...","“Shit!”","Feng Xun was so anxious that he almost jumped to his feet. “No! No!”","Feng Wu grabbed Feng Xun and asked, “What happened? What happened?","What’s going on? What’s that destructive power? Tell me!”","Feng Xun said anxiously, “Boss Jun has gone berserk. He’s going berserk...”","Feng Wu’s knees buckled. ‘What do you mean by that...’","Was it the berserk state she thought about?","Feng Xun was almost in tears. “Where is Feng? He’s the only one who can stop that. This is bad!”","However, apart from Feng Xun, no one knew what Jun Linyuan’s berserk state meant.","“Leave! Clear out this place!” Feng Xun shouted at the people behind him.","People a thousand meters away had been injured, and many had run away. After all, no matter how good a battle was, one’s life was the most important thing.","But some bold people were still standing there.","Meanwhile, Feng Xun grabbed Feng Wu’s arm and yelled, “Fall back! Fall back now! ”","He grabbed Feng Wu by the back of her collar.","Feng Xun tried to drag her away.","However, Feng Wu struggled. “No, I want to stay here. I...”","Feng Wu was more capable than Feng Xun at the moment, so if Feng Wu didn’t want to, Feng Xun wouldn’t be able to drag her away. Not only that, but Feng Wu had also pushed him to the ground, and he slid for dozens of meters, which infuriated Feng Xun.","“Boss Jun has gone berserk! He’s going berserk! He won’t be able to recognize you! He’ll kill you anyway, you idiot!” Feng Xun yelled at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu stiffened as well. Staring at Feng Xun, she asked, “What... Did you just","Feng Xun said anxiously, “The last time he lost his mind, he was only ten years old, but the power he exerted was enough to destroy everything within a 50-kilometer radius! Where do you think he got that nickname from? He’s a fiend who kills people like flies!”","Feng Wu was astonished.","Feng Xun said, “Let’s go!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m not leaving!”","With or without Feng Wu, the four people started fighting again.","It was true. Feng Wu couldn’t go to the battlefield this time.","The battle was much fiercer than before.","Feng Wu saw that when Jun Linyuan’s Sky Destroyer flew into the air, it turned into a river of blood. Gradually, it turned into a blood-red bone dragon!","Ignoring the others, Jun Linyuan charged at the man in black.","Right now, Jun Linyuan’s eyes had turned scarlet red, and he looked invincible!","Seeing Jun Linyuan charging at him, the man felt a chill run down his spine when he saw the strange look in Jun Linyuan’s eyes... It was as if he had died. He felt his arms go weak and his legs go numb, and he had forgotten how to lift a hand...","What a pair of eyes!","When Jun Linyuan moved, the air seemed to crack.","It was so terrifying!","Was he really only an intermediate Spiritual Saint?","Feng Wu felt that Jun Linyuan was suddenly going all out.","Frightened, the man in black turned to flee.","Both Xiao and the master of the Firmament Palace blocked the man’s way. The next second, they were knocked down by an arm.","With a thump, Xiao was knocked to the left and the master of the Firmament Palace to the right. Jun Linyuan then ran after the man in black.","“Ssss...”","Xiao only drew in his breath, but the old master of the Firmament Palace touched her arm, which had gone numb and was terrified.","That capability... that capability...","She wanted to curse him! Was Jun Linyuan even human?! How could it be so tough all of a sudden?!","She didn’t have time to complain, because they were already chasing Jun Linyuan. They couldn’t let him kill the man in black just like that.","The three of them formed a triangle, which was the most convenient way to attack Jun Linyuan. If they were one man down, their attack power would be greatly reduced.","However...","How fast was Jun Linyuan?","Before the master of the Firmament Palace and Xiao could do anything, Jun Linyuan had caught the arrogant black-robed man with his bare hands.","Seeing the man in black, who looked like a chicken in Jun Linyuan’s hand, Feng Wu sighed inwardly...","The man had given her the impression that he was as powerful as the sky, and she would never be able to get past him. However, he was like a fish on a chopping board now.","Feng Wu could even see the panic in his eyes.","For a moment, Feng Wu thought that the black-robed man was dead, but he kept showing up.","And now, Jun Linyuan finally had him.","The next second, Jun Linyuan pulled with both hands.","Whoosh!","“Ahhh!!!”","There was a scream.","The black-robed man screamed in pain.","Jun Linyuan had ripped the man in half with his bare hands!","Next to Feng wu, Feng nun snuaaerea a little.","Feng Wu paled a little as well.","Taking Feng Wu’s hand, Feng Xun said in a trembling voice, “He’s not thinking straight now. All he can do is kill everyone... everyone...”","Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun.","Tears welled up in Feng Xun’s eyes, but he still nodded solemnly. “It hasn’t happened for almost ten years... He wouldn’t have been like this if he hadn’t been cornered. Feng is the only one who can stop him. Feng is the only one... “With Boss Jun’s capability, he doesn’t need any protection at all.”","“Feng has been following him around all these years to prevent this from happening, but he couldn’t have predicted that something like this would happen when he was only gone for a few days.","“These people have pushed him to his limit...”","Tears welled up in Feng Wu’s eyes as she watched Jun Linyuan lose himself in this berserk state. Her heart went out to him..","Right now, Jun Linyuan reminded one of the god of war. There was a cold, murderous look in his eyes as if he were the god of death. He had the power to destroy heaven and earth.","The space around him contorted.","Terrifying power filled the air.","The wind howled.","The murderous energy was chaotic!","The blood dragon looked as if it had existed forever. Its scales glinted coldly, and its eyes were cold and emotionless.","It took a deep breath, and the spiritual essence in the air seemed to be sucked out by it!","It then injected all its drained spiritual essence into Jun Linyuan.","It didn’t fight, nor did it seem to care about fighting, but it kept giving its power to Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan headed straight for Xiao!","Night Owl was so shocked that he fell to the ground.","Oh god!","He had never expected such a turn of events.","It was so...","Victory was on their side. Why was this happening?","His face was drained of all color, and he was too shocked to speak.","Jun Linyuan grabbed Xiao with his bare hands.","“Argh!” Night Owl bellowed.","No!","NO!","It was Xiao!","An intermediate Spiritual Saint!","His father had given him that man to protect him.","But!","Jun Linyuan ripped Xiao apart with his bare hands again.","Blood gushed out, and Xiao’s body was covered in blood.","With his bare hands...","Jun Linyuan had just torn a Spiritual Saint to pieces with her bare hands!","Had this world gone insane?","Or were they seeing things?","The old master of the Firmament Palace was so frightened that her heart was pounding.","That was so scary...","She had been through countless battles in her life, but she had never felt so terrified before.","Killing an intermediate Spiritual Saint was as easy as killing a chicken for Jun Linyuan.","The head of the Firmament Palace didn’t dare to stay here anymore. She ran as fast as a gust of wind.","Jun Linyuan swayed and was ready to go after her.","However, Feng Xun said anxiously, “No, he’s too severely injured and has lost too much blood. Plus, there’s only so much time left. He’s reaching his limit!”","“Stop!”","Northern Yan’s king and his guards arrived in a hurry.","He had already received the news, but he pretended that he didn’t know what was going on.","The situation was too complicated, and he didn’t want the Northern Yan Kingdom to get involved.","Moreover, he was the king of the Northern Yan Kingdom. If the Dongsang Kingdom and the Junwu Empire were weakened, it would be a good thing for him. Therefore, he deliberately ignored them, but he couldn’t do that now.","A Spiritual Saint next to the king charged at Jun Linyuan.","The next second, Jun Linyuan gave up on chasing the old master of the Firmament Palace. Instead, he reached out and grabbed the Spiritual Saint by the throat.","“Ah!” The king cried out.","He saw a murderous look in Jun Linyuan’s eyes.","It was as if he was going to charge at them as soon as he killed the Spiritual Saint.."]},{"number":3928,"title":"Chapter 3928: Junjun (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3928: Junjun (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Sensing that Jun Linyuan was coming their way, the king stumbled back involuntarily.","Frightened by Jun Linyuan’s cold demeanor, everyone felt a chill run down their spines as if they were going to die at any moment.","“Hm...’","The Spiritual Saint in Jun Linyuan’s hand began to struggle. He didn’t want to die just like that.","However, Jun Linyuan picked him up as easily as picking up a chicken!","The onlookers were scared out of their wits, including the officials of the Northern Yan Kingdom.","“Isn’t that...","“If I’m not mistaken, he’s Master Wubai, isn’t he?”","“That’s right, Master Wubai! He’s the captain of His Majesty’s personal guards and one of the most capable cultivators in the imperial palace!”","Everyone exchanged looks of bewilderment.","A top cultivator.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched, and she froze on the spot.","Emperor Yan murmured, “Has he lost his mind? Has Jun Linyuan lost his mind?”","That was incredible!","He was so powerful that the king was scared.","As the king, he had nothing to be afraid of, but he could compare the ability of the two people.","He knew perfectly well how capable Wubai was. He was on the same level as Gui Quilai, and the two of them were even fellow disciples. One was protecting the king, and the other was wandering around.","But now... Jun Linyuan had grabbed Wubai by the throat before the latter could make a move. He was going to throttle Wubai!","The Junwu Empire... That was unbelievable!","Taking Feng Wu’s hand, Feng Xun was shaking a little. “He’s not thinking straight anymore. He’s driven mad by all the killing. Let’s go!”","Hearing Feng Xun’s words, the king turned to run.","However, he then remembered who Feng Wu was and dragged her to his side.","“Quickly! Let’s go to the inner tower now!”","The only safe place in the world now was Patriarch Huyan’s tower.","Feng Wu threw the king’s hand off. “No, I’m not leaving! I’m going to keep him company!”","However, Feng Wu couldn’t throw him off, which infuriated her.","Thump!","They heard the sound of something falling to the ground.","The others turned around and saw that Jun Linyuan had smashed Wubai to the ground. He then charged at the king.","Feng Xun’s eyes widened, and the king panicked. Shit! What was Jun Linyuan doing?","Before he could react, Jun Linyuan rushed over and grabbed him by the neck.","The king was astonished.","Feng Xun murmured in amazement, “Shit... Even when Boss Jun has lost his mind, he’s still that jealous.”","However, Feng Wu couldn’t hear Feng Xun anymore, for she was already running toward Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu was exasperated!","It didn’t matter if Jun Linyuan killed anyone else, even if it was Princess Raoxi. There would still be a way out. However, if he killed the king of Northern Yan, the two sides would have to go to war.","As a result, a lot of people would die!","The Dongsang Kingdom would be laughing.","In fact, in the Dongsang Kingdom...","Night Owl was furious and was going to blow up the water curtain when he saw Jun Linyuan choking Wubai.","Night Owl’s stomach lurched, and he looked ecstatic.","However, the next second, Jun Linyuan threw Wubai away and grabbed the king by the neck.","Night Owl almost jumped to his feet.."]},{"number":3929,"title":"Chapter 3929: Lord Jing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3929: Lord Jing","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Father, Father!” Night Owl called his father.","However, his father was in seclusion and didn’t reply, but someone did. It was Lord Jing, the sworn brother of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Because of the Dongsang Kingdom’s blood tax system, the king of Dongsang didn’t have any brothers. His closest friend was only his sworn brother, Lord Jing.","had come to see the crown prince at the invitation of Mr. Sakiya, and he heard the noise, so he walked in right away.","The first thing he saw was the water screen.","“What...","was astonished.","Imew the king of Northern Yan and had met Jun Linyuan before. He was astonished when he saw this. “This can’t be happening!”","Night Owl didn’t have time to exchange pleasantries when he saw Lord Jing. He grabbed the latter’s arm and said excitedly, “It’s true! My lord, it’s happening!” Lord Jin said, “Has Jun Linyuan lost his mind? That’s the king of Northern","Yan!”","Night Owl laughed again. “Yes, he has. As it turned out, Jun Linyuan has a hidden disease. Once he’s cornered, the seal on him will be removed, and he’ll go berserk! He’ll kill everyone he sees, no matter who it is!”","Night Owl pointed at Jun Linyuan and laughed again. “He can’t recognize the king at all. All he wants to do is kill. He’s a killer!","“But that’s the Northern Yan’s king. If Jun Linyuan kills the king in front of so many people, the rift between the Northern Yan Kingdom and the Junwu Empire will never go away. They’ll never rest until one of them is destroyed. I bet they can fight for hundreds of years!”","was equally excited. Grabbing Night Owl, he said, “Quickly, send Xiao. Northern Yan is going to be in a lot of trouble. Dongsang has so many advantages!”","Night Owl looked displeased when Xiao was mentioned.","was about to ask when he saw a dead body next to Jun Linyuan.","“Isn’t that...” Lord Jing cried out.","Night Owl nodded and said solemnly, “I’ve sent Xiao, and he has sacrificed his life for the Dongsang Kingdom. However, his death was worthwhile! As long as Northern Yan and Junwu fight for a hundred years, he’ll have a worthy death!","“Xiao isn’t the only one we’ve lost. Patriarch Zuo, our long-term mole in the Junwu Empire, is dead as well. Jun Linyuan has completely destroyed the pawns we’ve kept trained. But don’t worry. As long as Northern Yan’s king is dead, we’ll gain a lot!” has to digest so much information in such a short time.","Xiao was dead, Jun Linyuan had gone insane, and Northern Yan’s king was going to die.","quickly gathered all the information and nodded. “You’re right. If Northern Yan’s king dies, the Dongsang Kingdom will profit greatly.”","So, would Jun Linyuan kill the emperor?","Wasn’t it obvious?","The people of the Northern Yan Kingdom and the Dongsang Kingdom all thought the same.","Jun Linyuan was definitely going to kill him!","Because he had lost his mind!","Seeing that Jun Linyuan wanted to kill her father, Princess Raoxi was worried sick as well. She wanted to marry Jun Linyuan. If Jun Linyuan killed her father, she and Jun Linyuan would become enemies for the rest of their lives.","That couldn’t happen!"]},{"number":3930,"title":"Chapter 3930: Jun Linyuan (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3930: Jun Linyuan (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At that thought, Princess Raoxi rushed to Jun Linyuan’s side and pushed Feng Wu away while she was at it.","“Jun Linyuan, no!","“You can’t kill my father! He’s my father! Please, Jun Linyuan, please stop! Please stop for my sake!”","Princess Raoxi was really crying now. Not only that, but she had also knelt down.","Jun Linyuan, who was choking the king, glanced at Princess Raoxi.","One look and Princess Raoxi was thrilled.","The others were amazed. Could Jun Linyuan and Princess Raoxi really have something going? Were they very close? Otherwise, why would Jun Linyuan pause for a moment?","The king was filled with hope as well.","He didn’t want to die!","“Junjun...” Princess Raoxi scrambled to her feet and wanted to run toward Jun Linyuan. She wanted to help Jun Linyuan come back to his senses.","However, before Princess Raoxi could get close to Jun Linyuan, an earth-shattering shock wave charged at her!","As a matter of fact, Jun Linyuan only flipped his sleeve impatiently,","But to Princess Raoxi, it was fatal!","“Watch out!” Princess Raoxi’s guard blocked her way.","The guard was smashed into a pulp.","As for Princess Raoxi, she was luckier. The guard pushed her away, and when Jun Linyuan’s shock wave reached her, it only pushed her further away.","Everyone looked up.","Princess Raoxi was flying away like a kite...","And she was getting further and further away...","She was nowhere to be seen in the end.","Gone?!","Everyone was astonished.","Only then did they realize how terrifying Jun Linyuan was.","The king didn’t even dare to make a sound.","Seeing this, the head of the Firmament Palace moved further and further away...","She hid behind a wall and waited for her chance.","She wanted to run away because she knew that she couldn’t let Jun Linyuan see her now. If he did, he would throttle her.","She stayed because the capital of Northern Yan was going to become a killing ground. There would be rivers of blood and dead bodies everywhere. She had a lot of room to maneuver...","The Firmament Palace had been secretly siding with the Dongsang Kingdom. As long as she helped the Dongsang Kingdom start a war between the two forces, the Firmament Palace would make a great contribution.","But to her surprise...","And to everyone’s surprise...","After Jun Linyuan threw Princess Raoxi away, someone else ran toward Jun","Linyuan.","And she wrapped her arms around him.","She held him tightly from behind.","It was Feng Wu!","Jun Linyuan was about to throttle the king when Feng Wu rushed over and threw her arms around Jun Linyuan’s waist.","“Oh god!” Feng Xun was exasperated.","The eldest prince was worried sick as well.","Someone was going to die!","She was such a pretty girl..","To everyone’s astonishment, Jun Linyuan, who had been tense and ready to kill, froze on the spot.","The fire in his eyes seemed to have faded a lot.","What was going on?","Was Jun Linyuan going to stop?","NO!","The old master of the Firmament Palace was the first to scream in her head.","NO!","Night Owl, who was in the Dongsang Kingdom, drew in his breath as well.","“No! No! He can’t stop!”"]},{"number":3931,"title":"Chapter 3931: Jun Linyuan (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3931: Jun Linyuan (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu wrapped her arms around Jun Linyuan’s waist and said in a trembling voice, “Jun Linyuan, it’s me. Stop. It’s me...”","She kept talking to Jun Linyuan.","The king was the most nervous one. He thought he was going to lose his mind.","Jun Linyuan had almost choked him. If Feng Wu had been a little slower, he would have been killed!","But now...","Would Feng Wu’s words work? Would Jun Linyuan pause for a moment and try again, like what he did to Raoxi?","The king held his breath.","Then, he saw a slender hand...","It showed up right under his nose.","To be more precise, she had put her hand over Jun Linyuan’s hand, which was on the king’s throat...","Feng Wu, who had been holding Jun Linyuan from behind, slowly walked around to face him.","The king looked at Feng Wu and hoped that she would succeed.","He then saw Feng Wu holding Jun Linyuan’s hand with hers. Gradually, her fingers reached out and slowly wrapped around Jun Linyuan’s fingers.","The king almost couldn’t breathe.","But he still didn’t dare to struggle, fearing that Jun Linyuan would be disturbed.","Jun Linyuan looked like he was going to explode at any moment.","Feng Wu was trying to calm him down as if she was dealing with a giant beast that could go berserk at any moment.","As Feng Wu moved, she kept her gaze on Jun Linyuan. She spoke softly as if she was comforting a baby.","Then, the king noticed that the fire in Jun Linyuan’s eyes was gradually going out.","Then, with a thump, he was tossed aside by Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan didn’t use much force.","All his attention was on Feng Wu.","He kept his unblinking gaze on Feng Wu and caught all her attention.","After the king was thrown to the ground, he forgot about the pain. Rising to his feet, he quickly ran out of the circle. Gosh, he almost peed his pants. He wiped away the cold sweat on the back of his neck.","“Your Majesty!”","His guards stepped forward.","The king silenced them with a wave of his hand, telling them not to disturb Jun","Linyuan.","What if he went berserk again?","The king also gave the order, telling everyone to back off.","Even Feng Xun was dragged away.","The king glanced at Feng Xun. “What’s going on with your crown prince?”","Did he feel humiliated because Jun Linyuan had almost strangled him? According to the king’s understanding, even a Spiritual Saint had been torn in half, but he was still able to come out of it alive. He was so lucky, and luck was part of one’s capability.","As a matter of fact, the king was intimidated by Jun Linyuan’s capability. He didn’t dare to hold Jun Linyuan responsible for what he did. If Jun Linyuan went berserk again and killed another Spiritual Saint with bare hands, how many Spiritual Saints would Northern Yan have left?","Yes, they did have Patriarch Huyan, who could fight Jun Linyuan and had a high chance of winning. But the problem was that Patriarch Huyan doted on Feng Wu, not to mention that Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan were a couple.","The king didn’t know who the Patriarch would help if he and Jun Linyuan got into a fight.."]},{"number":3932,"title":"Chapter 3932: Only You Can Do It (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3932: Only You Can Do It (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“It’s me, Junjun. It’s me.” Feng Wu threw herself into Jun Linyuan’s arms and whispered in his ear.","The fire in the teenager’s eyes gradually died down.","He seemed to have regained his senses.","He caressed her face. “Are you alright?”","Feng Wu nodded with tears in her eyes. “I’m fine. I’m fine.”","The old master of the Firmament Palace was furious.","Jun Linyuan seemed normal now. If he didn’t lose his mind, he would... The old master looked at the dead bodies on the ground.","They weren’t just any dead bodies. They were all famous Spiritual Saints.","At that thought, she had no choice but to draw in her breath and fight back her rage.","The Dongsang Kingdom.","Night Owl was furious when he saw Jun Linyuan caressing Feng Wu’s cheek.","Thump!","He jumped up, and the water curtain splashed all over the ground.","Lord Jing looked sorry as well. “Why did things turn around in the end? Who’s that girl? Why is she so influential to Jun Linyuan? Is she...”","“My lord, please leave.”","Night Owl had to fight back his anger with all his effort. His voice was very soft, but he was furious.","Seeing this, Lord Jing opened his mouth but didn’t say anything in the end.","He patted Night Owl on the shoulder, shook his head, and left.","Night Owl turned to look at the manual that the mysterious person in black","To master the skill, one had to first...","Time was running out.","In two hours, the manual would self-destruct.","Meanwhile, everyone in the Northern Yan Kingdom watched this in silence.","Even Princess Raoxi, who had been kicked away, hobbled back and watched this.","Jun Linyuan’s cold eyes were twinkling as he stared at Feng Wu.","He stood ramrod straight, and his eyes were as bright as stars. He looked very serious as if he was making an oath.","“I kept my promise.”","He promised that he would protect her for the rest of his life, and he didn’t go back on his word.","The girl nodded repeatedly with tears in her eyes. “Yes, you did. You’ve protected me well. Very well...” It was just that it had cost him a lot.","Seeing all the blood on Jun Linyuan, Feng Wu felt so sorry for him.","Jun Linyuan beamed at her. His smile reminded her of dark clouds dissipating, and the sky was clear and blue.","Feng Wu was about to tell him that she liked him a lot...","However, before she could say that, Jun Linyuan swayed and fell into Feng Wu’s arms.","“Jun Linyuan? Jun Linyuan?”","Feng Wu wrapped her arms around him and cried out, but Jun Linyuan didn’t reply.","Feng Xun and the others all ran in her direction.","However, the master of the Firmament Palace, who was hiding behind the wall, narrowed her eyes.","Jun Linyuan had fainted? Didn’t that mean that Jun Linyuan was so weak now that she could do whatever she wanted to Feng Wu? The master of the Firmament Palace was over the moon!","She would be so lucky if she could kill Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu now!","She was about to charge out when she stopped.","But what if Jun Linyuan was faking it?","Feng Wu couldn’t be more cunning.."]},{"number":3933,"title":"Chapter 3933: Only You Can Do It (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3933: Only You Can Do It (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu couldn’t be more cunning.","The head of the Firmament Palace hesitated. When she finally made up her mind to charge out and kill Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan with a Great Destruction Spell—","All of a sudden, a figure landed from above.","The head of the Firmament Palace froze on the spot when he saw who it was. She didn’t dare to activate the skill anymore. Instead, she turned around and ran off.","The person who scared her off was none other than Patriarch Huyan himself.","He looked around and frowned.","Those who were close to Feng Wu didn’t think much of it when they saw the arrival of Patriarch Huyan, but those who didn’t know the relationship between Feng Wu and him were terrified.","Especially the onlookers thousands of meters away.","They all dropped to their knees and didn’t dare to move.","It was a sign of respect for the Patriarch.","To them, Patriarch Huyan was the pillar of the Northern Yan Kingdom. He was even more prestigious than their king and couldn’t be offended.","Patriarch Huyan glanced at the crowd, and everyone dropped to their knees.","Even Feng Xun dropped to his knees and lowered his head.","It was obvious that Patriarch Huyan was displeased.","The king was on his knees, so why should Feng Wu be standing?","Feng Xun was secretly alarmed. He couldn’t afford to be careless. He had only been able to stay in the tower because of Xiao Wu. Without Xiao Wu, he would be nothing in front of Patriarch Huyan.","Feng Wu was the only one who wasn’t intimidated.","Feng Wu was so anxious that she almost called him “Sixth Senior Brother”.","However, recalling what her sixth senior brother had told her, Feng Wu decided not to address him that way.","According to her Sixth Senior Brother, there were powerful enemies lurking in the dark.","At that thought, Feng Wu said to Patriarch Huyan, “Please help me!”","Luckily, only a handful of people were close enough, such as Feng Xun, the eldest prince, and the king of the Northern Yan Kingdom. Anyone else would have been astonished by Feng Wu’s tone.","Seeing the blood on Feng Wu’s face, Patriarch Huyan grew anxious.","Feng Wu said, “Please help us!”","Patriarch Huyan nodded and took Feng Wu back to the tower.","Holding Jun Linyuan in her arms, Feng Wu took him back to her room as soon as she landed, leaving Patriarch Huyan behind.","Patriarch Huyan was speechless.","He was a little frustrated when he saw Feng Wu run off.","Meanwhile, Feng Xun grabbed the eagle, who was about to fly away. “Brother","Eagle, please take me with you.”","The giant eagle didn’t want to, but Feng Xun was hanging on its wing and wouldn’t come off, for without the eagle, Feng Xun wouldn’t be able to get in.","The giant eagle stared at Feng Xun in resignation. “How am I supposed to fly when you’re holding my wings? Hold my legs.”","The bird was a Spiritual Saint now!","Feng Xun said, “Sure!”","In the tower.","Feng Wu almost burst into tears when she cut open Jun Linyuan’s black robe.","His lean, fair body was covered with wounds, some old and some new... There were a few cuts so deep that she could see the bones.","Feng Wu felt a lump in her throat. Taking a deep breath, she fought back her emotions and began to treat Jun Linyuan.","However, internal injuries weren’t as easy to treat as external ones.."]},{"number":3934,"title":"Chapter 3934: Only You Can Do It (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3934: Only You Can Do It (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan still wouldn’t wake up after three days.","Feng Wu grew anxious and went to see Patriarch Huyan.","Feng Wu knocked on the door.","Patriarch Huyan was cultivating when he heard the knock on the door. He raised his chin proudly.","Knock, knock, knock.","There was another knock on the door.","Patriarch Huyan deliberately kept a straight face and said in a low voice,","“Enter.”","Feng Wu pushed the door open and walked in to find Patriarch Huyan cultivating with his legs crossed and his eyes closed, looking very haughty.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She slowly walked up to him and sat down in front of him.","However, the old man only cared about his own cultivation and ignored her.","Feng Wu didn’t know what she had done to offend her sixth senior brother, but she kept her gaze on him.","The Patriarch went on cultivating with his legs crossed.","Feng Wu tugged at his sleeve.","Patriarch Huyan didn’t reply.","Hence, Feng Wu moved closer and tugged at his sleeve again. “Sixth Senior","Brother? Sixth Senior Brother?”","Only then did Patriarch Huyan open his eyes a little. He glanced at Feng Wu, then closed them again.","Feng Wu almost laughed. Why was her Sixth Senior Brother so adorable?","“Sixth Brother, Sixth Brother, please help me.” Feng Wu wouldn’t let him off the hook. She sat down next to him. Seeing that his eyes were closed, she tugged at his white beard.","“Cough, cough...”","The most capable man in Northern Yan Kingdom finally opened his eyes. He glanced at Feng Wu and snorted.","Feng Wu sighed in resignation. “Sixth Senior Brother, what did I do? Did I upset you?”","The old man said, “Of course you didn’t. You did a great job.”","Listen to that. Of course, he was upset about something.","Feng Wu couldn’t for the life of her figure out what had upset him, so she had to take his arm. “Please don’t be mad. Please don’t be mad at me. I’m so sad...","Feng Wu gave him a “I’m pitiful, weak, and helpless” look.","She knew how to do that!","It just so happened that Patriarch Huyan hadn’t been close to anyone in years, and he couldn’t resist Feng Wu. His heart softened right away, and he mumbled grumpily.","“You don’t need me anymore now that you have a boyfriend!” Feng Wu couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","The Patriarch couldn’t believe that she was laughing.","“Of course, I need you! Your my favorite senior brother!” Feng Wu said without hesitation.","He was the only senior brother she knew, so she didn’t feel any pressure.","Patriarch Huyan was thrilled.","Back then, they had all raised their little junior sister together. All the senior brothers had teased the girl with all kinds of gifts, making her say that one of them was her favorite senior brother. The girl had been very stubborn and wouldn’t say anything. But now, heh..","He was indeed the best senior brother to his junior sister! At the thought of how he had outshone all his senior brothers, Patriarch Huyan chuckled inwardly and was very pleased.","Feng Wu knew that her words had worked.","“Let’s go. Come with me. Jun Linyuan is so badly injured that you’re the only one who can treat him.” Feng Wu dragged her senior brother away.."]},{"number":3935,"title":"Chapter 3935: Save Him (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Patriarch Huyan liked Jun Linyuan a little better than before. After all, he was his junior sister’s favorite senior brother, and he had won the bet!","He followed Feng Wu to see Jun Linyuan.","“He’s suffering from a severe internal injury,” said Patriarch Huyan.","Feng Wu looked at him and nodded. “Yes, that’s right.”","Of course, she knew that Jun Linyuan had suffered from an internal injury. She had wrapped up all his external wounds, but his internal injury...","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Feng Wu could sense that Jun Linyuan’s soul felt like a candle that was going to extinguish. She was worried that once the flame was extinguished, he would... Patriarch Huyan frowned and said, “That internal injury isn’t easy to treat.”","Tugging at his sleeve, Feng Wu pleaded with her eyes.","Patriarch Huyan frowned.","Feng Wu knew what he was worried about.","Her pills alone wouldn’t be enough to treat Jun Linyuan’s internal injury. A capable cultivator had to inject their spiritual essence into Jun Linyuan’s dantian, and that person had to be very capable.","Feng Wu looked expectantly at the Patriarch with twinkling eyes.","Patriarch Huyan hesitated...","For he himself was stuck at the breakthrough threshold. Spiritual essence could be recovered after consumption, but Jun Linyuan was a teenager, and who knew how much he could absorb?","Patriarch Huyan stroked his beard and murmured, “The more talented he is, the more spiritual essence he can absorb.”","He glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu immediately put on a sympathetic look and nodded obsequiously.","Seeing that his junior sister understood him so well, Patriarch Huyan felt much better. He mumbled again, “It’s not easy for me to accumulate spiritual essence. I’m about to make a breakthrough...” He didn’t want to give away so much of his spiritual essence.","Feng Wu pouted and looked very pitiful.","Seeing that the girl wanted to say something but didn’t want to upset him, Patriarch Huyan felt sorry for her. He rubbed her head. “Do you really want me to treat him?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to do either. Her Senior Brother was on the verge of a breakthrough, and Jun Linyuan’s fate was hanging in the balance... Feng Wu began to waver...","Gradually, she began to take Jun Linyuan’s side.","“Sixth Senior Brother...” The girl pursed her lips and stroked his beard. “You’ve waited so long for this breakthrough... Of course, it’s more important than anything else. As for Jun Linyuan... He, he can just...’","Gosh...","Of course, he wouldn’t let that happen.","However, from what his junior sister said just then, Patriarch Huyan was convinced that he was the most important person to her.","Seeing that he still hadn’t made up his mind, Feng Wu added, “When I see my beautiful master one day, I’ll tell him that my Sixth Brother treats me very well.","He...","Patriarch Huyan shuddered at the mention of his master.","That was right. When she talked to their master about it later, was she going to say that he wouldn’t help her fiance? Gosh..","“Of course, I’ll help him!”","If his junior sister lost her love forever and cried in bed all by herself, he would blame himself even if his fellow senior brothers didn’t beat him up!","‘Guard the door! Don’t let anyone in!”"]},{"number":3936,"title":"Chapter 3936: Save him (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Guard the door and don’t let anyone in,” said Patriarch Huyan.","Feng Wu quickly ran out of the room.","After some thought, Patriarch Huyan waved his hand. “No one’s coming here anyway. Forget about it. Fix this lousy sword. It’s connected to him spiritually.","If it’s not fixed, I’m afraid his internal injury won’t recover either.”","Feng Wu took the Sky Destroyer with both hands and carefully held it in her arms.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","The sword was indeed in tatters. The blade was covered with cracks, and the tip was broken.","Feng Wu wanted to stay and see how Patriarch Huyan would treat Jun Linyuan, but he wouldn’t let her. With a wave of his hand, he sent Feng Wu away.","Feng Wu was worried, but with Patriarch Huyan here, Jun Linyuan should be alright.","She let out a breath of relief and decided to repair the sword first.","In Patriarch Huyan’s refinery.","Feng Wu stared at Sky Destroyer in a daze.","The sword had been with Jun Linyuan for a very long time. Although Jun Linyuan had been making rapid progress, it was obvious that Sky Destroyer couldn’t keep up with his cultivation level. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have been damaged this time.","Holding Sky Destroyer, Feng Wu racked her brain, trying to remember everything she knew about forging weapons.","Her eyes lit up all of a sudden.","She remembered that her master had told her to memorize the Semi-divine Weapon Refinement Manual. It would be great if she could forge Sky Destroyer into a Semi-divine weapon and make it a Growth-type one.","But she needed some divine iron.","wait!","Feng Wu looked around and saw that it was indeed the Patriarch’s refinery. Not only was there divine iron, there were three chunks of them! Moreover, each of them had denser energy than the next.","Feng Wu was conflicted.","She ran out of the room, wanting to ask Patriarch Huyan, but the door was tightly shut and she had no idea what stage the treatment had reached. If she disturbed the Patriarch and Jun Linyuan, she would be in a lot of trouble.","Feng Wu ran back to the refinery.","Taking it without asking was stealing. Although it belonged to her sixth senior brother, she couldn’t just take it...","“Do I have anything that my sixth senior brother needs?”","Ah!","Feng Wu smacked her head. Her sixth senior brother didn’t seem to know the manual she had just recited.","She would trade it with him.","Feng Wu took out a pen and ink and started writing. She then sealed the sheets of paper in an envelope and put them under the divine iron. After that, she took the one with the highest concentration of energy and started repairing Sky Destroyer.","Time went by.","Feng Wu had lost track of time when she was forging Sky Destroyer. In the end, the sword was so fired up that it seemed to set the entire refinery on fire!","Blood was needed!","As the owner of Sky Destroyer, Jun Linyuan had the best blood.","Feng Wu ran out again, but the door was still closed, and no one knew what was going on inside.","Feng Wu was worried. Was something wrong?","She wanted to push the door open, but it was sealed by the Patriarch, and she couldn’t get in.","The Sky Destroyer made a loud noise behind her.","Feng Wu was worried sick. Forget it. Since she didn’t have Jun Linyuan’s blood, she would use hers for now. One was the Divine Dragon Phoenix Blood, and the other one was the True Phoenix Blood. That should be enough, right? Feng Wu thought to herself.","However, when Feng Wu dripped her own blood on Sky Destroyer, the sword suddenly stopped moving, as if someone had just smacked it. Even the flames on it seemed to have extinguished.."]},{"number":3937,"title":"Chapter 3937: Jealous Teenager (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu looked at the Sky Destroyer in surprise and wondered what was wrong with it.","That was rather scary.","Just then, she heard a voice. Turning around, she saw that it was Patriarch","Huyan.","Hence, she waved at him. “Come here.”","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Right now, Patriarch Huyan didn’t look too well.","His face was drained of all color, his eyes were glassy, and he was stumbling as he walked. He almost tripped when he walked up to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu steadied him.","“Sixth Senior Brother, you...” Feng Wu felt sorry for him. Why had the old man gone through?","Before she knew it, the first thing she said was, “Sixth Senior Brother, did you come out of there? How’s Jun Linyuan? I’ll go check up on him!” After that, Feng Wu was going to rush into the stone house.","Patriarch Huyan infuriated...","Didn’t she say he was her favorite? Now that he was like this, she still only cared about her boyfriend.","The Patriarch grabbed Feng Wu’s arm.","Feng Wu turned around. “Sixth Senior Brother?”","Patriarch Huyan sounded a little jealous when he said, “Calm down. He’s still absorbing the spiritual essence. What if you interrupt him and make him go berserk? Won’t all my efforts go to waste?”","Frightened, Feng Wu didn’t dare to go any closer, but she still looked at","Patriarch Huyan in excitement. “Senior Brother, did you just say that Jun","Linyuan had recovered? Is he alright now?”","Patriarch Huyan glanced at Feng Wu and didn’t really want to talk to his junior sister.","But the girl wouldn’t leave him alone. “Just tell me. Sixth Senior Brother, what’s going on with Jun Linyuan? Gosh, I’m so worried!”","Patriarch Huyan mumbled enviously, “Jun Linyuan, Jun Linyuan. Al you ever say is Jun Linyuan...” Feng Wu chuckled.","Was he jealous?","Her Sixth Senior Brother looked like a little child now.","However, her heart went out to Patriarch Huyan when she saw his silver hair and wrinkles on his smooth face. She then turned to her Sixth Senior Brother with limpid eyes.","Patriarch Huyan couldn’t stand the look in his little sister’s eyes. His little sister was the apple of his eye, and as her senior brother, he had to do whatever she wanted, It was only natural.","Once he had made up his mind, he said, “Don’t worry. Your lover is doing great.","Do you know what he’s like?”","Feng Wu looked at him in confusion.","Patriarch Huyan glanced at Feng Wu and said aggrievedly, “He absorbs spiritual essence! Did you know that? He was really absorbing spiritual essence!","“I was only trying at first. I injected my spiritual essence into his body and was going to stimulate his dantian with it before taking my spiritual essence back.","“Do you know what happened in the end? His dantian was so vast that you couldn’t see the bottom of it. When I injected my spiritual essence into it, it disappeared without a trace. Then...”","Feng Wu asked, “Then what?”","Patriarch Huyan heaved a sigh. “Then I just wouldn’t accept it. You know, I’m one of the most capable cultivators on this continent, and apart from a few old people, I don’t think anyone is my match.. But...”"]},{"number":3938,"title":"Chapter 3938: Jealous Teenager (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“But Jun Linyuan is such a genius!","“I injected half of my spiritual essence, but he didn’t respond. I felt that something wasn’t right, so I stopped trying.","“And guess what?”","Feng Wu’s eyes widened, and she acted as if she was shocked. “What happened?”","Patriarch Huyan smacked the table in frustration. “That brat is a wolf in sheep’s clothing! He was so cunning! He was pretending when he didn’t respond to my spiritual essence!","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","“When I tried to take back my spiritual essence, I realized that I couldn’t!” Patriarch Huyan blushed in frustration.","Feng Wu asked, “What? How... And then?”","Patriarch Huyan said angrily, “Then? Then it was a competition between Jun","Linyuan and I. In the end...”","Feng Wu asked gingerly, “So, Sixth Senior Brother, did you lose in the end?”","Patriarch Huyan cared about his reputation in front of his junior sister. How could he give in?","“Of course not! I;ve never lost a battle!” said Patriarch Huyan aggressively.","Feng Wu said, “Alright, then...”","Patriarch Huyan was frustrated, but he had to admit it. “But that Jun Linyuan guy is quite capable. I don’t think he has lost either.”","Feng Wu looked curiously at him. Who won the competition, then?","However, the Patriarch was supposed to be more capable than Jun Linyuan, but he was a little angry now... Could it be...","Patriarch Huyan patted Feng Wu on the head. “What are you thinking? Master","Mu’s disciples are never going to lose!”","Feng Wu nodded and didn’t think about it anymore. She raised Sky Destroyer and asked Patriarch Huyan, “Sixth Senior Brother, what’s going on with this sword? It was so hot a moment ago, but it’s completely silent now.”","Patriarch Huyan said grumpily, “The sword spirit inside that lousy sword is already damaged, which is as good as an idiot in human terms. You can take a new sword, and the sword spirit... Wait!”","He was surprised when he saw the sword Feng Wu handed him.","He was shocked.","Feng Wu saw him shudder a little.","“Sixth Senior Brother?” Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Patriarch Huyan’s face gradually turned from pale to pink. He suddenly turned around and stared at Feng Wu with a look that Feng Wu couldn’t understand.","The look gave Feng Wu the creeps. “What’s wrong?”","Staring at Feng Wu, Patriarch Huyan was so excited that his beard was twitching. “Your sword spirit isn’t an idiot! Not only that, but it has also mutated!”","Feng Wu said, “Mutated? What’s going on? Why did it mutate? Is it good or bad?”","Unable to control his excitement, Patriarch Huyan said loudly, “Of course it’s for the better! It’s a divine weapon now! Do you know what that means?”","Feng Wu asked, “A semi-divine weapon?”","Patriarch Huyan was so excited that he swore. “Bullshit! Not a semi-divine weapon! It’s going to become a divine one!”","Seeing the confused look on Feng Wu’s face, Patriarch Huyan stared at her anxiously. “Do you still remember our master’s ruler?”","Feng Wu shook her head in confusion.","Patriarch Huyan said anxiously, “The ruler our master used to smack us when we dozed off in our study time? Remember that?”","Feng Wu shook her head in bewilderment... Was her beautiful master that strict before?","Patriarch Huyan sighed. “It doesn’t matter. You just need to know that it’s very likely that the sword will become a divine weapon..”"]},{"number":3939,"title":"Chapter 3939: Jealous Jun Linyuan","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu asked, “How did you know that?”","Patriarch Huyan said decisively, “Because the Sky Destroyer already contains a divine embryo. When the time is right, it’ll turn into a divine weapon!”","Feng Wu was amazed. “Really?”","Master Huyan rolled his eyes at Feng Wu. “Of course.”","Feng Wu immediately took out her Fallen Star Sword and showed it to Patriarch Huyan. “Please have a look. Is there a divine embryo inside?” Feng Wu looked expectantly at him.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Fallen Star Sword? After examining it carefully, he handed it back to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu kept her expectant gaze on Patriarch Huyan.","However, he only patted Feng Wu on the shoulder before walking away.","The look on his face...","Of course, Feng Wu could tell.","The Fallen Star Sword wasn’t a divine embryo!","Feng Wu’s face darkened.","On second thought, she realized that Sky Destroyer didn’t have a divine embryo in the first place. It had only become one by sheer luck after the narrow escape. Therefore, she still had a chance with her Fallen Star Sword!","At that thought, Feng Wu looked expectant.","All of a sudden, Feng Wu felt a pair of eyes on her, and she looked up in the direction of the gaze.","“Jun Linyuan!”","Feng Wu was elated to see Jun Linyuan, and she hopped toward him like a rabbit.","She had no idea how long Jun Linyuan had been there, nor did she know what he saw, but he didn’t look too happy.","Feng Wu didn’t notice it. She was thrilled to see Jun Linyuan come out.","“Why did you walk out on your own? Aren’t you badly injured? Won’t it affect your internal injury? You look pale. You don’t look well...”","Feng Wu rushed to his side and asked all the questions in a concerned tone.","Only then did Jun Linyuan look a little better.","Feng Wu frowned. “Sixth Senior Brother said that you were mostly recovered, but you don’t look much better. He lied to me.”","Jun Linyuan frowned. “Sixth Senior Brother?”","Gosh! Feng Wu wanted to slap herself. She had blurted out that secret in a moment of desperation. Her sixth senior brother had told her that her master still had enemies lurking in the dark and that no one should know about the sect.","But Jun Linyuan... Although he knew that Jun Linyuan would keep it a secret,.. No, she couldn’t tell Jun Linyuan because once the secret was revealed, it wouldn’t be a secret anymore.","Feng Wu stuck out her tongue involuntarily and smiled obsequiously. She then changed the subject. “Hey, why are you out here? You’re so badly injured. We don’t want you to catch a cold. Here, let me help you inside.”","After that, Feng Wu tried to hold Jun Linyuan’s arm.","However, as soon as her hand touched Jun Linyuan’s arm, Jun Linyuan threw it off with a livid face. The teenager then went back into the room with a cold look in his eyes and slammed the door shut behind him.","He closed the door?!","Feng Wu’s mouth fell open when she saw what he did.","“Jun Linyuan, you’re so grumpy!”","But it wasn’t too shocking because that was what Jun Linyuan used to be like. He would get angry when things didn’t go his way, and when he was angry, he would lock himself up and wouldn’t see anyone.","Recently, Jun Linyuan had been too kind to her, which gave her the impression that he was a mild-tempered man. As a matter of fact, the crown prince had always been very grumpy. Feng Wu thought to herself.","However...","It was so humiliating to be left outside like this...","Luckily, no one saw it.","Moreover, Feng Wu knew Jun Linyuan well enough to know that he was quick to flare up, but he was also easy to appease.","The longer she waited, the harder it would be to appease him. Therefore, she had to put out the fire before it exploded.","At that thought, Feng Wu was about to knock on the door.","“Pfft...","A voice rang out next to her.","Turning around, Feng Wu saw that it was the giant eagle. Right now, it was leaning against a stone wall with its wings crossed and grinning at Feng Wu.","That was to say...","Had it seen everything? That was so humiliating. Feng Wu thought to herself.","“Stop laughing!” Feng Wu said grumpily.","The giant eagle looked at Feng Wu up and down in amazement, as if it was looking at some strange creature.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. “Shut up!”","The giant eagle walked away, trembling. It was obviously trying to suppress its laughter.","Feng Wu also saw Little Phoenix standing on its head and talking to it. The giant eagle said, “Wow, I didn’t know that little phoenix could do that!” “Little phoenix” was referring to Feng Wu.","The giant eagle wanted to call Feng Wu “little phoenix”. That way, Feng Wu would be in the same category as them and sound much closer.","Little Phoenix didn’t know what to say. “Don’t flatter yourself.” The giant eagle said, “I think she’s going to knock on the door and go in.”","Little Phoenix didn’t know what to say. “Don’t be so ignorant.”","It had seen a lot of such things before.","The giant eagle said, “I just don’t get it. She’s a girl... Why would she try to appease him? It’s so humiliating! ”","Little Phoenix glanced at the eagle. “You don’t understand.”","The giant eagle asked curiously, “I’d like to hear about it.”","Little Phoenix glanced at it and said casually, “Just remember that little Feng","Wu has never been defeated before.”","The giant eagle said, “But isn’t Jun Linyuan in total control?”","“Heh!” Little Phoenix stuck out a paw. “No, Jun Linyuan is totally under control.”","The giant eagle said, “I don’t understand.”","Little Phoenix rolled its eyes at it. “That’s why you’re such an idiot. Just be humble and admit your defeat.”","The giant eagle exploded when it heard the first part. “Who are you calling an idiot? I’m a Level-2 Spiritual Saint! Come and fight me!”","Little Phoenix’s face turned green.","Feng Wu watched as they walked away.","She stared at the stone door and was about to knock when she recalled what the giant eagle said...","She was a girl. Why did she have to comfort him every time? She felt so wronged when he lost his temper for no reason!","And he always lost his temper for no reason. That was so frustrating!","“I won’t live with it anymore!","“He can stay angry inside!”","Feng Wu stormed off and went back to the refinery.","Feng Wu only realized that she was still holding Sky Destroyer when she sat down.","Sky Destroyer was repaired, but she could see the cracks on the blade.","Feng Wu recalled what happened in front of the temple.","Jun Linyuan had gone to the Zuo family for her.","He had gone to the Hua family for her.","She was also the reason that Jun Linyuan had come to Northern Yan for the duel despite his injury.","Despite the fact that he had gone berserk, Jun Linyuan still told her that he had kept his promise...","She gradually calmed down.","Slowly, she began to feel sorry for Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu thought to herself, “He’s just this unruly, arrogant, domineering, and overbearing man... Why would I take it for granted that he’ll be as mild-tempered as a normal person?”","So be it...","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead and told herself not to be mad. There was something wrong with being a genius. No one was perfect.","Feng Wu stood outside the room with the Sky Destroyer in her arms again.","As for whether the eagle would laugh at her or not... It didn’t matter. She could stand the humiliation. It wouldn’t cost her anything. Feng Wu comforted herself in her head.","She knocked on the door.","There was no reply.","She knocked again.","It was very quiet, and no one responded.","But Feng Wu knew that Jun Linyuan was inside because she could hear his breathing.","“Brother Jun? Brother Jun, it’s me. Open up...”","To be honest, Feng Wu felt ashamed to call him that.","She looked around, fearing that the eagle would burst into laughter.","“Brother Jun...","“Please open the door.”","The teenager inside blushed a little, wondering why she spoke in that way.","He couldn’t understand how the girl could be so shameless.","The teenager opened the door with an expressionless face.","He stared at Feng Wu with a stern look on his face.","However, the petite girl had a bright smile on her face. Her smile was warm, and her voice was so soft that he thought he could taste honey in his mouth. Tugging at the teenager’s sleeve, she smiled. “Brother Jun, are you hungry? Are you in pain?","Hungry?","Pain?","Was she trying to appease a three-year-old?","The teenager tried his best to keep his face emotionless.","He was going to throw a dirty look at the girl and make her run away, for he felt so wronged.","However, as soon as he said, “I don’t want to see...","Before he could finish, the girl ran into the room from under his armpit.","Jun Linyuan didn’t know what to say.","Was his voice not cold enough?","Jun Linyuan closed the door and stared at Feng Wu.","By then, Feng Wu had sat down on a stone stool at the table. Resting her chin on her hand, she beckoned at him. “Come here. Sit with me.”","Her smile reminded him of a warm spring day, and he couldn’t resist.","Although he still felt conflicted, he couldn’t control his instinct to stay close to","the warmth...","But he was still angry.","Feng Wu rose to her feet and hopped toward them like a bunny.","It just so happened that she had two bunny ears on her pink cape today. The fluffy white fur looked as bright as her smile.","“You’re still recovering, and you can’t stand there for too long. Sit down. Don’t hurt yourself again. Sit down.”","Taking his hand, Feng Wu sat him down.","Jun Linyuan remained unperturbed. He raised his chin and wouldn’t look at the girl.","The teenager had fair skin and was graceful and elegant. He looked like a noble young master who had come from a rich family, but in the blink of an eye, he could create mountains of corpses and seas of blood. Even the emperor of a powerful country blanched at his presence. Right now, he looked as awkward as a child.","Feng Wu found it hilarious.","However, she only dared to laugh inwardly and didn’t dare to let it show, for she feared that the crown prince would run away in frustration.","“Why are you smiling?” The teenager asked arrogantly.","Luckily, Feng Wu was mild-tempered today. If she were more straightforward, she would have retorted right away, saying, “It’s none of your business!” Feng Wu smiled at Jun Linyuan. “I’m smiling because you’re handsome.” Gosh!","Feng Wu only said it in passing, but the teenager’s earlobes almost turned pink.","“I don’t know what you’re talking about!” The teenager looked away.","Feng Wu smiled and tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve. “Well, we’re not mad anymore, are we?”","“I am mad!”","Feng Wu tugged at his sleeve. “Brother Jun, please don’t be mad at me.”","The teenager didn’t look back, but he didn’t say no either.","Feng Wu knew that he had softened.","She ran to Jun Linyuan’s side, crouched down, and looked up with her limpid eyes.","“Brother Jun, don’t be mad anymore. Please...”","She reminded him of an aggrieved kitten.","The teenager couldn’t stand it, and he couldn’t keep his face straight anymore.","Seeing this, Feng Wu knew that he was appeased, so she went on. “Brother Jun, let me check your pulse. I need to know how you’re doing, or I’ll be worried.”","She tried to grab Jun Linyuan’s wrist after that, and Jun Linyuan didn’t push her away.","He snorted inwardly. So, she cared about him.","While Feng Wu closed her eyes and concentrated on checking Jun Linyuan’s pulse, he kept his unblinking gaze on her beautiful profile in an almost greedy way.","He looked out of the window as soon as she opened her eyes as if he couldn’t be bothered to look at her.","Feng Wu didn’t notice that.","After checking his pulse, Feng Wu let out a breath of relief.","“That’s good!” Feng Wu was relieved. “It’s not getting worse, but it’s still quite serious because you’ve added more wounds to your old injury. It’ll take you a long time to recover from them. Luckily, your life is no longer in danger.” Jun Linyuan nodded coldly and still wouldn’t give Feng Wu a smile.","He was very proud.","Feng Wu didn’t seem to notice his cold face at all. She only took his hand and reminded him repeatedly, “I’m begging you. Don’t use force for the next three months. Don’t do it again. Remember?”","The teenager feigned an aloof attitude and looked out of the window.","Feng Wu pretended that she couldn’t see it and smiled. “You’re more important than anything else. Taking care of you is my top priority now. “Don’t worry. I’ll be responsible for you to the end.”","The teenager nodded and stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said earnestly, “I’ll take good care of you. I’ll make your meals, wash your clothes, and serve you tea. I’ll make sure that you’re properly looked after..”"]},{"number":3940,"title":"Chapter 3940: Precious","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I promise you that you won’t have to lift a finger! I’ll take care of you when you’re in danger, and I’ll beat your enemy up when you’re provoked. Anyway, just sit there and be the young master. I’ll take care of everything for you!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t know what to say.","He looked away again.","Feng Wu said, “Just leave your body to me!”","The crown prince was speechless. The girl was so explicit!","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","However...","Jun Linyuan was displeased at first, but when he saw how concerned the girl was, he was almost appeased.","The girl suddenly smiled bitterly.","There was a guilty look on her face, and her voice sounded lonely.","“Actually, I’m not in the position to say that because you’ve been severely injured because of me. You’ve been injured over and over again... You’re the crown prince, the hope of all the people of the Junwu Empire, and the treasure of many people...”","“I’m not anyone’s treasure,” the teenager said coldly. “There’s no one.” Other people wouldn’t quite make out what Jun Linyuan meant.","But Feng Wu understood.","By that, he meant that no one cherished him.","Feng Wu felt so sorry for him that she blurted out, “If no one cherishes you, I...” “What?” The teenager’s bright eyes immediately fixed on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu’s head went blank and she immediately calmed down. What was she supposed to say?","Feng Wu immediately corrected herself. “I... I don’t think that’s the right thing to say. Her Majesty will be the first to say no!”","Jun Linyuan looked disappointed and didn’t know what to say.","He smirked and stopped talking.","Feng Wu cleared her throat and tried to change the subject. “Jun Linyuan, why were you so angry just then? You weren’t happy to see me, were you?” Jun Linyuan said, “Yes, I’m not happy to see you!”","Feng Wu glared at Jun Linyuan, and Jun Linyuan stared back at her.","One second, two seconds, three seconds... ten seconds.","Feng Wu couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","With that, the mood in the room changed. She couldn’t stop laughing.","Having been persuaded by Feng Wu, the teenager didn’t have much anger left and had been pretending to be angry. After what Feng Wu said, he couldn’t keep his face straight anymore.","“Tell me. Why were you angry?","“I care about you a lot. You were so badly injured that I couldn’t save you from your internal injury. I had to beg Patriarch Huyan to save you.","“He also gave me the Sky Destroyer so that I could repair it. Otherwise, you won’t be able to recover from your injury. After that, I went to the refinery and started repairing it.","“Do you think Sky Destroyer is that easy to repair? No, it’s so difficult. To repair it, I stole six... I mean, Patriarch Huyan’s divine iron. I wonder if he’ll kill me if he finds out,” Feng Wu said aggrievedly.","The more Jun Linyuan listened, the more he smiled.","But when Feng Wu looked at him, he pursed his lips.","Therefore, Feng Wu had no idea how happy the teenager was.","“So, you do care about me after all! Hmph!” the teenager thought proudly. “Little Feng Wu, you’re still too young to understand what I mean. You’re showing me concern, and you’re in love with... Ahem, I’ll give you some pointers when I have time.”","The more he thought about it, the more pleased the crown prince was.","He was so pleased that Feng Wu could see the smile on his face.","“Jun Linyuan, you’re smiling.” Feng Wu was pleasantly surprised.","Jun Linyuan glanced at her and denied it outright. “No.”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, you are! I saw it! Not only are you smiling, but you’re also very pleased with yourself. Tell me, what are you laughing at me for?”","Jun Linyuan said, “You little fool.”","Feng Wu was furious. “I care about you so much, but you’re laughing at me in your head! You... I’m so mad!”","Jun Linyuan grunted in satisfaction, but he still had questions. “What’s your relationship with Patriarch Huyan?”","He cut to the chase and kept his gaze on Feng Wu, giving her no chance to run away.","“That’s... a good question,” Feng Wu said earnestly.","Jun Linyuan crossed his legs. “You can run away and choose not to tell me.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Really?”","The crown prince smiled at her.","Feng Wu mumbled, “I knew it! I knew it! Jun Linyuan, you’re such a tyrant!”","The tyrant looked at her in satisfaction.","Feng Wu racked her brain.","First of all, she had let it slip when she called Patriarch Huyan “Sixth Senior Brother”, so she couldn’t keep it a secret anymore.","If she told Jun Linyuan the truth...","If she didn’t tell Jun Linyuan the truth...","Feng Wu turned around and looked at Jun Linyuan in silence. Right now, he was also looking at Feng Wu with a serious look on his face that she had never seen before.","Feng Wu sighed and said in the end, “If you really want to know, I can tell you, but it’s the biggest secret of my life. Once you know it, you’ll be mine...” Jun Linyuan coughed.","Feng Wu said, “I mean that once you know the secret, you’re on my side. Got it?!”","Jun Linyuan nodded and sounded impatient. “Alright, alright.”","But he kept repeating Feng Wu’s words in his head.","Feng Wu said in a serious tone, “Listen carefully. I’m a genius teenage girl and an influential figure. You heard me right. Patriarch Huyan is my sixth senior brother. ”","She was right. Jun Linyuan frowned a little. “Sixth senior brother?”","Feng Wu gloated. “Yes.” asked, “How manv more senior brothers are there?”","Feng Wu said, “Five, obviously.”","Jun Linyuan asked, “What’s the point of having so many senior brothers? Is there no senior sister?”","Feng Wu chuckled. “I’ve asked him the same question. He said that there were no senior sisters, but only senior brothers, and they were all very capable. By the way, do you know who my third senior brother is?”","Jun Linyuan asked, “Who?”","Feng Wu chuckled like a little mouse. “It’s Chu Tianxiao.”","Jun Linyuan was genuinely surprised.","Patriarch Huyan and Chu Tianxiao were both influential figures on this continent since ancient times. Although Jun Linyuan was very capable now, he could only defeat a few intermediate Spiritual Saints.","At his current level, he wasn’t strong enough to fight off someone like Patriarch Huyan.","Jun Linyuan said, “Your master is Mu...”","Feng Wu nodded.","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu. “Your sect is quite impressive.”","Feng Wu nodded, looking pleased with herself. “That’s right. But my Sixth Senior Brother said that I couldn’t tell anyone about it, nor could he openly acknowledge me as his junior sister. That’s because my master’s enemy is out there, and I’m the weakest. The enemy may find me.”","Jun Linyuan’s eyes darkened. “Is your master still alive?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course.”","Jun Linyuan said, “But he can’t come out?”","Feng Wu asked, “How do you know?”","Jun Linyuan patted Feng Wu on the head. “You’ll be so pleased if he comes out.”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “I’m not that shallow!”","Jun Linyuan said, “You’ll only be more...”","Feng Wu said, “Hey, Jun Linyuan, are you looking for a beating?”","Jun Linyuan patted Feng Wu on the head with a smile on his face, but deep down, he was very competitive.","Mu Jiuzhou... Mu Jiuzhou... Mu Jiuzhou... He recited that name in his head. Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s arm and looked at him eagerly.","“What?” Jun Linyuan asked.","Feng Wu said, “That’s a shared secret between the two of us. You can’t tell anyone, or I’ll die. I’m putting my life in your hands now. I didn’t want to tell you, but when I saw you, I couldn’t help telling you everything. Hey, Jun Linyuan, stop smiling!”","The teenager smiled, and it was the brightest smile Feng Wu had ever seen. He rubbed the girl’s head and said, “Just wait for me. One day, I’ll be more powerful than Mu Jiuzhou. When that happens, no one will be able to threaten you anymore.”","Jun Linyuan wasn’t only talking to Feng Wu, but it was for himself as well.","He couldn’t bring himself to see his girl living in danger forever.","Because of that, he was going to become the most capable man in the world! He would then kneel on one knee and ask for her hand in marriage. “I’ll protect you forever!”","At that thought, Jun Linyuan smiled again.","What Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan didn’t know was that the entire tower was Patriarch Huyan’s magical instrument. Naturally, he could hear their conversation.","Patriarch Huyan thought, “I didn’t mean to eavesdrop, but the two of you were careless with your words. You can’t blame me?”","He was displeased when he heard that his junior sister had shared such an important secret with","He mumbled, “I told her repeatedly not to tell anyone, but she still said it. She’s not on my side anymore.”","Patriarch Huyan felt that he had to vent his anger on someone. He couldn’t stay in this tower anymore.","He ran into Feng Wu on his way out.","Feng Wu greeted him cheerfully. “Sixth Senior Brother!”","Putting his hands behind his back, Patriarch Huyan raised his chin. “Hmph!”","He then stormed off.","Feng Wu scratched her head. “What’s wrong with him now?”","Meanwhile, in the Northern Yan’s palace.","In the study.","The king hadn’t calmed down yet.","Because it was such a big deal, all the high-ranking officials came to see him, but the king sent them away so that he could pretend that nothing had happened.","He let out a breath of relief after everyone was gone. “What an undeserved catastrophe.”","Because of what happened, Emperor Yan gave the order to get to the bottom of it. He then obtained the information.","Princess Raoxi had joined hands with the Dongsang Kingdom, as well as the Zuo family, the Hua family, and the Firmament Palace of the Junwu Empire... The five forces had joined hands to hunt Feng Wu down, but Feng Wu had escaped. Jun Linyuan, on the other hand, had gone to the Zuo family of Jingyang and the Hua family of Flower Valley... He had almost killed their old masters.","The king felt a chill run down his spine.","“Raoxi, you almost destroyed this kingdom!”","Emperor Yan smashed a stack of paper on the table with a loud thump.","“Bring Princess Raoxi here!” Emperor Yan said angrily.","However, as soon as he said that, a voice came from outside. “Princess Raoxi is here.”","Emperor Yan smirked. “How dare she? Get her ass in here!”","Princess Raoxi entered the room in tears.","“Father!” She ran to a spot ten meters away from the king and inched toward him. “Father, Father, please don’t be sad. You have to take care of yourself.” The king was dumbfounded. What was she talking about?","He looked at her in bewilderment and asked, “Why should I be sad?”","Princess Raoxi comforted him in a hurry. “Father, there are more fish in the sea. Why fall in love with a single woman? That frivolous Feng Wu is so infuriating...”","“Wait.” The king pointed at Princess Raoxi. “Speak like a normal person. Why do you say Feng Wu is so frivolous?”","Princess Raoxi said, “Isn’t Feng Wu your concubine?”","The king’s face was ghastly pale. He kicked Princess Raoxi and said, “Nonsense! Since when is she my concubine? I’ll kill you if you say that!” Princess Raoxi said, “But Father, don’t you dote on her...”","“I’m not worth it!”","Before Raoxi could finish, the king said, “One more word, and I’ll rip your tongue out!”","To be honest, he had never considered Feng Wu in that way. Yes, she was beautiful, but he didn’t deserve her. If he dared to have such thoughts, the Patriarch would probably tear him to pieces.","Princess Raoxi was dumbfounded.","Why was this happening? Wasn’t his father in love with Feng Wu? Feng Wu and were cuddling in broad daylight. Why wasn’t his father angry at","Or was her father faking it?","Raoxi looked up at the emperor, trying to see if he was telling the truth.","She looked into the king’s eyes and saw that he was furious. Why wouldn’t she believe him?","Infuriated, the king kicked Princess Raoxi.","Princess Raoxi slid backward until she reached the door. The door was blocked by the threshold, or she would have been outside by now.","But that was enough to make her burst into tears in pain.","The king pointed at her and scolded her. “Say that again! I dare you!”","If the Patriarch wanted to, nothing could escape his eyes in Northern Yan.","However, Raoxi had said such things about him.. Feng Wu was his concubine? Forget it! He didn’t even dare to think about it!"]},{"number":3941,"title":"Chapter 3941: Father’s Mind","paragraphs":["Chapter 3941: Father’s Mind","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Only then did Princess Raoxi realize that her father was afraid.","Why was his father so scared when Feng Wu was mentioned?","“Father, are you afraid of Jun Linyuan?” That couldn’t be...","Princess Raoxi thought, “Jun Linyuan is indeed very powerful, but that was after he went berserk. If he hasn’t lost control... Jun Linyuan is an advanced Spiritual Saint, isn’t he? Father shouldn’t be so scared.”","The king wanted to kick her again.","Was his daughter born to take revenge from him? Why did she have to bring it up?","One Feng Wu was already frustrating enough, but now, Jun Linyuan was mentioned. The two of them put together... It gave the king a headache.","“Go away!” The king didn’t want to see Princess Raoxi.","“Father, about me marrying Jun Linyuan...” Princess Raoxi said hastily. The king gave her a “you idiot” look. “What did you say?”","Princess Raoxi said, “Father, have you forgotten? You agreed to let me marry Jun Linyuan, even if I’m only his concubine...’","“Are you an idiot?!”","The king couldn’t stand it anymore and gave her a “you idiot” look.","“I used to think that you were brilliant, Raoxi, and I even had the idea of making you the next king. But now... I’m so glad that I didn’t do that. If I had, the Northern Yan Kingdom would have been destroyed!”","Princess Raoxi was so angry that her face turned red.","The king said, “Do you really think that no one knows what you’ve been doing behind my back? Do you really think that I don’t know that you’ve joined hands with the Junwu Empire’s Firmament Palace, the Zuo family, and the Hua family to assassinate Feng Wu?”","“Father, actually...”","The king said, “Do you really think that you can do whatever you want without consequences? Do you think that the world should revolve around you? Do you think that Jun Linyuan is magnanimous enough to make you his concubine?!”","Princess Raoxi’s face turned even paler. “Father, I can explain... Jun Linyuan probably only cares about Feng Wu out of consideration. I have a source of information. The two of them","When Raoxi opened it, she saw that it was a letter from Jun Linyuan...","The letter contained a detailed description of what she had done, and the king was told to keep an eye on Feng Wu for a while. Jun Linyuan also said that he would pay Princess Raoxi a visit in a few days.","The king pointed at Princess Raoxi. “Don’t tell me you think Jun Linyuan is going to chat with you over tea.”","Frightened, Princess Raoxi dropped to her knees. “What does he want to do...”","So, her father was on Feng Wu’s side because of Jun Linyuan’s letter?","She still remembered the threatening words in the letter.","If he didn’t do as he was told, he would become the enemy of the Junwu Empire for a hundred years. One day, Jun Linyuan would arrive at the city and annihilate Northern Yan. Blood would flow like rivers!","“There will be blood everywhere!","“The empire will be our enemy for a hundred years!","“Jun Linyuan made that promise because he wanted to protect Feng Wu. How can you say that Jun Linyuan was only caring about the girl’s feelings? Are you going to lie to me again?!” The king was shaking from head to toe.","God knew how furious he was when he read the threats in the letter!","As a king, he couldn’t wait to take action when he was threatened like this. He wanted to go straight to the Junwu Empire and kill the emperor! The king used to be a hot-blooded young man as well!","However, he saw the battle in the temple.","Seeing Jun Linyuan in his berserk state and how close Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan were to each other, the king knew that the Northern Yan Kingdom was doomed.","Luck wasn’t on Northern Yan’s side.","It was with the Junwu Empire!","Why should he compete with fate? He didn’t have a death wish.","This time, Princess Raoxi was genuinely frightened. She burst into tears. “I didn’t know... I didn’t know that they would find out... I really didn’t know...”","The king waved her off. “Leave.”","Princess Raoxi panicked. “Father, please help me! I’ll make up for it! Even if I can’t marry Jun Linyuan, there’s still Feng Xun. I’m willing to marry Feng","Xun...”","The king took a deep breath. “Marry Feng Xun?”","Princess Raoxi nodded.","The king had to take a deep breath to fight back his rage. “Marry Feng Nun? I don’t know if you’ll survive Jun Linyuan’s rage yet. I don’t you will.”","The king remembered that Feng Wu had said before that she didn’t like Jun Linyuan and that they weren’t a couple. He hoped that was the case. He hoped that God would give Northern Yan a chance.","“Lock Princess Raoxi up!” The king waved his hand. “I’ll deal with her later!”","No matter how hard Princess Raoxi cried, the king didn’t give in this time. He only cared about the kingdom.","With his hands behind his back, Patriarch Huyan walked along the main street.","Patriarch Huyan was usually either in the tower or in seclusion, and only a handful of people from the royal family had ever seen him. Therefore, no one recognized him when he walked on the street with his hands behind his back.","Patriarch Huyan went to the Stingy Shop. The old man almost tripped when he saw the Patriarch. After that, he became even more obsequious and cautious...","Patriarch Huyan was here to vent his sarcasm, not to see someone kneel on the ground. He was soon bored. Waving his hand, he walked away. However, as soon as he left, the old man fell to the ground. Huyan Yichen said, “Grandpa?”","Old Huyan asked, “What was the Patriarch doing here?”","Huyan Yichen was at a loss as well. The Patriarch had never visited this shop","before, so why...","All of a sudden, Huyan Yichen smacked his forehead. “Grandpa, do you remember? I came here to ask you to help Xiao Wu during the battle in the temple. You weren’t there, were you? Is the Patriarch here to blame you?”","Old Huyan asked, “What?”","He was so anxious, but he really wasn’t there. If he had been, he would have helped Feng Wu!","This was bad...","Meanwhile, Patriarch Huyan had no idea how difficult it was for him to find someone to complain to.","All his old friends were either dead or in deep sleep, and only a few of them were still active in the world. It was so difficult to even talk to them.","Before he knew it, he was in the imperial palace.","The king had just locked up Princess Raoxi, and he was going to talk to Feng Wu to see if Raoxi could be spared. If it was up to Jun Linyuan, Raoxi would be dead.","He was still thinking about it when a figure dressed in gray walked into the imperial palace.","The king felt a chill run down his spine and turned his head involuntarily.","“Patriarch!”","The king cried out and blanched.","The Patriarch thought, “Look at how scared he is. How am I supposed to chat to him?”","Now that he was in the mood, he wanted to live like a normal person, but it was so difficult.","“What are you doing here? Please take a seat!”","After all, the king was much more level-headed than the others. When he saw the Patriarch, he only shuddered a little at first but was soon back to normal, albeit a little more respectful than usual.","Patriarch Huyan thought that the king was a reasonable man that he could talk to, so he sat down.","“Serve my best tea.” The king gave the eunuch a glance.","The eunuch knew how to read faces. He nodded and went out to make some tea.","Oh god, it was Patriarch Huyan... The eunuch felt his knees buckle.","Patriarch Huyan paid no attention to any of this. He sat there, looking rather dispirited.","The king was thrilled. That was the Patriarch..","He had been the king for so many years, but he had only seen the Patriarch a handful of times. The Patriarch usually wouldn’t come in person when he had instructions but would only send the message through his mind.","It was always a one-way command.","Therefore, in the king’s mind, the Patriarch was a lofty, unapproachable god. But now, he looked a little like a human being.","Why did he feel like a human now?","This was big news!","The king crouched down next to Patriarch Huyan. He didn’t dare to sit.","Patriarch Huyan gave him a sidelong glance. “Sit.”","The king hesitated. He didn’t think he was qualified to sit.","Patriarch Huyan rolled his eyes at him. If the king wasn’t going to sit down, was he going to raise his head like this the entire time?","Seeing that the Patriarch was displeased, the king sat down without hesitation. However, he only dared to sit at the edge of the chair.","At that moment, he finally knew how the officials felt around him. He was so nervous.","However, the idea of having only one Patriarch as their patron immediately appeased the king.","Patriarch Huyan had no idea that his presence was giving the king so much pressure. Right now, the chief eunuch was bringing him some tea, and he was stirring the tea in the cup.","The king panicked a little...","The Patriarch had shown up out of the blue and was going to have a nice chat with him. Was the Patriarch going to remove him from the throne?","The more he thought about it, the more flustered he became.","He and his senior eunuch exchanged looks and both saw panic in each other’s eyes.","Just then, Patriarch Huyan finally sighed.","The king was dumbfounded.","Speak!","“No, please don’t say anything. I don’t want to know!”","He was still fidgeting when Patriarch Huyan asked, “What do you think of that boy from the Jun family?” The boy from the Jun family?","Who was that?","“Jun Linyuan?” The king stammered. Patriarch Huyan threw a dirty look at him.","How scary!","The king’s stomach lurched as he racked his brain.","Why did the Patriarch suddenly ask about Jun Linyuan? What did he think of Jun Linyuan?","The Patriarch was from the Northern Yan Kingdom, and Jun Linyuan was from the Junwu Empire. The Patriarch might not be happy to have such a genius, because it meant that the Northern Yan Kingdom would have a great threat in the future.","It just so happened that Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu’s relationship was so complicated that there was something strange about it. Moreover, Feng Wu was the Patriarch’s favorite junior sister. So... what should he say to make the Patriarch happy?","Before the king could figure it out, Patriarch Huyan spoke first.","The old man sighed. “That Jun Linyuan isn’t all that nice. He just looks alright, doesn’t he?”","The king was thrilled. The Patriarch didn’t like Jun Linyuan at all. That was great!","The king nodded immediately. “That’s right! He’s not all that good-looking!”","Patriarch Huyan rubbed his chin and said, “I don’t think his cultivation level is very high either.”","Well... About that...","The king said, “That’s right! Her cultivation level is mediocre!”","Patriarch Huyan said, “He’s not a good person either.”","The king said, “That’s right. He has a bad temper and can go berserk.”","So, the Patriarch didn’t like Jun Linyuan. If that was the case, then...","Before the king could finish feeling excited, Patriarch Huyan rolled his eyes at him.","“Are you blind?” The Patriarch stared at the king.","The king was speechless.","Patriarch Huyan said, “You can’t find anyone that looks like Jun Linyuan on this continent!”","The king was shaking from head to toe.","Patriarch Huyan said, “There’s also his cultivation level and his talent. If you find another like him, I’ll let you be the patriarch!”","The king blanched.","He was almost in tears...","He thought, “Patriarch, you said it yourself that Jun Linyuan wasn’t all that good... I was only siding with you. Why did he scold me?”","Patriarch Huyan glared at the king. “Are you not happy with what I said?” The king said hastily, “No, of course not...”","But he couldn’t bring himself to say it. “Patriarch, you set the tone yourself.","Why is it all my fault?”","An idea struck him all of a sudden. He knew what was going on!","Wasn’t this how a father-in-law would treat a son-in-law?!","He was picky about his son-in-law’s faults, but when other people criticized the latter, he wouldn’t have it. However, he wouldn’t stop picking on his son-in-law. Deep down, the Patriarch was just a little jealous.","As expected, Patriarch Huyan spoke again. “That’s right. He can go berserk. What if he injures Xiao Wu next time? Plus, he’s going to be the emperor one day. What if he mistreats the girl? And...”","Seeing the Patriarch ramble on like an ordinary father, the king was amazed. He didn’t know how to react.."]},{"number":3942,"title":"Chapter 3942: Back in Northern Border City","paragraphs":["Chapter 3942: Back in Northern Border City","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Say something!” Patriarch Huyan glared at the king. The king said, “What? Right! Jun Linyuan... looks like a nice guy to me...” Before he could finish, the old man rolled his eyes at him.","“Well... he’s not that great. I think he’s just alright... Maybe there’s someone better...”","Before he could finish, the old master glared at him again.","The old man was so fierce that he looked like he was going to eat the king alive. The problem was that he really was capable of doing that. One slap from him, and the entire Northern Yan would collapse.","“Forget it. You won’t understand.” Patriarch Huyan pursed his lips in distaste.","He rose to his feet, put his hands behind his back, and was ready to leave.","However, he stopped after a few steps and glanced at the king.","The king immediately followed him and smiled obsequiously.","Patriarch Huyan snorted. “You won’t find anyone as good-looking or talented as that brat in the previous or next century!”","The king said, “Yes, of course...”","Patriarch Huyan said, “Don’t be jealous. Your daughter isn’t good enough. Don’t even think about it.”","Judging by his tone, he was pleased.","The king felt he had been hit on the most painful spot.","He was sure that the old master must have heard the conversation between him and Raoxi. Raoxi was doomed.","As expected, Patriarch Huyan smirked. “Assassinate my girl? How bold.”","The king didn’t dare to say a word.","Patriarch Huyan said, “No one will touch that kid!”","What a threat...","Both Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan were ready to go back to the Junwu Empire.","When Feng Wu told Patriarch Huyan, the old man was displeased.","Feng Wu tugged at Patriarch Huyan’s sleeve and tried to talk him out of it, but the old man still looked displeased.","Feng WII said. “With your cultivation level if von miss me. von can go to the","Junwu Empire at any moment. It’s as far away as your backyard.”","Patriarch Huyan realized that was indeed the case.","“If that brat picks on you again, just send me a letter.” Patriarch Huyan said to Feng Wu as he cast a stern look at the person who had taken his junior sister.","Feng Wu said, “Yes, of course. No one would dare to pick on me. As for Jun Linyuan... Oh my, Sixth Senior Brother, you make it sound like he’s mine...”","Patriarch Huyan said, “I wish he wasn’t!”","Feng Wu cleared her throat uneasily.","“Fine, fine. Now, off you go. You’re the only one that worries me.” The old man waved at Feng Wu and was about to go back into the house.","“Sixth Senior Brother.” Feng Wu ran up to him and whispered something in his ear.","Patriarch Huyan’s eyes lit up. “Really?!”","Feng Wu said, “Yes. I was going to write you a copy, but I thought you would like Master’s original copy better, so I put it there for you.”","Patriarch Huyan quickly went back to his room, forgetting all about his junior sister.","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan got into the carriage.","Xuan Yi had transported this carriage all the way here, and it was the one Feng Wu and the others had set out in. It wasn’t as bumpy as other carriages.","Jun Linyuan had yet to recover from his internal injury and needed to recuperate. Hence, this shock-absorbing luxurious carriage was what he needed the most.","Feng Wu had planned to ride a horse and leave Jun Linyuan alone in the carriage.","But Jun Linyuan always had a way to make Feng Wu go into the carriage willingly.","Feng Wu walked in to find Jun Linyuan staring at her curiously. She asked,","“Why are you so curious?”","The crown prince looked down at his book and said proudly, “I’m not.” Feng Wu chuckled.","Jun Linyuan had begun to show curiosity. He looked more and more like a human being than a god.","Leaning against the wall of the carriage, Feng Wu put a cushion behind her back and found the most comfortable position. She then said, “Didn’t I repair the sword for you earlier? That’s why I took my Sixth Senior Brother’s divine iron. But I couldn’t take it for free. I need to give him something in return.","“I remembered a piece of Master’s manual, so I gave it to my Sixth Senior Brother. He missed Master so much that he was almost in tears. This manual was written by Master himself and used to enlighten me. I thought I could give it to my Sixth Senior Brother.”","Jun Linyuan nodded and said proudly, “You don’t have to explain.”","Feng Wu clicked her tongue inwardly.","“Don’t you have to explain? Won’t you keep throwing tantrums?” Feng Wu had found out how petty Jun Linyuan was. He would give her attitude if he didn’t get what he wanted, but he would pretend that he didn’t want to hear it when he was pleased. He was so arrogant! Feng Wu nodded. “I won’t explain to you in the future, then.”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","Angry, he looked down at his book.","Seeing the frown on his face, Feng Wu couldn’t help but laugh. “Jun Linyuan, are you a little child?”","Jun Linyuan only glared at Feng Wu without saying a word.","Feng Wu laughed even louder. “Jun Linyuan, have I ever told you that you’re adorable?”","Adorable? The crown prince, who had always wanted to be a father figure, glanced at Feng Wu, and his earlobes turned pink.","However, he made some mental notes. First of all, Mu Jiuzhou wasn’t dead. Secondly, Mu Jiuzhou was still active ten years ago. Thirdly, Mu Jiuzhou was very important to Feng Wu.","At the thought of the third point, he looked a little displeased again.","The carriage moved faster than they had expected. It took them half a month to reach the border of the Junwu Empire.","Northern Border City.","Northern Border City was in the north-northwest of the Junwu Empire. From there, the Dongsang Kingdom was 400km away.","Feng Xun’s teasing voice rang out as soon as they set foot in Northern Border City. “Little Feng Wu, how about we take a trip to the Dark Forest?” Dark Forest contained a lot of their memories.","Back then, Feng Wu had tricked Feng Xun and Jun Linyuan and stolen the Immortal Spiritual Fruit by playing the ugly girl in the Dark Forest... Feng Xun still couldn’t get over it.","That was the first time Feng Wu had met them, and it was quite an impression.","Feng Wu chuckled. “A single eagle was enough to give us a hard time. Jun","Linyuan even had a duel with it. By the way, what level was that eagle?”","Feng Xun said, ‘A Spiritual Overlord?”","Feng Wu was surprised. “Jun Linyuan was a Spiritual Overlord two years ago, and he’s a peak Spiritual Saint now? That’s incredible!”","Feng Xun glanced at Feng Wu. “Why are you surprised? You were only a junior Spiritual Overlord when we set out from the imperial capital, but you’re already a peak Spiritual Overlord now. Aren’t you incredible?”","Xuan Yi held his sword between his crossed arms and sighed inwardly.","He had been cultivating in seclusion recently and had made some amazing progress. He had thought... Comparing himself with these people was so cruel.","“Shall we stay here tonight?” Feng Xun suggested. “We’ve been traveling for three days in a row. If I don’t sleep in a solid bed now, I won’t be able to hold on much longer.”","It had been over a year since Feng Wu left Northern Border City, and she was ready to walk around. Her eyes lit up when she heard that suggestion. However, Jun Linyuan was the one calling the shots here, and he had the final say.","Feng Wu turned to look at Jun Linyuan, but he was reclining on a soft chair and seemed to be absorbed in his book.","“Jun Linyuan?” Feng Wu looked eagerly at him.","Jun Linyuan didn’t even look at her.","“Brother Jun?” Feng Wu gave him a pleading look.","“Ahem!”","Feng Xun almost burst into laughter when he heard the conversation from outside. Little Feng Wu was behaving like a kitten that had its paws tucked away.","Feng Wu wanted to smack Feng Xun for ruining the mood.","Jun Linyuan darted a haughty look at Feng Wu. “Do you really want to stay the night?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes!”","Feng Wu had thought that Jun Linyuan would say yes, but he only glanced at her and shook his head.","Shaking his head? That wouldn’t do!","Pursing her lips, Feng Wu looked as pitiful as a puppy and wouldn’t look at anyone.","All of a sudden, a hand tugged at her braid.","“Ssss—” Feng Wu winced at the pain and looked up. However, Jun Linyuan spoke first.","“Off the carriage.” That was all he said. The girl’s eyes lit up. “You said so yourself!” As a matter of fact, Feng Wu knew that Jun Linyuan had been giving the order to hurry back to the Junwu Empire. He had to have a reason.","Seeing Jun Linyuan nod in resignation, Feng Wu rushed out and shouted, “Feng","Xun, go to my old manor and stay there tonight!”","Uncle Lan was the only one guarding the old manor of the Feng clan in Northern Border City. The others had all gone back to the imperial capital with Feng Wu.","Uncle Lan was so surprised to see Feng Wu.","“Uncle Lan, don’t you recognize me?” Feng Wu jumped out of the carriage with a smile and nodded at Uncle Lan.","“Miss Wu! Miss Wu is back!” Uncle Lan’s voice trembled with excitement. “I recognize you! It’s Miss Wu!”","Feng Wu was about to run back to her old house when she heard someone coughing in the carriage.","Gosh! She had almost forgotten about Jun Linyuan...","Feng Wu ran back in a hurry, pressed the button, and a clean pedal extended out of the carriage.","Uncle Lan then saw Miss Wu get into the carriage. Soon, she led a man out.","She carefully helped a teenager out of the carriage and quietly led him into the courtyard.","Wasn’t it improper for men and women to touch each other?","Moreover, why did Miss Wu look like a maid? Uncle Lan was perplexed.","“Wait, isn’t it...’","Uncle Lan cried out in surprise.","That was right. His Royal Highness and Young Lord Feng visited the Feng manor over a year ago, and Uncle Lan was the one guarding the door. That was why he remembered it clearly.","Uncle Lan was a little confused. He remembered that Miss Wu didn’t know the crown prince well back then, but now, she seemed to be very close to him.","Was the Feng clan getting lucky? Uncle Lan was thrilled!","Feng Wu helped Jun Linyuan to his feet and asked, “Are you going to be alright?","Will it affect your injury? Do you need Feng Xun to carry you?” Feng Wu was genuinely worried, for Jun Linyuan’s internal injury was too severe. Anyone else would have been dead by now.","“That’s right, Boss Jun. How about I carry you on my back?” Feng Xun said hastily.","However, Boss Jun only gave him a stern look. His handsome face darkened, and his eyes glinted.","Feng Xun cringed... What did he do? He was only concerned about Boss Jun.","Xuan Yi rolled his eyes at him.","Even Xuan Yi was like that...","Just then, they heard a voice.","“Hey!","“How dare a mere Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle show up in front of me? Get down!”","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle? What a familiar name!","Feng Wu and the others looked up to find a giant eagle soaring in the sky.","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle spread out its wings, casting a shadow over the ground.","The person chasing the eagle turned out to be a familiar face as well.","“Yu Mingye? It’s him?” Feng Xun was amazed. “What a coincidence!”","Feng Wu watched in amazement as Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle flew across the sky with Yu Mingye hot on its heels.","Feng Xun reminded her.","“Xiao Wu, that eagle! That Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle! Don’t you remember? It flew up with you in its beak!” Feng Xun tugged at Feng Wu in excitement.","Feng Wu’s face darkened. Why did he bring up such an embarrassing thing?","Feng Xun didn’t know how to read faces. Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t talk to him, he raised a hand in Yu Mingye’s direction. “Hey, Yu Mingye, can you do it? You can’t even take down a lousy eagle?”","Yu Mingye and Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle were flying around in the sky above Northern Border City, making everyone tremble in fear.","Many people heard what Feng Xun said.","So did Yu Mingye and Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle.","They both looked in Feng Xun’s direction.","No one knew what Yu Mingye saw, but Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle spotted Feng Wu right away!","Oh god! It was her!","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle recalled what happened over a year ago when it held the girl in its beak, but the girl got away!","Later, it hid in a corner and realized that the girl was very familiar with the teenager chasing after it. Moreover, the teenager was fawning on the girl!","Hostage!","The eagle had to take Feng Wu hostage!","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle grinned in satisfaction. The next second, it was already charging at Feng Wu.","wait!","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle saw a person standing next to Feng Wu. It was... Holy crap. It was none other than the powerful teenager with the black sword!","The eagle was so frightened that it almost turned around and ran, but it soon realized that the teenager with the black sword wasn’t on the same team as the unlucky girl. Back then, when it had threatened the unlucky girl, he didn’t care at all and had even told it to kill her.","So, he wouldn’t do anything about it, would he?","Seeing that the eagle was about to reach Feng Wu, Yu Mingye shouted anxiously, “Xiao Wu, dodge!”","However, to Yu Mingye’s surprise, Feng Wu’s eyes twinkled as she stared at the eagle!","It was never too late to take revenge!","Out of everyone, the eagle just had to pick her.","“Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle, what am I supposed to do to you?”"]},{"number":3943,"title":"Chapter 3943: Love Rival (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3943: Love Rival (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle swooped down at Feng Wu, thinking that the girl was an easy target. However, before it could reach Feng Wu...","The eagle felt its vision blur, and it met Jun Linyuan’s brooding eyes...","Before the eagle could react, Feng Wu had leapt into the air!","Thump!","Feng Wu jumped down and stepped on the eagle’s back!","Dust rose from the ground, and when it dissipated, everyone saw Feng Wu standing on one foot and stepping on the eagle’s head with the other!","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle stuck its face to the ground and looked at the girl in bewilderment...","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle couldn’t believe that something like this could happen.","“Why not?” Feng Wu smiled at it.","“Aren’t you a good-for-nothing? A good-for-nothing with no spiritual essence at all?” Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle said in frustration. “But with your current capability...”","One stance.","It couldn’t believe that Feng Wu could subdue it with a single leap.","Feng Wu smiled. “It was true that I was useless a year ago, and it’s true that I’m stepping on you now.”","She drew back her foot after that.","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle took the opportunity to rise to its feet, but it didn’t dare to leave, for the girl that could crush it with one stomp was smiling at it with a dangerous look on her face.","“What on earth did you eat? Why are you so capable all of a sudden?!” Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle wouldn’t believe that a person could become so capable out of nowhere.","She grinned at it, but before she could say anything, the teenager behind the eagle charged at her like a cannonball!","“Xiao Wu! Xiao Wu!”","The teenager beamed at her, revealing his white teeth. It was such a pleasant sight.","Feng Wu noticed Yu Mingye as well. She had to admit that Yu Mingye was so energetic. He looked as warm as the sun.","Feng Wu realized that Yu Mingye had helped her several times, but she seemed to have tricked him every single time... However, Yu Mingye was so excited to see her every single time... And if she hadn’t run into him this time, Feng Wu would have forgotten who he was.","At that thought, Feng Wu felt a little guilty, so she was very nice to Yu Mingye.","“So, you’re here as well.” Feng Wu smiled at him.","“That’s right.” Jun Linyuan was optimistic, lively, and innocent. He let all his emotions show on his face. He was excited to see Feng Wu, and his cheeks flushed a little. He then beamed at Feng Wu. “How can there be such a coincidence? I dreamed of you yesterday, which was why I came to Northern","Border City. I didn’t expect to run into you here. Do you think we’re telepathic?","Hahahaha!”","A certain someone stood a short distance away, and his face had darkened.","But Feng Wu didn’t realize that. She saw a feather on Yu Mingye’s hair, and she wanted to remove it for him. To her, Yu Mingye was like a younger brother.","What she didn’t know was that...","Thump!","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle, who had been curiously watching them, felt a great force coming at it, and it flew backward instantly!","Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle smashed into the ground with a thump, and its face was scrunched up in pain.","What was going on?","It was just curious.. Who hit it?"]},{"number":3944,"title":"Chapter 3944: Love Rival (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3944: Love Rival (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle’s voice startled Feng Wu.","Feng Wu gave Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle a strange look...","Just then, Feng Xun cried out, “Boss Jun, Boss Jun, are you alright?!”","Feng Xun rushed over and steadied Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan?","Yu Mingye then turned to look at Jun Linyuan. He had been staring at Feng Wu and hadn’t noticed that Jun Linyuan was here as well!","Yu Mingye had been on guard since he set his eyes on Jun Linyuan. His face was taut, and he stared at Jun Linyuan nervously with his sword in his right hand.","He looked like he was going to draw out his sword at the slightest disagreement.","Meanwhile...","Feng Wu ran toward Jun Linyuan as soon as Feng Xun shouted.","She saw that Jun Linyuan had thrown off Feng Xun’s hand and stumbled.","Feng Wu immediately took Jun Linyuan’s other hand and asked nervously, “What’s wrong? Are you in pain again? Where’s the wound this time? On your stomach, shoulder, or heart? Haven’t I told you already? Don’t move around!","Why don’t you care about yourself?”","Feng Wu ran her fingers through all the wounds she had just mentioned.","She let out a breath of relief and said, “Luckily, it’s not too serious. I was so scared.”","While Feng Wu was examining Jun Linyuan, the crown prince gave Yu Mingye a provoking look, which infuriated the latter.","Injured?","How could someone like Jun Linyuan be injured and look like he couldn’t stand still? Even if he was severely injured, he had to pretend that nothing had happened!","Hence, Yu Mingye had every reason to believe that Jun Linyuan had done it on purpose!","Then, Yu Mingye saw the half-smile on Jun Linyuan’s face.","SJun Linyuan looked so pleased! Yu Mingye was furious.","He rushed over, grabbed Feng Wu, and said anxiously, “Xiao Wu, don’t let him fool you! He did it on purpose!”","Feng Wu threw a dirty look at Yu Mingye. “That’s bullshit. He really is injured.” Yu Mingye stared at Feng Wu in disbelief!","Hadn’t Xiao Wu always been on his side and boycotted Jun Linyuan with him? How could she...","Seeing the aggrieved look on Yu Mingye’s face, Feng Wu softened her tone. “He really was injured and almost couldn’t make it. Please don’t upset him.”","Then, Yu Mingye saw Jun Linyuan leaning on Feng Wu with a badly injured look on his face.","What a poser!","Yu Mingye pointed at Jun Linyuan and was rendered speechless!","How shameless!","Yu Mingye thought, “Jun Linyuan is so shameless. How could he mock me while pretending to be weak in front of little Feng Wu?”","Feng Wu didn’t see through Jun Linyuan’s act. Not only was she supporting Jun Linyuan, but she was also asking after his well-being. “Can you still walk? Lean on me. Don’t worry. I can hold you up... Let’s go inside first. I need to examine you from head to toe...”","“...Yes,” Jun Linyuan said reluctantly.","After that, Yu Mingye watched as the two of them walked into the house together. They looked so intimate that they couldn’t be separated from each other.","Yu Mingye looked like he had been struck by lightning. He stood there in a trance-like state and forgot how to react.."]},{"number":3945,"title":"Chapter 3945: Love Rival (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3945: Love Rival (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan, on the other hand, looked over his shoulder and gave Yu Mingye a half-smile.","Was it mockery?","Provocation?","Content?","Show off?","Yu Mingye felt that it was all of above.","The more he thought about it, the angrier he became.","Feng Xun patted Yu Mingye on the shoulder.","Infuriated, Yu Mingye threw off Feng Xun’s hand.","“Hey, Yu Mingye, what are you angry about? What’s there to be angry about?","They’re a couple. That’s all.”","Why did it sound like Feng Xun was so pleased?","Yu Mingye threw a dirty look at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun shrugged innocently.","Infuriated, Yu Mingye pointed at the house in front of them. “Jun Linyuan, I’m not going to lose! Just wait and see!”","After that, Yu Mingye stormed off.","Feng Wu opened the window when she heard the noise, but all she could see was Yu Mingye running away...","Turning around, she saw Jun Linyuan resting his head on his hands and smiling like a pleased cat.","Feng Wu frowned a little and stared at Jun Linyuan. “Xiao Ye ran away because you pissed him off.”","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu. “YCall him Yu Mingye.”","Feng Wu said, “Xiao Ye.”","Jun Linyuan said, “No!”","Feng Wu snorted. “Jun Linyuan, don’t pick on him. He’s just a kid, not like you.” The crown prince was obviously displeased. “How so?”","Feng Wu sat down in front of Jun Linyuan and looked into his eyes. “He’s innocent, kind, and naive...","The crown prince frowned, and the temperature in the room dropped.","Feng Wu didn’t seem to notice it at all. She went on. “Look, every time he tried to challenge you to a duel, you would pick on him all the time, and he only got braver after every setback... I feel sorry for him.”","Jun Linyuan looked a little happier.","Feng Wu went on. “You’ve been picking on him all the time until he was almost in tears. He then ran off in a fit of rage... I can’t bring myself to see it.” The crown prince’s face darkened again.","Feng Wu went on. “I look at him as if he’s Xiaoqi, my younger brother. I just hope that he’ll live a better life...”","A younger brother? Jun Linyuan relaxed a little.","“I don’t know where he went this time. It’s not easy to meet him...” Feng Wu said in a sorry tone. “I need to talk to him. He’s very grumpy, and he’s gone as fast as he came. So, I think he’ll come back tonight. Please don’t pick on him again.”","Jun Linyuan snorted, but no one knew if he had agreed.","Feng Wu looked at him.","Jun Linyuan looked back at her.","Feng Wu rose to her feet, poured a cup of tea, and handed it to Jun Linyuan.","From outside, one could see her silhouette on the window paper.","However, Jun Linyuan didn’t take the cup. Instead, he turned his pleading gaze on Feng Wu again. The look in his eyes...","Feng Wu understood.","He was asking her to feed him.","However...","“Don’t you have hands?” Feng Wu glared at him.","Everything was fine before. Why did she have to feed him all of a sudden?","What Feng Wu didn’t know was that a little head was leaning against her wall.","Lying on his stomach on the wall in the dark, Yu Mingye watched everything that was going on...","He saw Feng Wu pouring Jun Linyuan some tea and feeding it to him.."]},{"number":3946,"title":"Chapter 3946: Love Rival (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3946: Love Rival (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Ahhh...","Yu Mingye was so angry that he almost fell off the wall.","“Little Feng Wu, you little fool! Are you blind? Can’t you tell that Jun Linyuan is faking it? He’s faking it! Why are you still serving him?!”","Then, he saw Feng Wu...","She...","What was she doing?","She was touching Jun Linyuan’s foot? And she was moving her way up his leg?","“You’re a girl! Don’t you know that it’s improper for men and women to touch each other? Ahhh!”","Yu Mingye was furious, but he wouldn’t leave. Instead, he kept his unblinking gaze on the window.","Closer... closer... They were so close, and they were hugging each other...","Inside, Feng Wu said grumpily to Jun Linyuan, “I started massaging from your feet and worked my way up to the top of your head. Do you feel better now that you’ve completed a whole cycle?”","Even Feng Wu herself had forgotten about her massage skills, but Jun Linyuan still remembered. He told her about the massage she gave him in the crown prince’s residence and insisted on doing it now.","Feng Wu couldn’t believe it.","“Hey, Jun Linyuan, don’t push it. Although I promised to look after you, I didn’t promise to do what a maid would do. That’s enough.”","The crown prince gave Feng Wu an aggrieved look, turned around, and faced the wall.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. Fine, she had to appease him now.","Feng Wu had no choice but to go up to Jun Linyuan and sit down on the bed. She then turned to Jun Linyuan and said in a gentle voice, “I’m not saying that I won’t take care of you. What I’m saying is that you shouldn’t order me around all the time when I’m busy.”","“What are you busy with?” Jun Linyuan asked quietly.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “It wasn’t easy for me to run into Yu Mingye, and I was only going to make some Semi-divine pills for him. After all the help he gave me, I couldn’t...","“Hey, Jun Linyuan, why are you angry again? I’m the one who’s going to give Yu Mingye some Semi-divine pills. Why do you mind it?","“Alright, alright. I’ll give you a massage. I’ll do it from the bottom of your feet all the way to the top of your head. Don’t be mad.","“You’re so stingy..","All Yu Mingye could see was the image, but he couldn’t hear anything, for Jun Linyuan had blocked all sound.","Right at that moment...","“Hello.” Someone patted Yu Mingye on the shoulder.","Turning around in frustration, Yu Mingye saw that it was Feng Xun, so he looked away again.","Since Feng Xun was Jun Linyuan’s friend, Yu Mingye decided that Feng Xun was his enemy.","Hmph! Yu Mingye threw a dirty look at Feng Xun and looked away.","“Hey, Yu Mingye, why are you so angry? I don’t understand. You’re so grumpy.” Feng Xun had always been a very friendly person.","“Hey, don’t tell me that you’re jealous because you’re in love with little Feng Wu... Wow, are you jealous of Boss Jun?” Feng Xun looked amazed.","Yu Mingye could admit anything, but he would never admit that he had lost to Jun Linyuan. Hence, he denied it outright!","“W- What are you talking about? I’m not! I just...” Yu Mingye pointed at the silhouette on the window paper and said angrily, “Look, look. It’s so... It’s the middle of the night! It’s against public morals!”","Feng Xun grinned at Yu Mingye. “Are you really not jealous of Boss Jun?” Crossing his arms, Yu Mingye snorted.. “He’s the last person I’ll be jealous of!”"]},{"number":3947,"title":"Chapter 3947: Confession of Love (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3947: Confession of Love (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Crossing his arms, Yu Mingye snorted. “He’s the last person I’ll be jealous of!”","Feng Xun darted a look at Yu Mingye. “Really?”","Yu Mingye glared at him. “You don’t believe me? I’ve always been telling the truth!”","Rubbing his chin, Feng Xun pondered for a moment, then asked, “That is to say, you don’t like little Feng Wu, right? You won’t be jealous if you don’t like her, right?”","Holding his sword between his crossed arms, Xuan Yi darted a look at Feng Xun before looking away. He wondered if it was a good idea to pick on Yu Mingye like this.","Yu Mingye was the most easy to provoke, especially when Jun Linyuan was involved.","“Like her? Heh, there’s no way I’m going to like her! With her unreasonable temperament, tsk!” Crossing his arms, Yu Mingye looked as proud as a peacock.","However...","Feng Wu heard him.","Feng Wu couldn’t hear him before, but she heard him now. Somehow...","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu and looked pleased.","Hearing Yu Mingye’s voice, Feng Wu rushed over to open the window. She needed to talk to Yu Mingye.","However, she only managed to say, “Yu Mingye, you...”","Right after that, she heard the sound of something falling on the ground.","“Ouch!” Yu Mingye fell to the ground with a thump. Holding his head, he cried out.","Feng Wu jumped out of the window and landed on the wall.","“Yu Mingye, you...”","As soon as Feng Wu started, Yu Mingye looked up and met Feng Wu’s gaze. The next second, his face went scarlet red, and he dashed off like a rabbit!","With a whoosh, he was out of sight!","Feng Wu was furious. “Why are you running away? I need to talk to you...”","She wanted to tell Yu Mingye to stay put and give him time to refine the pill before giving it to him as a gift. Feng Wu didn’t have anything else to give him, but she had pills.","But...","Yu Mingye was out of sight before Feng Wu could finish.","“Why is he running?” Feng Wu said grumpily. “I’m not going to eat him. It’s just...”","Feng Xun chuckled and told Feng Wu, “Xiao Wu, don’t worry. I’ll go talk to him.”","Feng Wu said, “Tell him to stay in Northern Border City for at least two more days. I’ll give him some pills tomorrow.” Feng Xun felt a chill run down his spine...","His eyes met Boss Jun’s...","Feng Xun said, “Well... I guess it’ll depend on if I can catch up with him. You know, Yu Mingye can run very fast.”","After that, Feng Xun dragged Xuan Yi away.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She went back to her room and sighed at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan glanced at her. “Why are you sighing?”","Feng Wu fretted. “Why do I get the feeling that Yu Mingye is behaving","strangely? Is he out of his mind?”","Jun Linyuan chuckled inwardly.","He had thought that Xiao Wu was unromantic only toward him, but as it turned out, she really didn’t know anything about it. Yu Mingye had made it so obvious, but she still couldn’t tell.","“Jun Linyuan, are you smiling?” Feng Wu stared at the handsome teenager.","“Why are you smiling?”","Would His Royal Highness be the type to help a rival in love?","He cleared his throat and said, “I think you’re right.”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you mean?”","Jun Linyuan said in a serious tone, “Didn’t you say that he was innocent, kind, and naive?”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Jun Linyuan said, “So, don’t you already know?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","After thinking for a while, Feng Wu finally understood what Jun Linyuan meant.","“How dare you call him stupid?” Feng Wu smacked Jun Linyuan on the shoulder.","“Ouch!” Jun Linyuan put a hand on his belly and looked like he was in pain. Feng Wu immediately put down her hand. “Are you alright?”","Jun Linyuan snorted. “It’s been a while since he’s been an idiot, and now, he also has poor eyesight. You haven’t spoken to him yet.”","Feng Wu asked, ‘What’s wrong with his eyes?”","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu and blushed a little. He then turned away and looked out of the window.","“Didn’t he say that he didn’t like you? What do you think of his eyes?”","“Holy crap! It’s true!”","Feng Wu was convinced by Jun Linyuan right away. “I was going to make a batch of pills for this Yu Mingye all by myself, but he called me short-tempered. I won’t disappoint him! Forget it. I’ll just ignore him.”","Jun Linyuan rubbed her head and almost couldn’t control the smile on his face, but he still put on a straight face. “He doesn’t like you. Actually... actually...” Jun Linyuan blushed a little... He had never been so...","It just so happened that he had met a very straightforward teenage girl!","The girl was still indulging in the bad things Yu Mingye said about her. Scratching her head, she said, “Forget it. I’m going to bed!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu covered Jun Linyuan with a duvet as she spoke. “Look at you. You’re in so much pain every time you move, which means that your internal injury is still very severe. It’ll take you a very long time to recover. So, be a good boy and go to bed now. Don’t say another word.”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu in silence.","Feng Wu was confused. “Why are you looking at me? Is there something on my face?”","Jun Linyuan said angrily, “I’m going to bed!”","He pulled the duvet over, turned around, and glared at the wall.","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment. Scratching her head, she mumbled, “...Are you angry again? I can’t believe it...”","Feng Wu was utterly confused.","She felt so innocent...","Hearing Feng Wu’s nagging, Jun Linyuan was even angrier. He clenched his fists and thought, “Little Feng Wu, you’re such a goofball! Goofball!”","Feng Wu didn’t return to her room. She only made a bed on the floor.","Jun Linyuan stole a glance at Feng Wu and saw her jump into the duvet. She immediatelv curled uD into a ball...","Jun Linyuan didn’t know what to say. It was inappropriate, but why was she so adorable?","Deep down, Jun Linyuan decided to forgive Feng Wu.","Moreover, he was going to stay on the subject.","That was because...","It was such a rare opportunity.","Yu Mingye’s appearance had provoked him, and he had made up his mind to claim his sovereignty openly. Moreover... little Feng Wu probably... liked him as well... right?","Hence, Jun Linyuan tossed and turned in bed and racked his brain..."]},{"number":3948,"title":"Chapter 3948: Confession of Love (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3948: Confession of Love (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan racked his brain. Finally, he summoned up his courage and went on.","He had to say it sooner or later.","“Little Feng Wu, actually...”","Summoning up the courage of his life, Jun Linyuan clenched his fists, stared at the ceiling, and was about to speak when...","Phew...","A long, even breathing sound came from two meters away, and it was accompanied by a little snore.","The crown prince who was capable enough to talk to a top cultivator of the continent... the one who could shake the continent with a stomp of his foot...","He looked like he had been struck by lightning!","He turned to the side and stared at the girl who had rolled up in her duvet.","Moonlight poured in through the window, lighting up the room.","Only her smooth forehead could be seen...","From Jun Linyuan’s angle, he could see most of the girl’s face. Right now, she was fast asleep, her cheeks flushed, and she was snoring happily.","Jun Linyuan was so frustrated..","Jun Linyuan’s usually taut face cracked a little. He took a deep breath... then another. Only then was he able to suppress his emotions.","Rising to his feet, he went up to Feng Wu and crouched down in front of her.","Even with the heavy shadow over her face, the girl could still sleep soundly. Jun Linyuan was so...","What could he do?","All her frustration turned into a long sigh.","Her eyes were closed, and her eyelashes were like butterfly wings. Her eyes would be so clear and bright when she opened them.","She looked like an innocent baby when she was asleep. Her skin was so smooth that he wanted to take a bite.","“You...”","In the end, his frustration turned into indulgence.","He picked up his girl, and slowly put her down on the bed.","The teenager lay on his stomach by the bed and looked curiously at the girl with his limpid, brooding eyes.","He would poke her little head one moment and move her hands the next... His eyes were filled with affection, and he couldn’t put his hands off her.","“Hm...’","He was still touching her hand when she smacked him. She wrapped the duvet around her again and turned away. She mumbled, “Jun Linyuan is so stingy.","He’s mad at me. He’s...”","In the end, she gave him all kinds of nicknames... She smacked her lips as she spoke.","Jun Linyuan’s mouth fell open.","In the end, he rubbed her head with a wry smile. She was so lovely.","Just then, he heard a faint noise outside.","It was a secret signal Feng Xun had made with Boss Jun when they were little.","Fearing that he might wake the girl up, Jun Linyuan quickly left the room and jumped over the wall.","As expected, Feng Xun was crouching outside the wall with his head stuck out.","“Boss Jun, you’re finally out.","“I made that brat Yu Mingye drunk. He really likes Xiao Wu. After he got drunk, he wouldn’t stop talking about Xiao Wu, saying that he wanted to marry her.","“And he said that he would marry her and make her the queen of the Dark Court.","“Tsk, tsk, that’s really something he would do...”","Feng Xun saw the smile on Boss Jun’s face when he came out, but the latter’s eyes had turned cold.","“Where is he?”","Those three cold words.","Feng Xun immediately said, “Yunlai Inn, but he’s guarded by three elders. They’re all Spiritual Saints.”","Yu Mingye’s father was genuinely kind to him. With three Spiritual Saint elders around him, he could do whatever on this continent, but he just happened to have a natural enemy.","Seeing that Boss Jun was heading for Yunlai Inn, Feng Xun followed him in a hurry.","He said in a hurry, “Boss Jun, Boss Jun, a gentleman doesn’t resort to violence. Calm down.”","It was mainly because Boss Jun was already injured. If he hadn’t been injured, those ordinary Spiritual Saints wouldn’t have been about to touch him in Northern Yan.","Boss Jun gave him a cold look.","Before Feng Xun could say another word, Jun Linyuan had disappeared.","“Well, well...” Feng Xun scratched his head. “He’s so aggressive... Are they going to start a fight? Why do I feel so uneasy?”","He looked up at Xuan Yi as he spoke.","Holding his sword between his crossed arms, Xuan Yi had the poker face of a real swordsman.","“Xuan Yi, I didn’t do anything wrong, did I?” Feng Xun asked diffidently. Xuan Yi patted Feng Xun on the head, sighed, shook his head, and walked away.","“What? Hey! Say something. I didn’t do anything wrong, did I? I... I just told Boss Jun what really happened to Yu Mingye. He wanted to marry Xiao Wu and make her a queen... That’ll be so scary! What if Xiao Wu agrees because it’s worth it? Don’t you think so?”","Xuan Yi rolled his eyes at Feng Xun.","“Why are you looking at me like that? Do you think I’m an idiot?” Feng Xun asked gingerly.","Xuan Yi took a deep breath. “Who do you think is more capable in this world? The most capable man or the ruler of a kingdom?”","Feng Xun said, “If that’s the case, of course it has to be the most capable cultivator. The capable cultivator can destroy a kingdom but not the other way around.”","Xuan Yi said, “There you go.”","Feng Xun said, “That’s right... Why couldn’t I think straight?”","As a matter of fact, Feng Xun was a little anxious when Yu Mingye told him about his plan to marry Feng Wu.","On one hand, Boss Jun was scolding Feng Wu with a straight face, and on the other hand, Yu Mingye was busy preparing for his marriage and running around Feng Wu like a puppy dog. Needless to say, he panicked.","Therefore, when Yu Mingye staggered toward Feng Wu after getting drunk, Feng Xun smacked him on the head, knocking him out on the table...","Luckily, the three elders were all cultivating in their rooms and didn’t see what was going on.","By then, Jun Linyuan had arrived at Yunlai Inn.","He was the most capable cultivator in the empire, and he couldn’t do anything when his girl was around. However, he wouldn’t be polite when she wasn’t around.","Yu Mingye was still swaying when he woke up to find Jun...","“J- Jun Linyuan?!”","Yu Mingye smelled of alcohol. As soon as he saw Jun Linyuan, he forgot all about it and looked like a cat with its hair standing on end.. He was on the alert!"]},{"number":3949,"title":"Chapter 3949: Conversation between Love Rivals (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3949: Conversation between Love Rivals (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The crown prince sat down in front of him and kept his gaze on him.","Yu Mingye had been reeking alcohol, but he woke up as soon as he saw Jun Linyuan!","“You!” Yu Mingye stumbled back involuntarily and bumped into the table behind him. Cups, plates, and bowls fell to the floor.","Yu Mingye slipped and fell to his knees.","And he was kneeling in Jun Linyuan’s direction.","The three Spiritual Saints didn’t come out when they heard the noise, but they all looked in that direction.","Spiritual Saints had their dignity, and they wouldn’t rush into a fight for no reason.","Jun Linyuan didn’t see that coming either and wanted to smack his forehead.","Him?","His rival in love?","Fearing that Jun Linyuan would say something humiliating, Yu Mingye jumped to his feet and glared at Jun Linyuan. “W- What do you want?!”","The crown prince was only a three-year-old in front of Feng Wu, but to everyone else, he was the fiend!","Hence, Yu Mingye’s stomach lurched when he saw the look in Feng Xun’s eyes. “Yu Mingye?” Jun Linyuan fetched an unused teacup and slowly poured himself some tea. He then rested his left hand on the table and spoke in an unhurried tone.","“Yes, that’s me! So what?!” Yu Mingye was flustered, but he was also secretly elated. Finally, Jun Linyuan knew his name!","Over a year ago, Jun Linyuan hadn’t even heard of his name. That was progress! Yu Mingye gloated inwardly.","“Huh?” Jun Linyuan frowned a little.","“You and Xiao Wu...” Yu Mingye cut him off before he could finish.","Yu Mingye then recalled that he had three Spiritual Saint elders behind him. Three! He wasn’t afraid at all!","He sat down in a chair and stared at Jun Linyuan. “Your Xiao Wu? Why is she yours? Have you asked for her opinion? Did she agree?”","Jun Linyuan gave him a taunting smile.","Yu Mingye was furious, for the look Jun Linyuan gave him made him feel like a retard. However, he suddenly remembered something.","The silhouette he saw on the window paper...","Yu Mingye finally knew why Jun Linyuan was so confident!","“You!” Yu Mingye almost jumped to his feet. “Jun Linyuan, you’re doing this to little Feng Wu... Are you even human?!","Jun Linyuan knew what Yu Mingye was thinking, but he wouldn’t clarify it. He only darted an unhurried glance at Yu Mingye and smiled a little.","“Holy crap! Jun Linyuan, you’re shameless!” Yu Mingye smacked the table in frustration.","Not only didn’t the crown prince retort, but there was satisfaction in his eyes as well. Yu Mingye was furious.","“Shameless! Shameless! Shameless! Ahhh!” Yu Mingye walked around the table in circles like a grumpy kid!","Jun Linyuan leaned back in his chair and sipped his tea.","“You!”","In the end, Yu Mingye ran up to Jun Linyuan and glared at him through gritted teeth. “Jun Linyuan, tell me. Have you... ”","Jun Linyuan raised his brows a little. “Huh? Oh, you mean that...”","“Are you really...”","Jun Linyuan said, “We were engaged when we were little. What’s wrong with that?”","Yu Mingye’s head was spinning. Taking a deep breath, he thought his lungs were going to explode.","He wanted to hit Jun Linyuan, but he wasn’t his match.","Jun Linyuan hit the nail on the head. “You can’t even defeat that girl. How can you be in love with her?”","Yu Mingye was going to retort, but all he could think of was how Feng Wu had taken care of Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle. It was so easy...","Yu Mingye had been chasing Giant Flaming Cloud Eagle but couldn’t catch up with it. Feng Wu, on the other hand, had defeated it with a single strike. It was obvious who was more powerful..","“I... I...” Yu Mingye blushed. “I have three Spiritual Saints with me. She’ll be very safe!”","Jun Linyuan looked into his eyes and gave him a half-smile. “What about your own capability?”","Talk about a sore spot! Yu Mingye was furious!","“I... I’m going to be very strong. Jun Linyuan, just wait and see!” Yu Mingye couldn’t stay here anymore. He felt so humiliated.","He couldn’t understand this world anymore.","He really was a very talented cultivator. He had worked very hard and had a lot of cultivation resources. He had done everything he could!","Feng Wu was only slightly better than him when they were in the imperial capital.","She was only slightly stronger, but now...","“What level?” Yu Mingye asked angrily as he marched through the streets.","Three Spiritual Saint elders stood a few steps behind him. The head of the elders said, “Advanced Spiritual Saint.”","“I meant Feng Wu. What level is little Feng Wu now?” Yu Mingye stopped, turned around, and stared at his elder. The head of the elders looked troubled.","Yu Mingye’s face darkened.","“Exactly what level is she?!” He was frustrated.","“A Spiritual Overlord...” The head of the elders looked at Yu Mingye, who let out a breath of relief.","However, the head of the elders added, “A peak one.”","“What?” Yu Mingye was so shocked that he thought he was hearing things.","The head of the elders glanced at Yu Mingye and sighed inwardly... Yu Mingye saw light right away.","“A peak Spiritual Overlord? Feng Wu is a peak Spiritual Overlord now? Are you kidding me?!” Yu Mingye almost jumped to his feet and stared at the head of the elders.","The head of the elders gave him a sympathetic look.","Yu Mingye’s stomach lurched. He turned around and looked at the two elders in silence.","Elder Two and Elder Three nodded.","For a moment, the atmosphere felt strangely quiet.","“A peak Spiritual Overlord? She’s a peak Spiritual Overlord already? Back in","Emperor Wu’s capital, she was only a junior Spiritual Overlord. She really was.” Fearing that the three elders wouldn’t believe him, Yu Mingye stressed repeatedly.","All three elders nodded.","As a matter of fact, the three elders had made some progress in the past three months as well, but Yu Mingye didn’t seem to have much luck and didn’t make much progress.","“I... I’m four levels...” Yu Mingye swallowed with much difficulty. “She has left me so far behind, hasn’t she?”","The three elders nodded.","Yu Mingye closed his eyes for an indeterminate amount of time. When he opened them again, there was a resolute look in his eyes.."]},{"number":3950,"title":"Chapter 3950: Conversation between Love Rivals (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3950: Conversation between Love Rivals (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Did you say that my opportunity was in the Dongsang Kingdom?” Yu Mingye had never sounded so calm.","Seeing how serious Yu Mingye was, the head of the elders grew serious as well.","“Your great opportunity is indeed in the Dongsang Kingdom, but it’s too dangerous there. You may not survive.”","Yu Mingye took a deep breath. “I’ll do anything, even if it’ll cost me my life.","Let’s go!”","Yu Mingye left without hesitation!","His pride wouldn’t allow it...","Feng Wu opened her eyes involuntarily when Jun Linyuan returned.","“Jun Linyuan?” Feng Wu sat up in bed, looked at Jun Linyuan in surprise, then looked down at herself. ‘Why am I in bed?”","Recalling that the girl had wasted the courage he had summoned, Jun Linyuan threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and ignored her. He then sat down in the corner and began to cultivate.","Was he angry again?","Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan in astonishment.","“Are you mad?”","The girl crouched down in front of Jun Linyuan and eyed him suspiciously.","Jun Linyuan opened his eyes, glanced at Feng Wu, and went back to his cultivation.","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","Rubbing her head, she tried to recall if she had offended Jun Linyuan.","However, now that Feng Wu had figured out Jun Linyuan’s temperament, she couldn’t ask him directly why he was angry. She had to be tactful. Feng Wu sat down in front of the teenager and blinked at him.","Jun Linyuan raised his chin.","Feng Wu found it amusing. “Hey, Jun Linyuan, are you angry because I took your bed?”","Jun Linyuan didn’t reply.","Feng Wu looked at his shoes and was surprised. “Did you go out?”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Have you recovered? That’s why you can run around now, isn’t it?”","Jun Linyuan was speechless.","Feng Wu said, “After everything I’ve done for you, you’re still out here in the middle of the night? I’m so mad!”","Hence, the tables had turned again, and it was Jun Linyuan’s turn to appease his girl.","The next day, while she still had time, Feng Wu went to see her old friend, Old Man Ba, the Supreme Level medicine refiner.","Old Man Ba was conflicted when Feng Wu arrived, for he had been refining a cauldron of pills ten times already and had failed every single time.","“Oh my, Xiao Wu!” Old Man Ba was amazed to see Feng Wu. “You’re back!","Quickly, give me some advice. This Mixed Essence Pill...”","Old Man Ba couldn’t see anyone else when he spotted Feng Wu. He then led Feng Wu away.","Feng Xun was amazed. “Old Man Ba, are you quite familiar with Xiao Wu?”","Old Man Ba glanced at Feng Xun over his shoulder. “What are you talking about? Of course, we’re familiar with each other. But why are you here together? Are you friends?”","Resting a hand on Feng Wu’s shoulder, Feng Xun darted a pleased look at Old","Man Ba. “Familiar? She’s my sister. Of course, I know her well?”","Old Man Ba looked at Feng Xun in bewilderment. Feng Xun raised his chin proudly and let Old Man Ba look away.","“That’s... not right.” Old Man Ba looked from Feng Xun to Feng Wu. “Didn’t you come to me to arrest Xiao Wu back then? She ran so fast, and you chased her.","Am I mistaken?”","Feng Xun scratched his head in embarrassment..."]},{"number":3951,"title":"Chapter 3951: Back to the Capital","paragraphs":["Chapter 3951: Back to the Capital","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun scratched his head awkwardly at Old Man Bat s words.","Back then, they didn’t know that Feng Wu was the ugly girl, and they had been chasing her everywhere.","Feng Xun remembered that he had chased her all the way to the brothel.","At that thought, Feng Xun and Jun Linyuan exchanged looks.","Jun Linyuan looked away...","He didn’t want to talk about such a humiliating thing anymore.","“Ahem...” Feng Xun immediately changed the subject and diverted Old Man Ba’s attention.","Not only did Feng Wu go to see Old Man Ba, but she had also met a lot of her neighbors.","No one knew if Jun Linyuan was doing it on purpose, but he had stayed by Feng Wu’s side the whole time, as if he was protecting her.","The looks the neighbors gave them became suggestive.","They were all surprised when they learned that he was the famous crown prince.","When Jun Linyuan came to Northern Border City over a year ago, they still considered him to be an invincible and distant god. But this time... he looked like an immortal man.","Not only wasn’t the crown prince angry when Aunt Wang teased them, he even smiled a little. That was so...","After Feng Wu, Jun Linyuan, and the others left Northern Border City, the common folk of Northern Border City talked about thismeetingg for a long time...","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan had left when the mayor arrived.","“Are they gone?” The mayor was so frustrated that he asked Uncle Lan loudly. Uncle Lan nodded as he swept the floor. “He’s gone.”","The mayor was frustrated. What was he doing in seclusion? Why didn’t he see the crown prince when he arrived?","Meanwhile, Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan were heading for the imperial capital.","Back then, this route had taken Feng Wu over a month, but she no longer needed that much time now.","In less than seven days, they were already in the imperial capital.","Feng Wu didn’t even go back home. Instead, she sent Jun Linyuan back to his residence.","Jun Linyuan needed to recover from his internal injury, and he had an epiphany.","Feng Wu locked Jun Linyuan up in the basement of the manor.","“Stay here and recuperate. No matter what happens outside, you’re not allowed to come out until your wounds are healed. Got it?”","Feng Wu was serious this time, and she stared at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan frowned.","Resting her hands on Jun Linyuan’s shoulders, Feng Wu said earnestly, “Jun","Linyuan, you’re going to die if you don’t treat your internal injury properly.”","Jun Linyuan kept getting injured, and each time, his dantian would be severely injured. Feng Wu examined it and saw that it was badly damaged.","“Your top priority now is to repair your body. Will you do that for me?” Feng Wu pleaded.","“Three months. I’ll be out of seclusion in three months.” Jun Linyuan kept his unblinking gaze on Feng Wu.","“Alright.” Feng Wu smiled.","Feng Wu set up a formation after she left the basement.","That way, no one would disturb Jun Linyuan’s cultivation.","No matter what happened outside, Jun Linyuan wouldn’t hear anything.","“These three months are of utmost importance,” Feng Wu said earnestly.","Seeing the look on Feng Wu’s face, Granny Gong became serious as well.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t let other people know that he’s here. This time, he can’t stop repairing his dantian. Otherwise, there’s a high chance that his dantian will be destroyed, and he may fall into the demonic path!”","Granny Gong nodded again.","Feng Wu was going to leave after that.","Granny Gong stopped her again. ‘Miss Wu, please wait.”","“What?” Feng Wu stopped, turned around, and looked at Granny Gong in bewilderment.","Granny Gong looked from the sealed door to Feng Wu and said after some hesitation, “Miss Wu, aren’t you going to stay here? If His Royal Highness knows, he’ll want you to stay in the residence.”","What Granny Gong wanted to ask the most was, “His Royal Highness isn’t feeling well now. Aren’t you worried?”","Feng Wu nodded. “The next three months are very important, and I have to be here to protect him. But I need to take care of something now.”","Granny Gong let out a breath of relief.","Feng Wu went back to the Feng clan.","Qiuling and the others greeted her.","They had been worried about Feng Wu for months. Now that Feng Wu was finally back home, they were relieved.","Chaoge burst into tears as soon as she saw Feng Wu.","“Xiao Wu, why did you leave? I’ve missed you so much..","“We’ve been getting news from the northwest, and some even said that you were dead. How can I believe that? I beat her up!”","Feng Wu frowned a little. “I’m dead?”","Chaoge nodded. “That’s right. We’ve been receiving news of your death, and His Majesty has been worried.”","Feng Wu asked Granny Zhao what was going on.","Tears welled up in Granny Zhao’s eyes as she nodded in fear. “I was told that you died in the Northern Yan Kingdom, and... I think...”","“What is it?” Feng Wu asked.","Granny Zhao said, “I think it has something to do with Princess Raoxi of","Northern Yan.”","Feng Wu said, “What? So, the rumor is that Princess Raoxi has killed me.”","Granny Zhao nodded. “Your Uncle Qiu asked around, but His Royal Highness,","Young Lord Feng, and Young Lord Xuan Yi weren’t there. In the end, he went to Northern Feng Mansion to ask around, but Northern Feng Mansion didn’t tell him anything either...","“I don’t know what happened, but my lady has heard about it...”","“Hey, where’s my mum?!” Feng Wu grabbed Granny Zhao and asked anxiously, “I’ve been back for a while, but I haven’t seen her anywhere. Where is she?” Feng Wu rushed in, followed by Granny Zhao and the others.","“She’s in the back room. I had a quiet discussion with your Uncle Qiu, but somehow, your mother heard it. She heard about your death and spat out a mouthful of blood. She hasn’t been doing well.”","Tears welled up in Granny Zhao’s eyes again. “She’s been getting worse...”","“Where’s the imperial physician? Didn’t you send for him?!” Feng Wu almost burst into tears when she saw her mother, who had lost a lot of weight. Taking her mother’s hand, she checked her pulse right away.","Granny Zhao said, “His Majesty has sent Master Chu here, but he said that it was a terminal disease, and there was nothing he could do. How could it be...”","Taking a deep breath, Feng Wu fought back her frustration and checked her mother’s pulse.","Feng Wu frowned when she checked his pulse.","She didn’t believe in terminal illnesses at first. After all, being too worried couldn’t be terminal.. However, judging from her mother’s pulse..."]},{"number":3952,"title":"Chapter 3952: Her Mum’s Pulse","paragraphs":["Chapter 3952: Her Mum’s Pulse","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu frowned a little. Her mother’s pulse was so strange.","Her pulse was weak at times, strong at times, and stopping at other times...","For a moment, Feng Wu couldn’t figure out what was going on with her mother. She was so worried...","“Xiao Wu?”","Seeing that Feng Wu didn’t say anything, Chaoge stepped forward.","Feng Wu shook her head at Chaoge. “I don’t know yet. Has anyone been to Fallen Star Yard recently?”","Granny Zhao and Chaoge shook their heads.","The beautiful lady was still unconscious, but luckily, her life wasn’t in danger for the time being... She still had time to solve this mystery.","Just then, Feng Wu heard a voice calling her.","The white fairy?","Feng Wu ran out of the door and soon reached the dry well of the Fang Manor next door.","The white fairy had been cultivating here. As expected, when Feng Wu arrived, she saw the white fairy sitting in the dry well.","The dry well was filled with yellow sand, but the white fairy’s dress was spotless.","She slowly opened her eyes and looked at Feng Wu.","Recalling her mother’s condition, Feng Wu grew anxious. She asked as soon as she sat down in front of the white fairy.","“Recently?” The white fairy frowned. “I’ve been cultivating, but...’ “What?” Feng Wu felt that the white fairy wanted to say something, but hesitated.","As expected, she spoke again. “Someone has been here.”","Feng Wu immediately asked, “Who is it?”","The white fairy said, “I don’t know.”","Feng Wu said, “How can you not know? Do you know if it’s a man or a woman? How old are they? What’s their cultivation level?”","The white fairy looked at Feng Wu and nodded. “She’s about your age, and her cultivation level is...”","The white fairy was going to say that the person was much more capable than Feng Wu was, but she hesitated as soon as she opened her mouth because she sensed the formidable spiritual essence coming from Feng Wu.","“You...”","The white fairy stared at Feng Wu. “Are you a peak Spiritual Overlord now?”","Feng Wu nodded without hesitation. She had nothing to hide.","The white fairy didn’t know what to say.","She didn’t want to talk anymore.","The white fairy remembered clearly that Feng Wu was only a junior Spiritual Overlord when she left the imperial capital three months ago.","‘What on earth did you eat? How can a person cultivate so fast?","Feng Wu smiled. “Ahem, I was just lucky... It was pure luck.”","The white fairy still didn’t want to talk to Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu prompted her. “How about that girl of my age? How’s her cultivation level compared to me?”","The white fairy shook her head. Feng Wu asked, “Is that something that you can’t talk about?”","The white fairy said, “It’s hard to say.”","Feng Wu immediately realized something. “Is she also a peak Spiritual","Overlord?”","The white fairy nodded. “And she has two very capable men with her. They’re peak Spiritual Saints.”","Feng Wu was astonished.","The white fairy nodded. “That’s right. They were at the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage. Maybe even higher.","“That’s an area I’ve never dealt with before, so I can’t tell exactly how capable they are, but I can say that they’re unfathomable.”","Feng Wu drew in her breath.","She searched her memory, but she still couldn’t think of anyone she knew that was like that...","“Who is she? What did she do to my mother?” Feng Wu asked.","The white fairy glanced at Feng Wu. “Do you want to hear the truth?” Feng Wu nodded earnestly.","The white fairy said, “That witch was very arrogant when she arrived.","“Her arrogance is demonstrated by the fact that she has deliberately caused fluctuations in the spiritual essence around her, which has disrupted the meridians of the people around her and made them vomit blood. But they still don’t know what has happened.","“I promised to protect your Fallen Star Yard for a hundred years, so I took action.","The white fairy looked at Feng Wu, and the look on her face became more and more serious. “But I only made one strike, and an invisible force knocked me away. My soul almost shattered.”","The white fairy had always been in her spiritual form. If her soul was destroyed, she might disappear forever.","Feng Wu was astonished.","The white fairy said, “It was one of the two masters I told you about. He only waved his sleeve. What do you think of his capability?”","Feng Wu pursed her lips, and her face darkened.","The white fairy went on. “After I left, that little witch went back to Fallen Star Yard. It was after dark, and all your maids and grannies were asleep. Your mother was the only one who was awake and crying because she missed you.","“No one knew what the little witch was doing in there. She came out fifteen minutes later.","“She wore bells around her ankles, and they jingled when she walked, but no one in the house woke up. That bell was a divine weapon.","“Your mother has been in a coma since she left, and we don’t know if she’ll survive.","“That’s all I know.”","Feng Wu stared at the white fairy. “Did they just let you go?”","The white fairy shook her head. “That little witch wanted to kill me, but the two Spiritual Saints stopped her in the end, which was why I’m still alive.” Feng Wu frowned a little.","According to the white fairy, the girl wasn’t a threat, but the two Spiritual Saints were.","Even Feng Xiangnan wouldn’t be able to withstand such power.","Jun Linyuan, on the other hand, had gone into seclusion because he needed to repair his body.","“Was that your rival in love?” The white fairy glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “Where would I find one of those? Was that Zuo","Qingluan?”","The white fairy said affirmatively, “Definitely not. She’s a little younger than Zuo Qingluan and with her bare feet and bells, it’s very easy to recognize her.","She’s definitely not Zuo Qingluan.”","Feng Wu racked her brain, but she couldn’t think of anything.","Just then, they heard voices in Fallen Star Yard next door.","Feng Wu jumped out of the well and soon returned to Fallen Star Yard.","Watching Feng Wu leave, the white fairy murmured, “Is it true that the younger generation is surpassing the older one? Are we going to be left behind?","These teenage girls are incredible.”","At that thought, the white fairy felt rather sad.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu went back to Fallen Star Yard to find Lady Northern Feng.","“Xiao Wu!” Seeing that Feng Wu was still alive, Lady Northern Feng was pleasantly surprised. She then held Feng Wu in her arms.."]},{"number":3953,"title":"Chapter 3953: Barefoot and Bells (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3953: Barefoot and Bells (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Northern Feng almost burst into tears of joy when she saw Feng Wu.","“Are you alright? You’re not dead?” Lady Northern Feng rubbed Feng Wu’s head, feeling sorry for her. Tears welled up in her eyes. “Feng Xun said you were back. You’re really alive. That’s great...”","Seeing that Lady Northern Feng was going to cry again, Feng Wu tried to appease her. “I’m fine. Please don’t cry. But where did you get that information?”","Lady Northern Feng said that she had learned it from someone called Lady Cai. In the end, she said, “Lady Cai... Her family is very close to the Dugu family.” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. The Dugu family?","“By the way, the Dugu family hasn’t been very peaceful recently,” Lady Northern Feng told Feng Wu in a serious tone. “Try not to get into conflicts with them later. If you can, bear with it. If something really happens, we’ll wait for your godfather to come back. It won’t be too late.”","Feng Wu looked at Lady Northern Feng in bewilderment. “The Dugu family?","Empress Dugu’s family?”","Lady Northern Feng nodded.","Feng Wu frowned a little. “I don’t think the Dugu family is that powerful.”","Feng Wu thought, “I’ve destroyed the Zuo family, and the Dugu family is about the same size as the Zuo family at most.”","However, Lady Northern Feng told Feng Wu, “The Dugu family used to be the same size as the Zuo family, but it’s different now. It’s so different.”","Feng Wu looked at her in bewilderment. “Different? How?”","Lady Northern Feng smiled bitterly. “I can’t tell you exactly, but I feel that the","Dugu family is much more powerful now. Apart from the royal family, the","Dugu family is also the most influential family in the imperial capital.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “Isn’t it Northern Feng Mansion?”","Lady Northern Feng shook her head with a wry smile.","Feng Wu frowned.","Lady Northern Feng was a valiant and heroic lady. Moreover, Northern Feng","General doted on her, and the empress dowager was her godmother. She had never been bullied in her life, but now, she looked a little defeated.","Feng Wu immediately asked, “What did the Dugu family do to the Northern","Feng Mansion?”","Lady Northern Feng smiled bitterly. “There’s a capable cultivator in the Dugu family, and he’s so powerful...”","Lady Northern Feng gave it some thought and said in the end, “According to your godfather, he may not be as capable as Master Linghu, but I don’t think he’s weaker than His Royal Highness. He’s at the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage. Right now, he’s guarding the Dugu family.” A peak Spiritual Saint?!","Feng Wu recalled what the white fairy said earlier.","According to her, there was a barefoot girl with two peak Spiritual Saints. Her mother had been unconscious ever since she entered Fallen Star Yard...","It was so difficult to find a peak Spiritual Saint on this continent. How could the imperial capital have so many of them all at once?","Gritting her teeth, Feng Wu asked Lady Northern Feng, “Have you seen a barefoot girl around my age?”","Tilting her head, Lady Northern Feng gave it some thought and her eyes lit up. “I think I’ve seen her somewhere before!”","Feng Wu asked anxiously, “Where? Think about it!”","Lady Northern Feng walked back and forth in the room. In the end, she gave Feng Wu a wry smile and said, “I can’t think of anything at the moment... I can’t help you...”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. Just keep it in the back of your mind. It’ll just pop up when you least expect it. You won’t be able to figure it out. when you think too hard.”","Lady Northern Feng then asked, “What about that barefoot girl?”"]},{"number":3954,"title":"Chapter 3954: Barefoot and Bells (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3954: Barefoot and Bells (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu gritted her teeth. “She has to have something to do with my mum’s coma! ”","The antidote Feng Wu needed had to come from that girl.","The look on Lady Northern Feng’s face became even more serious, indicating that she would think about it carefully.","Just then, someone came from the imperial palace.","Gao, the emperor’s eunuch, let out a breath of relief when he saw Feng Wu.","“Miss Xiao Wu, you’re really alive. I was so scared.”","Master Gao was on Jun Linyuan’s side and had always been very nice to Feng wu.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I think everyone in the imperial capital thinks that","I’ve died in the Northern Yan Kingdom. Does His Majesty think so as well?”","Master Gao smiled. “His Majesty was worried as well, but he said you had nine lives and was sure you would be alright. He then said...’","Feng Wu asked, “What else did His Majesty say?”","Master Gao smiled. “His Majesty also said that a scourge like you can live for a thousand years. You can’t possibly die. He even flogged those who spread rumors.”","Feng Wu said, “So, was Her Majesty the empress dowager over the moon?” Master Gao smiled bitterly and didn’t answer Feng Wu.","The empress dowager was so... Feng Wu didn’t want to talk to her anymore.","“Master Gao, may I ask why you’re here?” Feng Wu asked.","Master Gao said, “His Majesty wants to see you. Miss Wu, how long have you been here? When are you going to see His Majesty? He has a lot of questions for you.”","Feng Wu was about to say something when Gao cut her off. “Don’t say that you can’t get in without an audience. Have you forgotten about your waist plate? You can go anywhere in the Junwu Empire as if His Majesty is with you!” Feng Wu waved her hands with a wry smile. “I’m not your match. Let’s go to court now.”","“Sure!” Gao welcomed Feng Wu into the imperial palace without breaking a sweat.","“By the way, Lady Northern Feng,” Gao said before he left. “You’d better go back now. His Majesty has an edict.”","An edict?","Why now?","It didn’t seem to be bad news.","“His Majesty wants to welcome Miss Feng Wu back with a banquet in Taiji Hall. All officials above the fourth rank and their families have to come.”","Gao still remembered what His Majesty said.","“They were all saying that Xiao Wu was dead, and I’m going to summon all the gossipy women to the Taiji Hall. I want them to see that my daughter-in-law is still alive!”","When Master Gao said that, he chuckled, and so did Lady Northern Feng.","Feng Wu blushed and said, ‘What’s he talking about? It’s not official yet! Plus, the most important thing now is the poison in my mother’s system. Before she’s awake, I won’t think about anything else.”","Everyone became serious when Feng Wu said that.","Lady Northern Feng was the first to react. “Poison? You’re saying that your mother was poisoned, not terminally ill?”","Feng Wu shook her head but didn’t explain further.","She didn’t want to alert the others.","Feng Wu followed Master Gao into the imperial palace, while Lady Northern Feng went back home to prepare for the banquet.","In the study.","Emperor Wu looked at Feng Wu with tears welling up in his eyes. He was genuinely excited.","He stood on top of the stairs and stared at Feng Wu.","Those who didn’t know better would think that they were father and daughter.","“Your Majesty.”","As soon as Feng Wu bowed, Emperor Wu quickly walked up to her and patted her on the shoulder. “You’re really alive! I was right. How can anything happen to you? Hahaha!”","Emperor Wu immediately asked Feng Wu what happened on her journey. Feng Wu told him everything except for her sixth senior brother, which was confidential.","“Emperor Yan is so nice to you, and he’s punishing Princess Raoxi for you? Emperor Wu was amazed.","Feng Wu nodded. “When I came back, Emperor Yan had destroyed Princess Raoxi’s cultivation ability and banished her to a nunnery. I don’t think she’ll ever come out.”","Emperor Wu was surprised. “Why is he so nice to you?”","All of a sudden, Emperor Wu grew anxious. “He wants you as his daughter-in-law? He wants you to marry his son?!”","Feng Wu immediately smiled. “That’s not going to happen. Even his son won’t allow it.”","“Who else is after you?” Emperor Wu had sent someone to investigate, but they hadn’t come back yet.","Feng Wu counted with her fingers. “Apart from Princess Raoxi of Northern Yan, there’s also the Zuo family, the Flower Valley, the Firmament Palace, and the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu in amazement. “How can you still be alive when so many of them are after you? That explains the news of your death. Other people would never have come back alive. You’re the only one who can survive this.","“However...”","Emperor Wu’s face darkened. “I’ve given the order, but these people still want to kill you. They’re offending the Junwu Empire! I’ll forgive them!”","“And about my mother,” Feng Wu said earnestly.","Her mother was the most beautiful woman in the empire, and even Emperor Wu considered her an untouchable goddess. Of course, he cared about her.","“Mum isn’t terminally ill. She was poisoned.”","“What? Poisoned?” Emperor Wu’s face went scarlet red. ‘Who? Who poisoned her?!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “She’s a barefoot girl with two top-level Spiritual","Saints protecting her. Your Majesty, have you seen anyone like her?”","As soon as she said that, she saw Emperor Wu frown as if he had remembered something bad.","“You’ve met her before?” Feng Wu asked affirmatively.","Emperor Wu didn’t answer explicitly. Instead, he pondered for a moment, then looked at Feng Wu and said seriously, “Don’t mess with that person. She’s not someone you can mess with. Listen to me, and don’t go to her.”","Feng Wu frowned. “If I can’t find her, my mother won’t wake up. How can I let that happen?”","Feng Wu took a few steps back and stared at Emperor Wu. “I’ve worked so hard to protect the people I care about. Now that my mother is lying in bed, you’re telling me that I can’t go to the person who poisoned her?","“Heh, she’s just a peak Spiritual Overlord. Are you sure she’s not someone I can’t mess with?” Feng Wu smirked.","If she was really mad, she would go to her senior brothers and her beautiful master! She wouldn’t be intimidated!","Emperor Wu looked at Feng Wu in resignation.","“She’s just a peak Spiritual Overlord?” Emperor Wu patted Feng Wu on the head. “Don’t get too excited. Yes, you’re a genius, but you haven’t been cultivating for long. You’re a junior Spiritual Overlord at most...’","“I’m at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage,” Feng Wu said calmly.","“A peak Spiritual Overlord? What did you just say?!” Emperor Wu’s eyes widened as he stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “The peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage!”","Emperor Wu said, “Didn’t you have a chaotic battle with the Zuo and Hua families when you left the imperial capital? You were only a junior Spiritual","Overlord then. It’s only been three months, and you’re already a peak Spiritual Overlord! That can’t be!”","Emperor Wu looked from Feng Wu to Master Gao inquiringly.","Master Gao nodded at Emperor Wu.","To be able to stay by Emperor Wu’s side and protect him, one had to be a very capable cultivator.","Emperor Wu pointed at Feng Wu. “You... You’ve been making such rapid progress that you almost scared me!”","It took Emperor Wu a while to recover from his excitement. Staring at Feng","Wu, he said, “I don’t think Junjun made as much progress as you did, did he?”","Feng Wu was frustrated. “So what? I’m not a peak Spiritual Saint yet.”","If she was at the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage now, she wouldn’t need to worry about anything. All she needed to do was to find that barefoot girl and kill her. She didn’t need to worry about anything else. Emperor Wu rubbed Feng Wu’s forehead.","Feng Wu snapped. “What?”","Emperor Wu said, “You don’t have a fever. What are you talking about?” Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Seeing that Feng Wu was in a bad mood, Emperor Wu tried to appease her. “That’s doable. After all, they’ve come all the way here and didn’t bring many capable cultivators with them. When Junjun gets here... Wait, where’s Jun","Linyuan?”","Feng Wu wouldn’t tell anyone else, but Emperor Wu had nothing to hide, so she told him about Jun Linyuan’s recovery.","“He’s in seclusion? Repairing his body?” Emperor Wu’s eyes widened, and he looked shocked.","Feng Wu nodded. “We can’t disturb him this time. Otherwise, his body won’t be able to take it.”","Emperor Wu asked, “What will happen?”","Feng Wu glanced at Emperor Wu. “What do you think will happen if his body is destroyed?”","Emperor Wu frowned.","Feng Wu was confused. “Is there something that only he can do?”","Emperor Wu looked embarrassed. He didn’t tell Feng Wu what it was about but only waved at her. “Don’t worry. I’ll take care of it myself. Go back to your cultivation. The Junwu Empire will depend on the few of you when you reach the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage.”","Feng Wu could sense the fatigue in Emperor Wu’s voice as if something she didn’t know had happened.","Feng Wu suddenly recalled what Emperor Wu said earlier that the barefoot girl didn’t bring many capable cultivators with her. How were two peak Spiritual Saints not many?","“What does she want?” Feng Wu stared at Emperor Wu.. ‘Where did that barefoot girl come from? What does she want? Where is she now?”"]},{"number":3955,"title":"Chapter 3955: Who Is She","paragraphs":["Chapter 3955: Who Is She","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu only stared at Feng Wu without saying a word despite her questions.","“So... You can’t tell me.” Feng Wu smiled bitterly.","Emperor Wu patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “Xiao Wu, you’ve reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, but you haven’t reached the Spiritual Saint stage yet. It won’t do you any good to know about this. It’ll only interfere with your cultivation. Hurry up and become a Spiritual Saint.”","In the end, Emperor Wu sounded like he was pleading.","Entering the Spiritual Saint stage? Would it affect the Junwu Empire greatly? Feng Wu thought to herself.","However, to Emperor Wu’s surprise, while he was still hiding it from Feng Wu, at the imperial banquet that night...","At the banquet to welcome Feng Wu back, Feng Wu met the barefooted girl with the bells the white fairy was talking about.","Naturally, she wasn’t there at first. Halfway through the banquet, when the atmosphere became more intense, there was the faint jingling sound of bells. Many people didn’t hear it, but Emperor Wu frowned and looked displeased.","He put down his glass and looked in the direction of the palace.","The emperor’s seat had always been facing the door.","Therefore, Emperor Wu was the first to see the slim figure at the door.","The lower hem of her flirtatious purple dress flapped in the wind, revealing her smooth calves, and the bells on her ankles chimed.","Emperor Wu put down his cup, and his face darkened.","The emperor was the center of attention, so everyone turned their heads and followed Emperor Wu’s gaze.","The enchanting girl with exquisite features walked toward them in the moonlight.","She had only brought two people with her. Although they were few in number, there was an arrogant look on her face. She raised her chin and looked very arrogant.","“Who’s she?”","“She’s wearing such strange clothes! Half of her arm is out! That’s outrageous!”","“And she’s so arrogant!”","The others didn’t like the enchanting girl right away, for she had a very provocative attitude.","However, some of them were pleasantly surprised.","That man was among the Dugu family.","The pretty girl walked arrogantly to the center of the hall, raised her chin, and smiled at Emperor Wu. “Why, Emperor Wu, you’re in a good mood. A palace banquet?”","“How dare you!”","One of the officials scolded her.","It was none other than Duan Hongyi, Duan Chaoge’s father.","However, with that, the enchanting girl raised her hand, and a formidable energy shot at Duan Hongyi.","Master Duan didn’t even have time to react before he flew backward.","Thump, thump, thump!","Duan Hongyi knocked over several tables in a row, smashing into quite a few people before he landed.","Blood kept coming out of Master Duan’s mouth, and he couldn’t utter a word.","The people he bumped into fell to the ground as well.","Chaos ensued, and people cried out in surprise.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and stared at the pretty girl.","She created chaos as soon as she showed up. She was so eager to see the world in chaos.","The chief of the imperial guards came in right away. However, Emperor Wu waved them off.."]},{"number":3956,"title":"Chapter 3956: The Empire of Dayan (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3956: The Empire of Dayan (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The barefoot girl walked up to Emperor Wu, tilted her head, and smiled at him. “Why, Emperor Wu, you’re so grumpy! Are you mad at me now?”","Emperor Wu narrowed his eyes. “How dare you!”","The girl wasn’t angry. She looked around and saw the confused looks in everyone’s eyes. She smiled and said, “I’m Yan Ling. I’m from the Dayan Empire. By the way, do you know the empire?”","Everyone was confused, but a few important officials of the Junwu Empire frowned. It was obvious that only a few core members of the Junwu Empire knew about the existence of that empire.","Yan Ling glanced at Emperor Wu with a half-smile. “So, most of the people of the Junwu Empire don’t know about the existence of the Dayan Empire. Emperor Wu, that’s not right. How can you keep it from them?”","Emperor Wu’s face was livid.","But the girl named Yan Ling kept pressing, and she seemed to be very cheerful.","“The royal family of Dayan is the superior sovereign of the Junwu Empire. In other words, the Junwu Empire is a vassal state of the royal family of Dayan. The centennial annual festival is coming up. Emperor Wu, are you going to start preparing gifts now?","Seeing that Emperor Wu wouldn’t answer, Yan Ling chuckled again. “Have you forgotten about the tribute because we haven’t visited for a hundred years?”","The look on Yan Ling’s face turned serious when he said those words.","An intimidating energy filled the air.","Yan Ling was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, and the energy she was giving off wasn’t too bad. However, the two men she had brought with her were the most capable cultivators of their generation, and they were releasing their energy as well...","The capable cultivator hiding in the dark was about to step out when Feng Wu suddenly stared at Yan Ling and smiled.","“Miss Yan Ling?” Feng Wu glanced at her.","Yan Ling turned around and glanced at Feng Wu, which shocked her.","What a beautiful girl!","Her eyes flickered, and no one knew what she was thinking when she saw Feng wu.","“Who is this young lady?”","Yan Ling, who had been aggressive toward Emperor Wu, turned all her attention to Feng Wu now.","That was Feng Wu’s plan.","Feng Wu couldn’t bring herself to see Emperor Wu being bullied by Yan Ling in front of so many people.","After all, Emperor Wu had always been kind to her.","“I’m Feng Wu.”","“Feng Wu? Who’s that?” Yan Ling sneered at her. “Who gave you the permission to speak?”","Right now, many people were watching Feng Wu nervously.","Because it was a royal banquet, there were a lot of people here. Almost all the fourth-ranked officials and their families were there, as were all the members of the major clans. Right now, they were all watching the conversation between","Feng Wu and Yan Ling.","Many of them were Feng Wu’s old acquaintances. Some were gloating over Feng Wu’s predicament, but most of them felt sorry for her.","Needless to say, the ten major clans knew about the existence of the Dayan Empire.","Although the empire hadn’t been here for a hundred years. their existence was","like a shadow over the Junwu Empire.","To be the Empire of Yan was like a giant mountain that was crushing down on every country on this continent.."]},{"number":3957,"title":"Chapter 3957: The Empire of Dayan (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Who’s Feng Wu?” The others didn’t like it when Yan Ling asked that question.","Feng Wu, on the other hand, said calmly, “I’m just someone who can defeat you.”","Hearing that, Yan Ling couldn’t help but give Feng Wu a strange look. She then chuckled. “Interesting. I didn’t know that the Junwu Empire could have such an ignorant person. ”","Yan Ling smiled at Emperor Wu. “So, King Junwu, do you mean that as well?”","King Junwu?","<font < div>","To Yan Ling, the emperor of the Junwu Empire was only a king.","Emperor Wu clenched his fists.","However, the energy coming from the two Spiritual Saints behind Yan Ling stopped him from making any reckless moves.","He said, “Xiao Wu, come back.”","Crossing his hands behind his back, Yan Ling raised his chin and darted an arrogant glance at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu took a deep breath and went up to Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu shook his head at her, telling her to stay put.","Feng Wu was so frustrated. She could live with the humiliation, but she couldn’t stand it when an elder was humiliated, especially when that elder was Emperor Wu, who had been respected for his entire life.","Yan Ling didn’t look at Feng Wu again. Instead, she put her hands behind her back, raised her chin, and said casually, “I’m here today to discuss a business deal with King Junwu.”","Emperor Wu said indifferently, “Since we’re here to talk business, Princess Yan","Ling, let’s talk inside.”","He didn’t want to talk to Yan Ling in front of so many people. He only wanted to send her to the study, but Yan Ling waved him off.","“That won’t be necessary. It’s very simple. Just say the word, and I’m in a hurry.”","Emperor Wu knew that it wasn’t good news, so he frowned. “What is it?”","Yan Ling said, “I heard that the Junwu Empire has produced a genius teenager in the past hundred years. His name is Jun Linyuan. Is that true?”","Emperor Wu frowned and had a bad feeling.","However, Mrs Dugu chuckled before Emperor Wu could finish. “Jun Linyuan? Isn’t that His Royal Highness?”","Flame Spirit nodded. “That’ll make things much easier.”","Emperor Wu stared at Princess Yan Ling, who asked arrogantly, “Where is he?”","Emperor Wu knew where Jun Linyuan was because Feng Wu had told him that Jun Linyuan was repairing his body and cultivation technique in the secret underground room and wouldn’t come out for three months. Right now, no one was allowed to disturb him!","According to Feng Wu, even if the Junwu Empire collapsed, no one was allowed to disturb him.","Emperor Wu glanced at Feng Wu, then turned to Yan Ling. “Princess Yan Ling, mav I ask whv vou’re asking about Tun Linvuan?","Princess Yan Ling said arrogantly, “If he’s a genius, he should be a little talented. Of course, we have to take him back to the Empire of Dayan and teach him well. It’ll be such a waste if he’s left in the Junwu Empire. Let him come out.”","Emperor Wu smiled bitterly. “I appreciate your kindness, but he’s not in the Junwu Empire. Even if he wants to go to the Dayan Empire, he won’t be able to. Why don’t you leave first? When my defiant son comes back, he can go to the empire to look for you. How about that?” However, Princess Yan Ling shook her head. “No.” Emperor Wu’s face darkened, and he said coldly.."]},{"number":3958,"title":"Chapter 3958: The Empire of Dayan (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu said coldly, “Jun Linyuan really isn’t in the Junwu Empire. I’m afraid Princess Yan Ling won’t be able to find him.”","Princess Yan Ling’s face darkened.","She had been threatening him in secret before, but now, she was openly threatening him.","“Jun Linyuan isn’t here? Heh. Your Majesty, please come with me.”","Feng Wu frowned. That was so arrogant of Princess Yan Ling!","<font < div>","The others didn’t see this coming. They rose to their feet and glared at Princess","Yan Ling.","Humiliating Emperor Wu was like humiliating them!","Just then, they heard a taunting voice.","“Feng Wu, that’s not right. Why haven’t you told His Royal Highness? He’ll be here in no time.”","It was Mrs Dugu again.","Feng Wu recalled the information she had received. The Dugu family had suddenly become stronger, and they were going against her all the time, even offending Emperor Wu...","It seemed that the Dugu family was backed by the Dayan Empire.","As expected, Princess Yan Ling turned her attention to Feng Wu again.","She frowned and asked, “What does this girl have anything to do with it?”","Mrs Dugu smiled. “Princess Yan Ling, you may not know this, but Feng Wu was engaged to His Royal Highness once, and they’re very close. If anyone else knows about His Royal Highness, it’ll be Feng Wu.”","“Is that so?”","Princess Yan Ling had no interest in Feng Wu at first, but now, she narrowed her eyes and smiled at Feng Wu. “Jun Linyuan’s fiancee? Who the hell do you think you are?”","She didn’t try to be polite at all.","Many people’s faces darkened, especially Lady Northern Feng. She gritted her teeth and glared at Princess Yan Ling. If she could, she would slap the princess.","But there were also those who gloated, such as the Dugu family.","Feng Wu glanced at Princess Yan Ling and smirked. “That’s so strange. If I’m not good enough, are you?”","Princess Yan Ling acted as if she had only just heard about Jun Linyuan, which was obviously not the case. She had to know Jun Linyuan well. Maybe she was here for him!","Princess Yanling stared at Feng Wu and suddenly smiled. “He and I? Well, that’s not a bad idea if Miss Fenz Wu wants to Dart with him.”","Feng Wu smirked. “But I don’t want to part with him.”","Princess Yanling snorted. “It’s not up to you.”","Feng Wu shrugged. “At least, I’m still his fiancee.”","Princess Yanling said, “Not if you’re dead.”","Emperor Wu Imew how terrifying the Dayan Empire was, so he stopped Feng Wu and shook his head at her, telling her not to offend Princess Yan Ling.","But with what was going on, Princess Yan Ling wouldn’t let Feng Wu off the hook just like that.","Princess Yan Ling smirked at Feng Wu. “If that’s the case, let’s do it according to the rules of my empire. The loser of the battle will become the winner’s slave!”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Seeing that Feng Wu had agreed without hesitation, Emperor Wu was exasperated. He grabbed her by the arm. “Xiao Wu!”","Princess Yan Ling was too powerful. Had she lost her mind?","Lady Northern Feng also tried to stop Feng Wu from saying yes.","Mrs Dugu smiled. “Princess Yanl Lng has come all the way here, but Miss Feng Wu has been targeting her all the time. See? She’s angry now..”"]},{"number":3959,"title":"Chapter 3959: Princess Yan Ling","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Northern Feng glared at Mrs. Dugu.","Mrs. Dugu said innocently, “Isn’t that the case? Without the Dayan Empire, the","Junwu Empire would be the Junwu Empire. Now that the people of the Dayan","Empire are here, the Junwu Empire is no longer the Junwu Empire.”","Lady Northern Feng was furious, but she couldn’t deny that Mrs Dugu was telling the truth. It just didn’t sound nice.","<font < div>","“I see that the Junwu Empire still has some wise people.” Princess Yan Ling smirked and stared at Feng Wu. “Bring it on. I’ll show you how invincible the empire is!”","With a wave of her hand, the two capable cultivators next to her backed away. Meanwhile, Princess Yan Ling took out her whip.","It was a red whip with barbed thorns, resembling a venomous snake!","Before she could say anything, Princess Yan Ling struck first. With a smack, the red whip whipped down at Feng Wu’s face.","Instantly, spiritual essence filled the air.","With the whipping, the space between Feng Wu and Yan Ling became chaotic, and the atmosphere was very gloomy.","A short distance away, everyone drew in their breaths.","It was such a terrifying power!","“She’s at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage!”","As soon as Princess Yan Ling made her move, someone in the crowd spoke.","It was none other than Long Yanyi, the head of the Long family of Grey Dragon Valley.","The Long family sat very close to Lady Northern Feng, who asked, “Princess","Yan Ling is a peak Spiritual Overlord now?”","Long Yanyi took a deep breath and nodded. “That’s right. Princess Yan L ing has indeed reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, and she’s only a step away from the Spiritual Saint stage. That breakthrough may be today or in a few years.”","Lady Northern Feng asked anxiously, “What about Xiao Wu?”","Before, Lady Northern Feng could tell Feng Wu’s cultivation level, but in the past six months, she couldn’t anymore.","Long Yanyi watched as Princess Yanl Lng closed in with the red whip, but Feng Wu dodged. After a strike, Feng Wu ran away, while Princess Yan Ling ran after her.","“Wait a minute!”","Long Yanyi cried out.","“What happened? Just tell us!” Mrs. Long grabbed Long Yanyi’s sleeve and prompted him.","It was true. Because the battle had involved a cultivator at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, many people didn’t understand it and were waiting for Long Yanyi’s explanation.","“What level is Xiao Wu now?”","“How many stances can she take?”","“How’s she doing?”","The two of them fought so fast that they left after images behind. It would be impossible for the others to follow.","“That’s so strange!” Long Yanyi suddenly smacked the table and rose to his feet. “How can this be? How?”","Lady Northern Feng wanted to kick him. What was that supposed to mean? Just say it!","Long Yanyi took a deep breath. “If I’m not mistaken, little Feng Wu is a peak","Spiritual Overlord as well? Am I seeing things?”","Long Yanyi had met Feng Wu a year ago. Back then, Feng Wu was only a Spiritual Lord, but now, she was a peak Spiritual Overlord!","Everyone shook their heads.","“That’s impossible! Feng Wu was only a junior Spiritual King when she graduated from Imperial College!”","“That’s right. She was only a junior Spiritual King when she went to the battlefield. How could she be a peak Spiritual Overlord now? How long has it been? A year?”","“It’s not a year yet.”","“That’s not possible!”","No one believed it.","Mrs. Dugu said, “That’s impossible!”","Long Yanyi smirked. “If that girl wasn’t a peak Spiritual Overlord, she wouldn’t have been able to withstand Princess Yan Ling’s attack for so long. They’ve been fighting for five minutes.”","Everyone fell silent.","It was true.","If Feng Wu hadn’t reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, she would never have been able to survive Princess Yan Ling’s attack.","Meanwhile, Princess Yan Ling was driven mad by Feng Wu.","It wasn’t because of Feng Wu’s capability but because of her speed!","She couldn’t force Feng Wu to fight her head-on, for Feng Wu was as nimble as a fish. She kept jumping around, and Princess Yan Ling’s whip couldn’t even touch her.","“Feng Wu, how dare you run away?!” Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth.","She didn’t like the way she was now.","The Dayan Empire was several times more powerful than all the other kingdoms of the Junwu Continent put together. Therefore, when she came to the Junwu Continent, she was very condescending.","Just like when she was with Emperor Wu.","She was a princess of the Dayan Empire, and Emperor Wu was the ruler of a kingdom. They were of similar social status, so she didn’t want to show him anv resDect.","However, she didn’t expect that Feng Wu would play her like this.","“Stop right there!” Princess Yan Ling ran after Feng Wu with her whip.","But the longer she chased, the more disappointed she became.","She realized that Feng Wu was at least a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord.","The Junwu Empire was indeed full of unknown talented people!","They already had Jun Linyuan, and if they also had Feng Wu...","Just then, she heard a voice.","“Feng Wu has the Divine Phoenix Blood. That’s why she’s making such rapid progress!” It was Mrs Dugu again.","Lady Northern Feng grabbed Mrs Dugu. “Shut up!”","But she had said it, and it was too late to keep her mouth shut.","“The Divine Phoenix Blood?!” Princess Yan Ling stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment. ‘Why do you have the Divine Phoenix Blood?”","Seeing that Princess Yan Ling had been distracted by those words, Feng Wu stopped running.",", on the other hand, thought that Feng Wu was still moving forward, which was why she kept moving forward.","What happened was quicker than words could describe!","Feng Wu had put on the arm of discipline.","With a whoosh, the arm wrapped around the whip and pulled Princess Yan Ling, who was on the other end, to Feng Wu’s side.","Puff! Puff! Puff!","Numerous thin needles shot out of the arm, aiming at Princess Yan Ling’s vital parts.","Everything happened so fast that no one had time to react.","Princess Yanl Ling, who was still immersed in the incident with the True Phoenix Blood, was caught off guard.","“You!” gritted her teeth and glared at Feng Wu.","By then, Feng Wu had moved behind her and pressed the sharp dagger against Princess Yan Ling’s thin neck.","Feng Wu smiled a little. She was talking to Mrs Dugu while keeping her eyes on Yan Ling.","“Thank you, my lady, for helping me.”","Mrs Dugu blanched and didn’t know what to say.","She wasn’t helping Feng Wu. She was helping Princess Yan Ling, but as it turned out, Princess Yan Ling had been defeated by Feng Wu! Meanwhile, everyone was staring at Feng Wu in astonishment.","She won!","Feng Wu had won? How was that possible? How? Princess Yan Ling was a peak Spiritual Overlord, but Feng Wu..","Long Yanyi was equally shocked. He had never expected Feng Wu to win.","“This is unbelievable...” Long Yanyi shouted inwardly.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu pressed a dagger to Princess Yan Ling’s neck and asked with a half-smile, “Are you going to give in?”","Of course, Princess Yan Ling wouldn’t give in.","She smirked. “I’m not giving in. What? Are you going to kill me now?” Feng Wu didn’t speak.","Thinking that Feng Wu had been rendered speechless, Princess Yan Ling smirked. “You know the two capable cultivators I brought here, don’t you? Do you know how capable they are? Do you know that they’ll wipe out the entire empire? How dare you kill me? Bring it on!”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and stared at Princess Yan Ling.","was very pleased.","She was still gloating when something happened.","With a thump, Feng Wu clenched the arm of discipline into a fist and punched Yang Ling.","The impact almost sent Princess Yan Ling flying backward.","It just so happened that Feng Wu was holding the back of Princess Yan Ling’s collar with her other hand, which was why Yan Ling didn’t fly away.","Princess Yanling felt a sharp pain in her belly, so painful that she was almost in tears.","had been spoiled since she was little and had never been beaten up like this.","However, Feng Wu punched Princess Yan Ling in the stomach again. “Are you going to give in or not? Are you going to give in or not?”","With each punch, Princess Yan Ling arched her back like a cooked shrimp, and the pain made her break into a cold sweat. However, she was stubborn. Despite the pain, she wouldn’t give in.","“Feng Wu, kill me if you can! Otherwise, I won’t give in!”","Feng Wu smirked. It seemed that she hadn’t been harsh enough.","With a thump, Feng Wu used the power of thunder!","It was the power of thunder she had infused into the arm when she made it. Once she activated the thunder attribute, the arm would be covered with lightning.","In Feng Wu’s grip, Princess Yan Ling screamed.","Her hair stood up, and she was trembling.","Feng Wu smirked. “So be it. I don’t really want you to give up either.” almost rolled around on the ground in pain.","But she still wouldn’t give in.","They had made a bet that the loser would become the slave of the winner. As Princess Yan Ling of the Dayan Empire, she couldn’t become the slave of an unknown girl from a small country. Therefore, Princess Yan Ling wouldn’t admit her defeat.","Just then, two peak Spiritual Saints stepped out and walked up to them.","“Grandpa Yao, kill her!” Princess Yan Ling shouted at one of them.","Grandpa Yao, who had reached the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage, stared at Feng Wu with his cold eyes.","“No!” Emperor Wu pulled Feng Wu behind him and smiled obsequiously at Yao.","“She was reckless. Please forgive her. She’s still...”","However, Grandpa Yao only smirked and made a little push.."]},{"number":3960,"title":"Chapter 3960: Feng Wu’s Secret","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu was shoved away and smashed into the table behind him.","“Your Majesty!”","Master Gao steadied Emperor Wu and cried out.","Emperor Wu almost had a heart attack.","It was such a terrifying power!","<font < div>","His girl..","While Emperor Wu was worried about Feng Wu, Feng Wu was sneering at Grandpa Yao.","A smirk?","How dare Feng Wu smirk at a peak Spiritual Saint?","Everyone was snaking from head to toe. They couldn’t help but panic when they felt the power of a peak Spiritual Saint.","“You’re a bold girl.” Yao Yuan stared at Feng Wu with a cold look in his eyes. His tone was as calm as the ocean. “But even if you’re that bold, you’re still going to die today.”","“So, that’s the rule of your empire, isn’t it?” Feng Wu said sarcastically. “You propose a bet first, then force a competition. You’re going to kill someone if you lose? Is that how your empire behaves?!”","Princess Yan Ling rose to her feet and smirked at Feng Wu. “Young lady, I see that you really have no idea how capable the Empire of Dayan is. This is a world where the strong are respected, and you’re trying to reason with me? Why should I? Grandpa Yao, kill her now!”","Feng Wu asked, ‘Why?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Because I don’t like you.","“Because I’m more capable than you, I can trample on the contract at will!","“Because I don’t like you, even in your territory, my people can kill you however they want!","“I’m killing you because I want to. Reasonable? No one will reason with you in front of the powerful Empire of Dayan.","“To people of small countries like you, every member of the empire is a noble figure. If I want to kill you, I’ll do it. There’s no need to pick a date!”","Princess Yan Ling was unbelievably arrogant!","Feng Wu gritted her teeth and stared at her.","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “You don’t like it? If you don’t, go destroy the empire one day. As long as it’s alive, we’ll be so much more prestigious than you!","“Grandpa Yao!” Princess Yan Ling couldn’t be bothered to talk to Feng Wu anymore and prompted him for the third time. Yao Yuan nodded and stepped forward.","He grabbed Feng Wu by her thin neck.","He wanted to snap Feng Wu’s neck.","Feng Wu wanted to dodge, but Yao Yuan did something, and she felt so weak that she couldn’t even lift a finger.","Everyone watched as the peak Spiritual Saint lifted Feng Wu off the ground.","Feng Wu’s feet had left the ground, and she was suspended in mid-air.","Emperor Wu and Lady Northern Feng bellowed at the same time.","They wanted to charge out, but...","There seemed to be an invisible wall between Feng Wu and the man. No matter how hard they tried, they couldn’t get in.","Damn it!","Feng Wu was going to be throttled...","Emperor Wu spat out a mouthful of blood.","How was he going to answer Jun Linyuan if Xiao Wu died?","At that critical moment!","A cold voice rang out.","Stop.","His voice was so cold and authoritative that it gave one the creeps.","Even Yao Yuan, a peak Spiritual Saint, felt a chill run down his spine.","How was that possible?","They were peak Spiritual Saints!","Yao Yuan felt an invisible force on his throat.","If he didn’t let go, that dark energy would pierce his throat.","What a terrifying opponent!","Feng Wu fell to the ground with a thump.","“Xiao wu!”","Lady Northern Feng rushed over, caught Feng Wu, and led her away from Yao","Yuan.","At that moment, the owner of the voice finally showed up.","“Master Linghu!”","Everyone let out a breath of relief when they saw who it was.","That was right. Only Master Linghu could turn things around in a critical moment like this. It was like this for over a decade ago.","Emperor Wu let out a breath of relief, but his stomach lurched.","Master Linghu was about to die, and the old man had told him so himself. Would it affect his life? The thought made Emperor Wu even more flustered.","Master Linghu was the pillar of the Junwu Empire, just like Patriarch Huyan was in the Northern Yan Kingdom.","Emperor Wu watched this closely and didn’t dare to let his guard down. Meanwhile, Master Linghu was standing in front of two peak Spiritual Saints.","“How’s Prince Yan doing?” Master Linghu asked indifferently. Yao Yuan and Ma Quanquan looked at each other in surprise.","Master Linghu wasn’t a peak Spiritual Saint, but...","“You’ve reached that stage?” Yao Yuan gritted his teeth.","Master Linghu said indifferently, “I was lucky. I’ve only just gotten started.”","Even so, he was more than enough to handle the two of them. At that thought, Yao Yuan and Ma Quanquan wanted to give up.","Powerful cultivators like them cherished their lives more than anyone else.","They had put in so much effort for their cultivation that ordinary people couldn’t understand it. Therefore, they couldn’t afford to die.","“Linghu, are you going to make the empire your enemy?!” Yao Yuan warned him.","Although they weren’t as capable as Master Linghu, the empire behind them was enough to make all the capable cultivators of the Junwu Empire prostrate on the ground.","However, Master Linghu only smiled and said coldly, “I’ll kill you two first, then. ”","Master Linghu was giving off a murderous energy.","That Linghu was really...","“Let’s go.” Yao Yuan and Ma Quanquan exchanged looks before dragging Princess Yan Ling away.","Princess Yanling said angrily, “Grandpa Yao, I’m not leaving. I..","But soon, she was out of sight.","When Master Linghu turned around and saw Feng Wu, the look in his cold eyes softened a lot. He said to Emperor Wu, “Take care of her.” Emperor Wu nodded immediately.","The next moment, Master Linghu was out of sight.","He left as quickly as he had arrived. With a wave of his sleeve, he left no trace behind.","However, the legend he left behind was very popular.","The others let out a breath of relief. It had been a very difficult day.","It was going to be a sleepless night after they left the imperial palace.","They were all haunted by the Dayan Empire.","After a hundred years, the empire was back.","Many people only lived for a few decades, and their impression of the empire was only in the legends. However, when the empire walked out of the legends and landed on the ground...","Things began to change in the Junwu Continent.","Yao Yuan and Ma Quanquan left the imperial palace with Princess Yan Ling.","Outside the imperial capital, in the dense forest.","“Grandpa Yao, put me down!” Princess Yan Ling shouted angrily.","Only then did Yao Yuan let go of her.","As soon as she landed, she gritted her teeth. “Grandpa Yao, Uncle Ma, when Father handed you to me, he told you to keep me safe. Is this how you protect me?!”","The two peak Spiritual Saints’ faces darkened.","Princess Yan Ling immediately realized that they were both peak Spiritual Saints. Even in the Dayan Empire, such capable cultivators were very hard to come by, and there were only a handful of them in the entire Prince Yan’s residence.","Ahem..","She immediately changed her attitude and looked aggrieved. “Grandpa Yao,","Uncle Ma, that Feng Wu has bullied me. How could you...’","Yao Yuan frowned. “That Master Linghu is so capable. If we fight against him, he will suffer, but the three of us will die.”","Princess Yan Ling looked at him in surprise. “Grandpa Yao, is that true?”","Yao Yuan nodded.","Wiping away her tears, Princess Yan Ling smirked. “I didn’t know there was such a person in the Junwu Empire. How interesting.”","Yao Yuan said, “I heard that Mu had a few pupils here. Is that Linghu his pupil?”","Ma Quanquan frowned. “If that’s the case, it’ll be even harder to handle him.” Princess Yan Ling asked, “Are you talking about that man?”","Yao Yuan and Ma Quanquan, the two peak Spiritual Saints, didn’t try to explain to Princess Yan Ling. Instead, they said, “It seems that it won’t be easy for us to defeat the Junwu Empire.”","Yang Ling rubbed her chin and was lost in her thoughts.","She was a smart woman. She was so angry just then that she almost lost her mind, but after she calmed down, she began to analyze the pros and cons.","“I thought I could do whatever I wanted with their reverence for the empire, but Master Linghu just showed up out of nowhere!”","“It’ll be very troublesome for the empire to send capable cultivators here. The more capable they are, the more costly it will be. Sending us here will cost the clan a lot of money.","Princess Yan Ling rubbed her chin and pondered as she walked. “But the Junwu Empire does have a lot of secrets.","“There’s that Lady Xuanji over there in Fallen Star Yard. Heh, she thinks I don’t know who she is. If her father knows where she is, he’ll probably come here right away!”","Yao Yuan and Ma Quanquan nodded.","One look at Lady Xuanji’s face and one could tell who she was...","“It’ll depend on my father if we should get rid of her or trade her for a favor.","“And that Feng Wu... don’t you think she looks a little like Lady Xuanji? Princess Yan Ling was confused. “I don’t know where she came from, but we haven’t heard anything about a peak Spiritual Overlord at such a young age. Let the Dugu family look into it as soon as possible.","“There’s more!”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth. “What’s that Divine Phoenix Blood Mrs","Dugu was talking about? It’s so rare..”"]},{"number":3961,"title":"Chapter 3961: Her Master’s Secret","paragraphs":["Chapter 3961: Her Master’s Secret","Translator: Henvee Translations Editor: Henvee Translations","Princess Yan Ling said, “Even the royal family only has one descendant with that bloodline every generation! Mu... that person Left with the Divine Phoenix Blood. Is Feng Wu’s Divine Phoenix Blood related to him?”","“That’s very likely!” Yao Yuan nodded.","Ma Quanquan frowned. “She’s under Linghu’s protection. There’s nothing we can do.”","Princess Yanling smirked. “It’s just that we can’t do anything to her for the time being. For one, we can write to my father and ask him to send more capable cultivators here. For another, we can start a war on the continent of Jiuzhou.","“The Dongsang Kingdom and the Junwu Kingdom are at war. “Let’s go to the Dongsang Kingdom, then. ” Princess Yan Ling smirked.","Feng Wu, just you wait!","At the same moment, Feng Wu was still unconscious. When she woke up, three days had passed.","“You’re awake?” Feng Wu heard a calm voice.","The first person Feng Wu saw when she opened her eyes was Master Linghu.","“It’s you!” Feng Wu struggled to sit up and said in pleasant surprise, “I knew you would come.”","Master Linghu rolled his eyes at Feng Wu. “What if I couldn’t make it in time? You’re taking too much risk!”","Feng Wu smiled. “No, I know you’ll be here.”","Master Linghu snorted. “Where did you get that confidence?”","Feng Wu smiled again. “Fifth Senior Brother, please don’t pretend. Sixth Senior Brother has told me everything.”","Master Linghu stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu chuckled. “My sixth senior brother said that you were my fifth senior brother, the one who used to treat me very well!”","Master Linghu rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “Kiddo, do you remember something?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “Actually, I don’t remember what happened in the past. I only heard about it from you, Little Phoenix, and Sixth Brother...” Master Linghu nodded. “If you can’t remember it, don’t think about it. It’ll show up when you need it.”","Feng Wu nodded obediently.","Master Linghu sat down in front of Feng Wu. Seeing how obedient she was, he was amused. “Don’t you have anything to ask?”","Feng Wu moved closer and asked curiously, “Senior Brother, what’s going on with the Empire of Dayan? And what’s the status of the Yan Prince’s residence?","What’s the average level of their forces over there?”","Feng Wu had a lot of questions to ask, but Master Linghu wasn’t going to tell her.","He said, “If I tell you everything, you’ll only hear it in passing. It’s best if you can experience it yourself. Only then will you consolidate your cultivation and make a breakthrough.”","Feng Wu pouted. Her fifth senior brother wasn’t as easy to talk to as her sixth senior brother. If he were Patriarch Huyan, he would tell her everything if she gave him the lost puppy look.","Seeing the aggrieved look on Feng Wu’s face, Master Linghu couldn’t bring himself to see her like this. She was his only junior sister, and she was the apple of his eye.","At that thought, Master Linghu patted Feng Wu on the head and said grumpily, “The Dayan Empire is indeed a superior state to the Junwu Empire, which is a vassal state. We’ll have to start from our master...”","Feng Wu was astonished when Master Linghu told her about the origin of the continent.","“Is that so?","“Our Master was that capable?!","“Build a continent with his bare hands? I can’t believe it!”","Why was this continent called “Jiuzhou Continent”? Because Mu Jiuzhou had created this continent himself!","He had created this continent!","Mu Jiuzhou was a member of the royal family of the Dayan Empire and a","high-ranking official. According to Master Linghu, Mu Jiuzhou used to inherit the throne of the empire, but he abdicated shortly afterward and gave it to his nephew, while he built the continent himself.","That was why the continent was named after Mu Jiuzhou.","After Mu Jiuzhou died, the continent fell apart. The nine provinces were divided into nine kingdoms, which were what they were now.","The Junwu Empire used to be the Junwu Province.","Seeing how surprised Feng Wu was, Master Linghu said, “Master is unprecedentedly powerful, but we don’t know why he didn’t become the emperor back then and why he built a continent.”","All of a sudden, Master Linghu stared at Feng Wu. “Our Master is still alive, isn’t he?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Master Linghu said, “As long as my Master is alive...”","Feng Wu said, “But Master can’t come out right now. He...”","Master Linghu waved his hand. “I know. It won’t be that easy for someone as capable as him to change his fate. He’ll come out one day.”","Feng Wu nodded solemnly. “That’s right. He’ll come out one day.”","Master Linghu looked at Feng Wu and said, “Since the Dayan Empire is here, this battle is bound to happen.”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you saying that Dayan will target the Junwu Empire?”","Master Linghu nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Wu said, “Dayan is so powerful that the Junwu Empire is nothing compared to it.”","Master Linghu nodded.","Feng Wu asked, “Is there no other way?” Master Linghu stared at Feng Wu. “There’s one.”","“Feng Wu” asked, “What?”","Master Linghu said, “You and Jun Linyuan die, your soul will be destroyed, and you’ll never be able to reincarnate.”","Feng Wu was astonished.","Master Linghu said, “That’s not all. The same thing will happen to my master’s disciples, as well as my master himself! They’ll never be able to reincarnate. If that’s the case, I don’t think Dayan will attack the Junwu Empire.” Feng Wu clenched her fists in frustration. “How can this happen? How...”","Master Linghu sighed, rubbed Feng Wu’s head, and said in a serious tone, “Junior Sister, your Senior Brothers can withstand it for a year or two, but if the empire sends all its capable cultivators in, we may not be able to withstand it either. The only option is...","“My Master has to come back.”","Master Linghu stared at Feng Wu and stressed each word. “Only my master can solve this crisis. Remember that?”","An idea struck Feng Wu all of a sudden. “So, Sixth Brother said that an enemy was secretly searching for my Master and my senior brothers. That’s why my senior brothers are often elusive?”","Master Linghu nodded.","Feng Wu said, “That’s why my sixth senior brother told me not to tell anyone about our relationship. The enemy is too powerful. I thought that with how capable my senior brothers are, I wouldn’t be afraid of anyone. But now that I think about it, the enemy is from the Dayan Empire.”","Master Linghu nodded again. “You’re smart.”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “Is the Dayan Empire that invincible?”","Master Linghu said, “Junior Sister, please don’t worry. The Empire of Dayan is indeed a formidable force because there are so many capable cultivators. In terms of Spiritual Saints alone, they have ten times more than our continent.”","Feng Wu said, “Ten times!”","Master Linghu said, “But it’s only ten times. They’re much more powerful than us, but it’s still within reach. All the capable cultivators of our continent have been making rapid progress in the past few years. I think in another ten years, they’ll only be eight times better than us.”","Ten years... eight times...","Feng Wu thought to herself, “That’s just a drop in the bucket.”","Luckily, the Dayan Empire wasn’t that powerful. Otherwise, Feng Wu wouldn’t Imow what to do.","Before she knew it, Feng Wu had blurted it out.","Master Linghu smiled. “No, it’s not like that. After all, cultivation progresses step by step. Moreover, people can grow old and die, and there’s no such thing as immortality. Therefore, people of the Empire of Dayan will die when they reach old age. The old ones can’t survive forever. When the capable ones die, new ones take their place. That’s all. They may seem impressive, but it’s only because they have been around for a long time.”","Feng Wu nodded. “We can handle them if we try hard.”","“By the way, my mother...” At that thought, Feng Wu told Master Linghu that Princess Yan Ling had poisoned her mother.","However, Master Linghu nodded. “I know that.”","Feng Wu asked, ‘What? You know about that?”","Master Linghu glanced at Feng Wu and said something that shocked her. “Our Master told me to guard you in the imperial capital. Of course, I know what happened to you.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","It was her Master...","Her beautiful master had told her fifth senior brother to protect her... Feng Wu didn’t know how to react...","Master Linghu said, “Your mother’s poison...”","Feng Wu took a bottle out of her chest pocket and handed it to Master Linghu. “This is the bottle I took from Princess Yan Ling when I fought her. Please have a look.”","Feng Wu and Master Linghu examined it together.","Soon, they exchanged looks and said in unison, “We’re still short of one ingredient.”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right. Although it’s the right medicine, the toxin has been in my mother’s system for a long time. This can neutralize the toxin, but she’s too weak to withstand it. Therefore, we have to add the dragon stone plant.”","Master Linghu said, “The Junwu Empire doesn’t have it.”","Feng Wu asked, “Where can I find it, then?”","Master Linghu looked at Feng Wu and said, “The royal palace of the Dongsang Kingdom has it.”","Master Linghu couldn’t leave the Junwu Empire or even the imperial capital...","“I’ll go!” Feng Wu clenched her fists. “I was going to the Dongsang Kingdom to find my third senior brother anyway, and I’m going to take that plant while I’m at it. There’s no time to waste. I’m leaving now!”","After that, Feng Wu turned to leave.","“Wait.” Master Linghu stopped Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Master Linghu handed Feng Wu a metal ball. “Take it.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s that?”","Master Lingnu said, “It’S a gilt rrom me. Keep It well. It’ll worK perrect1Y witn the arm.”","Holding the ball the size of a pigeon egg, Feng Wu looked at Master Linghu in bewilderment.","Master Linghu smiled. “Smear your blood on it, and it’ll be yours..”"]},{"number":3962,"title":"Chapter 3962: Dangerous Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 3962: Dangerous Battlefield","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was surprised.","Most of the time, only a divine weapon required blood.","It was at least a semi-divine weapon!","Feng Wu looked up at Master Linghu in astonishment. “Fifth Senior Brother...”","Master Linghu rubbed her head. “Do as you’re told.”","“Alright.”","Expectedly, Feng Wu dripped blood on the ball. Soon, it popped open, and a suit of armor floated in mid-air.","It was covered with scales and filled with fighting spirit.","“A semi-divine weapon?!” Feng Wu was pleasantly surprised.","Master Linghu said, “It used to be a divine weapon, but because you’re still a little weak, if you put on a divine weapon, peak Spiritual Saints will try to take it away. Therefore, I’ve suppressed it to a semi-divine weapon. “One day, when you’re strong enough, you can upgrade it to a divine weapon.”","Master Linghu looked at his junior sister in amazement. Apart from cultivation, each of her six senior brothers was only good at one subject. Huyan specialized in both cultivation and weapon refinement.","Their third senior brother was a cultivator and a swordsman.","He, on the other hand, specialized in cultivation and formations.","But Feng Wu was the only exception... Their master had taught her everything, and she just happened to be very smart.","No matter what her master taught her, she could master it as soon as she was taught. Once she mastered it, she would be able to draw inferences from it and innovate... The girl was amazing.","“It’s called the Qilin Armor,” said Master Linghu. “It’s returned to its rightful owner, but don’t wear it unless you have no other choice. Although I’ve changed its appearance, old people may still recognize it.”","Feng Wu nodded.","After bidding Master Linghu farewell, Feng Wu entered the imperial palace with the Qilin Armor.","Emperor Wu was sitting in the study with a long face when Feng Wu saw him.","“Xiao wu!”","Emperor Wu was elated to see Feng Wu. He rose to his feet and went to greet her.","“Your Majesty.” Feng Wu greeted him.","Emperor Wu waved his hand. “Why are you doing this? Get up!” Emperor Wu wanted to talk to Feng Wu, so he led her to a table and sat her down.","Other people wouldn’t have a place to sit if they came here to see Emperor Wu. They could just stand there.","Emperor Wu had set up the table for Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan.","“How’s your injury? Is it serious? Did Master Linghu tell you anything?”","Feng Wu hadn’t woken up that day, and the imperial physicians couldn’t do much, so Emperor Wu went to Master Linghu himself. Master Linghu was indeed here, but he took Feng Wu to the Wandering Temple straight away.","Feng Wu then told him what Master Linghu had told her about the Dayan Empire.","“I see, I see...” Emperor Wu looked anxious. “The Dayan Empire has set their eyes on Junwu. They want Master Linghu dead, as well as the crown prince, you, and all the talented people...’","Emperor Wu smiled bitterly and rubbed his face. “Actually, I know that all along...","“I knew it...","“The Empire of Dayan is too overbearing and unreasonable for its own good. They’re used to being the ruler, and of course, they don’t want other forces to rise.","“The Junwu Empire has Junjun, you, and Master Linghu... Of course, the Dayan Empire doesn’t like that.","“What centennial tribute? They’re just exploiting us over and over again.” Feng Wu was confused. “Over and over again?","“That’s right!” Emperor Wu said solemnly. “The Dayan Empire comes here every 100 years and chooses a country to take away the most capable cultivators. They do it one at a time. Therefore, the continent of Jiuzhou has been neither strong nor weak for the past 1000 years. If the talented people hadn’t been taken away, we might have been as powerful as the Dayan Empire now! This time, they’ve chosen the Junwu Empire.”","Feng Wu said solemnly, “They’ve gone too far!”","Emperor Wu sat on the ground and said bitterly, “Not only are we being targeted by the Empire of Dayan, but there are other eight kingdoms as well!”","Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu and stressed each word. “The Dayan Empire will never do it themselves. They’ll support the proxy state so that it can fight for them.","“As for the rest of the kingdoms, they can either sit by and watch, or join the other kingdoms and work together against the Junwu Empire.”","At that thought, Emperor Wu frowned. Things were getting out of hand for the Junwu Empire.","Feng Wu immediately said, “Don’t worry. I can’t say about other countries, but at least the Northern Yan Kingdom won’t be our enemy.”","She didn’t waste the past three months. She had found her sixth senior brother and made a reliable ally for the Junwu Empire.","Emperor Wu was confused. “Why?”","Of course, Feng Wu couldn’t say that the pillar of the Northern Yan Kingdom was her Sixth Senior Brother, but she said affirmatively, “Don’t worry. If you need an ally letter, I’ll go get it.”","Seeing how confident Feng Wu was, Emperor Wu couldn’t help but relax a little. “If we can form an alliance, then when we take care of the Empire of","Dayan...”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “Master Linghu said that even if the continent of Jiuzhou can form an alliance, we’ll only be a tenth of the strength of the Dayan Empire.”","Moreover, they still had the Dongsang Kingdom to fight.","Recalling her purpose here, Feng Wu told Emperor Wu, “Your Majesty, I need to go to the Dongsang Kingdom.”","“No!” Emperor Wu refused. “Nonsense! Don’t you know that the Dongsang Kingdom is fighting us in the Peace Grassland? They’ll catch you and skin you alive if you go there! No! You can’t go!”","Feng Wu only smiled at him.","She was here to take her leave, not to hear Emperor Wu’s opinion.","Emperor Wu probably knew how grumpy Feng Wu could be. Seeing her gentle smile, he knew that he wouldn’t be able to persuade her.","Emperor Wu said in resignation, “Where are you going? I’ll send someone to escort you...”","“Green Emperor City.”","It was the capital of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Emperor Wu stopped abruptly.","“You’re going to Green Emperor City? Why? Do you have any idea how dangerous it is?!!!” Emperor Wu bellowed at Feng Wu. “Do you have a death wish?!”","The last time when Feng Wu almost died, Emperor Wu was already scared out of his wits. Now that Feng Wu was trying to scare him like this, he was furious.","Feng Wu smiled. “I’ll go to the Dongsang Kingdom and ask for an alliance letter. How about we form an alliance with them? Otherwise, we won’t be able to defeat the Dayan Empire. An alliance will give us a chance.” Although it was only a very slim chance.","Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu instead.","“What are you talking about?","“Of course, I know the benefits of forming an alliance. If I can do that, of course, it’ll be great. Is that possible? Can I?","“We’ve been enemies with the Dongsang Kingdom for generations, and we want to kill each other as soon as we meet.","“Plus, do you think the people of the Dayan Empire are idiots? Princess Yan Ling is very smart. If I’m guessing right, they’ve chosen the Dongsang Kingdom as their proxy this time.","“Many of the ancient technologies of the Dongsang Kingdom were given by the Dayan Empire when they had more advanced versions.","“But look, all their outdated technologies are so powerful. This time, this time... ”","The more Emperor Wu said, the more pained he became.","Looking at Emperor Wu, Feng Wu suddenly walked up to the desk and started writing.","“What are you writing?” Emperor Wu asked.","“It’s a promise,” said Feng Wu. “I have to get that letter from the Dongsang Kingdom.”","“Nonsense.” Emperor Wu threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and poked her in the head. ‘Wake up, kiddo. Stop daydreaming. If you can get the letter of alliance from the Dongsang Kingdom, I’ll make you the emperor! ”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","Emperor Wu said, “Of course!”","Feng Wu said, “Fine! Sign it!”","Emperor Wu asked, “What?”","Feng Wu quickly wrote down a bet and handed it to Emperor Wu. “If I can get an agreement from the Dongsang Kingdom, you’ll owe me the throne. I can take it whenever I want. Will you sign it?”","Emperor Wu said, “So be it. You won’t get that letter.”","Seeing that Emperor Wu had signed the agreement, Feng Wu carefully put it away and hid it in her ring space so that it wouldn’t get wet.","Feng Wu was worried about one thing, but with the bet, she didn’t have to worry about what would happen next.","What Emperor Wu didn’t know was that Feng Wu was so smart that she had set him up in such a short time. If he knew what she did, he would be furious.","After bidding Emperor Wu farewell, Feng Wu hurried back to the Feng clan.","Time was of the essence here, so Feng Wu didn’t linger in the Feng manor. She immediately set out for the Peace Grassland.","The shortest route to the Dongsang Kingdom was through the Peace Grassland.","Moreover, Feng Wu could enter the Peace Grassland through the portal.","Feng Wu had at least three plans for the Dongsang Kingdom this time.","The second one was the letter of alliance, which involved Emperor Wu’s throne.","The third was her third senior brother and the third broken star piece.","Taking a deep breath, Feng Wu stepped into the portal.","Before long, she arrived with a ding.","The Peace Grassland was right outside the portal.","As soon as Feng Wu left the Peace Grassland, she heard panicked shouts a short distance away.","“Dodge! Dodge! Get into the cover!”","“Don’t go inside! Get out! Now!”","“They’re going to bomb us! Everyone, get out! Find cover and split up!”","Feng Wu paled when she heard the hasty voices.","Feng Wu recognized that voice.","If she remembered it correctly, it was Ying Yuan.","Feng Wu had been on his team before, so she could recognize his voice.","Feng Wu rushed over and grabbed Ying Yuan.","Caught off guard, Ying Yuan was caught by Feng Wu and he cried out, “Who are you? You... Ah! Feng Wu!”"]},{"number":3963,"title":"Chapter 3963: The Defense Battle (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3963: The Defense Battle (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu nodded calmly. “Yes, it’s me. Report to me now. What happened?”","Ying Yuan shook his head. ‘We don’t have much time. To cut it short, the Sun Castle is going to attack us. They’ve made a small attack before, but it’s a large one now! Everyone, move out!”","Feng Wu frowned. “Didn’t we take Sun Castle? Didn’t Night Owl run back to Green Emperor City? Why is he here?”","Ying Yuan smiled bitterly. “That’s right. They’ve taken Sun Castle again. For some unknown reason, they’ve gained a lot of capable cultivators this time, and the technology of ancient times has been greatly enhanced. Didn’t you invent the flying fighter jet? We’ve put it into use as well, and we were evenly matched. But for some unknown reason, their technology of the ancient times has skyrocketed!”","Ying Yuan said anxiously, ‘We can’t hold them off much longer!” “Where are the others? Where’s the general? Where are the elders?” Ying Yuan shook his head. “They went to another battlefield...”","Before he could finish, they heard a rumbling sound ahead of them.","Instantly, there was an explosion, and flames filled the air!","A building a short distance ahead of Feng Wu was blown to pieces.","“This is only the first wave!” Ying Yuan’s eyes were bloodshot red as he gritted his teeth. “This is only the first wave. Look, the densely packed fighter jets are coming our way!”","Feng Wu followed Ying Yuan’s gaze and saw it!","The densely packed dots really were fighter jets!","Just then, Feng Wu saw a group of people running in her direction, and she recognized their leader. It was Senior Sister Lan.","Senior Sister Lan, who used to be a Level-3 Spiritual King, was a Level-4 Spiritual King now. She was followed by a group of people.","They were running in Feng WII’s direction-","“Out of my way! Out of my way!” Senior Sister Lan shouted at Ying Yuan.","However, Ying Yuan frowned and said to Feng Wu, “We can’t let them in! Even if we have to die, we have to stay here! No one is allowed to enter the portal, let alone retreat into the empire!","“If we retreat, we’ll lose Nest, and the Dongsang Kingdom will march right in and reach our empire!","“If it comes to the worst...","Ying Yuan stared at Feng Wu. “Let’s destroy the portal together!”","Feng Wu frowned but didn’t answer Ying Yuan right away.","Seeing that Feng Wu was hesitating, Ying Yuan said loudly, “If they enter through the portal, they’ll reach the imperial capital directly. The Junwu Empire will be wiped out when the soldiers arrive! Therefore, we have to cut off the portal here and force them to enter from Northern Border City. That’s the only way... the only way to stall them. Do you understand?!","“We were training our soldiers when you were here before, so we played with the Dongsang Kingdom. But now, it’s a real battlefield, and it’s about life and death!”","Ying Yuan took a deep breath. “Feng Wu, will you guard the portal with me?” Before Feng Wu could say anything, Senior Sister Lan arrived with a team of people.","There were at least a hundred of them.","These people were about the same level as Senior Sister Lan, and the weaker ones were sent by the Imperial College and Military Academy to guard the","Peace Grassland.."]},{"number":3964,"title":"Chapter 3964: The Defense Battle (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3964: The Defense Battle (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“What are you doing?!” Ying Yuan stared at them.","Senior Sister Lan said aggressively, “Let us through the portal! Out of my way!”","Ying Yuan stepped out. “The portal will never open. If you insist on going in, you’ll have to walk over my dead body!”","Senior Sister Lan said, “Ying Yuan, are you serious?!”","Ying Yuan stood there, unmoved.","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “Fine, fine. If you insist, don’t blame us for being merciless!”","After that, Senior Sister Lan turned around and told the others, “Since Ying Yuan has blocked our way and told us to wait for the explosion, we’ll jump over him!”","Many people around her hesitated.","Ying Yuan said angrily, “Lan Wumei, you’re running away from the battlefield! That’s punishable by death!”","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “If you want us to be killed by the fighter jets of the","Dongsang Kingdom, we’ll have to fight for our lives!”","As she spoke, Senior Sister Lan drew out a long saber from behind her back and struck down at Ying Yuan.","Those behind her who had been hesitating stirred as well.","The battle could start at any moment.","At that critical moment, someone grabbed Senior Sister Lan’s sword.","Feng Wu had been standing behind Ying Yuan the whole time, and Ying Yuan had caught Lan Wumei’s attention just then, so neither she nor the others behind her noticed Feng Wu.","Until...","“Feng WII?”","A familiar voice called Feng Wu’s name.","Feng Wu looked up and saw a teenage girl standing a few steps behind Lan Wumei. She looked rather familiar, and Feng Wu seemed to have dealt with the girl before.","Right.","It was Shan Jingfei, who had given Feng Wu a hard time in Imperial College before coming to the Peace Grassland.","Shan Jingfei walked up to Feng Wu with a frown. “Why are you back? Who are you to stop us? Do you know how capable Senior Sister Lan is? How dare you stop her?!”","Lan Wumei recognized Feng Wu as well.","She and Feng Wu had never been on friendly terms.","The so-called feud was actually a one-sided one. Feng Wu had never had the energy to care about such petty things.","“It’s you.” Lan Wumeng frowned and stared at Feng Wu. “Why are you here?”","Glancing behind Feng Wu, she saw that apart from Ying Yuan and a few of his friends, Feng Wu didn’t have anyone else to help her. At that thought, Lan Wumei was elated!","Feng Wu was the person she hated the most, and now that Feng Wu had no one to help her, not to mention the chaos...","Instead of telling Feng Wu to get out of the way, she struck down at Feng Wu’s face.","However, Feng Wu caught the blade between her fingers.","Lan Wumei was furious. “Feng Wu, one of us is going to die today!”","After that, she gave up on the sword, drew a dagger out of her sleeve, and struck down at Feng Wu’s throat. “Watch out!” Ying Yuan was alarmed.","Shan Jingfei smirked.","“Feng Wu, since you’re all by yourself today...","“Brothers and sisters, with her around, we won’t be able to enter the portal today. If we can’t, we’re going to die here. So, everyone, let’s kill her together!”","While Lan Wumei was attacking Feng Wu, Shan Jingfei began to incite the people behind her.","They were all hot-blooded young men, and Shan Jingfei’s words had driven them crazy. They attacked Feng Wu one after another.."]},{"number":3965,"title":"Chapter 3965: The Defense Battle (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3965: The Defense Battle (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was furious.","She had never been so angry before!","It was time to defend the empire. Not only had they abandoned their teammates and fled, but they had also tried to kill the guards. How abominable!","Holding his sword, Ying Yuan said angrily, “You all deserve to die!”","After that, he was going to charge at those people.","He didn’t have any confidence in winning this battle, because there were only ten of them, and Lan Wumei was leading hundreds of people.","They were all Level-I and Level-G Spiritnal Kings. so Ying Yuan was bound to","lose and die.","However, before he could do anything, something unexpected happened.","Thump, thump, thump!","One by one, those fell to the ground.","They fell to the ground like dominos.","There were over a hundred of them, but they were all defeated in a matter of seconds.","Ying Yuan stared at Feng Wu, who was moving through the crowd, in disbelief.","“You...","“They...","Looking from the crowd to Feng Wu, Ying Yuan opened his mouth but couldn’t utter a coherent sentence.","Lan Wumei and the others were all dumbfounded.","They weren’t dead, but their knees had been shattered, and they would never be able to walk again!","“You! You!” Lan Wumei stared at Feng Wu and didn’t know what to say. Her heart was pounding, and she was so nervous that she didn’t dare to breathe.","That was so terrifying!","How could something so terrifying happen?","She thought she knew Feng Wu’s cultivation level and believed that Feng Wu had made rapid progress through unorthodox means. She didn’t think Feng Wu was much better than the rest of them.","But what she did just then was so terrifying.","In Lan Wumei’s mind, Feng Wu was as capable as Elder Dongfang.","Feng Wu stared at them with cold eyes and stressed each word. “I don’t have time for this now. You can come back for your death after this is over!”","Death..","She said they were going to die!","Lan Wumei and the others were so frightened that they couldn’t utter a word.","Just then, Lan Wumei noticed fighter jets coming their way, and she grinned maliciously.","Even Feng Wu wouldn’t be able to withstand the explosion.","“Let’s all die together! Hahaha!” Lan Wuzhi guffawed.","Feng Wu followed her gaze and saw a team of fighter jets coming their way.","It was obvious that their target was the portal.","Feng Wu frowned a little. They were asking for it!","Feng Wu took out the arm of discipline on her back and put it on.","Senior Sister Lan and the others looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. They didn’t understand why Feng Wu would take out her arm when the fighter jets were here. It wasn’t a close-range battle, and her arm wouldn’t work either! They weren’t the only ones who thought that way. The people in the fighter jets thought the same.","There were twelve jets, and they were all capable cultivators.","Seeing the group of people, the team leader gave the order to attack everyone on the ground.","Everyone...","That was to say, they could fire at will and eliminate all the targets!","However, as soon as the captain gave the order, the girl in red made her move.."]},{"number":3966,"title":"Chapter 3966: No One Is Leaving (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3966: No One Is Leaving (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, as soon as the captain gave the order, the girl in red made her move.","She raised her arm of discipline.","A long barrel suddenly appeared at the end of the arm.","Thump!","A black dot shot out like an arrow!","It was so fast that it cut through the wind!","When the black dot hit the fighter jet, there was a loud bang, and flames filled the air.","“That’s...” Everyone was dumbfounded.","They watched this in disbelief.","The fighter jet flying at the front was surrounded by flames and was burning as they watched!","The people on the fighter jet didn’t even have time to jump out.","“It’s just a little thing, How can it be so...”","Ying Yuan opened his mouth but realized that he couldn’t utter a word.","Ying Yuan wasn’t the only one who was shocked. Everyone was staring at Feng Wu as if she was a demon!","Feng Wu took aim at the second fighter jet.","Although it was only a small black pellet, it was a high-explosive compressed powder shell that Feng Wu had developed with Patriarch Huyan when they were in the Northern Yan Kingdom.","The high-energy spiritual essence had been compressed in the pellet. If it was shot out, the explosion would burn up enough energy to destroy a small team.","It was the same with the second generation fighter jets.","Thump!","Feng Wu fired another high-explosive compressed powder ball.","Poof!","There came a loud sound.","The second fighter jet exploded as well.","“Shit!”","The trembling people on the ground were all excited.","As for the fighter jet...","The people on the fighter jets drew in their breaths.","On the third fighter jet...","There was only one pilot in each fighter jet, and they were all under the command of the team leader.","It had never occurred to them that Feng Wu could do such a thing, so the team leader was flying at the rear, and he was the first to die. Now that the captain was dead, the deputy should be in charge.","However...","If the captain of the team was running at the front, the deputy was naturally flying next to him.","Then, the deputy died as well.","All hell broke loose.","The pilots on the fighter jets could communicate with each other through the communication channel.","“Guys, what should we do now? Should we charge or not?” The third-in-command was uneasy.","“Let’s go! Of course! We’ll avenge the captain and the deputy!”","“No, I don’t know what kind of ancient technology they have. We have to go back and report it to the higher-ups! We can’t finish the task for the time being. Let’s go back now!” “No, we can’t let them die for nothing! We have to avenge them!”","“No, we have to retreat!”","They couldn’t reach an agreement, and everyone had their own opinion.","That was the bad thing about not having a leader.","Feng Wu smirked.","She was going to shoot each fighter jet in turn, but the fighter jet at the end of the line, the one furthest away from her, had changed its direction.","“You want to leave?”","Feng Wu smirked and raised her arm.."]},{"number":3967,"title":"Chapter 3967: No One Is Leaving (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3967: No One Is Leaving (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Remote, fire!”","There was a loud thump.","The high-explosive compressed powder exploded.","The rearmost fighter jet was hit, and flames erupted, creating a glow brighter than fireworks!","Ying Yuan and the others clenched their fists in excitement.","However, the fighter jets in mid-air began to panic.","Should they fight or not?","“Shoot her!”","A voice came from the third jet.","However, only a handful of fighter jets stopped, and most of them had already fled.","The three remaining fighter jets...","Feng Wu smirked.","Thump, thump, thump!","Feng Wu fired three high-explosive compressed powder shells in a row.","She wasn’t familiar with the controls at first, but after two shots, she was able to shoot fast and accurately.","She turned the three fighter jets into flames before they could do anything.","The pilots who had fled turned around and saw what was going on. They were terrified.","If they had chosen to stay, they would have been turned to ash as well.","At that thought, they picked up their speed. Feng Wu said, “Guard the portal, and don’t let anyone in!”","Ying Yuan nodded repeatedly. “Yes!”","He looked at Feng Wu with sparkling eyes that were filled with excitement and admiration.","“And them! Watch them closely!” Feng Wu looked around at the people lying on the ground.","She meant Lan Wumei and the others.","Ying Yuan nodded solemnly. “Don’t worry. I’ll keep an eye on them and deal with them when you get back!”","Lan Wumei and the others wanted to cry, but no tears would come.","Many gave Senior Sister Lan reproachful looks, and she said angrily, “Didn’t you say that Nest would be destroyed and we would all die? Didn’t you want to run back to the imperial capital? Why are you blaming me now?!”","Naturally, the others wouldn’t let Lan Wumei talk her way out of it, so they started criticizing her.","Lan Wumei said angrily, “She’s only shot a few fighter jets. How can she change the situation? It’s a one-sided war now, and we’re bound to lose!”","Many people couldn’t retort her.","They had all come from the front line, so they knew how dangerous it was.","Feng Wu ran after the fighter jets, while they flew as fast as they could.","If anyone else had seen it, they would have been shocked, for they had only seen fighter jets chasing people, not the other way around...","“Run!” The pilots in the communication channel broke into a cold sweat.","They wished they could have ten more wings.","Just then, there was a loud bang.","They turned around and saw what was going on.","Another fighter jet exploded in mid-air.","That was it...","They had lost another fighter jet.","There were only three of them left.","“Hang on. We’re almost there!”","Thump!","Thump!","“Argh! I surrender! I surrender!”","Feng Wu destroyed all the small fighter jets in one go, leaving only one behind.","She kept the last one because she wanted to drive it herself.","She didn’t have time to clean up the mess. Instead, she ran toward the front line as fast as she could.."]},{"number":3968,"title":"Chapter 3968: No One Is Leaving (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3968: No One Is Leaving (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","According to Ying Yuan, everyone was fighting fiercely on the frontline.","Because of the ancient technology, the Junwu Empire was inferior to the Dongsang Kingdom, and the latter had to have taken control of the air. One could only imagine how fierce the battle would be.","At that thought, Feng Wu tightened her grip on the explosive.","Luckily, she had gone to Northern Yan before and met her sixth senior brother.","His Sixth Brother was an expert in refining weapons, and Feng Wu had only been able to make a batch of highly combustible compressed gunpowder bullets with his help.","“I hope I’ve brought enough this time...” Feng Wu thought.","Soon, Feng Wu arrived at the front line.","From afar, she could see the miserable scene through the fighter jet.","It was a battle between intermediate cultivators.","Feng Wu didn’t see the general, nor did she see any Spiritual Overlords or above. Mr Lu, Mr Xu, Elder Helian, and Elder Dongfang weren’t there","However, Feng wu spotted Feng xun and xuan Yl ngnt away!","And her familiar friends!","Feng Wu had been assigned to the same school as them, and many of her friends were of the same level. Right now, they were all fighting.","They were led by Feng Xun and Xuan Yi.","Helian Zehang, Ning Yiqiu, Senior Brother Min, Chen Ziyun, Song Yao, Yang","Wan...","Right now, they were in a very bad situation!","There were fighter jets in the air and Dongsang cultivators of the same level on the ground.","Feng Xun had been stabbed three times.","Xuan Yi was covered in blood as well.","The others were covered in blood, but they still fought with determination.","Seeing this, Feng Wu felt blood rush to her head.","She still didn’t know where Elder Helian and the others were, but it didn’t take a genius to figure out that they were fighting a difficult battle.","Feng Wu was a little anxious, but she soon calmed down.","Feng Wu had made some rough modifications to the fighter jet, and it was equipped with her specially made high-explosive compressed powder bullets.","Shoot!","Feng Wu decided that she would eliminate the fighter jets that were suppressing the Junwu Empire soldiers first.","Hence, she opened fire in mid-air!","The Dongsang Kingdom’s first fighter jet was destroyed.","What?","The fighter jets immediately realized that something wasn’t right.","But they couldn’t see Feng Wu’s fighter jet, because","Feng Wu had Little Phoenix cover her fighter plane with its stealth ability so that no one could see her.","Whoosh!","Feng Wu fired seven more times.","After that, Feng Wu changed direction and moved away from the spot.","As expected, the area where she had been standing was covered by bombs.","The Dongsang Kingdom’s fighter jets panicked.","There were 200 of them in total. Losing seven in one go wasn’t good news, but it wasn’t enough to shock them. However, the enemy was unpredictable, which frightened them the most.","“Captain, what’s going on?”","The 200 fighter jets were divided into groups of 20, making a total of 10 teams. Right now, all the leaders of the ten teams were questioning their captain.","The captain was equally dumbfounded.","While the 200 fighter jets entered the battlefield, the captain’s black one stopped a short distance away and watched the battle.","But he had no idea where that attack came from.","“Do you sense anything?” the captain asked his deputy.."]},{"number":3969,"title":"Chapter 3969: In One Go","paragraphs":["Chapter 3969: In One Go","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The captain was Guan Han, General Guan Qi’s younger brother.","His deputy was Qiyun Feng.","Qi Yunfeng frowned and shook his head. “The attack seemed to have come out of nowhere. Has the enemy taken cover?”","However, with the ancient technology of the Junwu Empire, how could they have hidden fighter jets?","“Our stealth fighter jets are still here, and we haven’t lost a single one. I don’t think they’ve been stolen,” said Qi Yunfeng.","The last time the fighter jet was stolen, the entire Dongsang Kingdom was furious. After that, the supervision became very strict.","Guan Han thought the same. “Take this stealthy fighter jet and take a detour. Be careful!”","Qi Yunfeng was an expert in observation and calculation, so he was perfect for the job.","“Yes.” Qi Yunfeng entered the stealth fighter jet right away.","Stealth fighter jets were very rare even in the Dongsang Kingdom, and there were only a handful of them on the front line.","Feng Wu had no idea that Qi Yunfeng was looking for her.","Right now, she had rushed into the circle of fighter jets and started shooting. Feng Wu knew that the fighter jets were gathering together now, but they would soon scatter, making it very difficult for her to destroy them.","Therefore...","“Whoosh!”","She destroyed seven fighter jets in one go!","She then turned in another direction and started another round of shooting. Even the people on the ground had noticed the change in the sky.","“Wait a minute!”","“What’s going on?”","“Why did their fighter jet explode all of a sudden?!”","Feng Xun suddenly thought of someone.","Feng Wu was able to turn herself invisible and had the technology of ancient times!","At that thought, he and Xuan Yi exchanged looks and both saw pleasant surprise in each other’s eyes.","They had arrived at the Peace Grassland before Feng Wu and had no idea what happened at the banquet the other day.","They had been engaged in this frantic battle ever since they arrived at the battlefield.","The upheaval in the sky had benefited the Junwu Empire greatly.","Feng Xun shouted, “It’s just a fighter jet! Why should we be afraid of it?! We have them too!","“Look! Our fighter jet can turn invisible! We caught them off guard!","“Dongsang Kingdom used to have 200 fighter jets.","“Look, 50 have fallen already!","“Hahaha! The Invincible Battle Squadron? They’re so weak!” Feng Xun’s words cheered the soldiers of the Junwu Empire up.","They had been determined to fight to the death.","“We’ll soon regain our control in the air! Guys, let’s go!” Feng Xun waved his hands and gave the order.","“Charge!”","The battle had been one-sided on the ground, but with Feng Wu’s intervention, things had changed.","The soldiers of the Junwu Empire were filled with passion.","Especially students from Imperial College and Military Academy.","Because they were still young, they had tied a red cloth around their foreheads, which made them look more fierce.","“Die!”","They ran as fast as they could, ignoring their own lives.","Intimidation was the most important thing in a battle.","The Dongsang Kingdom might be powerful, but when the soldiers of the Junwu","Empire showed no fear of death, they were terrified.","They looked up involuntarily.","Their fighter jets were still burning and exploding one after another.","In mid-air,","Qi Yunfeng had noticed the hidden fighter jet and gave the order. “All ten teams, split up into five groups, covering the center and all four directions!”","Hence, the ten groups of fighter jets no longer cared about the battle below and split up as they were told.","However, each group of fighter jets suffered losses, some more than others.","Once they were separated, if Feng Wu attacked another team, the other teams would soon notice her and outflank her.","What Qin Yunfeng didn’t know was that Feng Wu had planned everything.","Seeing this, Little Phoenix asked Feng Wu, “Kiddo, what should we do now?","They’ll soon surround you no matter which group you attack.”","Feng Wu smiled a little. “Is that so?”","Little Phoenix looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu said, “If that’s the case, let’s attack the one in the center!”","Little Phoenix stared at Feng Wu. “Have you lost your mind?!”","Feng Wu said, “Of course not.”","Little Phoenix said, “But the moment you do that, those people will attack us. That’s impossible!”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Then why don’t we take a detour around and get to that fighter jet at the center?”","Little Phoenix’s eyes lit up. “Are you sure you want to take the risk?”","Feng Wu asked Little Phoenix, “Are you scared?”","Little Phoenix immediately became competitive . “How dare you? I’m the famous Master Phoenix! Why should I be scared?!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Alright. Get the bombs ready. Let’s go!”","Hence, Feng Wu drove the fighter jet, which had been turned invisible by Little Phoenix, and slowly arrived at the team at the center.","All the fighter jets were suspending in mid-air. They kept an eye on their surroundings as they attacked the ground. Feng Wu’s fighter jet was right above them.","Boom!","High -explosive bombs were fired at the fighter jets.","It was supposed to be bait.","As soon as Feng Wu made her move, the fighter jets realized what had happened, and they scattered in all directions, trying to surround Feng Wu’s stealthy fighter jet.","However, Feng Wu had her reasons for doing that.","While all the fighter jets were rushing out, Feng Wu moved very fast and jumped into another group.","There was another round of explosions.","“It’s in the east!”","While they were shooting in the east, Feng Wu turned to the fighter jets in the south.","Boom!","All hell broke loose!","Feng Wu was able to make herself invisible, which gave her the greatest advantage.","Qi Yunfeng didn’t expect that his plan would fall apart so easily. Blue veins popped on his forehead as he bellowed, “Scatter! Now!”","Since the grouping approach wouldn’t work, the fighter jets separated and flew on their own.","At his command, the fighter jets did as they were told.","Then?","Then, they heard a loud bang!","Qi Yunfeng’s fighter jet made a loud noise before turning into a ball of fire. Qi Yunfeng was flying a stealth fighter jet, so how did he get spotted and blown up? It was a second-generation one and was much more defensive than the first-generation.","Had Qi Yunfeng’s fighter jet really been destroyed? No.","But Feng Wu had taken it.","Qi Yunfeng had been knocked out and thrown into the back seat. The exploding fighter jet was the one Feng Wu had been using.","“Wow, a second-generation fighter jet. It’s a new weapon.”","Feng Wu sat down in the second-generation fighter jet, looked at the device, and smiled a little.","It was well-hidden and powerful. Wasn’t it tailor-made for Feng Wu?","Feng Wu couldn’t stop smiling when she looked at the first-generation fighter jets a short distance away.","“Everybody, let’s see how lethal your own second-generation fighter jet is!” After familiarizing herself with the fighter jet, Feng Wu decided to start it up and let it work for the Junwu Empire.","Meanwhile, Guan Han, the captain of the fighter jet, stomped his foot.","He had lost Qi Yunfeng, his most capable assistant. To his frustration, half of the 200 fighter jets were gone.","“Find it! Find it! We must find it!” Guan Han bellowed. This time, it was his turn to give instructions.","What he didn’t know was...","Feng Wu’s target wasn’t the scattered fighter jets, but Guan Han!","If she could take down Guan Han, the Dongsang Kingdom’s morale would plummet, and the Junwu Empire would be able to turn things around.","At that thought, Feng Wu steered the second-generation fighter jet toward Guan Han at top speed!","Guan Han suddenly sensed something and stared into the distance.","There was movement!","“A stealth fighter jet?!” Guan Han’s guards were astonished.","Wasn’t Qi Yunfeng’s second-generation fighter jet destroyed? Why was it coming this way? And why was the captain the target?","The guard grabbed Guan Han and dodged to one side.","Thump, thump, thump!","Many fighter jets were attacking the second -generation stealth fighter jet.","However...","What they didn’t know was that Feng Wu was no longer in the stealth fighter jet. After setting it to autopilot and pointing it in Guan Han’s direction, she disappeared into the air.","Qi Yunfeng saw everything.","Yes, Qi Yunfeng wasn’t dead. Feng Wu had sealed his acupoints and thrown him in the back seat.","Seeing what Feng Wu was doing, Qi Yunfeng mumbled. Sweat covered his forehead, but he couldn’t make a coherent sentence, nor could he warn Guan","Han.","That was to say, it had been exposed!","What Guan Han saw was...","Sitting in the driver’s seat, Qi Yunfeng drove the fighter jet toward him.","“Qi Yunfeng, you’re not dead! “Qi Yunfeng, are you nuts?","“Qi Yunfeng, stop!”"]},{"number":3970,"title":"Chapter 3970: The Spiritual Overlord Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3970: The Spiritual Overlord Battle","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Guan Han shouted at Qi Yunfeng, but the latter didn’t stop.","Qi Yunfeng wanted to stop more than anyone else, but he couldn’t even move a finger.","“Out of the way! Everyone out of his way!”","Guan Han bellowed, “No if it’s a stealth fighter jet, why can we see it? What on earth...","However, it was too late for him to realize that.","Almost all the fighter jets had been attracted by the noise, and Guan Han was still very close to Qi Yunfeng’s jet.","Feng Wu counted. “Three, two, one!”","On the count of one, she aimed her arm at Qi Yunfeng’s fighter jet and started shooting.","Feng Wu had made preparations for this fighter jet, and she had piled up hundreds of high-explosive bombs inside.","And there was a giant keg of dynamite.","Therefore, when the fighter jet was set on fire...","Boom!","The sky exploded into flames!","The explosion went on and on!","Countless fighter jets were set on fire and exploded!","Guan Han thought he was going to lose his mind.","However, before he could react, a hand pulled him away.","He was able to stay out of the fire!","Guan Han thought it was his guard.","Because at that critical moment, only the guards would be the first to react and save him.","Guan Han suddenly saw that his guards were being blown to pieces.","So, who had dragged him away?!","Guan Han turned around abruptly, and his pupils contracted when he saw who it was.","Rumble!","The explosions went on and on!","None of the 100 fighter jets were able to get out.","They all exploded one after another.","All of them were blown up.","The battle on the ground had stopped.","They couldn’t tight anymore because the explosion was so widespread that they all ran away.","In the end, Feng Wu slowly landed on the ground with Guan Han in one hand.","“Xiao wu!”","Feng Xun was thrilled to see Feng Wu and quickly walked up to her with Xuan Yi.","Feng Wu tossed Guan Han to Feng Xun. “Tie up the captain of the Dongsang Kingdom’s fighter jet squadron.”","“Great!” Feng Xun was elated. He then tied up Captain Guan Han and handed him to his men.","Meanwhile, many people were staring at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Before they could say anything, Feng Wu said, “What are you waiting for? Aren’t you going to kill the enemies?","As a Spiritual Overlords, Feng Wu couldn’t do anything. Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were already Spiritual Overlords, so they couldn’t take part in the intermediate battlefield, but the others could.","Now that the Dongsang Kingdom’s air power had been destroyed, they were at their weakest.","As expected, Feng Wu’s voice woke everyone up.","“Die!” Feng Xun was the first to shout.","“Charge!”","“Die!”","“With Master Feng Wu here, we’re not afraid at all! Let’s go!”","Feng Wu had destroyed all 200 fighter jets with a single strike. That wasn’t just a rumor but something that had happened right under everyone’s noses!","The shocking news greatly motivated the Junwu Empire, but it also greatly demoralized the Dongsang Kingdom.","Therefore, when the Junwu Empire charged at them, the soldiers of the Dongsang Kingdom fell back. In the end, they all fled.","Their leader this time was Young General Jinge.","The Dongsang army was being chased.","Jinge turned around and glared at Feng Wu. The look in his eyes reminded one of a venomous snake.","“Young General, run!”","Shi Haoqing, Jinge’s deputy, grabbed him and quickly led him away from the battlefield.","Thousands of people had been sent here to kill all the school-level cultivators of the Junwu Empire, but things had turned around.","And they were still chasing the soldiers of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Jinge was furious.","Shi Haoqing pushed him forward. “Young General, where there’s life, there’s hope. Let’s go!”","In the end, they left with a few hundred people.","“Don’t chase them!”","Only then did Feng Xun stop his people.","They were so excited that they almost collapsed on the ground when they stopped.","What a crazy day!","Everyone turned around and stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Among them were Feng Wu’s friends, such as Helian Zehang, Ning Yiqiu, Senior Brother Min, Song Yao, Yang Wan, and so on.","And Yan Han, who didn’t like Feng Wu before...","Everyone stared at her in astonishment and disbelief.","But no one dared to talk to Feng Wu. It was as if she was a god that was on a completely different level from them.","It took Yang Wan a while to realize who it was. “You really are Feng Wu, aren’t","you?”","The others all stared at Feng Wu.","Yan Han also stared at Feng Wu and clenched her fists.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Yang Wan. ‘What do you mean by that? If I’m not Feng Wu, am I Yang Wu?”","“Teehee...","Yang Wan chuckled.","That smile immediately dispelled most of the estrangement between them because of their cultivation levels.","“You’re amazing! How did you become so capable? You weren’t like this the last time I saw you!” Yang Wan had been on Feng Wu’s team before and had been taken care of by Feng Wu, so Feng Wu had left a good impression on Yang Wan.","Once Yang Wan started, the others moved closer to talk to Feng Wu as well.","“You destroyed 200 fighter jets all by yourself!”","“And you’ve taken the captain of the enemy’s fighter jet alive!”","Everyone was astonished.","Just then, Feng Wu’s eyebrows twitched, for she sensed a formidable power exploding in the distance and spreading out in all directions. Although it was a little far away, Feng Wu could still sense it.","“Over there...” Feng Wu looked in that direction.","“What?!” Feng Xun smacked his forehead. “How could I have forgotten about such an important thing?! The Spiritual Overlords are fighting over there!”","Spiritual Overlords?","That was to say, Elder Dongfang and the others were over there.","Feng Wu said, “Stay here. I’ll go have a look.”","Feng Wu left before she could finish her sentence. The next second, she was out of sight.","“Hey, wait for me.” After instructing Helian Zehang to guard the area, Feng Xun quickly followed Feng Wu.","Xuan Yi went with him.","Yan Han suddenly asked, “What level is Feng Wu now?”","Everyone’s stomach lurched. That was right. What level was Feng Wu now?","She had single-handedly destroyed 200 fighter jets. Exactly how capable was she?","Helian Zehang shook his head. “I don’t Imow. She’s at least a Spiritual","Overlord. ”","The others nodded as well. She had to be a Spiritual Overlord.","“I think even if she’s a Spiritual Overlord, she’s only a junior one. She can’t be more than a Level 3 Spiritual Overlord...” said Yan Han.","She didn’t want to admit how capable Feng Wu was because she considered Feng Wu to be her enemy. If Feng Wu was really that capable, it would make her look like a failure.","However, Guan Han smirked.","“A Level-3 Spiritual Overlord? I’m a Level-7 Spiritual Overlord, and she could pick me up so easily!”","“Yan Han, where are you going?!” Helian Zehang stopped her when he saw that she was leaving.","Yan Han said, “I’ll go help them!”","“Stop right there! Come back!”","However, no matter how loudly Helian Zehang yelled, Yan Han wouldn’t stop. She ran as fast as a rabbit.","Helian Zehang knew that the girl from Grand Secretary Yan’s family was a troublemaker. That was the battlefield of the Spiritual Overlords. What was she doing there?","“Keep an eye on him! I’ll be right back!”","Henan Lenang ran arter ner.","By the time Yan Han and Helian Zehang arrived, Feng Wu had joined the battle.","Helian Zehang and Yan Han were on a slope, but the battlefield was in the valley.","The sound of fighting went on in the valley.","There were at least 50 Spiritual Overlords in the Junwu Empire, and the two schools had given all they could.","The Dongsang Kingdom had also sent 60 Spiritual Overlords.","The situation was very dire.","It was obvious that the Junwu Empire was losing ground.","“Zehang, what should we do? They’re losing ground, and my grandpa is in danger!” Yan Han’s eyes were filled with tears.","Helian Zehang wanted to join the fight as well, but he was too weak. He hadn’t become a Spiritual Overlord yet, and he would be annihilated before he could join the fight.","Despite his anxiety, he still tried to comfort Yan Han. “Don’t worry. We’re going to win!”","As a matter of fact, the Junwu Empire was at a disadvantage when Feng Wu arrived.","Things only improved a little after Feng Wu joined the battle.","“Feng Wu has joined the battle!” Yan Han gritted her teeth. “She’s so weak. I don’t think she’ll survive this!”","Yan Han didn’t know if she wanted Feng Wu dead or not...","“I think it’ll be a pity if she’s dead,” said Yan Han.","Helian Zehang said, “No, she’s not going to die. She’s very capable. You’ve seen how capable she is. I’m sure she won’t...’","“Gosh! What’s Feng Wu doing? She’s heading for my grandfather!” Seeing that Feng Wu was moving toward Elder Yan, Yan Han almost jumped to her feet. “My grandfather is having a hard time fighting two Spiritual Overlords all by himself, and he’s been stabbed several times. Why is Feng Wu still going? She has two Spiritual Overlords with her!”","Yan Han said angrily, “I see! Feng Wu is no match for the people behind her, so she’s going to lure them to my grandfather. She’s trying to set him up!","“How could Feng Wu do that?! How could she?!” Yan Han’s eyes went bloodshot red. “I hate her!”","However, the next second!","Something unbelievable happened.","Elder Yan couldn’t withstand two Spiritual Overlords, so he stumbled and fell to the ground.."]},{"number":3971,"title":"Chapter 3971: Confrontation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3971: Confrontation","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Spiritual Overlords of the Dongsang Kingdom grinned maliciously.","They each held a machete.","One aimed at Elder Yan’s neck and the other at his throat.","The blades were going to fall.","Yan Han screamed.","Her grandfather was going to die!","However, Feng Wu arrived at that critical moment.","No one saw what Feng Wu did, but she moved as fast as a streak of lightning and caught the two Spiritual Overlords with both hands. Yes, she was holding a Spiritual Overlord in each hand.","Feng Wu bumped their heads together.","There was a loud thump.","Their heads cracked open like two watermelons, and their brains were all over the ground...","Feng Wu tossed the two bodies aside and asked Elder Yan, “Are you alright?” Elder Yan wasn’t badly injured, but he was shocked by what Feng Wu did.","“You, you...","“Are you really Feng Wu?!”","Elder Yan recognized the face, but he couldn’t believe his eyes.","“Behind you!”","Elder Yan didn’t have time to give her more hints.","Two more Spiritual Overlords charged at Feng Wu from behind.","Elder Yan was going to help Feng Wu when Feng Wu turned around and kicked one of them to the ground. She then swiped her dagger across the air.","The poor Spiritual Overlord’s throat was cut open.","Blood gushed out!","His eyes widened, but he couldn’t close them.","A short distance away on a slope, Yan Han watched with wide-open eyes. She covered her mouth with both hands, fearing that she would scream if she didn’t do something.","“That...” Yan Han turned around and stared at Helian Zehang. “Is that real? Am I seeing things? Can you see it?”","Helian Zehang nodded in excitement. “It’s true! It’s true! Feng Wu... Oh god, Feng wu!”","Helian Zehang was so excited that he wanted to scream.","Elder Yan was equally excited.","Elder Yan was already a Level-7 Spiritual Overlord, which made him one of the top cultivators in the Peace Grassland.","However...","What did he see?","He watched as Feng Wu killed four Spiritual Overlords in a row.","Four!","And they weren’t junior Spiritual Overlords. They were at least intermediate Spiritual Overlords!","Elder Yan wouldn’t have found it so hard to believe if Feng Wu had demonstrated such capability when he first met her. However, she was only a Spiritual King when he first met her...","And she wasn’t even a peak Spiritual King back then.","“You... you...”","Elder Yan opened his mouth twice but still couldn’t finish the sentence.","That was incredible!","Was she even human?","After taking care of the four Spiritual Overlords, Feng Wu turned to Elder Yan, tossed him a Semi-divine pill, and said, “Recuperate first. Join the fight after you’re fully recovered.”","After that, Feng Wu quickly joined the battle with her Fallen Star Sword over her shoulder.","Elder Yan’s stomach lurched when he saw the pill.","How extravagant!","However, with the girl’s capability, she should be using such pills.","What level was the girl now?","Elder Yan watched in trepidation as Feng Wu rushed into the circle, holding a sword in her left hand and a strange arm in her right. She killed a Spiritual Overlord with a pinch of her fingers.","At first, the elders fought on their own, so they didn’t pay much attention to what was going on around them.","But soon, they realized that the pressure on them seemed to have been lifted.","The battles had been one-on-two or two-on-two, but they soon became one-on-one.","What was going on?","Shouldn’t the pressure be getting bigger and bigger? Why...","Elder Dongfang took a look and was shocked.","She saw a familiar figure flitting across the battlefield.","It was none other than Feng Wu herself!","Elder Dongfang grew anxious.","Although she had been giving Feng Wu a hard time before, she still admired Feng Wu’s medical skills from the bottom of her heart. Therefore, she shouted at Feng Wu, “Are you supposed to be here? Leave now!”","Elder Dongfang thought, “His Royal Highness will be furious if he hears about this!”","However, not only wouldn’t Feng Wu leave, but she was also moving toward Elder Dongfang.","Elder Dongfang grew anxious and kept giving Feng Wu warning glances, telling her to get lost!","But it didn’t work. The girl moved even faster!","Dongfang Ziyun had a formidable enemy. She was a peak Spiritual Overlord now, which meant that her opponent was also a peak Spiritual Overlord.","Between masters, the tiniest mistake could determine the winner.","Elder Dongfang was at a disadvantage when she shifted her attention to Feng wu.","A blade pierced her shoulder.","It went right through.","Elder Dongfang’s hand trembled in pain.","Elder Dongfang was the leader of the Spiritual Overlords of the Junwu Empire. If she lost, only a handful of them would survive.","Elder Dongfang grew anxious.","However, the more anxious she was, the more chance her opponent had.","The leader of the Dongsang Kingdom’s Spiritual Overlords was Hua Xuebing, who was Elder Dongfang’s opponent.","Hua Xuebing stared at Elder Dongfang and smirked. “How dare you be careless in a battle against me? Don’t blame me if you die!","“But do you know how many people will be incriminated if you die? “I’m warning you. None of your men will be able to escape today!”","Hua Xuebing didn’t just stand there.","She struck out as soon as she spoke.","Elder Dongfang knew that she wouldn’t be able to withstand the strike, so he took a step back and turned to run.","However, Feng Wu moved forward when Elder Dongfang was about to run away.","Dongfang Ziyun was about to take Feng Wu with her and throw her out of the range of the attack.","She tried to grab Feng Wu, but she missed.","How was that even possible?!","Dongfang Ziyun was dumbfounded. How...","When she turned around, her heart almost jumped out of her mouth!","She saw Feng Wu was within Hua Bingxue’s reach.","“You idiot!”","Elder Dongfang was so frightened that she almost fainted.","She saw the smirk on Hua Bingxue’s face.","Hua Bingxue looked at Feng Wu as if she were an ant.","Elder Dongfang was sure that Hua Bingxue would severely injure Feng Wu.","Even so, Elder Dongfang was still going to help Feng Wu. However, the moment she was about to move in...","Feng Wu’s strange arm was aimed at Hua Bingxue’s neck.","Elder Dongfang was amazed.","That was preposterous! Who did she think she was? She couldn’t possibly hit her target! Hua Bingxue was a peak Spiritual Overlord!","However, to her surprise...","Hua Bingxue stared at the girl in disbelief.","But she reacted quickly and struck down Feng Wu with her sword.","They brushed past each other, but Feng Wu wasn’t injured. Hua Bingxue’s throat, on the other hand, was bubbling with blood.","Elder Dongfang was speechless.","She looked at Feng Wu and Hua Bingxue as if she was looking at a fairy.","Yes, Feng Wu was fighting Hua Bingxue!","Dongfang Ziyun was about to step out to help when Feng Wu said, “Elder","Dongfang, please help the others. I can take care of her myself!”","Hua Bingxue was so angry that she laughed. “How arrogant!”","Feng Wu asked, “Does it hurt?”","Hua Bingxue was astonished.","Feng Wu taunted her. The next second, she attacked again.","Right now, Feng Wu was rampaging around like a bull, but she was frighteningly capable.","Thump, thump, thump!","Both of them went on attacking.","To Elder Dongfang’s astonishment, Feng Wu and Hua Bingxue were evenly matched.","Elder Dongfang almost dropped to her knees.","Who was Hua Bingxue?","She was the leader of the Dongsang Kingdom and the most capable cultivator at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage.","However...","Feng wu...","“Am I seeing things?”","Elder Dongfang rubbed her eyes.","However, no matter how hard she rubbed, the image didn’t disappear. Feng Wu was still fighting Hua Bingxue, and by the look of it, Feng Wu had gained the upper hand.","Elder Dongfang thought she was going to lose her mind.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at her. “Go help the others!”","Only then did Elder Dongfang realize that Feng Wu was only a junior. Why did she listen to that girl?","She decided to let it drop for now.","As soon as Elder Dongfang left, Feng Wu smiled at Hua Bingxue.","Hua Bingxue narrowed her eyes and looked alarmed. “Why are you smiling?”","Feng Wu said, “I didn’t want to scare Elder Dongfang, so I held back. Now that she’s gone, I’ll let you see my true capability.”","Hua Bingxue smirked and couldn’t be bothered to talk to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled. “You probably don’t know me yet. Remember my name because that’s the name of the person who’s going to kill you!”","Hua Bingxue smirked. “How arrogant!”","However, as soon as Hua Bingxue said those words, Feng Wu lashed out at her.","Feng Wu was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, and she was supposed to be below the Spiritual Saint stage.","Therefore, when she put her mind to it, even Hua Bingxue, a veteran at the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage, wasn’t her match.","She drew out her Fallen Star Sword as well as the arm of discipline.","Hua Bingxue dodged the Fallen Star Sword but not the dagger hidden in the arm.","The blade slid across Hua Bingxue’s throat.","Instantly, her artery was cut open.","The bloodshot three meters into the air.."]},{"number":3972,"title":"Chapter 3972: The Girl in Red (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3972: The Girl in Red (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hua Bingxue’s bloodshot three meters into the air.","Covering her throat, she stared at Feng Wu but couldn’t utter a word.","Just then, Feng Wu drew back her sword, glanced at her, and asked the Elder","Dongfang family, “Do we need to take the head back with us?”","Elder Dongfang was fighting a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord. The man wasn’t as capable as Elder Dongfang, but Elder Dongfang wanted to finish the battle as soon as possible so that she could help Feng Wu. She was too hasty, so the man took advantage of the opportunity and cut her arm open.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She glanced at Elder Dongfang. The next second, she moved closer and cut the","Level-9 Spiritual Overlord’s head off with her Fallen Star Sword.","Elder Dongfang looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked back at her. “You can’t even kill a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord","Elder Dongfang said, “It’s not... Where’s Hua Bingxue?”","Elder Dongfang looked behind Feng Wu and saw Hua Bingxue fall to the ground. She then looked at the Level-9 Spiritual Overlord behind Feng Wu and fell silent.","If Feng Wu had been lucky, it couldn’t have been luck that helped her to kill Hua Bingxue and a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord!","“Since when are you so capable?” Elder Dongfang’s heart was pounding.","She remembered clearly that when Feng Wu left the Peace Grassland a few months ago, she wasn’t even a Spiritual Overlord, was she? Was she a peak Spiritual King back then?","But a few months later, she was already better than Elder Dongfang, who was a peak Spiritual Overlord!","Feng Wu smiled. “Shall we defeat the Dongsang Kingdom first?”","Elder Dongfang came back to herself and said, “Let’s do it!”","Feng Wu said, “Let’s see who can kill the most!”","Before Elder Dongfang could say anything, Feng Wu charged into the battlefield.","If a peak-level Spiritual Overlord charged into the battlefield, the other Spiritual Overlords would be as helpless as chickens.","Before Elder Dongfang could react, Feng Wu had killed three people.","Dongfang Ziyun rushed into the crowd as well.","With the addition of the two peak Spiritual Overlords, the Junwu Empire was soon able to turn things around.","In less than five minutes, there were only 30 Dongsang Spiritual Overlords left.","With Hua Bingxue dead, Yang Hong, the deputy, saw what was going on.","The girl in the red dress charged into the crowd and killed them one at a time.","It was unbelievable!","Who was she?","But Yang Hong couldn’t care less about that now because the Dongsang Kingdom only had 30 Spiritual Overlords left.","He was the first to run away.","“Stay!”","Seeing that the man was running away, Feng Wu tried to stop him.","Needless to say, this person had to be very influential!","However, Yang Hong was prepared. He grabbed a person next to him and threw them at Feng Wu.","The person he had caught was a Spiritual Overlord from the Junwu Empire.","Feng Wu couldn’t kill that Spiritual Overlord, so she had to catch him and put him down. When she looked up again, Yang Hong was nowhere to be found.."]},{"number":3973,"title":"Chapter 3973: The Girl in Red (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3973: The Girl in Red (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yang Hong ran very fast, but the Spiritual Overlords of the Dongsang Kingdom were in trouble.","When the battle ended, only seven of them managed to escape.","“Seven of them got away. What a pity.” Resting her hands on her waist, Feng Wu sighed.","Elder Dongfang gave Feng Wu a strange look.","The other elders also gave Feng Wu indescribable looks.","Elder Dongfang said quietly, “Don’t you know?”","Feng Wu was confused. “What?”","Elder Dongfang said, “We were at a disadvantage before you came. Seven of us might be able to escape, and we would have been defeated because they had ten more Spiritual Overlords.","“But you’re here. Things have turned around, and they’re the ones running away.”","The other elders all nodded. Elder Yan said, “You...","Elder Yan almost wanted to call Feng Wu “naughty girl”, but he soon realized that he couldn’t do that anymore. She was even more capable than Elder Dongfang now.","Elder Yan corrected himself right away. “Master Feng Wu, why are you so capable now?”","The other elders asked one after another.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I just cultivated as I usually did.”","While Feng Wu was talking to the elders, Helian Zehang and Yan Han looked at each other.","Both of them were dumbfounded and didn’t know what to say.","Helian Zehang was the first to react. He told Yan Han, “Let’s get out of here. If the elders find out, we’ll be severely punished.”","Yan Han stood there dazed until Helian Zehang dragged her down the slope.","It took her a while to come back to herself.","“Do you think we’re seeing things? Is it all an illusion?” Yan Han looked at","Helian Zehang.","Helian Zehang didn’t know what to say. Yan Han said, ‘Maybe it wasn’t Feng Wu.”","Helian Zehang looked at her in resignation.","Yan Han was almost in tears. “I don’t believe it! I can’t believe it! She was a Spiritual King! She...”","They weren’t that far mart. but why was Feng Wu stronger than her","grandfather all of a sudden? She was even stronger than Elder Dongfang!","Helian Zehang patted Yan Han on the shoulder and sighed. “Get over it. Don’t let your imagination run wild.”","Helian Zehang found it unbelievable as well, but in the end, he convinced himself and accepted the fact that had shocked him.","He and Yan Han had thought that Feng Wu was only a junior Spiritual Overlord. That was hilarious.","After they left, Feng Wu went on talking to the elders.","“By the way, where are Mr Lu and the others?” Feng Wu asked.","“They’ve gone to the Spiritual Saint Battlefield!” Elder Dongfang looked concerned. “The general has been injured. I wonder what’s going to happen.” She looked worried, and so were the other elders.","Hearing that, Feng Wu turned to leave, but Elder Dongfang stopped her. “Wait!” Feng Wu looked over her shoulder in bewilderment.","Elder Dongfang frowned. “That’s the battlefield of Spiritual Saints. You can’t go there.”","The battlefield of Spiritual Saints...","Feng Wu gritted her teeth. “No matter what, I have to try.. What if they get ambushed? That was what happened last time!”"]},{"number":3974,"title":"Chapter 3974: The Girl in Red (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3974: The Girl in Red (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“But you’re not powerful enough yet.” Elder Dongfang grabbed Feng Wu’s arm.","“You can’t go to the other dimension.”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “The other dimension?”","Elder Dongfang said, “That’s right. The battlefield of Spiritual Saints has to be in a different dimension, not a physical plane like ours.","“Because once the war breaks out, the Peace Grassland won’t be able to withstand their full power. It’ll sink right away.”","Dongfang Ziyun said solemnly, “Therefore, you won’t be able to go. Even if you’re strong enough, you won’t be able to break the wall before you reach the Spiritual Saint stage.”","Feng Wu took a deep breath. “How do I get in, then?”","Elder Dongfang said, “There’s nothing we can do.”","Feng Wu frowned.","Just then, Elder Yan said, “There’s a way. If a Spiritual Saint takes you in, you can go in.”","Elder Dongfang threw a dirty look at Elder Yan. “What are you talking about? There are no Spiritual Saints left. All the Spiritual Saints on our side have gone in. ”","Elder Yan sighed. Judging by Feng Wu’s performance, she might really be as strong as a Level-I Spiritual Saint. If they had one more Spiritual Saint on their side now, they might be able to turn things around.","“I was delusional.” Elder Yan smiled bitterly.","Just then, Feng Wu’s eyes lit up, and she stared at Elder Dongfang.","Dongfang Ziyun was confused. ‘W- What are you doing?","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “Even Elder Helian is a Spiritual Saint now, but you’re still a peak Spiritual Overlord. Don’t you feel indignant?” Elder Dongfang was furious. Why did she have to bring it up?","However, before Elder Dongfang could hit her, Feng Wu said, “Do you remember how Elder Helian became a Spiritual Saint?”","Elder Dongfang snorted. “If you hadn’t given him the Three Transformation","Liquid, would he have been able to make a breakthrough?”","Feng Wu smiled. “What if I give you the Three Transformation Liquid as well?”","Elder Dongfang glanced at Feng Wu. “Do you know how much Three Transformation Liquid you need to become a Spiritual Saint? You’ll need at least a vat of it. Aren’t you already..","Before Elder Dongfang could finish, a big water bucket fell on the ground.","Dongfang Ziyun’s eyes widened when he smelled it.","It was the taste she had been dreaming of!","As expected, many elders gave her envious looks.","It was the Three Transformation Liquid of All Life.","Back then, all the elders of Imperial College had the chance to cultivate with the Three Transformation Liquid, but not the elders of the Military Academy.","Elder Dongfang stared at Feng Wu in amazement. “You!”","Feng Wu said, “Just tell me if you can do it or not.” Elder Dongfang knew what Feng Wu meant.","Would she be able to rise to the Spiritual Saint stage?","“Yes!” Elder Dongfang smacked her thigh, and her eyes had never looked so resolute. “I can do it!”","Feng Wu said, “Let’s get on with it, then. Use the time to cultivate. If we’re late, the battle will be over by then.”","Elder Dongfang asked curiously, “What about you?”"]},{"number":3975,"title":"Chapter 3975: Dongfang Cangjiang","paragraphs":["Chapter 3975: Dongfang Cangjiang","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu shook her head. “I don’t need the liquid to raise my cultivation level.”","She couldn’t even if she wanted to.","Because of the rapid progress in her cultivation, her foundation was already a little shaky. Although the pills she had obtained from Patriarch Huyan had greatly improved her physical fitness, she couldn’t make any more progress in the short term.","Elder Dongfang nodded solemnly, then jumped into the large bucket.","Time was of the essence here, and she didn’t have much time to think about it.","The elders envied Elder Dongfang, and their impression of Feng Wu improved as well.","Although they didn’t know if Elder Dongfang would succeed...","If she succeeded, it would mean that Feng Wu had a shortcut to rise from the Spiritual Overlord stage to the Spiritual Saint stage. If that was the case, she would be even more important!","Elder Yan and the other elders who had interacted with Feng Wu before all looked at one another and thought that they would have to get closer to Feng wu.","Seeing that the other elders had nothing better to do, Feng Wu took out the rest of the liquid and told them, “That’s all I have left. Please share it among yourselves.”","All the elders of Imperial College had received the Three Transformation Liquid before, so it was useless to them.","The elders of the Military Academy had been longing for the Three","Transformation Liquid for so long that they thought they would never get it.","However. Feng WII took the lianid Oilt and shared it with them- The elders were","so touched that they almost burst into tears.","Feng Wu told Elder Yan to distribute the liquid while she sat down by the bucket where Elder Dongfang was. She watched over the elder as she repaired her body.","She couldn’t stand the looks of gratitude from other people.","Time ticked by.","Elders kept making breakthroughs.","Some rose from junior Spiritual Overlord to intermediate Spiritual Overlord, some from intermediate to advanced ones, and some even reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage. The elders looked at Feng Wu as if she was a god.","The elders used to be so arrogant, but now, they were so grateful to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu had no idea of any of this. Right now, all her attention was on Elder Dongfang, and she prayed in her head that she wouldn’t fail.","The longer it took, the more worried Feng Wu became.","Suddenly, there was a thump.","The impact sent a shockwave through the water, and the porcelain bucket shattered.","Sensing the shockwave, Feng Wu immediately backed away.","The moment Feng Wu stepped back, the bucket exploded, and Elder Dongfang stood there with a stern look on her face.","She was much more intimidating than before.","“Elder Dongfang?”","Feng Wu cried out in surprise.","She immediately realized that Elder Dongfang had succeeded.","Elder Dongfang turned around and nodded at Feng Wu.","It was the aura of a Spiritual Saint.","“Thank you.” After the arrogant look disappeared from Elder Dongfang’s face, she finally smiled and cupped her fists at Feng Wu.. “Little Feng Wu, I, Dongfang Cangjiang owe you a big favor!”"]},{"number":3976,"title":"Chapter 3976: The Spiritual Saint Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 3976: The Spiritual Saint Battlefield","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Only then did Feng Wu realize that Elder Dongfang’s real name was Dongfang Cangjiang. What a masculine name.","“Let’s go.” With a wave of his hand, Elder Dongfang led Feng Wu away.","“Sure.”","Feng Wu followed Elder Dongfang and saw her tear the space open with her bare hands. The two of them went in together.","This was Feng Wu’s first time in a different space.","As soon as she walked in, Feng Wu felt a gust of wind blowing at her.","There were countless wind blades in the wind, each as sharp as a blade. If one wasn’t careful, they would be cut open and bleed profusely.","A golden shield appeared around Elder Dongfang, blocking out all the wind.","Elder Dongfang was a little worried about Feng Wu. After all, Feng Wu hadn’t reached the Spiritual Saint stage yet, and she probably wouldn’t be able to withstand the wind. She decided to protect Feng Wu. Although it would affect her capability, Feng Wu’s safety was the most important thing.","When Elder Dongfang turned around to look for Feng Wu and tried to put her golden shield on the latter, she was surprised by something.","She stood ramrod straight and looked completely unaffected.","Elder Dongfang noticed the scale armor on Feng Wu.","The armor was in the shape of a Qilin. Not only did it protect her head, torso, and all four limbs, but it also covered her head, and only her eyes could be seen.","Elder Dongfang asked, “What’s this?”","Feng Wu’s voice came out of the armor. “Don’t worry. I can protect myself. The wind won’t do anything to me.” Of course, it wouldn’t.","Feng Wu was wearing the Qilin Armor.","It was the Qilin Armor her fifth senior brother gave her.","It used to be a divine weapon, but for some special reason, it was turned into a semi-divine weapon.","However, even a Semi-divine weapon was enough to drive people crazy.","Elder Dongfang gave Feng Wu a strange look, wondering why the girl had such a formidable defensive semi-divine weapon. However, with the armor, Feng","Wu wasn’t afraid of the wind anymore.","“Let’s go.”","Elder Dongfang immediately took Feng Wu to the Spiritual Saint battlefield.","A battle was taking place.","The Junwu Empire had four capable cultivators.","General Feng Xiangnan.","Mr xu.","Elder Helian.","The Dongsang Kingdom had five capable cultivators.","Xue Zhibei.","Left Emissary Wang.","Right Emissary Zhao.","Lord Jing, a brother of the Dongsang King and Night Owl’s uncle.","And one of Yan Ling’s guards Feng Wu had met in the Junwu Empire, and he was a peak Spiritual Saint.","If the Dongsang Kingdom only had the first four cultivators, the Junwu Empire would still stand a chance. However, with the addition of a peak Spiritual Saint, the battle was doomed.","Feng Xiangnan was at a disadvantage against Xue Zhibei.","It was a tie between Mr. Xu and Wang, between Mr. Lu and Zhao, and between Elder Helian and Lord Jing.","However, the peak Spiritual Saint was watching the battle with a sword between his crossed arms.","Ma Quanquan was ready to join the battle and kill the Junwu Empire’s cultivators at any moment.","As a matter of fact, he was about to start.","He walked up to Lord Jing and said indifferently, “Go get some rest.”","Lord Jing was a prominent figure in the Dongsang Kingdom, but he was very polite to Ma Quanquan and didn’t dare to say no.","That was because..."]},{"number":3977,"title":"Chapter 3977: It’s You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3977: It’s You","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Yes, master.” Lord Jing stepped aside respectfully.","Elder Helian’s stomach lurched.","“Master?”","Lord Jing’s master was this unfathomable master?!","Elder Helian didn’t know how capable Ma Quanquan was, but he could sense how formidable he was.","As expected, Elder Helian stumbled back when Ma Quanquan stood in front of him.","Ma Quanquan struck out without hesitation.","Instantly, the spiritual essence around Elder Helian became chaotic, and the air contorted, revealing his ferocious side.","“Die!”","Ma Quanquan punched out.","A murderous energy filled the air!","A short distance away, Feng Xiangnan, who was fighting Xue Zhibei, looked over his shoulder and was astonished. “Helian, fall back!” Feng Xiangnan bellowed.","But it was too late.","Elder Helian had thought that he could move away, but Ma Quanquan made him feel like a cumbersome child. He tried to walk away, but his legs seemed to be stuck to the ground.","Until— Thump!","There was a loud bang!","Elder Helian was pushed away.","Blood gushed out of Elder Helian’s mouth, and he flew backward like an arrow!","Behind him, the air seemed to freeze, and cracks appeared on it.","Thump!","Elder Helian landed on the ground.","The moment he hit the ground, Elder Helian felt numb, and his head went blank. He thought he was dead.","“Helian!” Feng Xiangnan kept looking in their direction.","However, Xue Zhibei was his equal, and he wasn’t injured.","“Go keep him company!” Xue Zhibei struck down at Feng Xiangnan’s throat.","Feng Xiangnan tilted his head to dodge, but the blade cut a long gash on his chest.","The wound was so deep that one could see the bone.","It was obvious that Feng Xiangnan was in an even more difficult situation.","Xue Zhibei swiped his sword across the air, and Feng Xiangnan was hit in the right arm again. Blood gushed out!","When Feng Xiangnan finally steadied himself, Xue Zhibei took the opportunity to strike out again!","The sword energy was fierce!","Thousands of swords seemed to fill the air.","An invisible shock wave rushed toward Feng Xiangnan!","The sword energy erupted like an erupting volcano, and dark clouds gathered in the sky.","A streak of sword energy slashed down at Feng Xiangnan!","His right arm was cut off!","Xue Zhibei glared at Feng Xiangnan. “We’ve been at each other’s throats for over a decade. Let’s fight to the death!”","He was in grave danger!","Feng Xiangnan’s heart sank.","He had no regrets about his impending death, but what pained him was that if he died, Nest Castle would fall. Would the Dongsang Kingdom take the Junwu Empire again?","Was the humiliating battle fourteen years ago going to happen again?","“Die!” Xue Zhibei raised his sword.","That was what Feng Wu saw when she arrived.","Elder Helian’s life was hanging in the balance, and so was General Feng!","“Stop!”","Feng Wu bellowed.","Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","Xue Zhibei and Ma Quanquan stopped fighting involuntarily and looked at Feng Wu.","‘You?”","Ma Quanquan immediately recognized the girl who had defeated his princess at the banquet.","Xue Zhibei also recognized Feng Wu.."]},{"number":3978,"title":"Chapter 3978: The Most Amazing Person (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3978: The Most Amazing Person (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu found it strange.","She was already wearing the Qilin Armor. Apart from her eyes, the rest of her body was hidden. How could these people recognize her?","What she didn’t know was that these capable cultivators didn’t just recognize a person by their appearance, but by their aura as well.","But Feng Wu couldn’t care less about that now. She stared at Xue Zhibei and said, “Stop!”","“And you, stop it, too!” Feng Wu said firmly.","Ma Quanquan frowned. Because of Princess Yan Ling, he felt that the girl seemed to be hiding a big secret.","Xue Zhibei looked at Feng Wu and smirked. “Young lady, you’re not supposed to be here. I won’t kill you just yet. You can go now.”","Feng Xiangnan glared at Feng Wu and shot her a warning glance. “Leave now!” She shouldn’t be here! What was she doing here? Bring Jun Linyuan here!","Feng Wu knew perfectly well what her godfather meant. If Jun Linyuan could come here, he would have done so already... He was in a critical moment like this, and he couldn’t just walk out of his seclusion. Feng Wu shook her head at Feng Xiangnan.","Feng Xiangnan lost all hope.","Jun Linyuan couldn’t come? If that was the case, they didn’t stand any chance at all.","Since Jun Linyuan couldn’t come...","“Leave! Leave now!” Feng Xiangnan said angrily. “Go tell His Majesty to get ready for war!”","Xue Zhibei laughed. “Feng Xiangnan, I never thought I would hear you sound so anxious.”","Feng Xiangnan glared at Xue Zhibei. Xue Zhibei shook his head. “Let’s end it.’","After that, he struck out.","At that critical moment, Feng Wu stepped out and blocked Feng Xiangnan’s way.","Clang!","There was the cold sound of clashing weapons.","Everyone looked in their direction.","Xue Zhibei’s sword hit Feng Wu, and the metal clashed. Feng Wu took three steps back to offset the pressure.","“Xiao wu?”","Feng Xiangnan blanched. Dragging Feng Wu to his side, he looked her up and down. “Kiddo, why did you do that? Do you want to die? Are you alright?!” Xue Zhibei’s strike almost knocked Feng Wu out.","Judging by her appearance, she looked alright because most of the attack power was offset by the armor. However, Xue Zhibei was much more capable than Feng Wu, and the impact from the armor had shaken Feng Wu’s internal organs.","Feng Wu almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","She only realized what had happened when Feng Xiangnan grabbed her arm.","“What?”","Feng Wu realized she could move.","That wasn’t the most important thing. She noticed something incredible.","She realized that the spiritual essence Xue Zhibei exerted on the armor had been transferred to her in a mild way.","Moreover, it had reached her dantian through her limbs.","Feng Wu was astonished.","She had never expected that the armor could have such a nice function.","“No, it can’t be!” Feng Wu murmured in surprise.","However, when she examined it again, she realized that the spiritual essence could still gather and get used in attacks after it entered her dantian. Feng Wu was thrilled!","That was to say, she could use the armor as a hub..."]},{"number":3979,"title":"Chapter 3979: The Most Amazing Person (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3979: The Most Amazing Person (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","That was to say, she could use the armor to absorb the opponent’s spiritual essence before attacking them.","That was the best news!","Just then, Xue Zhibei attacked again.","Feng Wu pushed Feng Xiangnan away and ran up to Xue Zhibei.","Xue Zhibei looked surprised, but he soon realized that Feng Wu was trying to trick him.","The girl seemed to be at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage. She shouldn’t be able to withstand his lethal strike!","This time, Xue Zhibei made another strike.","The fluctuation of the space in front of him smashed into Feng Wu, throwing her out of the way.","After Feng Wu and Xue Zhibei started fighting, the others stopped fighting and were all watching them.","Feng Wu flew backward. The Qilin Armor had withstood 90% of the attack, but","the remaining 10% was enough to give Feng Wu a headache.","Cough.","Blood rushed to Feng Wu’s head, and she tasted blood in her throat.","Xue Zhibei smirked and ignored Feng Wu. When he was going to attack the others again, Feng Wu stumbled back to her feet.","“Xue... Zhibei, is that all you can do?!” Feng Wu’s voice was full of provocation.","Xue Zhibei was speechless.","He turned around and looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","He had used all his power in two strikes, but the girl still hadn’t been defeated. Wasn’t she a peak Spiritual Overlord?","Wearing the scaled armor, Feng Wu slowly walked up to Xue Zhibei and smirked. “You can’t kill me!”","Xue Zhibei narrowed his eyes.","He was already an intermediate Spiritual Saint, and even a junior Spiritual Saint wouldn’t be able to withstand his attack, but Feng Wu was only a Spiritual Overlord. How could she withstand it? “Do you want to die that badly? I’ll grant your wish.” After that, Xue Zhibei struck out at Feng Wu.","Feng Xiangnan shielded Feng Wu with his own body.","Feng Wu smiled at Xue Zhibei. “Is that all you can do?”","Xue Zhibei stared at Feng Wu with narrowed eyes, as if he was thinking.","Ma Quanquan suddenly realized something. “She’s stalling!”","Xue Zhibei’s face turned livid as he stared at Feng Wu.","“Stall for time? Is there anyone else in the Junwu Empire that they can use?”","Xue Zhibei turned to look at Ma Quanquan. “Didn’t you say that Jun Linyuan was missing?","Ma Quanquan nodded. “That’s true.”","Xue Zhibei asked, “Who else can the Junwu Empire count on?”","Ma Quanquan frowned and shook his head. As far as he knew, Master Linghu couldn’t leave Emperor Wu’s capital, so who else could it be?","Xue Zhibei sneered at Feng Wu. “Since no one is coming, none of you are going to leave this place alive!”","Xue Zhibei stared at Feng Xiangnan. “Since we’ve been fighting each other for so many years, I’m going to allow you to have an intact body. Kill yourself.”","Feng Xiangnan’s face was livid.","There was no frustration on his weathered face, but only tenacity.","Kill himself? That was impossible.","“Let her go. She’s still young,” Feng Xiangnan pointed at Feng Wu. “She’s not a","Spiritual Saint yet..”"]},{"number":3980,"title":"Chapter 3980: The Most Amazing Person (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3980: The Most Amazing Person (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Xue Zhibei shook his head and told Feng Xiangnan, “No.”","Feng Xiangnan said, “Xue Zhibei, you’ve broken the rules. This is supposed to be a battlefield for Spiritual Saints, not Spiritual Overlords.”","Xue Zhibei smirked. “She’s only a Spiritual Overlord, but she still came here. Who’s going to stop her?","“Plus, in the face of absolute power, rules are meant to be broken.","“Since you won’t kill yourself, there’s a way that I can spare her life.”","Xue Zhibei smiled at Feng Wu. “Kiddo, I’m going to give you a chance.","“Your godfather risked his life for you.”","With a clang, Xue Zhibei tossed his sword in front of Feng Wu.","“Take this sword and kill Feng Xiangnan yourself. You’ll live. Go.”","Xue Zhibei smiled at Feng Wu, looking forward to seeing Feng Xiangnan killed by the person he protected.","Staring at his archenemy, Feng Xiangnan trembled violently, and his pupils contracted.","Xue Zhibei had created a dilemma for Feng Wu.","It was a difficult task that tested one’s character.","“That won’t be necessary.” Fearing that Feng Wu would have a hard time, Feng","Xiangnan picked up the sword and tried to slit his throat.","“Wait!” Feng Wu grabbed the sword.","But Feng Xiangnan was determined.","“Father!” Feng Wu gritted her teeth. “You can’t do that! Put down your sword!” But Feng Xiangnan wouldn’t let it drop.","Feng Wu shouted angrily, ‘Where did you get that confidence from? Will they let me go after I kill you? Do you believe in their honor or their conscience?","“If they had a conscience, they would have signed the peace treaty a long time ago. Why would they tear it up?","“Father, don’t believe a word they say. The only thing you can trust is your capability!”","Feng Xiangnan smiled bitterly.","He knew perfectly well that the other side couldn’t be trusted, and he also knew that the only thing he could trust was his capability. However, he couldn’t bring himself to put Feng Wu under such pressure.","“Trust me. We’re not going to lose!” Feng Wu said earnestly. “We won’t!” Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Xiangnan, Mr Lu, Mr Xu, Elder Helian, and Elder Dongfang all looked expectantly at Feng Wu.","Was it Jun Linyuan? Would the crown prince be here in time?","“Heh, so what if Jun Linyuan can get here? We still have a peak Spiritual Saint.” Ma Quanquan’s voice rang out in the crowd. “Jun Linyuan is just one more","Spiritual Saint from the Junwu Empire.”","Feng Xiangnan and the others were filled with despair.","They were still short of a peak Spiritual Saint.","Ma Quanquan shook his head and said to Xue Zhibei, “Xiaobei, don’t waste your time.”","“Yes, Master.” Xue Zhibei stared at the crowd and said indifferently, “In that case, all of you can go to hell. The Divine Phoenix Blood is finally gone. It’ll be a great relief for His Majesty.”","After that, a giant ball of light appeared on Xue Zhibei’s chest.","Standing next to him, Ma Quanquan was ready to give it his all.","The battle could start at any moment.","The Junwu Empire was on the verge of collapse...","At that critical moment!","“Stop!”","They heard a cold voice.."]},{"number":3981,"title":"Chapter 3981: He’s Here (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3981: He’s Here (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","They heard a cold voice.","Everyone looked up in the direction of the sound and saw a streak of light. A formidable cultivator had landed in front of them.","People of the Junwu Empire had thought that Jun Linyuan was here, but even if Jun Linyuan was here, it wouldn’t change anything.","However, they were all confused when they saw who it was.","Elder Helian and the others didn’t know who he was, but Feng Xiangnan did.","“You... you...” His voice trembled a little.","Someone who could make General Feng so excited had to be extraordinary.","That was indeed the case.","It was none other than Patriarch Huyan, Feng Wu’s sixth senior brother.","Of course, Feng Wu couldn’t do that in front of other people.","Feng Wu let out a breath of relief when she saw Patriarch Huyan.","Finally, she didn’t have to risk her life anymore.","Didn’t she want to cherish her life? Yes, she did, but she just couldn’t.","When she left the Northern Yan Kingdom, her Sixth Senior Brother gave her a jade plate and told her that if her life was in danger, she could crush it, and he would rush to her side as soon as he could.","Therefore, Feng Wu crushed the jade plate as soon as she saw Ma Quanquan and summoned her sixth senior brother.","However, her Sixth Senior Brother didn’t arrive immediately, and Feng Wu was still injured.","He only let out a breath of relief when he saw the Qilin Armor.","But it only lasted for a split second, and Feng Wu was the only one who noticed it.","Feng Xiangnan recognized the old man, and so did Xue Zhibei.","Xue Zhibei was confused and shocked to see Master Huyan here.","“Why are you here?” Suppressing his anger, Xue Zhibei forced a smile.","The Spiritual Saints of the Junwu Empire were supposed to disappear after this battle. Even if Jun Linyuan came out again, there was nothing he could do. The Dongsang Kingdom would be able to march into the city without breaking a sweat.","Just like 14 years ago.","However, Patriarch Huyan stopped it from happening.","As sharp as he was, he immediately saw what was going on. It was a battle to the death between two armies.","The Dongsang Kingdom and the Junwu Empire were the two most powerful forces on this continent. The Northern Yan Kingdom, the third most powerful empire, could just sit around and cheer them on. Once the battle was over, they could choose to side with the winner. There was no need to get involved in such a complicated matter.","At that thought, Patriarch Huyan gave Feng Wu a dispirited look.","Feng Wu made a face at him.","Patriarch Huyan rubbed his forehead.","Had it not been for Feng Wu, he would have enjoyed the show, but the girl was on the Junwu Empire’s side... Gosh, that was so troublesome.","As he complained inwardly about his junior sister, he stared at Xue Zhibei.","“What? Is this the Dongsang Kingdom’s land? Why can’t I come?”","Xue Zhibei didn’t dare to offend Master Huyan, so he smiled bitterly. “Of course, you can come here. I wonder if you’re here on purpose or just passing","“","Patriarch Huyan smirked. “So what if I’m here on purpose? So what if I’m","Dassinz bv?”","Xue Zhibei smiled. “If you’re just passing by, we’d like to show you our utter respect. We won’t dare to stop you. Moreover, the Dongsang Kingdom would like to form an alliance with the Northern Yan Kingdom for a hundred years..”"]},{"number":3982,"title":"Chapter 3982: He’s Here (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3982: He’s Here (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","What Xue Zhibei said was a bribe.","Master Huyan glanced at him with a half-smile. “What if I’m here on purpose?”","Xue Zhibei’s stomach lurched, and he had a bad feeling.","But...","If he had a choice, Xue zhibei wouldn’t dare to offend Master Huyan.","Because the old man was from ancient times.","Xue Zhibei forced a smile. “If you’re here on purpose, there are two possibilities. One is that you’re here for the Junwu Empire, and the other is for the Dongsang Kingdom. I wonder...”","Master Huyan cut to the chase. “I’m here for the Junwu Empire. What are you going to do?”","Xue Zhibei blanched at those words, while Feng Xiangnan’s eyes widened.","Was he here to save the Junwu Empire?","The Northern Yan Kingdom and the Junwu Empire had never been very close. Speaking of which, the Northern Yan Kingdom and the Dongsang Kingdom were much closer.","Therefore, he should be on the Dongsang Kingdom’s side. Why the Junwu Empire?","Xue Zhibei had the same question, and he forced himself to ask, “May I ask why you want to help the Junwu Empire?”","If this intimidating figure really wanted to help the Junwu Empire...","Normally, someone as capable as Master Huyan wouldn’t talk so much to an intermediate Spiritual Saint like Xue Zhibei. However, Master Huyan seemed to be very talkative this time.","Crossing his hands behind his back, he said indifferently, “I’m here on a young friend’s request.”","Other people might not be able to tell, but Feng Wu could tell that her Sixth Senior Brother was grinding his teeth... Was he trying to beat her up? Feng Wu cringed.","As expected, everyone focused on what Patriarch Huyan said.","A young friend’s request?","Who was this young friend?","How could that person get Patriarch Huyan’s help?","“Is it Jun... Jun...” Xue Zhibei felt a chill run down his spine. If it really was Jun","Linyuan, it meant that the Northern Yan Kingdom had sided with the Junwu Empire. Had they become allies? That was bad news for the Dongsang Kingdom!","Patriarch Huyan grew impatient. Glaring at Xue Zhibei, he said, “I’ve been entrusted with a task. These people of the Junwu Empire can’t be touched today. You can leave now.”","But Xue Zhibei couldn’t bring himself to waste such a great opportunity.","Therefore, he was still trying.","“Master Huyan, are the Northern Yan Kingdom and the Junwu Empire allies now?”","Gritting his teeth, he asked, “Is Northern Yan really siding with Junwu?”","Patriarch Huyan closed his eyes with a grim look on his face.","But Feng Wu knew...","She had put her Sixth Brother in a difficult spot.","Northern Yan was supposed to be an onlooker country that didn’t need to be involved in the war. If helping the Junwu Empire put Northern Yan in constant conflict, how could her Sixth Senior Brother stand it?","Feng Wu suddenly said, “Why do you care if Northern Yan is on our side or not? Since Master Huyan has agreed to help the Junwu Empire, it has to be a personal favor.”","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","How dare a mere Spiritual Overlord like her speak up in a situation like this?!","Even Mr Lu, a Spiritual Saint, didn’t dare to make a sound, nor did Elder Helian, a new Spiritual Saint..."]},{"number":3983,"title":"Chapter 3983: He’s Here (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3983: He’s Here (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu hadn’t reached the Spiritual Saint stage yet, so it was only natural that she trembled in fear.","No, she wasn’t qualified to be here.","Not only wasn’t she shivering, but she was also chatting and laughing as if she was the host.","Feng Xiangnan tugged at Feng Wu’s sleeve and glared at her. “Shut up, young lady. Can’t you see that I’m too scared to make a sound?”","Patriarch Huyan belonged to the same era as Master Linghu.","He was in the same generation as the Matriarch of the Firmament Palace.","However, even when Feng Xiangnan tugged at her, Feng Wu still grinned at","Patriarch Huyan. “Sir, do you think I have a point?”","She was smiling like a little monkey. Even the Spiritual Saints of the Junwu Empire were worried that Feng Wu would offend Master Huyan.","After all, the legendary Patriarch Huyan had a short temper.","Xue Zhibei and the others also sneered at the arrogant girl.","Master Huyan glanced at the girl and grunted. “Yes.”","That was it?","Xue Zhibei suddenly had a strange feeling. Somehow, he felt that Patriarch Huyan was treating the girl better than he treated other people.","Feng Wu grinned. “We don’t dare to ask which friend of yours made that request, but I’m sure they don’t want to drag the neutral Northern Yan Kingdom down with them either.”","Patriarch Huyan’s eyes lit up a little when he looked at Feng Wu. He didn’t expect his junior sister to be so smart. Their master was amazing. If he picked Feng Wu as his last pupil, she had to be the most brilliant of the seven disciples.","At the thought of his master, Patriarch Huyan felt guilty for not taking good care of his junior sister.","Feng Wu smiled. “Therefore, I won’t take up too much of your time. How about you protect us for three months?”","When Jun Linyuan came out of seclusion three months later, he would be invincible!","Three months?! Xue Zhibei was the first to shake his head.","According to the deadline set by the Dayan Empire, Dongsang needed to destroy the Junwu Empire in two months. The army should wipe out everything in their path.","Master Huyan wanted to say yes, but Xue Zhibei said, “Master, may I talk to you in private?”","Was he going to make a secret agreement?","Someone as capable as Patriarch Huyan wouldn’t just follow Xue Zhibei’s","orders. If the old man was displeased, he could strangle Xue Zhibei with a wave of his hand. Therefore, the old man snorted contemptuously.","Feng Wu couldn’t wait to find out the secret, so she gave Master Huyan a warning look, telling him to go with Xue Zhibei.","Since his junior sister had asked...","With a wave of his hand, Patriarch Huyan shut everyone out, apart from him and Xue Zhibei.","Xue Zhibei dropped to one knee and pleaded, “Master, this isn’t just about the Dongsang Kingdom. It’s about the Dayan Empire...”","Xue Zhibei told him what the empire had told him and pleaded, “The Junwu Empire is bound to fall, and that’s bound to happen. Please think about the people of the Northern Yan Kingdom and don’t let them die in vain.","“The people the Dayan Empire is looking for are in the Junwu Empire, and so is the thing the empire is after. They’re going to destroy the Junwu Empire, and the other countries won’t be affected..”"]},{"number":3984,"title":"Chapter 3984: Secret Task","paragraphs":["Chapter 3984: Secret Task","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Master, please show some mercy to the people of Northern Yan,” Xue Zhibei said sadly.","“If the Junwu Empire isn’t destroyed, the Dayan Empire will destroy the entire Jiuzhou Continent. All nine kingdoms will be destroyed!","“If that’s the case, why not let the Junwu Empire make a sacrifice for our survival?","“We’ll live if they’re dead.”","Xue Zhibei’s words kept replaying in Huyan’s head.","The Dayan Empire...","Patriarch Huyan’s face turned livid at those words.","What an empire! Wasn’t it enough to destroy the continent once? Were they going to do it again?","Patriarch Huyan smirked inwardly. However, Feng Wu was right. He needed to stall.","Therefore, he said indifferently, “Three months.”","Xue Zhibei looked at him in bewilderment.","Patriarch Huyan smirked. “You’re not allowed to lay a finger on the Junwu","Empire for three months. That way, I’ll be able to answer to my young friend.”","Xue Zhibei kept his gaze on Master Huyan. Seeing how stubborn the old man was...","Xue Zhibei could only sigh and went back to talk to Ma Quanquan.","Ma Quanquan was a Spiritual Saint, and he could do whatever he wanted in the outside world. However, he didn’t dare to be careless in front of Master Huyan.","Someone above the Spiritual Saint stage was a very prestigious figure even in the Empire of Dayan!","They couldn’t defeat him.","Ma Quanquan had no choice but to nod at Xue Zhibei.","Three more months didn’t matter. The most important thing was to destroy the Junwu Empire. Blood would flow like rivers and lives would be lost.","As for why...","Ma Quanquan didn’t know the answer. He only knew that was what his lord told them","Soon, Ma Quanxue and the others left.","Feng Wu had picked up Feng Xiangnan’s severed limb and steadied him.","Patriarch Huyan was about to leave, but Feng Wu still had something to tell him, so she stopped him involuntarily. “Patriarch","The others jumped at her voice.","Patriarch Huyan was leaving, but the girl had just called him. How bold!","It just so happened that Patriarch Huyan looked back at Feng Wu, and if the others weren’t mistaken, they saw resignation in his eyes.","Master Huyan didn’t know what to do with little Feng Wu.","“Fine. I’ll go with you.” Patriarch Huyan stopped and walked up to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled. “Of course. I’ll have to treat you to a good meal when we get back. You’ve worked very hard today.”","Patriarch Huyan glanced at Feng Wu. The girl sounded so respectful now, but she was like a spoiled child around him. So what if she was a little spoiled? She was only like that around him.","At that thought, Patriarch Huyan couldn’t help but gloat.","Feng Xiangnan invited Master Huyan to lead the way, but the old man waved him off. “Don’t worry. I’ll just stay with her and keep the wind away from her.” Feng Wu didn’t even feel the wind when Master Huyan stood next to her.","General Feng, Mr. Lu, and the others all looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Mr. Xu was also giving Feng Wu strange looks.","When the girl joined the Imperial College, Mr. Xu actually had a problem with her. However, after Feng Wu’s achievements, Mr. Xu changed his opinion of her over and over again.."]},{"number":3985,"title":"Chapter 3985: The Sixth Senior Brother","paragraphs":["Chapter 3985: The Sixth Senior Brother","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","By now, his curiosity about Feng Wu had outweighed his dislike.","Especially today...","Mr. Xu walked behind them and stared at the three people in front of him.","Feng Wu supported Feng Xiangnan as they walked, while Patriarch Huyan stood next to Feng Wu as if he was ready to protect her at any moment.","Mr. Xu nudged Mr. Lu with his elbow.","Mr. Lu looked at him in bewilderment.","Mr. Xu whispered, “What’s the girl’s relationship with Master Huyan?”","Mr. Lu shook his head. How was he supposed to know? But what did little Feng Wu have anything to do with Northern Yan’s pillar? It had to be the first time they had met.","Mr. Xu glanced at Mr. Lu and clicked his tongue. It couldn’t be the first time they met. If he was guessing right, His Royal Highness had introduced Feng","Wu to the Patriarch once before. That was why they seemed so familiar. So, the","“young friend” that Master Huyan was talking about was...","Of course, Patriarch Huyan, who was walking in the front, heard them. However, he didn’t like it when someone tried to take Feng Wu’s credit.","“Jun Linyuan? Of course, it’s not him,” said Patriarch Huyan.","Mr. Xu stumbled and almost fell to the ground.","Behind Mr. Xu, Elder Helian and Elder Dongfang exchanged looks, and both lowered their heads.","Even Mr Xu, who had been so arrogant in front of them, was frightened by Master Huyan. That was new!","But if it wasn’t His Royal Highness, then who was it?","The others were all confused.","After they left the other dimension, Elder Dongfang said anxiously, “I wonder how the intermediate battlefield is doing. I’ll go have a look first.”","She dashed off after that.","Elder Helian was about to follow her when Feng Wu stopped him. “Don’t worry. The battlefield is fine.”","Elder Helian looked at Feng Wu. “How do you know that?”","Feng Wu shrugged. Of course, she knew that. She had single-handedly destroyed 200 fighter jets, and she had captured their captain as well.","Feng Wu said, “Go find Helian Zehang. I think he’s holding the captain of the Dongsang Kingdom’s fighter jet.”","Elder Helian looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","Feng Wu waved him off. “Go. Why don’t you believe me? Just ask your grandson.”","After Elder Dongfang and Elder Helian left, Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu went back to their own courtyards to treat their wounds. Hence, Feng Xiangnan, Feng Wu, and Patriarch Huyan were the only ones left in the general’s residence.","Feng Wu sat Feng Xiangnan down on the chaise lounge and tried to reattach his right arm.","If she didn’t put it back in time, it would damage his cultivation in the future.","However, Feng Xiangnan told Feng Wu to attend to Master Huyan first.","After all, to Feng Xiangnan, Patriarch Huyan was a senior of Master Linghu’s generation, and he couldn’t afford to show any disrespect. Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. “Why? Let him find a place to sit.”","Feng Xiangnan was dumbfounded.","Since when was this girl so arrogant?","“Senior Huyan, my daughter was reckless...”","It wasn’t that Feng Xiangnan was pedantic, but...","How could she be so indifferent in front of such a powerful senior?","However, Master Huyan had already found a chair and sat down. He even poured himself a cup of tea and took a sip.."]},{"number":3986,"title":"Chapter 3986: Brilliant Girl (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3986: Brilliant Girl (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Only then did he glance at Feng Wu. “We’re all back in the room. Aren’t you tired of wearing this Qilin Armor? Take it off. It looks so exhausting.”","Feng Wu snorted. “You don’t even have one.”","Patriarch Huyan said, “Why should I care?”","Feng Wu said, “Well, you don’t have one. Master Linghu gave it to me.”","Patriarch Huyan smacked Feng Wu on the head. “Kiddo, hurry up. We still have to go back after this.”","Feng Xiangnan was baffled by the conversation.","Since when was his daughter able to talk to someone as influential as Patriarch Huyan? And why did she look so familiar with him? And why did Master Linghu give her the Qilin Armor?","Feng Xiangnan was still baffled when Feng Wu reattached his arm and tied it with a pretty bow.","“Father, you have to be careful with this hand from now on. Don’t move around before it recovers. Otherwise, it’ll affect your ability to use the sword.” Feng Wu reminded him in a serious tone.","Feng Xiangnan nodded in bewilderment.","By then, Feng Wu had finished cleaning her hands and turned to look at","Patriarch Huyan.","“So, what did Xue Zhibei tell you in private?”","Feng Wu cut to the chase.","General Feng drew in his breath.","Feng Wu was confused. “Don’t you want to know?”","Of course, General Feng wanted to know, but was that even possible?","That was a secret between the Northern Yan Kingdom and the Dongsang Kingdom, and the Junwu Empire and the Northern Yan Kingdom weren’t very close.","However, Patriarch Huyan waved her off. “Kiddo, if you want to know, of course, I’ll tell you.”","General Feng was speechless.","Patriarch Huyan said, “That little general was very straightforward. He said that the Dongsang Kingdom wanted to attack the Junwu Empire because of an order from the Dayan Empire, who wanted to destroy the Junwu Empire.”","After a pause, the look on Patriarch Huyan’s face became even more serious, and he went on. “They won’t stop until there’s bloodshed.”","“Why?” Feng Wu was confused. “Why does Dayan want to do that? Why do they have to kill so many people? What did the Junwu Empire do?”","Master Huyan shook his head. “I don’t know.”","Feng Wu clenched her fists. “That’s outrageous!”","Patriarch Huyan glanced at Feng Wu and said slowly, “The empire is hundreds of times bigger than the continent of Jiuzhou. It’s only normal that they have hundreds of times more capable cultivators than us.","“After all, we’ve only been around for a few years, and the empire has existed since time immemorial. A hundred times is only an estimate.","“If such a colossus wants the Junwu Empire dead...” Even Patriarch Huyan felt troubled. “Kiddo, why don’t you change your nationality to Northern Yan?” Feng Wu threw a dirty look at him.","Patriarch Huyan smiled bitterly. He knew that the girl wouldn’t agree.","“I want to know why...”","Feng Wu paced up and down the room, her head spinning.","Patriarch Huyan was pleased to see Feng Wu like this.","Other people would be scared out of their wits if they knew that a colossal like Dayan was going to destroy the Junwu Empire. They would either run away or kneel down. However, Feng Wu was trying to figure out a way to solve the problem.."]},{"number":3987,"title":"Chapter 3987: Brilliant Girl (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3987: Brilliant Girl (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Crossing her hands behind her back, Feng Wu frowned as she walked. “The only thing we can do now is figure out why Dayan is doing this.","“Why did they want the Junwu Empire dead?","“Why do they want to kill everyone in the Junwu Empire?","“Do they only want the Junwu Empire dead or the entire continent destroyed?” Patriarch Huya stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Please don’t stare at me like that. It’s like you said before. The empire is such a colossus that no one can predict what they’re going to do.","“What difference does it make if they want to destroy the Junwu Empire or the continent?","“What if we destroy the Junwu Empire first before taking care of the other eight kingdoms?”","Patriarch Huyan was speechless.","Although he knew that the girl was talking nonsense, what if...","He was lost in his thoughts.","General Feng looked at Feng Wu in amazement, his eyes twinkling. His daughter was so talented!","It would be great if he could make the Northern Yan Kingdom an alliance! General Feng looked expectantly at Master Huyan.","Patriarch Huyan rolled his eyes at them.","“What do you want?” Master Huyan said grumpily. “Of course, I’ll help you, but the Junwu Empire is too big a burden for me to carry.”","Feng Wu said seriously, “What if the Junwu Empire is only the first step toward destroying this continent? What if the second step is the Northern Yan","Kingdom?”","Patriarch Huyan immediately stopped talking.","Feng Wu said seriously, “I think that’s very likely.”","Patriarch Huyan said solemnly, “If that’s the case, of course, Northern Yan will stand with the Junwu Empire.”","Feng Wu said, “Deal!”","Patriarch Huyan looked at Feng Wu in amazement. “What are you doing?","Feng Wu said, “I’m going to the Dongsang Kingdom’s capital!”","Before Patriarch Huyan could say anything, Feng Xiangnan said, “No! You can’t do that!”","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Feng Xiangnan said solemnly, “Do you know what’s going on in the Dongsang","Kingdom? You’re just a girl, and you’re traveling thousands of miles to Donglin City. Do you know what danger you’ll run into there? That place is heavily guarded. We can’t even send a spy there. You’ll be all alone, and no one will be able to help you! No, you can’t go!”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “That’s why I have to go.","“Godfather, you know I have Magic Vine. I can change my aura into that of the Dongsang Kingdom. They can’t tell that I’m a fake.","“That’s my specialty. No one else can do it, so I’m the only one who can do it.” Feng Xiangnan still shook his head and wouldn’t let Feng Wu go.","“There are men in the empire, and a girl like you doesn’t have to put your life on the line! You’re not going!”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. Ever since she was born, she couldn’t just stand there and wait for other people to protect her.","“If someone has to go, let Jun Linyuan do it. This is his empire, his people, and his responsibility!” Feng Xiangnan said affirmatively.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “If he could go, he would. No one can stop him, but he can’t go now.”","Feng Wu then told him about the ambush in the Northern Yan Kingdom.."]},{"number":3988,"title":"Chapter 3988: His Junior Sister Insisted","paragraphs":["Chapter 3988: His Junior Sister Insisted","Feng Xiangnan asked, “Is he injured?”","Feng Wu nodded. “He can’t come out for three months. He can’t get injured again.”","General Feng nodded.","When he heard that Jun Linyuan had single-handedly defeated so many Spiritual Saints, General Feng was astonished.","Before she knew it, Jun Linyuan had become so capable.","He then looked at Feng Wu, who was bargaining with Patriarch Huyan.","As a matter of fact, Jun Linyuan wasn’t the only one. The girl in front of him was equally astonishing.","General Feng was pleased. The younger generation had grown so fast that it was a lot less stressful for them.","However, when he recalled what Patriarch Huyan said, that the Dayan Empire was determined to destroy the Junwu Empire, General Feng felt a chill run down his spine.","By then, Feng Wu had finished talking to Patriarch Huyan. She said, “It’s a deal, then.”","Patriarch Huyan nodded. “Of course. I can fool other people, but I can’t fool you.”","If their Master heard about this, he would be in trouble!","General Feng was perplexed. What was the Patriarch and Feng Wu talking about in that split second? Why were they so excited?","Patriarch Huyan was about to leave after that when General Feng suddenly remembered someone.","If that person was here, they might be able to save the Junwu Empire and the entire continent.","Hence, General Feng said, “Senior Huyan..","Master Huyan looked at General Feng in bewilderment.","After some thought, General Feng asked, “Is it rumored that Master Mu is your master?”","Patriarch Huyan glanced at Feng Wu, but she didn’t say anything.","Did that mean that he could say whatever he wanted?","Patriarch Huyan cleared his throat and put on a straight face. “Why do you ask?”","General Feng said eagerly, “If we can find Master Mu, maybe...”","Patriarch Huyan was speechless. “Only one person in this world knows where he is.”","Feng Xiangnan asked excitedly, ‘Who is it? Please tell me!”","Patriarch Huyan dampened his enthusiasm. “If that person could show up, would the Dayan Empire still be so arrogant? Do you know what happened back then...","Seeing the expectant look in Feng Wu’s eyes, Patriarch Huyan stopped talking involuntarily. He couldn’t afford to reveal this secret!","“Senior, which master knows where Master Mu is...","Master Huyan glanced at Feng Wu and said grumpily, ‘Who else could it be? It’s the young friend who has asked me to protect your empire!”","Feng Xiangnan was shocked.","“And that is...","Master Huyan had denied Jun Linyuan’s claim, but no one else in the Junwu Empire was capable enough to make him come here.","Patriarch Huyan waved him off.","He also wanted to know where his master was, but his junior sister had kept it a secret and wouldn’t say a word. What choice did he have?","“You’ll have three months. Take care of yourselves.” In the end, Master Huyan left.","Feng Xiangnan’s headache at the thought of what would happen three months later.","Feng Wu comforted him. “Jun Linyuan will come out of seclusion in three months, which is why I’ve asked for three months.”","Feng Xiangnan shook his head with a wry smile. After all, the girl had no idea how terrifying the Dayan Empire was.","No individual could withstand the Dayan Empire all by themselves.","No matter how powerful Jun Linyuan was, he was still one man.","Even if he made it to that legendary stage..."]},{"number":3989,"title":"Chapter 3989: Relationship with Patriarch Huyan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3989: Relationship with Patriarch Huyan","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Patriarch Huyan was already at that level, and he was still intimidated by the Dayan Empire.","so...","Feng Xiangnan looked at Feng Wu and asked casually, “You seem to be very familiar with Master Huyan.”","Feng Wu said, “Well, not really. We’re just friends.”","“Does my godfather suspect that I’m Patriarch Huyan’s friend?”","As a matter of fact, General Feng didn’t suspect Feng Wu at all because he asked, “Who do you think that friend of Master Huyan’s is? If we can find him, we’ll be able to find Master Mu. Once we find Master Mu...","Feng Wu shook her head. “Forget about it. If Master Mu could come out, he would have done so already. Since we haven’t heard from him...’ “It only means that he’s dead.” Feng Xiangnan heaved a sigh.","Feng Wu stared at General Feng. No, her master was alive.","General Feng rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “What do you know? Why would I tell you that...","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“But you really can’t go to the Dongsang Kingdom. Got it?” General Feng reminded Feng Wu.","Just then, they heard a voice outside. It was Mr. Lu.","Mr. Lu had to be here for something important.","“Got it?” General Feng reminded Feng Wu again.","Feng Wu grinned but didn’t say yes.","General Feng decided that he would talk to the girl after talking to Mr. Lu so that she wouldn’t run off to Donglin City.","However, when General Feng and Mr. Lu came back from their discussion, Feng Wu was nowhere to be seen.","General Feng paled and rushed out.","After searching for Feng Wu for a while, General Feng still couldn’t find her, so he went straight to Elder Helian.","Elder Helian was thrilled to see General Feng.","“General! That girl is incredible! She has defeated 200 fighter jets all by herself!","If it hadn’t been for her, we would have...”","Only then did General Feng realize that the girl had made such a great achievement before she went to the Spiritual Saint battlefield.","This girl was practically a treasure in the study of ancient technology. He couldn’t afford to lose her!","“What? Didn’t she go north on your order?”","General Feng’s face turned livid.","Elder Helian immediately realized what had happened. “What? Wasn’t that girl supposed to be there? Did she go there on her own?”","General Feng said, “We must stop her!”","Elder Helian said, “At her speed, she should have reached Sun Castle by now.”","General Feng was speechless.","Just as Elder Helian expected, Feng Wu had entered Sun Castle.","This wasn’t the first time Feng Wu had been here, so she knew the way like the back of her hand.","She was even able to sneak into Sun Castle with great ease.","Feng Wu had thought that she would be able to get some information from Lord Jing, but as it turned out,","Lord Jin was about to set out for Donglin City.","Feng Wu heard it when a steward was chatting with Lord Jing’s guards.","Feng Wu also received some very important information.","It would take a normal person at least a month to get to Donglin City, but there was a portal between the Sun Castle and the city.","If they walked through the portal, they would soon reach the city.."]},{"number":3990,"title":"Chapter 3990: Donglin City","paragraphs":["Chapter 3990: Donglin City","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu thought, “Isn’t it similar to the Junwu Empire’s portal?”","The Junwu Empire also had a portal from Nest to the imperial capital.","Because of that portal, it didn’t take Feng Wu much effort to travel between Nest and the imperial capital.","Feng Wu was secretly elated when she heard the conversation between the guards and the steward.","She didn’t want to waste her precious time on traveling.","If she could use the portal, she would take advantage of it, but she didn’t know what it would be like.","Feng Wu hid behind a rockery and watched as the guard and the steward parted ways and headed for the living quarters.","Feng Wu moved.","Feng Wu had reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage and shouldn’t be underestimated.","If she was fully equipped, she might even be able to defeat a Level-I Spiritual Saint. Therefore, Feng Wu dragged the guard away without hesitation.","According to Feng Wu’s observation, the guard was a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord at least.","The man struggled, but Feng Wu wouldn’t let him. She squeezed his tendons.","Lord Jing’s guard went limp and couldn’t even lift a finger.","“You...","His pupils contracted when he saw Feng Wu.","It was obvious that she wasn’t from Sun Castle. Who on earth was she? However, Feng Wu didn’t give him any chance to warn other people.","“Your name.” Feng Wu asked indifferently.","However, the person wasn’t very cooperative. He kept darting around, looking for an opportunity to run away.","Feng Wu smiled a little.","She didn’t have time for this, so she took out the truth serum and sprayed it in the man’s mouth.","After Feng Wu’s improvements over and over again, the truth serum now looked like a small sprayer. All she needed to do was spray it in the person’s face.","As expected, after a few puffs of the truth serum, the guard felt dizzy and was in a trance-like state.","Just then, Feng Wu said, “Your name.”","“Jing Wei,” the man stressed each word.","Jing Wei?","Feng Wu didn’t like that name at all. “Your job.”","“One of Lord Jing’s four guards...”","Hence, Feng Wu told the guard to tell her everything he knew.","Because Feng Wu had a plan before she caught the guard.","She wanted to go to Donglin City to find out the secret of why the Dayan Empire wanted to destroy the Junwu Empire.","“So, you’re going back to Donglin City with Lord Jing, aren’t you?”","Jing Wei nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Wu smiled a little. She knew that she had guessed right.","“Who’s going back this time?”","Jing Wei said, “Lord Jing, Senior Ma, and the guards.” Senior Ma? Ma Quanquan? The top Spiritual Saint?","“Time?”","“An hour later.”","Feng Wu smiled. “In that case, tell me everything about you, including all your connections and secrets.”","If Jing Wei were conscious, he wouldn’t have told Feng Wu this. Unfortunately, he was drugged.","Hence, he told Feng Wu everything.","More than half of the time had passed.","Seeing that she was running out of time, Feng Wu..."]},{"number":3991,"title":"Chapter 3991: Dongsang, Donglin City (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3991: Dongsang, Donglin City (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing that she was running out of time, Feng Wu knocked the guard out.","She then disguised herself as Jing Wei and took off his clothes. Soon, Feng Wu looked exactly like him.","As for Jing Wei...","Naturally, she packed him up and put him in her ring space.","That person would be useful in the future.","Fearing that she might defile her beautiful master, Feng Wu had prepared a wooden box in a corner of the ring space, so she stuffed the guard into it.","After tidying up the place, Feng Wu headed for the courtyard where Lord Jing used to live.","As expected, when Feng Wu arrived, Lord Jing and the others had packed up and were ready to leave.","One of the guards frowned when he saw Feng Wu. “What time is it now? Why are you still wandering around? Do you need His Royal Highness to wait for you if you cant make it in time? You can’t just open a portal! You’ll be left here all by yourself!”","Feng Wu had learned from Jing Wei that the person who had scolded her was Jing Bao, the captain of the guards of Lord Jing’s Manor.","It was easy to remember the names of the four guards, for their given names put together meant “protect the empire”.","The four guards were called Jing Bao, Jing Jia, Jing Wei, and Jing Guo.","The other three were all peak Level-9 Spiritual Overlords. As for how capable the captain was, even Jing Wei couldn’t tell.","Feng Wu couldn’t tell what level the man was either. She only knew that he gave her an unfathomable feeling.","Had Lord Jing always had these four guards? Yes.","Because if one of them fell, a new member would replace the dead one, and that new member would inherit the name. Therefore, the four guards had changed quite a few times over the years, but the names remained the same.","The elite guards were on friendly terms. Hearing this, they tried to mediate the situation. “Brother, it’s about time. I think our lord is coming out.”","As expected, Lord Jing came out at that moment. He glanced at the guards and asked, “Is everyone here?”","Jing Bao threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and told Lord Jing, “Your Royal","Highness, everyone is here.”","Lord Jing waved at him. “Let’s go. To the portal.”","Feng Wu noticed that Jing Bao walked half a meter behind Lord Jing, followed by Jing Jia. As the third brother, Feng Wu quickly followed Jing Jia, and Jing Guo, who had been silent this whole time, was right behind her.","Feng Wu had only just arrived and didn’t want to stand out. Hence, she kept her ears open and kept her eyes lowered as she tried to memorize everything.","She needed Lord Jing’s help to get to Donglin City, and she needed to make her way into the upper circle of the Dongsang Kingdom. Only then would she be able to achieve her goal.","If she couldn’t finish the task, no one in the Junwu Empire would survive three months later.","Her family, her friends, the people she cared about, and the people she protected would all be crushed by Dayan.","She would never let that happen!","And this task was so dangerous that even Feng Wu wasn’t sure that she could complete it. She had to do her best and leave it to fate.","For instance, it was already very dangerous for Feng Wu to sneak into Lord Jing’s team.","Jing Bao was much more capable than her, and Lord Jing was even more so.","Feng Wu also saw Ma Quanquan after she met up with the others. He was a peak Spiritual Saint of Dayan. If she made the slightest mistake, she would be crushed to pieces.."]},{"number":3992,"title":"Chapter 3992: Dongsang, Donglin City (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3992: Dongsang, Donglin City (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Let’s go,” said Ma Quanquan.","Because of his special privilege, Lord Jing could use the portal once.","Under normal circumstances, the portal would only open once a month.","Inside, Feng Wu noticed Ma Quanquan sitting in a corner and cultivating.","Lord Jing was Ma Quanquan’s pupil, so of course, Ma Quanquan had his pupil serve him. Lord Jing told his guards to back off and make some space for him, while he knelt down in front of Ma Quanquan.","Ma Quanquan glanced at him and was very satisfied with his humble behavior.","“Do you have something to ask?” Ma Quanquan couldn’t help but ask when he saw Lord Jing’s expression.","Lord Jin asked, “Master, does the empire have to destroy Junwu?","Ma Quanquan smiled. “So what if the answer is yes?”","Lord Jin immediately smiled obsequiously. “If that’s the case, it’ll be great. From now on, the Dongsang Kingdom will be invincible on this continent. No other kingdom will be able to threaten our existence.”","Feng Wu kept her gaze on the ground but was watching Ma Quanquan from the corner of her eyes.","She cared more about the answer than Lord Jing did.","Ma Quanquan nodded. “Don’t worry. Junwu is doomed.”","Lord Jing grinned. “That’s great. When the Junwu falls, I’ll ask His Majesty to let me run the place. When that happens...”","Ma Quanquan gave him a strange look.","Lord Jing sensed it, so he looked at Ma Quanquan in bewilderment. “Master, why are you looking at me like that?”","It was as if he was looking at an idiot.","Ma Quanquan said indifferently, “What do you think?”","Lord Jing scratched his head and was confused.","If that happened, the Junwu Empire would be at their mercy. Was there something behind it?","Seeing that his silly pupil still couldn’t figure it out, Ma Quanquan was worried that Lord Jing would make the request to his king, so he made it clear.","“When that happens, the Junwu Empire won’t exist anymore. What place are you going to run to?”","Lord Jing said, “Master, although Junwu is gone, we still have their land, people, and wealth.”","Ma Quanquan shook his head. “No, they won’t be there.”","Lord Jing was confused. ‘Why is that? Wait, is everything going to Dayan?”","Ma Quanquan shook his head. “There will be nothing left.”","Lord Jing was still confused, but he had a feeling...","Seeing that his master had closed his eyes and wouldn’t say another word, he didn’t dare to disturb him, but he was still very suspicious.","Lord Jing couldn’t figure it out, but someone as smart as Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine.","If what Ma Quanquan said was true, it meant Junwu would be wiped out.","Did he mean that Junwu’s people, land, wealth, and everything else would be wiped off the map?","Why?","Feng Wu was utterly confused. Even if they were defeated and surrendered, the common people should still be able to live. Why would they all be wiped out?","Just then, Lord Jing suddenly realized something. “Master, are you saying that everyone in the Junwu Empire is going to die? No one is going to live!”","Ma Quanquan glanced at him and nodded.","Feng Wu was astonished.","She took a few deep breaths, and Ma Quanquan turned his cold gaze on her.."]},{"number":3993,"title":"Chapter 3993: Dongsang, Donglin City (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3993: Dongsang, Donglin City (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Right now, Feng Wu didn’t dare to let anything show on her face. She took a deep breath and buried her astonishment.","Luckily, Feng Wu wasn’t the only one who was shocked. The other three guards and Lord Jing were all in a state of astonishment. Therefore, Ma Quanquan only glanced at her and didn’t pay much attention to her.","Lord Jing looked at Ma Quanquan in astonishment and wanted to ask more, but the peak Spiritual Saint waved him off. “That’s a secret. Don’t ask.”","Lord Jing was experienced enough to know that his master didn’t want to reveal more.","Ma Quanquan looked at the four guards behind him.","Lord Jin said, “They’ve all taken a blood oath. They’re loyal to me and won’t say a word.”","Ma Quanquan nodded and said casually, “If they leak the information, we’ll destroy their entire clan.”","Lord Jing nodded immediately. “Yes.”","Feng Wu could sense the other guards tense up. They were so nervous that they looked like statues.","Feng Wu’s head spun a little as well.","She had thought that it was a serious matter, but now that the peak Spiritual Saint had told her the truth, Feng Wu realized that it was much more serious than she had expected.","Even if the Junwu Empire was defeated this time, they would have a chance to revive. That was what Feng Wu thought at first.","However, Ma Quanquan’s words made it very clear to Feng Wu that this wouldn’t happen again. Dayan was going to get rid of them all.","But why?","Wasn’t Dayan afraid of divine retribution?","Feng Wu wanted to ask that question, but she couldn’t.","She closed her eyes and forced herself to calm down. She knew that there had to be something behind it, something she didn’t know.","The Junwu Empire was a vast empire, and she was the only one that could save it. Therefore, she had to figure out what was going on.","They didn’t talk again until they were out of the portal.","Feng Wu thought that Ma Quanquan would go back to Lord Jing’s manor with Lord Jing, but he didn’t.","Ma Quanquan moved into the imperial palace.","Feng Wu asked around and found out that Princess Yan Ling lived in the imperial palace, and Ma Quanquan was only there to deal with Feng Xiangnan and the other Junwu elders. It was only normal that he was back with Princess Yan Ling.","Lord Jing went straight to the imperial palace and told the king what had happened.","Feng Wu could imagine what Lord Jing would report.","Patriarch Huyan had ruined the Dongsang Kingdom’s plan and delayed it by three months. Would the Dongsang King attack the Northern Yan Kingdom?","He didn’t dare to do it before, but with the help of Dayan, the Dongsang King might actually make a move.","The four guards were able to follow Lord Jing into the imperial palace, but they could only wait in the long corridor outside when the king and Lord Jing were discussing a matter in the study.","Feng Wu could faintly hear the sound of porcelain being smashed.","The Dongsang King was furious.","Before long, Lord Jing came out, and Feng Wu noticed a wound the size of a baseball on his forehead. Blood was oozing out.","Jing Bao quickly handed him a hemostatic pack.","Lord Jing’s face was livid, and his eyes were wide open. Without another word, he headed for the door.","Feng Wu and the others quickly followed him.."]},{"number":3994,"title":"Chapter 3994: Noticed by Lord Jing (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3994: Noticed by Lord Jing (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu and the others quickly followed him.","Lord Jing went back to his study and slammed the door when they were back at the manor.","The four guards looked at one another in bewilderment. In the end, Jing Bao, the head of the guards said, “Lord Jing is inside. Two of us should stay here.","The other two will come back to take over the shift in a few hours.","“Jing Jia and Jing Wei, you’re on guard for the first half of the night.”","Because of Jing Jia’s close relationship with Jing Wei, Jing Bao had never liked them. Hence, he left with Jing Guo.","After they left, Jing Jia sighed and whispered, “Lord Jing is in a bad mood now. I’m sure he’ll vent his anger on someone. Let’s be careful.” Feng Wu nodded earnestly.","When she lowered her head, her head was spinning.","She wasn’t here to have fun. She was here for something big.","Putting everything else aside, she had to figure out why the Dayan Empire wanted to destroy everyone in the Junwu Empire. Only then would she have a chance to figure out a way to solve it.","Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine when she thought about what would happen when Dayan attacked the continent on their own.","And she had to find her third senior brother.","The third broken star piece was with her third senior brother, so she had to find him and get it. With him as her patron, she could go wherever she wanted.","However, the two tasks were equally hard.","Recalling her capability, Feng Wu sighed inwardly.","She used to think that she was very capable, but here in Lord Jing’s manor, she was only as good as one of the four guards.","She couldn’t come and go freely in this manor, let alone the Dongsang Kingdom.","If only she could become a Spiritual Saint now.","Once she reached the Spiritual Saint stage, she would rise to a whole new level.","When that happened, even Lord Jing would have to treat her with great respect.","It would be so convenient for her to travel around.","“What’s on your mind?” Jing Jia looked curiously at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “The captain’s capability...”","Jing Jia said, “He’s a Spiritual Saint.”","Feng Wu said, “I knew it.”","Jing Jia asked, “Do you want to become a Spiritual Saint as well?”","Feng Wu snapped, ‘What do you mean by that? Everyone wants to become a Spiritual Saint!”","Jing Jia said, “It’s not that. I just don’t want you to overthink it. Instead of thinking about such useless things, you should focus on your job.”","Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t accept it, he smiled bitterly. “Level 9 Spiritual Overlords are indeed only one level away from the Spiritual Saint stage, but this gap is like the deepest oceanic trench.","“How many Level-9 Spiritual Overlords do we have? And how many can rise to the Spiritual Saint stage? There’s a 1% chance.”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","The Dongsang Kingdom had so many Spiritual Overlords.","Feng Wu nodded.","Jing Jia added, “Many people are stuck at the Spiritual Overlord stage for the rest of their lives. It’s already very rare for someone of your age to have such a cultivation level. Don’t even think about it. It’s impossible.”","Feng Wu said, “What if I really make a breakthrough...”","Jing Jia said grumpily, “If you really make a breakthrough, I’ll do whatever you want me to do. How’s that? Tsk, it’s impossible, but you’re still delusional. I don’t know what to say about you.” Just then..."]},{"number":3995,"title":"Chapter 3995: Noticed by Lord Jing (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3995: Noticed by Lord Jing (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then...","The door opened with a creak.","The two guards immediately straightened their backs.","Lord Jing glanced at them coldly. “What were you talking about?!”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything, so Jing Jia said, “My lord, I was only joking with Jing Wei.”","Lord Jing didn’t have much patience. He said coldly, “Speak!”","Jing Jia didn’t expect Lord Jing to get to the bottom of it, so he said, “Jing Wei said that he wanted to become a Spiritual Saint, but I said that he couldn’t do it.”","“Really?” Lord Jing turned to Feng Wu. “Did you really say that?”","Feng Wu knew that Lord Jin was on the verge of losing his temper, and it wasn’t because of her.","Jing Jia kept giving Feng Wu warning glances, telling her to get over it as soon as possible and stop making empty promises. If she couldn’t keep her promise, Lord Jing would kill her.","However, Feng Wu knew that if she lied to someone as capricious as Lord Jing, he would probably kill her the next moment.","Therefore, she had to be honest when dealing with such people. Even if she wasn’t, she had to pretend to be.","Therefore, Feng Wu lowered her eyes and said in a flustered but calm voice, did say that. I do want to become a Spiritual Saint as soon as possible.”","Lord Jing’s face was livid, and his eyes were as sharp as an eagle’s.","“Why do you want to become a Spiritual Saint as soon as possible?” asked Lord Jing casually.","Feng Wu said, “The Dongsang Kingdom is going to war with the Junwu","Kingdom soon. At this critical moment, if I’m stronger, I’ll be able to help you. I just want to protect you.”","Lord Jing didn’t say anything for a while.","However, Feng Wu could feel the intense gaze on her. If he realized that something was wrong, he would probably cut her neck open.","Lord Jing was a Spiritual Saint. If he found out that Feng Wu was an impersonator here in the manor, Feng Wu would never be able to get away.","Anyone else would have been flustered by the sharp look in his eyes.","That was what happened to Jing Jia, whose hands were trembling in his sleeves.","All of a sudden, Lord Jing turned his cold gaze on Feng Wu. “Look up!”","Feng Wu slowly looked up.","To make herself look like Jing Wei, Feng Wu had to put on an exquisite disguise that included her eye area. If one didn’t lift her eyelid, they wouldn’t notice that mask.","Lord Jin stared at Feng Wu with his soul-stirring eyes.","For a moment, Feng Wu thought that she was going to suffocate...","As a matter of fact, she had broken into a cold sweat, and it was dripping down her back, almost soaking her clothes.","“You can withstand my mental pressure?” Lord Jing was obviously surprised.","Feng Wu pretended that her legs had given out. She stumbled back and almost fell.","In terms of mental power, although he was already a Spiritual Saint, he might not be her match.","“Good!” Lord Jing cried out in surprise. “I didn’t know that after so many twists and turns, I had a treasure that I didn’t know of!”","Somehow, Feng Wu felt that the laughter was too wild as if something crazy was hidden in it.","“Come with me!”","Lord Jing quickly led the way after that.."]},{"number":3996,"title":"Chapter 3996: Noticed by Lord Jing (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3996: Noticed by Lord Jing (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu and Jing Jia looked at each other, and Jing Jia gave her a concerned look. “Be careful!” Feng Wu nodded, then followed Lord Jing. Lord Jin was a junior Spiritual Saint, and Feng Wu wasn’t weak either. If they were to fight, Feng Wu might not lose.","Lord Jing led Feng Wu into the study.","However, the study was only a facade, and inside was a secret room.","There was a painting on the wall of the study, and it depicted a man wearing a green robe. Lord Jing slid a finger across a button on his belly.","The door to the secret room slowly opened.","Lord Jing waved at Feng Wu with a smile. “Come with me.”","Wherever Lord Jing passed, candles lit up in the dark passageway. Instantly, the tunnel was as bright as day.","Lord Jing led the way, and Feng Wu quickly followed him.","Feng Wu looked around and paid close attention to her surroundings.","Soon, a bronze door appeared ahead of them. Lord Jing unlocked it with a special method and entered first.","Feng Wu followed him in.","As soon as she walked in, Feng Wu sensed a dense spiritual essence coming her way.","Lord Jing turned around and gave Feng Wu an indifferent look. “Jing Wei, how have I been treating you?”","Feng Wu immediately feigned a respectful tone and bowed. “My Lord, of course, you’ve been very kind to me. I’ll always remember that.”","“Are you willing to give up your life for me?” Crossing his hands behind his back, Lord Jing raised his chin and stared at Feng Wu arrogantly.","Shocked, Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine.","However, Feng Wu was the most level-headed person. She calmed herself down and said, “It’s my honor to die for you.”","If Lord Jing dared to kill her, she would kill him before he could do anything.","Fortunately...","Lord Jing guffawed, and the intimidating energy soon dissipated.","Lord Jing smiled. “I’ve carefully chosen you as my guard, and you’re very loyal. But you’re still one step away from completing the task. I’ll only believe you if you can do it. I’ll give you a future that’ll change your life!”","Feng Wu didn’t care what that future was, but she had to do as Lord Jing said.","Lord Jing might sound polite, but if she didn’t do as he said, he might try to kill her again.","“Look ahead of you. This is the essence pool,” said Lord Jing. “You have good mental strength. Temper it well after you go in.”","Feng Wu saw that it was more like a wooden tub than a pool.","The lid was on the bucket and could be removed at any moment.","Feng Wu could see smoke rising out of the gaps.","And it had already been refined!","Feng Wu was amazed. It was an extremely precious liquid that had been purified twice! It wasn’t something common spiritual stones or spiritual liquid could compare with.","“Go in.” Lord Jing smiled at Feng Wu.","It was obvious that the pool was for Lord Jing himself, but now, he was smiling at her.","He had either recognized her and wanted to use this chance to drown her or was using her as an experiment.","Because he wasn’t sure about the purity and measurement of the liquid..","Feng Wu felt the latter was more likely, so..."]},{"number":3997,"title":"Chapter 3997: A Spiritual Saint (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3997: A Spiritual Saint (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu felt it was the latter, so she walked into the bucket without hesitation.","Lord Jing stared at her and said in a kind voice, “I’ve prepared this pool for you. Cultivate well. Don’t worry about anything. Just focus on your cultivation. If you can become a Spiritual Saint in one go, it’ll be the greatest reward for me. I don’t care how much spiritual liquid you use.”","Looking at the liquid in the pool, Feng Wu turned to Lord Jing and asked sincerely, “Are you sure you don’t mind the cost?”","Lord Jing waved his hand. “Use whatever you want and absorb as much as you want. I’ve been there, and I know better than you that this trip will cost me a lot of spiritual liquid. If you can’t make a breakthrough, you won’t be able to absorb much even if you want to. Don’t worry. Even if you absorb all the spiritual liquid, I won’t blame you!”","Lord Jing thought, “How can you absorb that much? I only absorbed a shallow layer. Who do you think you are? Are you more talented than me?” The more one absorbed, the more talented they had to be.","Feng Wu nodded at those words, but she still had to show her gratitude.","Lord Jing waved him off. “Go back to your cultivation. I’ll wait for you in the cultivation room next door.”","After that, he put his hands behind his back and waddled off.","Lord Jing was over the moon.","Either way, it was a win-win situation for him.","If Jing Wei succeeded, they would have another Spiritual Saint in the Jing Manor. His Majesty would be so happy.","If Jing Wei failed... Well, it was only natural that he would fail. Success was almost impossible.","If he failed, it would mean that the concentration of the liquid wasn’t good enough, and Lord Jing could make some adjustments. Jing Wei would be an excellent test subject. What was the harm of that?","No matter what, it was still a win-win situation.","While Lord Jin went to the room next door, humming a tune, Feng Wu started cultivating.","Meanwhile, the other two guards, Jing Bao and Jing Guo, were on their way to change shifts. They were surprised when they saw that the lord wasn’t here and that Jing Jia was alone.","“Where’s Lord Jing?” Jing Bao asked anxiously.","Jing Jia smiled bitterly. “He left.”","Jing Bao said, “Aren’t you supposed to be on duty? Why didn’t you stay with Lord Jing? Why did you let him leave? You’re not worth it!”","Jing Jia didn’t know what to say.","“Where’s Jing Wei?!” Jing Bao asked anxiously.","Lord Jiing wasn’t here, nor was Jing Wei.","“Lord Jing took him away...” Jing Jia stammered.","“Why did His Grace leave with him alone? What happened?” Jing Bao asked.","Jing Jia had no choice but to tell her what happened.","“What?!” Jing Bao stared at Sefiro in astonishment. “Are you saying that Jing Wei said he wanted to become a Spiritual Saint?”","Jing Jia nodded.","Jing Bao snorted. “Who the hell does he think he is? He can’t make a breakthrough just because he wants to! He’s only a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord! It’ll take him decades to make that breakthrough!”","Jing Bao was the only Spiritual Saint among the guards, but Jing Wei was so ambitious!","“So, His Grace took him inside to cultivate?” Jing Bao frowned.","Jing Jia nodded.."]},{"number":3998,"title":"Chapter 3998: A Spiritual Saint (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3998: A Spiritual Saint (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jing Bao stared at Jing Jia with a livid face.","He was supposed to be the lord’s most trusted man, but...","Before Feng Wu knew it, Jing Bao already hated her.","“But he can’t make a breakthrough to the Spiritual Saint stage!” Jing Bao smirked.","Jing Bao wasn’t the only one. The other two shook their heads as well, saying that Jing Wei was making things up. Meanwhile...","Feng Wu wasn’t so sure either.","She had been using the spiritual liquid of the Junwu Empire for her cultivation. The spiritual liquid of the Dongsang Kingdom was fundamentally different from that of the Junwu Empire, and Feng Wu was worried that it would make her cultivation less efficient.","However...","When she really started cultivating, she realized that the Magical Soul Vine would filter the energy of the Dongsang Kingdom and provide her with a purer spiritual essence.","That only made it easier for Feng Wu.","Feng Wu had been making rapid breakthroughs before, so she thought that she could improve her cultivation level a little. However, she didn’t expect to make any breakthroughs for the time being. However, with the help of the Magical Soul Vine, Feng Wu could sense her spiritual essence rising!","And the speed was uncontrollable!","Seriously?","Feng Wu couldn’t believe that she could become a Spiritual Saint just by saying that she wanted to make a breakthrough!","Everyone wanted to become a Spiritual Saint.","Once she made a breakthrough, with Feng Wu’s talent, she would be able to walk freely in the Dongsang Kingdom. At that thought, Feng Wu grew excited.","The agitation backfired on her spiritual essence!","“Cough, cough...","Feng Wu coughed violently.","The spiritual essence around her was disturbed as well.","After sensing the chaotic spiritual essence fluctuation in the room next door, Lord Jin looked disappointed and heaved a sigh. It seemed that his guard wouldn’t make it.","However, he didn’t expect to succeed, so he wasn’t too disappointed.","Jing Wei was only a test subject.","What he didn’t know was —","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was rapidly absorbing the spiritual essence in the spiritual liquid.","The water had barely reached her chin when she sat down, but now, the level of the spiritual liquid was falling at an unbelievable speed.","It dropped from Feng Wu’s neck to her shoulders, then to her waist...","Hum!","Feng Wu could sense that she had become a Spiritual Saint!","But it wasn’t enough!","She was still absorbing the spiritual essence.","Feng Wu panicked a little... Wasn’t it a bad idea to make breakthroughs so fast?","However, she then recalled that after obtaining the Vast Essence Pill from her Sixth Senior Brother, her physical fitness had been enhanced. Maybe this time, she would be able to make a breakthrough.","Here in Dong Lin City, the more capable she was, the better.","Hence, Feng Wu gritted her teeth and started absorbing the spiritual essence again!","The Magical Soul Vine absorbed all the impurities when the spiritual essence went through it, and the appropriate concentration was transferred to Feng Wu’s dantian. The spiritual essence then flowed through her body over and over again...","The stagnant spiritual liquid decreased again.","It dropped from Feng Wu’s belly all the way to her legs until the pool was empty!","But it still wasn’t enough. She was so close...","The floor of the spiritual liquid pool was made of spiritual bricks as well.","And the Spirit Stones on the shelf that hadn’t been purified yet...","Feng Wu’s frantic power drained them all.."]},{"number":3999,"title":"Chapter 3999: A Spiritual Saint (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3999: A Spiritual Saint (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Rumble...","The familiar sound of a breakthrough rang out again.","Feng Wu almost jumped to her feet.","A Level-2 Spiritual Saint?!","She had just become a Level 2 Spiritual Saint!","Feng Wu was so excited that she was almost in tears... God was so kind to her! He had given her the power she desperately needed when she needed it the most!","A Level-2 Spiritual Saint...","Feng Wu was invincible among her peers and could defeat opponents of a higher cultivation level!","Now, she could fight a junior Spiritual Saint. How amazing!","The noise was so loud that Lord Jing rushed in, and what he saw was...","Feng Wu stood in the spiritual liquid pool and was surrounded by a mess...","No, there was no spiritual liquid pool.","The spiritual liquid had dried up, and even the bricks and piles of Spirit Stones on the ground had turned into white powder.","“You...”","Lord Jing stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “You...”","Feng Wu opened her eyes as well and saw what was going on. One look and she knew that things were getting out of hand.","“I...” Feng Wu cleared her throat.","Lord Jing stared at Feng Wu. “Don’t tell me that you’re a Level-I Spiritual Saint now...”","Level-I Spiritual Saint? What was that? She was a Level-2 Spiritual Saint now!","On second thought, Feng Wu realized that she had to do a lot of things in secret from now on, so she decided that she shouldn’t reveal her real capability to Lord Jing. She had to keep a card up her sleeves.","At that thought, Feng Wu nodded and said, “Yes, I... I’m a Level-I Spiritual Saint now.”","Lord Jing was baffled. He couldn’t understand how the guard could have succeeded. That wasn’t possible!","“Why should I believe you?” Lord Jing frowned.","Feng Wu opened her palm, and a streak of sword energy flew unhurriedly toward Lord Jing.","Lord Jing observed it...","It was indeed the spiritual essence of a Level-I Spiritual Saint.","Before Lord Jing could react, Feng Wu bowed and said, “My lord, this pool of spiritual liquid and these Spirit Stones are all my fault.”","Lord Jing had been elated, but hearing Feng Wu’s question, he shifted his attention to that subject as well.","He looked around...","What a mess.","This was his cultivation room, and he had spent a lot of time and effort preparing all the materials that would enable him to rise from a Level-I Spiritual Saint to a Level-2 one. Who would have thought...","Lord Jing wanted to flare up, but he couldn’t. He only stood there with a grim face.","Feng Wu put on a pitiful, trembling face.","Seeing that a Level-I Spiritual Saint was so intimidated by him, Lord Jing was appeased. He feigned a magnanimous tone and patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “I’m so glad that you’ve made a breakthrough. That’s the most important thing now. I’ll get everything ready later.”","Feng Wu said excitedly, “Thank you, my lord! I promise I’ll do my best for you from now on!”","Lord Jing nodded and liked Feng Wu even more.","“He” had really made a breakthrough, although Lord Jing had lost a lot of treasures in the process.","The spiritual liquid inside cost him almost half of the wealth of the Jing Manor...","However, it was still worthwhile to have a Level-I Spiritual Saint as a subordinate. At that thought, Lord Jing said indifferently, “Fine. Follow me out.”","He had to show off.."]},{"number":4000,"title":"Chapter 4000: My Spiritual Saint Guard (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4000: My Spiritual Saint Guard (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lord Jing was ready to show off.","The guard had used up a lot of his spiritual liquid... The thought made Lord Jing’s stomach lurch, but he could only feign a happy face.","What else could he do? Reprimand the guard and drive him away? He was a rare Spiritual Saint now.","Lord Jing smiled reluctantly and patted Feng Wu on the shoulder.","Feng Wu wanted to laugh whenever she thought about what was really going on in Lord Jin’s head, but she fought back her laughter and said respectfully, “My lord, I’m borrowing your spiritual liquid, and I’m going to sell my life to you. You can use it however you want. I’ll pay you back.”","That cheered Lord Jing up.","The spiritual liquid was a dead thing, but a person wasn’t. Lord Jing could enslave a Spiritual Saint for the rest of his life. That was a sweet deal. At that thought, Lord Jing nodded with a smile. “Good, very good.”","When they came out, they ran into the other three guards.","Jing Bao’s face darkened when he saw Lord Jing come out of the study with Jing Wei.","It had always been his duty to follow Lord Jing around alone. Since when was it the third guard’s turn?","He threw a dirty look at Jing Wei. Just wait when Lord Jing was gone...","Just then, Lord Jing looked up and saw Jing Bao. He smiled at the latter before heading for the bedchamber.","Jing Bao stopped Feng Wu with a ferocious look in his eyes.","“By the way,” Lord Jin turned around and glanced at Jing Bao. “Raise his pay level to the same as you.”","A promotion?","Although Jing Bao was a guard, he was a powerful Spiritual Saint, so he had his own courtyard, cultivation room, and...","But why could Jing Wei have them as well?","Lord Jing left without giving an explanation.","However, Jing Bao only stared at Feng Wu. “Why?!”","Feng Wu wasn’t intimidated by the fierce look in his eyes at all. All she could think of was what she could do with his rage...","“Why?!” Jing Bao grabbed Feng Wu by the collar, and blue veins popped on his face.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes and knew what to do.","Lord Jing... Did he think his life would be so easy? She wanted to destroy the Jing Manor first!","Feng Wu frowned a little. “Put me down first.” Of course, Jing Bao wouldn’t do that.","However, Feng Wu reached out and grabbed his arm. The pain made Jing Bao stare at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","“How is that possible?” He gritted his teeth and asked angrily.","He thought he knew how capable Jing Wei was/","“You’re just a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord. Why...”","Feng Wu tightened her grip.","Jing Bao felt that his entire arm had gone numb. He exerted all his strength, and blue veins popped all over his body.","Jing Jia and Jing Guo were both anxious, but there was nothing they could do.","They stared at Feng Wu in astonishment as well.","Jing Wei should be a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord, but why couldn’t Jing Bao, a junior Spiritual Saint, defeat him?","To their further astonishment, the next second, Feng Wu threw Jing Bao’s hand off.","Just like that.","The contrast between their power was obvious.","“Aren’t you a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord?” Jing Bao stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.."]}]);
